window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_CULTIVATION_CHAT_GROUP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2201,"title":"Chapter 2201 A means left behind by an old friend","paragraphs":["2201 A means left behind by an old friend","Skylark’s guess was absolutely correct.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said, “Although I have no idea why Senior White has disguised himself as Shuhang and entered this prison, I know that as long as Senior White is here, it’s a good thing for us.”","Since Senior White was here, it meant that luck was on their side.","In this way, his and Fairy Skylark’s escape plan would have a greater success rate.","“A disguise?” The kirin, who was quietly keeping guard from outside the Lock Immortal Prison, was stunned.","So that’s why...","No wonder Cheng Lin looks like a man.","It turns out that she had been using a disguise all along!","The kirin secretly took a glance at Cheng Lin, who looked like a young man.","Is Fairy Cheng Lin’s true appearance hidden under this kind face?","Oh, no. My heart has become troubled again...","“Enough!” The kirin shouted inwardly, getting rid of the demon named Cheng Lin inside his heart.","After breaking through the mental barrier, he was able to continue thinking calmly.","The man and woman in the next cell seem to know Cheng Lin...","With that being the case, they have become of even greater value.","Thank you for reading on myboxnovel.com","Perhaps I can get some information about Cheng Lin from the pair.","When he thought of this, the kirin silently made some hand seals, passing this information to Zither Master Phoenix Bearing.","To prevent any accidents from happening, it had to constantly monitor Cheng Lin and stop her from escaping.","??????","“Senior White~ Senior White, wake up!” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber tried calling out to Senior White with the secret sound transmission technique.","However, Senior White did not reply.","When Senior White was closing up, even if the heavenly tribulation were to strike, he might still not wake up.","“What do we do then?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked using the secret sound transmission technique.","“We wait,” said Skylark.","They had to wait until Senior White woke up.","Calm returned inside the Lock Immortal Prison.","Senior White continued with his meditation.","Skylark and Thrice Reckless Mad Saber closed their eyes and waited in the next cell.","The kirin stood guard and watched them all.","??????","Time slowly passed by.","After an unknown amount of time, a strand of hair protruded from Senior White’s sleeve, which the kirin could not see.","This strand of hair came with a powerful camouflage ability and an invisibility effect. It could even block all kinds of aura from leaking from it—an Immortal’s hair had a multitude of functions.","The hair stretched longer and longer, avoiding the kirin’s senses. Soon, it managed to slip into the ear of Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, who was in the next cell.","[Senior Thrice Reckless.] Sixteen’s voice spread from the tip of the hair, echoing in Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s ears.","Thrice Reckless, who was resting with his eyes closed, was taken aback.","Sixteen said, [It’s me, Sixteen. Don’t move, the kirin is still watching us. You can use the secret sound transmission technique to communicate with me.]","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, who was quite proficient at acting, managed to maintain a calm face as he followed Sixteen’s guidance and began to communicate through the strand of hair.","[Sixteen, are you also here? Where are you?] Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked curiously.","Sixteen replied, [We are currently in Senior White’s sleeve. Shuhang is also there.]","[Haha, it seems like the whole gang’s here. Anyway, why were you arrested?] Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked.","Sixteen replied, [It’s a long story. Shuhang was mistaken by the members of the Heavenly City for another person. After that, Senior White was seemingly amused by the scene, so he let himself be captured by the kirin. How about you, Senior Thrice Reckless?]","[We deliberately provoked the members of the Heavenly City, and then we let ourselves get arrested. Senior Skylark and I infiltrated this place to find something... or a certain place. I’m not sure.] Thrice Reckless Mad Saber laughed.","[Senior, what are you looking for?] Sixteen asked curiously.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s ears twitched slightly. [Uhh, you’ll have to ask Senior Skylark for that.]","While communicating with Sixteen, he simultaneously transmitted the discussion to Skylark.","The strand of hair beside Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s ear shifted slightly, and moved to Skylark’s ear.","“Eh? This head...” When Pavilion Master Chu approached Skylark’s ear, her heart skipped a beat.","Gorgeous long blue hair, and ice blue eyelashes and eyes... Isn’t this the head that Song Shuhang gave to Chu Two before?","She didn’t notice it before, but when her hair came closer to Skylark, she immediately noticed this tiny detail.","[Senior Skylark, what are you looking for?] Sixteen asked.","Maybe they could help.","[A large resurrection formation, possibly in the form of an altar. It’s a means of resurrection left behind by an old friend.] Skylark replied softly.","Sixteen mused, [An old friend?]","From Senior Skylark’s tone, this old friend should not be a member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group, and none of the members of the group would place their resurrection formation in the lair of the members of the Heavenly City in the Beast Realm anyway.","[It is the means of resurrection left behind by the Scholarly Sage,] Skylark added.","After her bone of eternity was retrieved from Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball and taken away by the urn of the Scholarly Sage, the chaotic memories in her mind became clearer.","She remembered that the Scholarly Sage had hidden a resurrection formation in the Beast Realm.","This formation was very special. Before it was activated, it would have nothing to do with the Scholarly Sage.","Maybe, there was a very small chance that this formation had avoided the detection of the Wielder of the Will.","With this thought in mind, she came to the Beast Realm to have a look.","She wanted to see if the formation still existed.","And if it existed, would it still work?","Together with Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, she entered the Beast Realm in search of clues.","In the end, the clues pointed her here.","The resurrection formation left behind by the Scholarly Sage appeared to be somewhere in the base of these members of the Ancient Heavenly City.","[A means of resurrection left behind by the Scholarly Sage?] Sixteen was stunned when she heard Skylark’s words.","This was huge news at the nuclear level.","At the same time, she looked around in the Universe Hiding Sleeve. Senior White came here on his own initiative, could it be that his luck had secretly guided him here?","So, it’s something related to the Scholarly Sage and Ancient Heavenly City... Sister White Dragon thought to herself.","She looked at Song Shuhang.","That scholarly fairy should be interested, right?","As expected, Fairy Creation emerged from Song Shuhang’s body.","Sister White Dragon asked, “Fairy, do you know anything about this?”","Fairy Creation shook her head.","She didn’t know that her teacher had set up a resurrection formation here.","The black-skinned Soft Feather, who was hidden in Song Shuhang’s shadow, recorded everything she saw and heard. Once the signal was restored, she would share all the information with her main body.","The black-skinned Soft Feather could smell the makings of something massive.","Sixteen thought for a while and approached the strand of hair on Song Shuhang’s head. “Senior Skylark, do you have any plans?”","[I have a three-step plan. The first step is to break out of prison. The second step is to look for the resurrection formation. The third step is to get out of here,] Senior Skylark replied solemnly.","Sixteen: “...”"]},{"number":2202,"title":"Chapter 2202 May the world be forever at peace","paragraphs":["2202 May the world be forever at peace","Should I applaud Senior Skylark for her three-step plan?","Sixteen did not know whether to laugh or cry. [Senior Skylark, how do you plan to get out of this Lock Immortal Prison?]","Sister White Dragon said before that the Lock Immortal Prison was surrounded by dozens of spatial confinements chained to form an unbreakable spatial lock. Even an Immortal would have trouble getting out of it in a short while.","Could Senior Skylark have a way to get out?","[Leave that to me. As soon as Fellow Daoist White wakes up, we will break out and escape from this prison.]","From the looks of it, Skylark had a plan in mind.","Senior White, who was meditating, seemed to have heard someone call him and opened his eyes.","He got up from the ground.","He’s woken up?","“Senior White, you’re awake,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was overjoyed and said via voice transmission.","Senior White stood up and turned his head, looking at Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s position with a bewildered expression.","His eyes were out of focus, and he did not appear to be fully awake.","Seeing this, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber felt a chill in his heart.","A Senior White who was not fully awake was distracted, and thus a moving natural disaster.","“Senior Skylark, tactical evasion!” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber shouted.","He crouched down and quickly rolled away from Senior White.","Skylark said calmly, “Don’t be so scared, Fellow Daoist White is not showing any signs of falling to the ground.”","Her eyes were watching White’s footsteps, just in case.","Senior White stared at Thrice Reckless’s position in confusion for a while, then turned back.","He squatted down on the spot and stretched out his hands to the ground.","The ground of the Lock Immortal Prison was made up of rock slabs; each slab had been reinforced with layers of defense, and runic formations were engraved on it. With everything added together, it was a top-level sealing formation that was extremely difficult to destroy.","Senior White squatted casually, reached out with his hand, grabbed a rock slab, and then lifted it up forcefully.","The heavy rock slab was easily lifted up.","Without that single slab, a “hole” appeared in the large formation.","The kirin, who was watching from the sidelines, was taken aback.","Was what she aimed at the weak point of the entire formation?","I must stop her! the kirin thought to himself.","But before he could move, Senior White had taken off another six slabs.","He moved his hands quickly, and the six blocks were arranged to form a stone box.","The virtuous lamia stepped forward, wrapped her long tail around the stone box, and held it together tightly so that it would not fall apart.","Finally, Senior White went into the stone box and curled up.","A lid was positioned on the stone box, leaving only a gap.","Runes drilled out of the stone box and branded themselves on the stone. In the blink of an eye, an exquisite defensive formation was formed around it.","Highly efficient!","The kirin: “...”","Sixteen: “...”","Fairy Skylark: “...”","“Can you do that while sleepwalking?” Pavilion Master Chu said dumbfoundedly.","Sixteen speculated, “It could also be his instincts. I heard that whenever Senior White closes up, a layer of stone ends up covering his body, turning him into a statue. It might be that the environmental conditions of the Lock Immortal Prison were not up to Senior White’s standards, so he instinctively urged his body to create a safe and reliable environment for himself.”","“Is it safe now?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber skillfully rolled back to where he was standing earlier.","Skylark looked at the Lock Immortal Prison and the sealing formation dug up by Fellow Daoist White and smiled.","Senior White was indeed their lucky star.","She wanted to wait for Fellow Daoist White to wake up and then escape from the prison with his help, but that was no longer needed.","Fellow Daoist White had already paved the way for her to escape.","[Guys, get ready. We are going to escape from prison!] Skylark transmitted her voice.","She then flicked her long blue hair.","Ice condensed on her long hair, turning her soft hair into sharp blades, which she then used to slice her wrists.","Her hands were cut off, but not a drop of blood was spilled out as the wound was immediately frozen.","At the same time, the handcuffs that sealed her spiritual energy fell off along with her hands.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, who was beside her, was ready.","When Skylark’s hands fell, he darted toward them and caught them.","Then, he reached out and raised them.","Skylark stretched out her arms, and her wrists came in contact with the base of her hands. The wounds instantly healed, and her hands recovered their functionality.","“Thrice Reckless, move back,” Skylark said.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber swiftly moved backward.","Skylark reached into the middle of her chest and took out a potion.","The kirin, who was watching from the sidelines, appeared to be quite slow today. Nevertheless, it soon made a move and a large hand made of Immortal energy grabbed Skylark.","Although it had no idea what she was doing, it decided to stop her.","At the same time, it activated the alarm of the Lock Immortal Prison.","“Klink~” Skylark broke the potion.","At the same time, she activated a magical technique that she prepared earlier.","She had prepared this magical technique before she and Thrice Reckless Mad Saber even got captured. She had inscribed the runes of the magical technique on her body.","“With all living beings as witnesses, if I become a Profound Sage, I shall create a world where all heretics and evil spirits do not exist. If I fail, I shall suffer from dismemberment.”","A weird magical technique erupted from her body.","This magical technique was extremely ancient. When it was cast, there was an aura of antiquity that emanated from Skylark.","This magical technique seemed as ancient as the world itself.","The large hand approaching Skylark was repelled by the power of the magical technique, unable to advance further.","“With all living beings as witnesses, if I become a Profound Sage, all living beings shall live in peace in my world, and the virtues shall be immeasurable. If not, my body shall suffer ten thousand calamities, and my soul and path shall be erased entirely.”","An even vaster aura rushed towards Skylark, wrapping around her.","Is she crazy? The kirin stared at her wide-eyed.","He could sense that Skylark was performing a magical technique similar to the ‘grand wish’ of Buddhism, but it was even more profound and ancient.","This kind of magical technique required one to do what one said.","If the user failed, the consequences were no joke.","All living beings shall live in peace? Is such a wish even possible?","Moreover, can a Profound Sage’s path even be as grand as this?","It felt like sacrificing one’s life for a First Stage spirit stone.","The price to pay was way greater than the reward they would get from fulfilling these wishes!","However, Skylark’s oath was not over yet.","“With all living beings as witnesses, if I become a Profound Sage, the world shall be forever peaceful, and there shall be no more conflicts. If not, I wish to be shattered like a star.”","World Peace?","This kind of thing can’t be achieved even by the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will. Yet, you want to accomplish such a feat when reaching the Profound Sage Realm? Who gave you the courage to make such a big oath?!","“With all... Hahaha, I’m dead.” Skylark opened her arms. It was impossible for her to turn these wishes into reality."]},{"number":2203,"title":"Chapter 2203 Those who are inconspicuous are the strongest!","paragraphs":["2203 Those who are inconspicuous are the strongest!","In the next moment, Skylark’s body really did shatter like a star.","The vast energy attracted by the three vows enveloped her and caused her to detonate.","A mushroom-like explosion spread from Skylark’s body, making the entire Lock Immortal Prison tremble.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber had rolled to a corner of the Lock Immortal Prison and curled up into a ball. The location he was at was the ‘safe zone’ designated by Skylark. As long as he did not move around, he would not be killed.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair also retracted and returned to Senior White’s stone box.","Did Fellow Daoist White build this stone box just for this moment? Pavilion Master Chu thought to herself.","“Crazy!” The kirin was beyond shocked","It was the first time that he had met a woman with such a personality. She was simply crazy.","Still, although the energy that had been drawn over by the three vows was massive, it was not enough to destroy the prison.","The Lock Immortal Prison was not so easy to breach.","The kirin did not waste time and began to suppress the power of the explosion.","Perhaps due to those distracting thoughts from before, his reaction time was a tad slower today. Whether it was when Cheng Lin dug up the rock slabs, or when the blue-haired fairy self-destructed, he failed to react in time.","He could not stop himself from thinking about Cheng Lin. Moreover, Cheng Lin’s appearance kept overlapping with the image of this young man in the Lock Immortal Prison.","Those distracting thoughts were on the verge of evolving into an inner demon, which left the kirin’s heart stifled.","Other than that, he was injured by the data flow that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song forcefully injected into his brain earlier, which didn’t help his situation.","“Suppress!” The kirin’s claws pointed at the mushroom cloud.","But as soon as it stretched out his arm, the two cells in front of him were blown open!","His heart skipped a beat.","This is impossible! How could the Lock Immortal Prison be blown open by an explosion of such magnitude?! Even if the sealing formation on the ground was disrupted by the young man, resulting in a faulty formation, the overall performance should not have dropped so much!","But at this moment, he didn’t have the time to think about this problem.","Even if the Lock Immortal Prison had been broken open, he could not allow the people inside to escape.","The kirin quickly returned to his senses.","His claws moved around, unleashing a powerful binding technique that covered the area where the two cells were located. He felt especially wise for having stayed back to keep an eye on the prisoners!","Moreover, he had already activated the alarm of the prison, so his companions should be rushing over.","Neither “Cheng Lin” nor that man who seemed to be afflicted by some kind of infectious disease could escape from the Lock Immortal Prison.","As for that crazy woman, she had already been reduced to dust; her soul had died and her path had vanished. It was the kind of death one could not come back from. Making a vow to all the beings in the universe was no joke. She died under the weight of her own vow, and there was nothing that could revive her.","The binding technique unleashed by the kirin turned into a big net and covered the Lock Immortal Prison.","This binding technique had a wide range and strong binding ability. It was a magical technique that the kirin liked very much and was very proficient at.","All creatures in the dungeon were covered by the huge net.","“You can’t escape!” the kirin appeared and said in a low voice.","“Baa, baa?” At this moment, a strange bleat came from one of the cells.","Soon after, the spiritual energy of the explosion dissipated, and the smoke cleared.","Inside the Lock Immortal Prison, a huge turtle was covered by a large net, looking bewildered.","The strange bleating sound just now came from the turtle.","The giant turtle’s eyes met those of the kirin.","The kirin: “...”","His brain also skipped half a beat, and it did not know how to react!","Trapped in the big net, the giant turtle let out a sweet feminine sound. “Meow?”","Is this thing trying to act cute?","The kirin gritted his teeth and said, “May I know who you are?”","How did this giant turtle appear here?","It was clear that this giant turtle was not an alternative form of the man with the infectious disease, as that man was a human and not a monster. And there was no way that this turtle could be Cheng Lin either.","So, how did this giant turtle end up in the Lock Immortal Prison?","From the beginning to the end, the kirin had not sensed any spatial fluctuations.","Was the Lock Immortal Prison’s spatial confinement just a decoration?","The giant turtle of disaster blinked and finally sighed tiredly.","Due to the language barrier, they were unable to communicate.","In the next moment, the figure of the giant turtle turned illusory as if it was preparing to escape.","“Stop right there!” The kirin yelled in anger.","Do you really think you can just come and go as you want? What kind of place do you think the Lock Immortal Prison is?!","With a wave of the kirin’s claw, the binding net tightened. This binding technique could even affect space!","How can you leave so easily after being caught in my binding technique?","While he was thinking this, the giant turtle disappeared.","In the binding net, only air was left.","The stone box in which Cheng Lin was lying and the man with the infectious disease disappeared alongside the turtle.","“Vile beast!” The kirin raised his claw angrily and smashed it against a pillar, cursing in his native language.","Deep gashes were left on the thick pillar.","It must have been that turtle who rescued Cheng Lin and that man.","Fairy Cheng Lin, who was captured after so long, has now escaped!","The kirin gritted his teeth, turned around, and ran outside the Lock Immortal Prison.","He was very angry at the moment.","He was annoyed that he was not in the right form today. He was always one step slower and failed to hold the Lock Immortal Prison down.","He was also annoyed at the incompetence of his companions.","Why had none of his companions rushed over after it activated the alarm of Lock Immortal Prison?","Even Zither Master Phoenix Bearing had not shown up.","Did none of his companions, or even Zither Master Phoenix Bearing, notice the huge commotion taking place at the prison?","Unless... Something happened outside.","The kirin suddenly felt uneasy.","??????","Outside the Lock Immortal Prison, an inconspicuous mass of gray liquid was wriggling slowly.","This gray liquid was very strange, and it was easy to ‘overlook’.","It was just like a certain fellow daoist in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Even if you saw it, once you looked away, you would forget its existence.","This gray liquid squirmed and slowly moved forward.","Inside it was a small person the size of a fingernail.","This small person was carrying a stone box and controlling the movement of the gray liquid.","The person was Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, and the box was Senior White’s stone box","This gray liquid came from the potion that Skylark took out and smashed before casting that magical technique.","The gray liquid was an instrumental part of her escape plan, and it would act as coordinates for when she would resurrect.","As long as they found a safe place, a brand new Skylark could be quietly revived where the liquid was."]},{"number":2204,"title":"Chapter 2204 That is simply unfair to body-tempering cultivators","paragraphs":["2204 That is simply unfair to body-tempering cultivators","After the gray liquid, which had enveloped Thrice Reckless Mad Saber and Senior White’s stone box, crept out of the range of the Lock Immortal Prison, its pace increased.","Although Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s body had shrunk down to the size of a fingernail, when he began running faster, even the wind could not catch up with him. The strength of a Fifth Stage Spiritual Emperor was shown in full.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair peeked out from a small gap in the stone box. It extended beyond the gray liquid and scouted the outside world.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “Eh? The members of Ancient Heavenly City seem to be in trouble. They are fighting someone... No wonder only the kirin tried to stop us after we blasted our way out of the Lock Immortal Prison.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s consciousness quietly swept across the surrounding area, and she noticed that the members of Ancient Heavenly City were currently fighting with other forces.","This foreign force directly invaded the lair of the members of the Heavenly City, and even Zither Master Phoenix Bearing, who possessed Immortal-level strength, was involved in the fight.","Is there someone with Immortal-level combat power among the invaders? Or could they have brought some treasures to restrict Zither Master Phoenix Bearing?","At the same time, Pavilion Master Chu projected the image captured by her divine sense into space in Senior White’s sleeve using a projection-type magical technique.","Sixteen said, “It seems we are very lucky today.”","If it was not for this foreign force that just so happened to invade the lair of the members of the Heavenly City, it would not have been so easy for them to escape from the Lock Immortal Prison.","The timing was just right at every turn.","“Well, we have Senior White with us. With his presence, luck is on our side.” The black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from Song Shuhang’s shadow and looked at the screen projected by Pavilion Master Chu.","The ongoing battle in the secret base was fierce.","The intruders and the members of the Heavenly City used all kinds of skills while fighting and killing each other.","Fresh blood, mutilated limbs, shattered magical treasures, and broken flying swords unceasingly fell from the sky.","“So far, I have not found any energy fluctuations that belong to Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders. It seems that when the Ninth Stage cultivators commenced their battle, they left this place.” Pavilion Master Chu dutifully explained the situation on the battlefield. Her lazy voice sounded especially pleasant to the ears when she was explaining what was taking place.","Sister White Dragon said softly, “This is a secret realm created from the fragments of the Ancient Heavenly City, and it means a lot to the members of the Heavenly City. With people at the Ninth Stage or above involved, they would naturally try to move the battlefield to some other place to avoid damaging the fragments in the secret realm. Moreover, it wasn’t only the Ninth Stage battles that were moved elsewhere, but the Eighth Stage ones as well.”","“That’s true. In addition, there are still two Ninth Stage fighters hiding in this secret realm, but they are not making a move. And there is still that kirin in the Lock Immortal Prison. The overall situation seems to be under control.” Pavilion Master Chu quickly moved the camera around.","A bald man with his arms crossed was shown on the screen, and beside him was a woman with a snake around her waist. She had half of her face covered by a fan, and her eyes were full of vigilance.","These two were the Ninth Stage fighters in charge of keeping an eye on the situation, and act as backup should the need arise.","The bald man was a genuine Tribulation Transcender, while the woman was carrying a top-notch Tribulation-Transcender-level magical treasure. With her Profound Sage strength, she could unleash destructive power close to the Tribulation Transcender Realm for a short period of time.","Sister White Dragon said calmly, “There are a lot of members of the Ancient Heavenly City lurking all over the Beast Realm, and they can quickly return to this base of theirs. The longer the battle lasts, the greater the advantage they will hold.”","[The battles between Profound Sages and Tribulation Transcenders have been transferred elsewhere?]","The black-skinned Soft Feather felt slightly regretful when she heard this. She wanted to carefully watch the battles between Profound Sages and Tribulation Transcenders to increase her knowledge and experience.","After all, it was rare to be able to witness such high-level battles while in a safe place. By watching through the broadcast, she would not have to worry about the pressure released from the moves of those Tribulation Transcenders.","It was truly a pity","“Don’t be discouraged. Although you can’t see the battles between Profound Sages, you can witness several wonderful battles between Venerables. For example, those two Venerables over there are masters of body tempering and they’re fighting with their fists. Such fights are extremely fierce and cause the spectators to go wild with excitement,” said Pavilion Master Chu as she shifted the camera to another place.","Although the members of the Ancient Heavenly City had several Profound Sages and Tribulation Transcenders, the number of Venerables they had was not that high.","The reason there were more Profound Sages and Tribulation Transcenders than Venerables was that Profound Sages and Tribulation Transcenders could live longer!","There were several Tribulation Transcenders who survived the collapse of the Heavenly City and lived until now.","On the other hand, most of the Venerables here were descendants or disciples of the members of the Heavenly City. They were basically new Venerables that had ascended in the past few thousand years.","So in comparison, the number of Seventh Stage Venerables was actually smaller.","In the picture projected by Pavilion Master Chu, the two Venerables covered in muscles and whose arms were thicker than Soft Feather’s waist were frantically confronting each other.","Their fighting style was reckless and violent.","“Fellow Daoist Chu, I did not expect you to like men with such style.” Sister White Dragon smiled lightly. “If that’s the case, why did you fall in love with a guy like Slow-Witted Song who has thin arms and legs?”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair tied itself into a bowknot, and smiled without saying a word. Who said that Slow-Witted Song still looks like that? His style right now is one that exudes extreme power, and he relies on his fists to fight Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders.","The scene of him appearing in the form of a golden Buddhist monk and rescuing her from the Trees of Life and Death was etched in her mind.","It was after that incident that she became interested in cultivators with this type of build.","Fellow Daoist White Dragon’s information was lacking, so it was her win.","“Boom~ Boom~ Boom~”","On the screen, the two Venerables were fighting each other, every punch making a thunderous sound.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “Senior Chu, Sister White Dragon, how do these two Seventh Stage cultivators compare with Senior Song? Disregarding magical techniques and other stuff, and just focusing on the physical aspect.”","She had remembered that Senior Song was also a body-tempering cultivator.","Sister White Dragon: “...”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","After a while, Pavilion Master Chu said earnestly, “Soft Feather, don’t compare that guy who has a face that even the Heavenly Punishment cannot break to normal cultivators. It is simply not fair.”","While they were speaking, the two Venerables in the air, as if with tacit understanding, violently punched each other in the face.","They hit each other’s faces with no hesitation!","The fists of both parties seemed to sink into the other’s face; blood spurted from their orifices, and the teeth of the two Venerables fell from the sky.","Sister White Dragon gestured with her little claw and said, “For example, that punch. If they had done this to Song Shuhang instead... His face would definitely not sink in like this. Instead, it would be their fists that would break.”","“Sister White Dragon, don’t badmouth Shuhang like that.” Sixteen gently pulled on Sister White Dragon’s claw."]},{"number":2205,"title":"Chapter 2205: Is it my turn this time?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2205: Is it my turn this time?","Translator: God Brandy","Sixteen felt that Sister White Dragon was still angry about Song Shuhang using her as a scarf and wrapping her around his neck.","“Badmouthing Shuhang?” Sister White Dragon patted Sixteen lightly with her little claw.","This girl is still too young and naive.","How are we badmouthing Song Shuhang? We’re simply speaking the truth!","If the two of them wanted to truly badmouth Song Shuhang, they could have easily done so.","For example, they could say that if a body-tempering cultivator were to punch Song Shuhang in the face, while Song Shuhang’s face would remain safe, the body-tempering cultivator’s fist might have ended up with a print of Song Shuhang’s face on their hand. This would have been a much better way to badmouth Song Shuhang!","While they were talking, the two body-tempering cultivators on the screen had already finished their fight.","These two cultivators had the same strength, physique, and stamina.","They had been fighting for a long time before Pavilion Master Chu began showcasing their fight.","When they started smacking each other’s face, they ended up entering a battle where they traded blow for blow and injury for injury.","After the two of them had fought for a while, they both fell from the sky.","Both cultivators had passed out at the same time.","“This kind of fighting lacks skills. This is negative material, so you two must not learn from it.” After Sister White Dragon finished evaluating the fight, she gave her opinion to Sixteen and the black-skinned Soft Feather.","This kind of reckless fighting style lacked skill and blindly relied on the strength of the body. Such a style was not suitable for Sixteen and Soft Feather.","“I feel that the battle was really passionate. Sometimes, this kind of fighting style can bring out a cultivator’s potential,” retorted Pavilion Master Chu.","She found herself captivated by their well-sculpted and swelling muscles, as well as their passion as they launched and received punches.","Sometimes, the love for a person makes one biased toward those with even a tinge of similarity to them.","“Splash- ‘","“Thud-”","The two muscular cultivators landed on the ground one after another, but they made different noises. One of them fell into a small lake in one of the Heavenly City Fragments and created huge waves, while the other fell right in front of Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","The latter fell very close to Thrice Reckless, creating a deep pit in the ground.","As body-tempering cultivators, they had strong bodies, so they did not become meat paste after the fall. Instead, it was the ground and the small lake that suffered tons of damage when they fell into them.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, who was nearly hit, was startled.","“I was only one step away from being crushed!” Thrice Reckless was terrified. If he had been hit directly, he would have been squashed to death!","Fortunately, the body-tempering cultivator had landed a step away from him and he was protected by the gray liquid.","“It’s Senior White we’re talking about. With him, fortune is always accompanied by danger.” Sixteen’s voice sounded from Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair.","When they escaped from the Lock Immortal Prison, that was when fortune came into play.","It was thus normal for the danger to follow.","Is it possible that since little friend Shuhang isn’t here to bear the brunt of the bad luck, that role has been passed on to me?Thrice Reckless Mad Saber thought to himself.","Thrice Reckless looked into the deep pit. The muscular Seventh Stage cultivator’s face was covered in blood and caved in due to the brutal fight just now. His body was covered in deep fist marks. Despite that, he was slowly recovering.","After thinking for a while, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked the strand of hair,","“Is this guy from the Ancient Heavenly City’s side? Or is he one of the invaders? Seniors, can you tell the difference?”","Sister White Dragon’s voice sounded, “He’s a member of the Ancient Heavenly","City. He has a code mark on his body. It’s on his wrist. ‘","As the Ancestral Golden Dragon of the Ancient Heavenly City, she was familiar with such code marks.","“Great.” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber laughed. “It was unlucky that he nearly hit me just now, but it is our fortune that this Venerable is a member of the","Ancient Heavenly City.”","After saying that, he took out a mask from his pocket.","This mask was a one-time-use artifact created by Silver Trigram.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber observed the unconscious muscular cultivator carefully and put on the mask.","Soon after, his appearance changed, becoming the same as the muscular Venerable. He even managed to copy the mark on the other party’s wrist, as well as their facial structure and body shape.","However, because he was still covered by the gray liquid, his figure was only the size of a fingernail.","After disguising himself, or rather shapeshifting, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber clenched his fists and performed a set of basic punches on the spot.","“The muscles all over my body seem to be real. This is not just some simple disguise!” Thrice Reckless murmured.","He felt as if he had really turned into the muscular Venerable.","The disguise technique of the Metal Trigram clan was truly miraculous.","In the future, who could recognize Copper Trigram if he became this good?","At the same time, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber had a sudden thought.","Copper Trigram... Is he really Copper Trigram ?","From what they knew, Copper Trigram belonged to the family of Metal Trigrams, and above Copper Trigram seemed to be Silver Trigram, while above Silver Trigram appeared to be Gold Trigram.","However , Copper Trigram never seemed to have mentioned having a master named Silver Trigram, or the existence of a Gold Trigram.","“Perhaps there are no Silver or Gold Trigram in the world and all of them are just Copper Trigram in disguise...” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber pinched his chin and thought.","“Senior Thrice Reckless, Senior Copper Trigram has a disciple named Iron Trigram.” The voice of the black-skinned Soft Feather came from the strand of hair, reminding Thrice Reckless Mad Saber of something he seemed to have overlooked.","“That’s right.” Thrice Reckless laughed and decided to stop thinking about this matter for now.","Afterward, he made a hand seal, and his figure emerged from the gray liquid.","When he emerged from the liquid, his figure swelled rapidly. In a blink of an eye, he reverted to his normal size.","Sixteen asked, “Does Senior Thrice Reckless want to rely on the disguise to find the Sage’s resurrection formation?”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber nodded and said, “Yes. This guy happens to be seriously injured, so I can make use of his identity to move around the battlefield.’","Pavilion Master Chu asked, “The question is, what should we do with this Seventh Stage Venerable?”","Sister White Dragon hesitated for a moment and said, “If possible... Let him live.”","While they were conversing, the virtuous lamia emerged from the gray liquid.","She stretched out her hand, and the fat virtuous whale appeared.","The fat whale looked at the seriously injured Venerable and swallowed him in one go. That solved the problem of how to deal with him for the moment.","Sister White Dragon asked, “Fairy your fat whale won’t end up digesting him, right?”","The virtuous lamia giggled, and she patted the virtuous fat whale lightly.","In the next moment, the belly of the fat whale squirmed.","The injuries that the muscular cultivator had suffered began to recover. The virtuous fat whale actually had a healing ability.","After the virtuous fat whale swallowed the cultivator , the virtuous lamia returned into the gray liquid and went back to being the size of a fingernail.","At the same time, hurried footsteps could be heard coming from outside the pit.","‘Quickly! Quickly rescue the injured Venerable Azure Reckless. He’s in the pit!” Someone from the medical staff of the Heavenly City could be heard shouting from outside the pit.","Azure Reckless?","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “"]},{"number":2206,"title":"Chapter 2206 She might be another Thrice Reckless","paragraphs":["2206 She might be another Thrice Reckless","Thrice Reckless felt as if the other party’s daoist name was an attempt to insult him.[1]","In fact, there were many similar situations in the world of cultivation.","For example, there was a well-known forging master in the Jade Silk Artifact Sect in the North of China, and their daoist name was Daoist Prosperity.","And then in the Slaughter Saber Alliance, which was in the same area as the Jade Silk Artifact Sect, there was a famous saber cultivator who went by the daoist name “Slicing Prosperity.”","Because the two sects were situated in the same area, there were occasional exchange conferences between them.","As elites of the two factions, it was difficult for Daoist Prosperity and Slicing Prosperity to avoid meeting each other.","When people started introducing them, the scene usually went like this...","[This is the Daoist Prosperity of the Jade Silk Artifact Sect.]","[This is the saber cultivator Slicing Prosperity of the Slaughter Saber Alliance.]","The scent of gunpowder would immediately pervade the area.","??????","“Immediately bring Venerable Azure Reckless out of the pit!” The medical staff swiftly came over and jumped into the pit.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber hastily closed his eyes, suppressed his aura, and faked a state of serious injury. At the same time, he reached out and scooped up the gray liquid into his hand.","Things were going smoothly for now, other than the daoist name Azure Reckless making him feel a little stifled.","The only thing that he had to watch out for was the respawn time of Skylark. He could only hope that she would not come back to life while the medical team of the Heavenly City was bringing him out of the pit.","The members of the medical team gently moved Thrice Reckless Mad Saber onto a flying sword and then brought him out of the deep pit.","“Be careful, don’t cause Venerable Azure Reckless’ wounds to open up.”","“Hurry up. There are still many companions waiting for us to transport them!”","During the transportation, a member of the Heavenly City’s medical team suggested, “Venerable Azure Reckless is severely injured. We should give him first aid first.”","Then one after another, healing magical techniques fell on Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s body, but the wounds on Thrice Reckless did not heal.","Someone said out loud, “This is not good. Our healing techniques are too low-leveled. Venerable Azure Reckless’ injuries are the result of the attacks of a Seventh Stage Venerable. Our healing techniques are too weak for him... Feed him healing pills first to stabilize his injuries.”","A medical staff opened Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s mouth and stuffed several pills with unknown effects into it in one go.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “...”","Brother, I am in a “coma” and severely-injured state! You just stuffed so many pills into my mouth without holding back, and a few of those pills aren’t the type to instantly melt after entering one’s mouth! There are even a few big ones! Are you not afraid of choking me to death?!","While Thrice Reckless was feeling greatly stifled, one of the medical staff activated the “manual chewing mode” and helped him chew the pills in his mouth.","However, this person was by no means as gentle as Fairy Creation or the virtuous lamia. When the medical staff was manually bringing Thrice Reckless’ jaw up and down to chew on the pills, Thrice Reckless felt a fair amount of pain from how hard their grip on his chin was.","This scene was broadcasted by Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair.","Sixteen, Sister White Dragon, and the black-skinned Soft Feather watched the entire event silently.","??????","Although the Heavenly City’s medical team was particularly rough with how they carried out their treatment, the effect was good.","Not long after, the pills in Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s mouth were chewed into fine pieces.","However, because he did not know the specific effects of these pills, Thrice Reckless kept the pill fragments in his mouth and did not swallow them immediately.","He wanted to try to distinguish the effects of these pills before swallowing them.","Luckily, he had some experience in distinguishing the effects of pills.","When he was young, he and a little monster stole the pills of a certain alchemy master and treated them as jelly beans. In addition, over the years, due to various reasons, he had ended up eating countless medicinal pills, so he could roughly gauge their effects from their taste.","“Senior Dong, Venerable Azure Reckless’ coma is too deep. He isn’t swallowing the pills!” the medical staff who was holding Thrice Reckless’s jaw called out anxiously.","Senior Dong, who was at the front, replied without turning his head, “Use a magical technique to force the pills down Venerable Azure Reckless’ throat.”","The medical staff replied, “But I don’t know such a magical technique.”","Senior Dong said out loud, “Does anyone here know such a magical technique? If any of you do, then please hurry up and help Venerable Azure Reckless swallow down the pills.”","“Senior, we are the medical personnel of the psychological and inner demon department. None of us knows such a magical technique,” one of the medical staff replied with a wry smile.","On weekdays, they were responsible for giving psychological counseling to the practitioners of the Heavenly City, loosening their mental barriers and reducing the chance of them developing inner demons.","The members of their department only knew some simple healing techniques. During battles, the task of going out to rescue the wounded and bringing them back fell on them.","The medical personnel who were really in charge of treating the wounded were already fainting from overwork at the rear of the battlefield, and they were unable to divert any more staff to the battlefield.","Senior Dong gritted his teeth and said, “Then, there is no other way. Use your mouth to help Venerable Azure Reckless swallow the medicine. Don’t waste any more time.”","The medical staff who was holding Thrice Reckless’s chin could not help but freeze when he heard what Senior Dong said.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber felt a sharp pain in his jaw due to it being pinched too hard.","??????","Inside the space in Senior White’s sleeve.","The black-skinned Soft Feather, Sixteen, and Sister White Dragon were sitting side by side as they watched the live broadcast.","Faced with the situation where a mouth-to-mouth procedure was about to be carried out to help him swallow the pills, what would Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber choose to do?","The flying sword that was transporting Thrice Reckless continued to steadily head toward the rear of the battlefield.","Senior Dong urged, “Saving lives is of utmost importance!”","The consciousness of Thrice Reckless Mad Saber quietly swept across the medical team that was transporting him. There were no women, only burly men.","The medical staff pinching his chin gritted his teeth and seemed to have made up his mind.","While the flying sword continued moving at the same speed, he lowered his head and leaned towards Thrice Reckless’ face.","“Gulp~ Gulp~” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber gulped loudly.","He swallowed very loudly, making sure that it was impossible for the other party to miss it!","He had confirmed that most of the pills in his mouth were medicinal pills for healing internal injuries and enhancing spiritual energy.","They would heal the body if one had injuries, or act as a supplement if there were no injuries.","They were basically no different from jelly beans for him.","It was just that there were a little more of these “jelly beans” in his mouth than he was normally used to, and he had to swallow them all in one go.","“Venerable Azure Reckless has swallowed the medicine!” The medical staff attending to him was relieved.","Helping a patient swallow medicine mouth-to-mouth was not something unacceptable to medical staff, but it didn’t mean that they liked doing it.","Senior Dong praised, “Liang, you are truly understanding.”","Then, he waved his hand, and another flying sword was brought over from not far away.","Lying on the flying sword was a beautiful fairy maiden who was also seriously injured and unconscious.","Senior Dong said encouragingly, “I’ll leave it to you to feed Fairy Yuanyuan medicinal pills!”","Was this the rainbow after the heavy rain?","Only an understanding man could be trusted with heavy tasks such as this.","On the flying sword next to them, the unconscious Fairy Yuanyuan trembled slightly, but the degree with which she trembled was so small that nobody noticed.","But Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, who was watching nearby, noticed this detail clearly.","Pavilion Master Chu said, “There is something wrong with this Fairy Yuanyuan. She might be another Thrice Reckless!”","[1] Azure Reckless sounds similar to Fuck Reckless, hence his reaction."]},{"number":2207,"title":"Chapter 2207 A hungry Seventh Stage Venerable","paragraphs":["2207 A hungry Seventh Stage Venerable","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “???”","The black-skinned Soft Feather explained, “Senior Chu is trying to say that this Fairy Yuanyuan might also be wearing a disguise. As for the original Fairy Yuanyuan... she might not be among us anymore.”","The tip of Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair nodded. “Exactly.”","Sister White Dragon added, “She should be a part of the invader’s camp. She’s trying to sneak in from the backlines.”","“While launching a direct attack, they are sneakily sending in ‘injured’ people through the rear... Their real target may be something located in the lair of the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City. Additionally, it should be something that can be carried away by one or more people.” Sixteen voiced out her thoughts.","Pavilion Master Chu added, “It may also be that they are simply trying to create chaos by sneaking in through the rear. Once they are deep enough, they can destroy the control center of this secret realm and achieve their true goal.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “However, there are still two Tribulation-Transcender-level fighters guarding the lair of the members of the Heavenly City. Even if they reach the control center, it won’t be easy to damage it.”","Sister White Dragon said, “Actually, I’ve got a bad feeling.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair swayed slightly. “Me too. I suspect that the goal of this fake Fairy Yuanyuan coincides with ours.”","Hearing this, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber felt pain in his liver.","I just want to take a look at the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation and see if it can actually revive the long-dead Sage. Is it necessary to make me go through so many trials?","Can’t I just be allowed to sneak into the formation, summon Senior Skylark, then call it a day and safely escape from the lair of the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City?","??????","Fairy Yuanyuan seemed to be internally struggling, and her fingers were twitching very slightly.","“She appears to be struggling. She must be deciding on whether or not she should wake up from her ‘coma’,” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair zoomed in on the fake Fairy Yuanyuan and explained. “She must have heard the words of this Senior Dong. She probably does not want to be fed pills by that Liang guy, but if she wants to get in, it would be much easier for her to do so by pretending to be unconscious. Because while in an unconscious state, she would not need to talk to anyone, thus the chance of her slipping up is much smaller.”","Afterward, Pavilion Master Chu zoomed out.","On the screen, members of the medical team were looking enviously at Fellow Daoist Liang.","At the front of the team, Senior Dong said, “Don’t waste time! Liang, give Fairy Yuanyuan some medicine.”","In the end, the fake Fairy Yuanyuan decided to not wake up.","Pavilion Master Chu said, [It seems that she has made up her mind and is going to continue playing unconscious until the very end.]","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan had indeed made up her mind. She remembered how “Venerable Azure Reckless” had been fed pills.","First, the pills were manually chewed in his mouth, and only when Venerable Azure Reckless could not swallow the paste was the mouth-to-mouth procedure brought up.","If it happened to her, she could follow Venerable Azure Reckless’ example and swallow the pills before anything of that happened.","With this thought in mind, the fake Fairy Yuanyuan made her choice.","On the flying sword next to her, Liang took out several pills. He then pinched Fairy Yuanyuan’s chin and opened her mouth.","He did everything professionally and sincerely!","This was an honest person who has never been corrupted.","If this opportunity to feed the fairy maiden was given to his companions, there was a high probability that they would directly chew the pills and feed them to Fairy Yuanyuan.","However, Liang followed the procedure honestly and helped Fairy Yuanyuan manually chew the medicinal pills first.","His companions cast complicated glances at him.","They felt that such a great opportunity was wasted on this honest man.","It was really lucky for Fairy Yuanyuan that it was an honest man such as this one that was treating her. Seeing this, she secretly heaved a sigh of relief.","But at this moment, Senior Dong said, “Stop wasting time. Fairy Yuanyuan’s injuries are worse than Venerable Azure Reckless. Additionally, she is not a body-tempering cultivator. Even if you help her chew the pills manually, she won’t be able to swallow them. Just skip the manual chewing portion and go to the third step.”","“Ah? Oh, ok.” Liang nodded silently.","After saying that, he stuffed several pills into his mouth and started chewing them up...","The plot so far had been unpredictable and caught people off guard time and time again.","Sixteen, the black-skinned Soft Feather, and Sister White Dragon could all feel the deep despair of the fake Fairy Yuanyuan through the projection.","On the screen, the honest Liang kept flying on his flying sword while lowering his head to feed Fairy Yuanyuan the medicine.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair deliberately enlarged this shot. She was going to teach the young Sixteen and the black-skinned Soft Feather a lesson.","But just when she was about to give a lecture, she found that she only had theoretical knowledge herself... She did not have any practical experience on this topic either!","In the end, Pavilion Master Chu remained silent.","The black-skinned Soft Feather stared at the image, forcing herself to keep looking to preserve her dignity as an inner demon.","Sixteen looked at this scene, and then turned her head to look at Song Shuhang, thoughtful.","??????","Meanwhile, outside of Senior White’s sleeve.","[Hahaha.] Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was elated.","Keep on acting! This is what you get for trying to mess with my plan!","Just as he was celebrating, a gentle voice suddenly sounded in his ear, “Senior Gangfeng, why am I being forcefully fed medicine while you got to avoid it? The world is so unfair!”","This gentle voice was speaking in the language of the ancient era.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was currently studying the basics of the language of the ancient era, so he could understand some of the words.","With everything taking place, it was easy to guess what was happening.","This gentle voice was coming from none other than the fake Fairy Yuanyuan, who was forcefully kissed by the medical staff.","And she seemed to regard Thrice Reckless Mad Saber as one of her seniors, someone called Gangfeng.","In their plans, this Gangfeng should have been in charge of looking for an opportunity to replace Venerable Azure Reckless and sneak into the lair of the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City.","Now, Fairy Yuanyuan mistook Thrice Reckless for her companion.","[Interesting, interesting!] Thousands of thoughts flashed through Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s mind.","Every idea brought him great excitement.","??????","Inside Senior White’s sleeve.","Pavilion Master Chu fixed the camera on Thrice Reckless and Fairy Yuanyuan, watching them as they were carried to the backlines where they would wait for further treatment.","After dropping off the patients, Senior Dong led the medical staff and hurried back to the frontlines to bring back other wounded people.","Thrice Reckless and Fairy Yuanyuan lay on the ground quietly, looking for an opportunity to escape; neither of them moved.","The picture projected on the screen looked rather boring at this time.","“Gurgle~” All of a sudden, Song Shuhang’s stomach let out a loud noise.","The black-skinned Soft Feather looked at Song Shuhang doubtfully. “Is Senior Song hungry?”","Generally speaking, Seventh Stage Venerables no longer had a real need for food unless they consumed too much of their energy.","Has Senior Song been consuming a lot of energy while unconscious?","“I’ll give him a fasting pill.” Sixteen took out a small bottle from her pocket and took out a pill.","Then, under the puzzled eyes of the black-skinned Soft Feather, she calmly put the fasting pill into her mouth."]},{"number":2208,"title":"Chapter 2208 Enhanced Draconic Might, a move that can only be used once a month","paragraphs":["2208 Enhanced Draconic Might, a move that can only be used once a month","‘Practice what you have learned.’ Was there not a saying that went like this?","Is there anything more joyful in this world than being able to put something into practice immediately after learning it?","Sixteen was all about applying what she learned now.","She chewed the fasting pill, helped Song Shuhang up, and leaned closer to him.","“Wait... wait!” said the black-skinned Soft Feather.","Her intuition as an inner demon told her that it was a little wrong for Sixteen to continue what she was doing.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair: “...”","Sister White Dragon: “...”","In fact, Sixteen was very nervous right now. Her heart of virtue was beating like a drum, and it felt as if it could break at any moment.","With great difficulty, she mustered up the courage to bring her face closer to Song Shuhang’s. She knew what she had to do next, and she had prepared herself for it.","But when she saw Song Shuhang’s face, she began to falter and second-guess herself.","She was especially daunted by the black-skinned Soft Feather’s words, which made her feel at a loss.","If Song Shuhang were to wake up at this time...","This thought flashed through Sixteen’s mind.","Then, as if her thought had triggered a certain precondition, Song Shuhang, who had been unconscious until now, suddenly opened his eyes.","The duo stared at each other.","Sixteen: “...”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair curled up.","Sister White Dragon sighed inwardly.","??????","Song Shuhang was busy comprehending the Benevolent Saber he got from Striped Dragon Two.","This saber intent left some information in his mind after unleashing that last attack.","He wasn’t looking to fully comprehend this saber intent but wanted to obtain a superficial understanding of it. He still had some self-awareness; a saber intent that belonged to the ruler of the Netherworld was not something that a small cultivator like him could master so easily.","During the comprehension process, his physical, spiritual, and mental energy were being consumed continuously.","If not for his divine sense and mental energy getting strengthened by the three-eyed young man’s data stream, he would not have been able to keep up with the consumption rate.","If he had forced it, perhaps his brain would have exploded halfway through the comprehension process.","Because of the excessive consumption, he started to feel hungry. Song Shuhang was starved to the point of suffering, and he woke up suddenly from starvation.","As soon as he opened his eyes, he saw Sixteen’s little face approaching his own.","Her cheeks were bulging, as if she was about to give him artificial respiration.","The duo looked at each other.","Cute. This thought popped up in Song Shuhang’s mind.","Sixteen, with her bulging cheeks, looked like a cute little hamster.","Reason told Song Shuhang that it would be best for him to close his eyes and pretend to fall unconscious again.","However, Sixteen looked so cute that he could not help but take a second look at her.","??????","“I can’t stand it anymore.” Sister White Dragon could not bear it any longer.","Her dragon head turned around, and a pair of golden pupils stared intently at Song Shuhang.","She unleashed an innate ability.","This was an innate ability that Sister White Dragon could only use once a month—Enhanced Draconic Might.","Her draconic might was already at the top among true dragons. Once her innate ability strengthened it even further, it could affect even Immortals.","Of course, when she used her draconic might on Song Shuhang, she didn’t use her full strength and only used it for an instant.","In this way, she could force him to fall unconscious without hurting him.","Song Shuhang felt his vision go dark—this was a new type of mental pain that he had not felt before and had yet to be recorded by his pain endurance skill.","Moreover, the impact had only lasted for a split second, so his innate skill failed to develop a resistance against it.","After being hit by the powerful draconic might, Song Shuhang’s eyes rolled upward, and he passed out once again.","??????","[That’s cheating.] Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair transmitted her voice to Sister White Dragon.","Won’t it be more interesting if Shuhang were awake? Why did you knock him out?","Sister White Dragon: [What are you going to do about it? Bite me?]","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","If it was not for my strand of hair not having a mouth or teeth, I would have definitely bitten that head of yours!","??????","After Sixteen saw that Song Shuhang had passed out, she was a little bit disappointed but also happy.","Because from the moment Shuhang opened his eyes, the meaning of her actions had completely changed.","However, now that Shuhang had already figured out what she was going to do... It seemed even more inappropriate for her to give up halfway.","“Gurgle~” Song Shuhang’s stomach made another gurgling sound.","Sixteen did not hesitate anymore and followed the plan that she had played in her mind dozens of times.","This time around, she would try to become familiar with the process. Next time, she could use this experience to feed Song Shuhang medicine when he was awake.","??????","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair twirled slightly.","Biting the Ancestral Golden Dragon was impossible as her strand of hair did not have the ability to bite people. Also, her head could not leave Song Shuhang’s Inner World.","[Since you decided to cheat, don’t blame me for cheating too!] Pavilion Master Chu flicked the tip of her hair, and secretly used a secret technique.","Pavilion Master Chu’s hair was one of her primary weapons and an important part of her body. Every strand of her hair had been infused with spiritual energy and could store things like divine sense and consciousnesses.","After she activated her secret technique, Song Shuhang’s consciousness was secretly extracted from his body and transferred to her strand of hair.","When Sixteen leaned over and pressed her lips against his... Song Shuhang’s consciousness was in the strand of hair and thus awake.","Pavilion Master Chu’s and Song Shuhang’s consciousnesses manifested in a humanoid form and sat side by side within the strand of hair, watching Sixteen ‘feeding him medicine’ from the perspective of a third party.","“What do you think, little friend Tyrannical Song?” Pavilion Master Chu clenched her right hand into an empty fist and brought it close to Song Shuhang’s mouth, asking him a question in the tone of an interviewer.","Song Shuhang replied, “It tastes good.”","“Apart from that, do you have any other thoughts?” After Pavilion Master Chu finished speaking, she placed her empty fist close to Song Shuhang’s mouth once again.","“Next time, if possible, I hope that Senior Chu can quietly wake me up after Sister White Dragon knocks me out,” said Song Shuhang sincerely.","After his consciousness left his body, he could only watch from the sidelines without interacting with the scene.","Pavilion Master Chu asked, “Do you still want to experience the feeling of being fed medicine?”","“If there is a chance,” Song Shuhang replied.","Pavilion Master Chu nodded. She then pointed at herself and said, “Shall I help you with that?”","“Senior, you?” Song Shuhang looked at Pavilion Master Chu’s red lips, and calmly waved his hands. How could he take such an obvious bait?","While he was waving his hand, Pavilion Master Chu’s fist turned into a palm and hit his chin. Song Shuhang was knocked down by a soft force.","When he fell to the ground and rolled over, he found a third spiritual body sitting beside him and Pavilion Master Chu."]},{"number":2209,"title":"Chapter 2209 Amazing even in death","paragraphs":["2209 Amazing even in death","This third spiritual body was Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit.","The ghost spirit was one with him, so when his consciousness was drawn over by Pavilion Master Chu’s secret technique, the ghost spirit’s consciousness was also drawn over and transferred to the strand of hair.","Under normal circumstances, the appearance of a ghost spirit should be exactly like that of its host. However, Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit had a completely different appearance from him, and it was female on top of that.","Moreover, his ghost spirit’s consciousness appeared to be very young, only about five or six years old.","Strange, why is my ghost spirit’s consciousness so weak? Song Shuhang thought to himself, wondering if there was something wrong with his ghost spirit.","“Do you see? This is your ghost spirit’s consciousness.” Pavilion Master Chu moved past Song Shuhang, reaching out to hold his ghost spirit in her arms like she was holding a baby.","With a dull expression on her face, the ghost spirit allowed Pavilion Master Chu to hold her without resisting.","Song Shuhang nodded. “Yeah, I can see her.”","Pavilion Master Chu hugged Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit and continued, “You should know that the senses of a ghost spirit are synced with its host’s. As such... If you want to experience what it’s like to be fed medicine again, I can let you experience it indirectly through your ghost spirit.”","“Senior, I feel that if I were to accept your offer, you’d beat me to death,” said Song Shuhang calmly. He was not at all tempted by Pavilion Master Chu’s beauty.","With how firm his will was, how could he be affected by this degree of temptation?","Pavilion Master Chu fell back lazily. “...You really have fate with Buddhism.”","“No, I do not. That’s not true.” Song Shuhang shook his head repeatedly.","Even though he had ascended to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, he did not want to become a monk.","He still wanted to get married and have children like ordinary people, and it would be best if he could have a boy and a girl in correspondence with the national two-child policy.","He would watch his daughter grow up day by day, and marry her off to a young man with a blurred face when she was of age, wishing her well.","Then, late at night, he and his wife would huddle under a quilt and weep quietly.","Although it was not easy for a Seventh Stage Venerable to have children, it was not impossible since Venerable Spirit Butterfly had Soft Feather after reaching the Venerable Realm.","As long as they worked hard, a Seventh Stage Venerable could still have a daughter!","Senior Spirit Butterfly was his role model.","As long as he had faith and worked hard, he could even have a second child after his daughter got married. In this way, the birth of his second child could reduce the sadness brought about by the marriage of his eldest daughter.","Pavilion Master Chu sat up again. She watched Song Shuhang’s face, which was rich with changes, and felt like she was watching a short movie.","“What if I promise not to kill you? Do you want to try? Anyway, I’m just going to feed your ghost spirit medicine with my mouth. I don’t mind your ghost spirit getting close to me.” Pavilion Master Chu continued to ask.","Song Shuhang’s ghost spirit gave her a very strange feeling. It was a feeling beyond kinship; it was as if they shared a deep level of trust that could not be described with words.","Song Shuhang shook his head even harder this time. “No need. After all, Senior Chu is old enough to be my great ancestor, and having you do that would make me feel rather strange.”","Pavilion Master Chu: “???”","Shuhang was good at a lot of things. But sometimes, he forgot to use his brain before speaking.","Pavilion Master Chu gripped Song Shuhang’s petite ghost spirit and used her as a weapon, slamming her into Shuhang’s face. The ghost spirit and Song Shuhang were one, so hitting Song Shuhang with his ghost spirit should bring him double the pain!","Even though she was wielded as a weapon, the ghost spirit continued to have the same dull expression on her face and did not resist.","After spinning one, she hit Song Shuhang’s face.","Pavilion Master Chu shouted, “Go!”","The consciousnesses of Song Shuhang and the ghost spirit were kicked out of her strand of hair and back to Song Shuhang’s body.","Shuhang had learned from his previous experience and did not open his eyes this time.","When he returned to his body, Sixteen was slowly rising up from him.","Song Shuhang could still feel the fragrance lingering in his mouth.","There was a fragrant and fruity taste, as well as the taste of Sixteen.","Did I brush my teeth today?","Ah, wait... I’m now a Seventh Stage Venerable, and I don’t need to brush my teeth. Let alone today, it’s normal even if I were to not brush my teeth for a whole year!","He felt the hunger in his stomach begin to disappear. Fasting pills were a great thing; delicious and very useful.","Sixteen asked softly, “Are you awake?”","Don’t you dare wake up, don’t you dare wake up! Song Shuhang thought to himself.","If he were to open his eyes now, Sister White Dragon might reward him with another round of her draconic might!","And so, he continued to pretend to be unconscious and remained motionless.","Secretly, he focused his attention on his lips.","There was still some warmth left behind by Sixteen, and another sensation as well.","After carefully trying to figure out what it was, he felt that this sensation was very weird, just as if he had kissed himself.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Is Senior Song still hungry?”","She felt that she had to do something and occasionally perform her inner demon duties.","I’m not hungry anymore but thank you, Butterfly Song White Creation Yellow Trigram Lychee Six Dou Phoenix, Song Shuhang thought to himself. He did not dare to reply to her or use the secret sound transmission technique.","Sister White Dragon was a big shot. If he used the secret sound transmission technique, she would definitely notice the fluctuations caused by the technique.","??????","Meanwhile, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber and Fairy Yuanyuan finally found a chance to escape.","Taking advantage of the increasing number of patients and the medical team being too busy, the two slipped off the hospital bed without attracting attention.","Everything went smoothly. Luck was on their side.","After leaving the place where the wounded were being treated, the two successfully sneaked into the depths of the base.","They met no obstacles on their way.","“Senior Gangfeng, let’s split up,” said Fairy Yuanyuan said to Thrice Reckless Mad Saber via sound transmission. “According to the information we received, the legendary Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation should be hidden in this area.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber nodded expressionlessly.","It was really as the seniors had guessed. The target of the invading force was the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation.","What were they planning to do? Did they want to bring the Scholarly Sage back to life?","Could it be that they were members of the scholarly faction?","Several guesses flashed through Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s mind.","“Senior, the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation can definitely withstand the strength of the Venerable Emperor. The survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City wanted to transform it into a formation that would resurrect the Heavenly Emperor, but they did not expect that they would end up doing the work for us,” transmitted Fairy Yuanyuan.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber nodded silently.","I see...","No wonder the members of the Ancient Heavenly Court created a base around the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation. They wanted to resurrect the Heavenly Emperor.","And what the invading forces want to do is something similar. They also want to use the formation to resurrect this “Venerable Emperor.”","The Scholarly Sage was truly amazing. Even a resurrection formation of his could attract all kinds of forces and make them dance for it."]},{"number":2210,"title":"Chapter 2210 Tyrannical Song has remotely sent you a request for help","paragraphs":["2210 Tyrannical Song has remotely sent you a request for help","The fake Fairy Yunayuan agreed on a way to contact Thrice Reckless. Then, they parted ways to search for the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation.","After the fake Fairy Yuanyuan left, Thrice Reckless quickly shared the information that he had obtained with Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, passing it on to everyone through her.","“Are the members of the Heavenly City trying to repurpose the formation to resurrect the Heavenly Emperor?” Sister White Dragon frowned. It seemed like the Heavenly Emperor did not bother to contact the members of the Heavenly City after possessing Soft Feather’s ghost spirit. It looked like she was hiding things even from her old allies.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said, “And that invading force also wants to repurpose the resurrection formation to resurrect this Venerable Emperor. By the way, who is this Venerable Emperor? Have any of you ever heard of them?”","Ever since the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion had been destroyed, she had lived inside the illusory reality. She lacked a lot of information about the outside world and had never heard of anyone that went by the name ‘Venerable Emperor’.","“They sound quite powerful, but I have never heard of any legend concerning someone named ‘Venerable Emperor’.” The black-skinned Soft Feather shook her head.","She sat beside the unconscious Senior Song, wanting to see if Senior Song would get hungry again so that she could perform her duties as an inner demon.","Sixteen also shook her head. “The Spirit River Su Clan has no records of anyone that goes by that name.”","Song Shuhang, who was “unconscious,” also started searching for the keyword ‘Venerable Emperor’ in his mind.","A moment later...","What am I even searching for? Today is the first time that I’ve heard of a big shot that goes by the name ‘Venerable Emperor’! Song Shuhang felt that his mind was a little slow now. It was probably an aftereffect of Sister White Dragon’s draconic might.","At this time, what he wanted to search was not his memory; he wanted to search online.","After all, he still had his chat group.","And so, Song Shuhang began to secretly fiddle with the chat.","[Send a group message!] Song Shuhang began to try to use the chat.","He remembered that as long as he willed it, he could send messages to all of his friends through the Cultivation chat group.","With the urging of Song Shuhang’s will, the chat group was successfully activated.","[Beep~ Tyrannical Song has initiated a remote request for help. The specific content of the request for help is as follows: “Seniors, Fellow Daoists, Fairies, does anyone know of some ‘Venerable Emperor’? I’ll be waiting for answers, very urgent!” Would you like to help Tyrannical Song? Yes/No.]","That’s more like it. After blocking the friends that are on the Ancient Heavenly City Friend List, send the message to everyone!","The members of the Ancient Heavenly City List had to be blocked before he sent the message.","Now, he just had to wait and see who among the fellow daoists in his friend list had any information on this Venerable Emperor.","I’m so witty, Song Shuhang praised himself.","After the next evolution, it would be great if an “AI service” could be added to the group chat. That would make its management much easier.","?????","After a while, the group request for help was sent to all available friends on the list.","Then...","Sister White Dragon, Pavilion Master Chu, and Sixteen all lowered their heads and looked at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang, who was pretending to be unconscious, sensed several gazes focusing on his body.","Oh my god, I’m dead.","When he sent that message for help, he only thought of preventing the members of the Ancient Heavenly City List from receiving it. He had completely forgotten about Sister White Dragon and Pavilion Master Chu.","The aftereffects of Sister White Dragon’s draconic might are really scary. My mind has become so confused, and I keep on overlooking important details!","At this time, there was no longer any point in pretending to be unconscious.","Song Shuhang could only open his eyes in embarrassment. “Would you believe me if I said that I was sleepchatting?”","Pavilion Master Chu smiled and said, “Your Cultivation chat group is becoming more and more practical.”","[Beep~ Pavilion Master Chu has rejected your request.]","Sister White Dragon grabbed her chin with her claw and looked at Song Shuhang thoughtfully.","[Beep~ The Ancestral Golden Dragon has rejected your request.]","“Has anyone replied?” Sixteen subconsciously avoided Song Shuhang’s gaze and asked in a low voice.","Sixteen’s shy appearance was really sweet.","Song Shuhang shook his head and said, “Not yet.”","[Beep~ Demon Emperor Hezhi has rejected your request. Postscript: Beep Beep Beep~]","Demon Emperor Hezhi seemed to be fuming.","When Song Shuhang saw this postscript, he imagined him inflating like a pufferfish.","[Beep~ The Indestructible Lord has rejected your request. Postscript: Snore~ Snore~]","[Beep~ The blacklisted ‘Almighty Merchant’ has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: I have information.]","“Information?” Song Shuhang jumped up from the ground.","Sister White Dragon asked curiously, “Who has information?”","“It’s the Almighty Merchant. He said he has information on the Venerable Emperor... Hey, wait a minute. He did not agree to my request.” Song Shuhang noticed that the Almighty Merchant had transferred energy to send him a message instead of accepting the request.","[Almighty Merchant: Do you want it? If you want my information, I will sell it to you for a thousand Fifth Stage spirit stones!]","“One... one thousand Fifth Stage spirit stones...” Song Shuhang flinched when he heard this number.","Should I buy this information?","[Beep~ The blacklisted ‘Fairy Cheng Lin’: Why are you asking about the Venerable Emperor?]","Eh? Fairy Cheng Lin seems to know something!","Song Shuhang hastily sent a drop of energy back with a postscript: [The Venerable Emperor’s old subordinates are attacking the base of the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City. They are aiming for the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation and plan to use it to revive the Venerable Emperor. Does Fairy Cheng Lin have any information about this Venerable Emperor?]","After replying, Song Shuhang remembered something else and turned and looked to the side.","When he turned to the side, he saw Fairy Creation, who was very well-behaved today, sitting beside him silently.","Song Shuhang asked, “Fairy Creation, does the scholarly faction know about the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation?”","The survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City, the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates, Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark... so many people knew about the resurrection formation left behind by the Scholarly Sage.","But what about the scholarly faction?","Fairy Creation raised her head to look at Song Shuhang. She nodded, but then shook her head.","The black-skinned Soft Feather looked puzzled.","What does she mean by nodding and shaking her head?","Song Shuhang explained, “The scholarly faction probably knew in the past, but the current members do not know about it.”","It looked like the scholarly faction was hit really hard.","Not only had their experts fallen, but even the knowledge that had been passed on appeared to be fragmentary.","At this time, Fairy Cheng Lin sent another postscript: [I should have thought of it earlier. You were running around the Beast Realm a short while ago, and now you’re fighting against the members of the Ancient Heavenly City... You must currently be in the base of the survivors of the Heavenly City located in the Beast Realm, right?]","Across his Cultivation chat group, Song Shuhang could feel the helplessness in Fairy Cheng Lin’s tone."]},{"number":2211,"title":"Chapter 2211 And then, it opened on its own","paragraphs":["2211 And then, it opened on its own","The helplessness in Fairy Cheng Lin’s tone immediately made Song Shuhang think of a certain possibility.","He quickly asked: [Fairy... Could it be that you are the Venerable Emperor?]","After Song Shuhang sent this message, Fairy Cheng Lin quickly replied.","[Fairy Cheng Lin: Like hell I’m the Venerable Emperor! Let those subordinates of his find you immediately so that they can dig a hole and bury you inside, lest you cause any more trouble!]","Song Shuhang: “...”","Although I do often stir up trouble, it was really not my fault that I ended up in the base of the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City. I was brought here by Senior White while I was in a coma. Also, it’s Senior Thrice Reckless who’s jumping all over the place right now.","[Fairy Cheng Lin: The Venerable Emperor is someone who lived very long ago. He existed even before the era of the third Wielder of the Will, so it is normal for you to not know of him. The Venerable Emperor was a “god of nature,” and he ruled over a group of gods who were also related to nature. He once conquered most of the universe, but due to the limitations of a “natural god,” his life was bound to have a start and an end. He had no fate with the Heaven’s Will, able to wield only a small portion of the Wielder’s authority. He wanted to break through these limitations and made many attempts to do so. In the end, he failed and died thoroughly. Ever since the third Wielder of the Will came to be, no one has ever seen him. Even his subordinate gods seemed to have gone into hiding.]","Fairy Cheng Lin quickly recounted the origin of the Venerable Emperor.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin and fell into thought.","After careful consideration, he asked: [Fairy Cheng Lin, how can you write so many words in one post? Any tips?]","He asked because when the number of words in his postscript surpassed a certain limit, the message could not be sent or it would get cut short.","?????","When Fairy Cheng Lin received Song Shuhang’s message, her fingers froze.","In an instant, billions of plans popped up in her mind, all about how to crush the spirit of the first Sage in a thousand years.","In the past, she was the one who challenged the limits of other people’s patience. But ever since she got acquainted with Tyrannical Song, she would always get the urge to strangle him and become particularly irritable.","While Fairy Cheng Lin was thinking, Song Shuhang sent another message.","This time, it was an apology. [Thank you for the information, Fairy Cheng Lin. I just received a blow from Sister White Dragon’s draconic might, so my mind is still a bit befuddled. Because of that, I keep saying and writing weird things. So if I have offended you in any way... Fairy, come and fight me! Uh, I mean. Fairy, please forgive me.]","Fairy Cheng Lin: “...”","She stretched out her hand and grabbed a phone-shaped magical treasure. She unlocked it and silently opened an app called “Lightning Pack,” ordering a thunderstorm package for Tyrannical Song. She set the time for next month, and the location to Jiangnan area, China, Earth in the main world.","As long as Song Shuhang returned to China, he would be able to enjoy a package of lightning strikes.","Fairy Cheng Lin nodded in satisfaction. Although the package of lightning strikes could not hurt Song Shuhang, it could somewhat let her vent her anger.","At this time, Song Shuhang sent another postscript: [Fairy Cheng Lin, do you know what the Venerable Emperor might be searching for in the base of the survivors of the Heavenly City?]","Even the news of the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation did not surprise Fairy Cheng Lin, and adding that to the helplessness in Fairy Cheng Lin’s tone, a hypothesis emerged in Song Shuhang’s mind.","He sent another postscript: [Fairy Cheng Lin, did you return among the living again and set something in motion?]","After a while...","Fairy Cheng Lin replied: [I secretly guided the Venerable Emperor’s old subordinates and made them attack the base of the survivors of the Heavenly City. I disclosed the news about the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation to his subordinate.]","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky","...Fairy Cheng Lin is indeed a sinful woman.","??????","Meanwhile, Fairy Cheng Lin received a new message. [Beep~ Tyrannical Song: Fairy Cheng Lin is indeed a sinful woman.]","Block, block! Friendship ended!","Fairy Cheng Lin was about to block Song Shuhang when she noticed that she was already on Song Shuhang’s VIP blacklist.","I’m going to extract your ghost spirit again and have you share the pain! Fairy Cheng Lin said hatefully in her mind.","After imagining countless scenarios of torturing Song Shuhang’s through his ghost spirit, she calmed down a lot.","After calming down, Fairy Cheng Lin sent another postscript to Song Shuhang: [Regarding the matter of the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates attacking the survivors of the Heavenly City’s base, do not interrupt them. Just watch silently from the sidelines.]","Song Shuhang quickly replied: [Fairy Cheng Lin, do you want to be reborn through the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation?]","Fairy Cheng Lin said, [I died with no regrets, so why would I want to be resurrected? One of my companions is Daozi of the scholarly faction’s Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders, and it was him who told me of the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation. He wants to retrieve the resurrection formation.]","“Daozi? This name sounds familiar.” Song Shuhang turned to look at Fairy Creation.","After Fairy Creation thought for a while, she stretched out her hand and projected a picture.","Then, the image of the old driver he met when he went to the scholarly faction previously appeared before his eyes.","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “Oh, so it was him. It’s strange how I always forget about him.”","Since it was Daozi of the scholarly faction who was planning things behind the scenes, Shuhang would obediently watch from the sidelines and not stir up trouble.","[Rest assured, Fairy Cheng Lin. I am a person who understands when to take things seriously. I will do my best to hold myself back and quietly watch from the sidelines.] Song Shuhang assured Fairy Cheng Lin.","Just as he said that...","Inside the stone box, Senior White, who was wearing Song Shuhang’s face, opened his eyes and woke up from his meditative state.","Song ‘Senior White’ Shuhang got out of the stone box and stretched himself.","Then, he sniffed lightly.","Senior White said, “This smell... It’s the smell of treasure!”","At the same time, the gray liquid surrounding everyone dispersed.","It then split into two strands and rushed toward the air where the two strings intertwined like DNA.","With this gray liquid as the center, a woman’s body began to take shape in the air.","It was like 3D printing an object.","After the prototype of a body was constructed, long blue hair fell down.","The thick long blue hair was like a cloak, covering the woman’s body.","Her blue eyes slowly opened, her long eyelashes fluttering.","Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark had resurrected.","Skylark said softly, “Is this the place?”","Her voice was not as energetic as before. This downcast tone did not fit her personality.","She gently stretched out her hand and pressed it lightly against the air before her.","A small black dot appeared in her palm.","The resurrection formation left by the Scholarly Sage was hidden in this black dot.","Even though Skylark did not have the method to open the space of the resurrection formation, after sensing Skylark’s aura, the entrance to the space opened automatically."]},{"number":2212,"title":"Chapter 2212 Do you want to ruin the play?","paragraphs":["2212 Do you want to ruin the play?","This was the backdoor left for Skylark by the Scholarly Sage.","Even if the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City had added all kinds of restrictions and anti-theft measures at the entrance to the resurrection formation, none of them would have stopped Skylark—because they only had knowledge about the main entrance.","This back door was only for Skylark, and no one other than the Sage knew about it.","This scene was completely relayed by Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair.","Song Shuhang: “...”","I, Song, am a man who knows when to be serious. If I say I will not stir up trouble, I will not do so.","However, the Scholarly Sage opened the door himself, so I can’t be blamed for this, right?","He silently sent a point of energy to Fairy Cheng Lin with a postscript attached: [Fairy Cheng Lin, even when a tree wishes for silence, the wind does not stop blowing. I wished for peace and quiet, but the Scholarly Sage did not give me the opportunity to carry out my wish.]","Fairy Cheng Lin: [Huh? What did you do? What did you do with the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection space?]","[I didn’t do anything. I merely stood by and watched. But after Senior Skylark appeared, the entrance to the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation opened up by itself,] Song Shuhang quickly replied.","Fairy Cheng Lin: “...”","The Sage left a back door for her?","?????","Outside the resurrection formation, Senior Skylark said softly, “Let’s go in.”","Next, the little black dot in front of her generated a powerful force of attraction, which sucked her, Sage White, and Thrice Reckless into it.","That black dot was both infinitely small and infinitely large.","When Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was sucked into it, he felt as if he had entered a dungeon inside a game. First there was a black screen, and when the world was loaded and the light returned, they found themselves in a new place.","Once he was inside, Senior White flicked his sleeves lightly, releasing Sixteen, Sister White Dragon, and Soft Feather from his sleeve.","However, Song Shuhang was left in the space within his sleeve.","Song Shuhang: “???”","Senior White, what are you doing? Let me out too!","Song Shuhang called out, “Senior White, Senior White, don’t forget about me!”","Senior White replied softly, “You cannot come out right now.”","Sixteen, Sister White Dragon, and the black-skinned Soft Feather looked at Senior White doubtfully.","Song Shuhang also looked confused. “Why? Could it be that... it’s not good for me to wander in this resurrection formation?”","Could it be because of the Scholarly Sage’s eye in my eye socket or the drop of the Sage’s blood in my body?","As soon as I come out with those two items, is it possible that I might end up activating the resurrection formation?","As expected of Senior White, he’s so meticulous!","Senior White replied solemnly, “That’s because I am pretending to be you right now. If you come out, won’t there be two Song Shuhangs? Wouldn’t that ruin the play?”","Song Shuhang: “???”","Sixteen: “...”","The black-skinned Soft Feather blinked her eyes.","Senior White then added, “Just stay in my Universe Hiding Sleeve for now. Fairy Creation, you should also stay where you are. I will let you out when I think it’s okay.”","Sister White Dragon said with a smile, “Fellow Daoist White is worried that if Shuhang and Fairy Creation come out, it could alter the resurrection formation, so we should wait and check the place before making a decision.”","Sixteen nodded in understanding.","Sister White Dragon turned her head and looked around the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection space before saying, “I quite like this place.”","She said this because, in this space, everyone had become the same color as her.","This was a world with only two colors, black and white.","White sand, white grassland, and a huge black lake.","The people standing on the beach were also affected by the environment and turned into shades of black and white.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “Where is the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation?”","In this space, there was no formation they could see.","“The entire space is a part of the resurrection formation,” said Skylark. She took a few steps forward, then squatted on the edge of the big black lake, reaching out to touch the black water.","Thrice Reckless thought for a short moment and said, “And this dark lake is the core of the resurrection formation, right?”","Skylark nodded and said, “Indeed.”","She raised her slender hand back and held out her palm to Thrice Reckless.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber handed over a bracelet-shaped magical treasure to her.","Skylark got up and put on the magical treasure. She then took out a dress from it and changed into the dress calmly.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber turned his head, avoiding looking at her while she changed.","The virtuous lamia reached out and covered Senior White’s eyes.","“By the way, is there no guardian in this space?” Senior White asked. When his eyes were covered, he immediately got the urge to start meditating.","In order to stop himself, he had to divert his attention by chatting.","Song Shuhang said from the Universe Hiding Sleeve, “Perhaps the survivors of the Heavenly City are confident in their defensive measures, or maybe people cannot stay in this resurrection space for long periods of time, so they can’t really send people to guard this place.”","“It seems to be the second reason. Someone is coming.” Sister White Dragon looked up at the sky above the lake.","On the surface of the pitch-black lake, the projection of a white gate appeared.","Then, a bald man stepped through the gate.","It was one of the Tribulation Transcenders who was secretly guarding the base.","While he was responsible for keeping an eye on the base, he was also responsible for guarding the resurrection formation.","Just now, he sensed that there was an intruder, so he undid the seals as quickly as possible to enter the space through the main entrance.","“I did not expect for people to be able to break in despite all the time and resources we spent on the defensive measures at the entrance of this place.” The bald man had his arms crossed as he stood in the air and looked down at the people on the beach. “I’m curious, how did you get inside? I’ve been guarding the entrance the entire time. In other words... you did not come through the main entrance, right?”","It was clear to him that there were other entrances to the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection space, and that was not good news.","As he said that, his gaze happened to fall on Sister White Dragon.","“Ancestral Golden Dragon, so it was you,” the bald man said in a deep voice. “If it was you, I can understand. It seems that you secretly broke through our confinement.”","“Don’t fault me for this. I’m neutral.” Sister White Dragon shook her head.","So, it was not the doing of the Ancestral Golden Dragon?","The bald man obviously believed in Sister White Dragon.","Then, who broke through the restrictions?","His eyes then fell on Sage ‘Song Shuhang’ White.","“I know you. You’re the first Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. I just happened to go out of the secret realm and see your show of divinity.” The bald man stretched his neck, making a crackling sound, and said in a mocking tone, “I did not expect that apart from having superb cultivation talent, you’re also very good at scurrying around like a little mouse.”","Sage ‘Song Shuhang’ White nodded slightly and said, “Many people acknowledge me as a little mouse that is difficult to crush.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","The bald man: “...”"]},{"number":2213,"title":"Chapter 2213 You have been kicked out by Group Owner Scholarly Sage","paragraphs":["2213 You have been kicked out by Group Owner Scholarly Sage","Senior White, that title is actually not something to be proud of...","Song Shuhang thought while inside his sleeve.","“But... I am not the one who broke into this space,” said Sage ‘Song Shuhang’ White.","The bald man wore a textbook sneer expression on his face. “Do you think that I will believe you?”","“Whether you believe me or not, that does not change the fact that I didn’t do it.” Senior White slightly smiled.","The bald man was stunned, and he could no longer maintain his textbook sneer.","After a while, he changed his target. Right beside the man he just questioned was a large, muscular figure. This muscular figure was curled up into a ball and had his hands pressed against his face. He looked like an ostrich with its head buried in the sand.","“Azure Reckless!!” The bald man let out an angry roar when he got a proper look at the muscular man.","It was apparent that the bald man and Azure Reckless had a relationship that was deeper than that of ordinary allies. Judging from their muscular physiques, the two were likely to be in a master-student relationship.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was startled by the shout.","He had been squatting on the ground just now, trying to take off his disguise mask. Since they had already reached the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection space, it was meaningless to keep wearing the face of this Venerable Azure Reckless.","At first, he planned to use the identity of this Venerable Azure Reckless to carry out several bold actions. But now that they had already achieved their goal, these bold plans were left to waste.","Startled, Thrice Reckless looked up at the angry bald man in the sky.","What’s with this bald man’s furious expression? Is he somehow related to Venerable Azure Reckless?","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber thought for a moment, and then it suddenly clicked in his mind.","He covered his face with his hands, and said in a pained voice, “Senior, you are a good person, but... let’s break up!”","The surroundings turned silent.","“I see, so you’re not Azure Reckless... Is this how you want to proceed?” When the bald man said this, veins could be seen bulging on his head.","Since these guys refused to tell him how they sneaked into the Sage’s resurrection space, the only option he was left with now was to take them down and extort a confession out of them or directly read their memories.","“Are you going to surrender without a fight, or are you going to force me to take you down one by one?” The bald man stretched his hands and clenched them into fists.","Right after he said that, pale white flames blazed on his body.","The terrifying aura of a Tribulation Transcender came bearing down on everyone.","As the guardian of this space, he could not let anything happen to the Sage’s resurrection space.","Below, Senior White put his hands in the pockets of his windbreaker, a calm expression on his face.","Sister White Dragon went to protect Sixteen.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber shrunk into a ball from the suppression of the Tribulation Transcender’s aura.","Skylark, who was by the lake, suddenly raised her head and asked, “Are you going to kill me?”","The bald man said coldly, “I’ll give you a chance to surrender without a fight.”","“Are you going to lock us up in the Immortal Lock Prison again afterward?” Skylark brushed her long hair behind her back. “I just got out of it and don’t want to go back inside.”","“That’s not up to you to decide!” The bald man stretched out his hand toward Skylark. She was a Seventh Stage Venerable, and he should be able to handle her easily.","A large hand materialized and grabbed Skylark.","Skylark faced the large hand with her chest raised and with no fear in her eyes.","At this time, a burst of golden light surged from the originally pitch-black small lake.","The Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation had been triggered.","The golden light soared into the sky and turned into a Scholarly Rune, which then slammed into the bald man’s body.","The Scholarly Rune read as “Seal.”","The bald man, as well as the large hand he had summoned, were frozen in mid-air, just as if time had halted.","What just happened?! the bald man wondered.","Why did the Sage’s resurrection formation suddenly activate? Why does it seem like the formation is protecting this female Seventh Stage Venerable?","?????","Inside Senior White’s Universe Hiding Sleeve.","Song Shuhang chuckled. It’s fine if you want to disco dance on the Sage’s grave, but you better not try to hurt Skylark in its proximity!","“Boom~”","An explosion came from the pitch-black water once again, and another Scholarly Rune flashed.","This rune read as “Expel.”","The bald man and the large hand were hit by this second Scholarly Rune. Tribulation Transcender blood spilled from the bald man’s body as he was expelled from the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection space.","Congratulations, you have been kicked out of the space by the Group Owner Scholarly Sage~ Song Shuhang said inwardly.","For a short time, the bald man would not be able to come back, and other people could not enter either as the main entrance to the space was now blocked.","Sixteen asked, “Has the Scholarly Sage resurrected?”","Skylark shook her head slightly.","The two Scholarly Runes that resurfaced from the bottom of the lake just now were means left behind by the Scholarly Sage when he was still alive.","They were set to be activated if Skylark was attacked while in the formation space.","Skylark said softly, “This resurrection formation is no longer complete.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Was it sabotaged by the members of the Heavenly City?”","Senior White arrived beside the lake and reached into the water to investigate.","After a while, he said, “This resurrection formation has been erased from the root.”","This grand formation was secretly arranged by the Scholarly Sage for his resurrection. But in the end, it still failed to escape the eyes of the current Wielder of the Will and was erased from the root.","The Scholarly Sage could no longer be resurrected with this formation.","Sister White Dragon said, “So that’s why the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City and the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates are fighting for it. They just need to add the information of the Heavenly Emperor or the Venerable Emperor in the layer that was erased. Filling that up again could turn this resurrection formation into a resurrection formation for the Heavenly Emperor or the Venerable Emperor.”","It was only this kind of resurrection formation that was set up by the Scholarly Sage that had any hope of resurrecting entities like the Heavenly Emperor and the Venerable Emperor, who were in a similar cultivation realm.","Song Shuhang asked, “If we use the Sage’s eye and blood, can this large formation be restored?”","“It’s useless. This formation can no longer resurrect him.” Skylark sighed.","It was the current Wielder of the Will that disabled the formation. Under the influence its will, the information of the Scholarly Sage could no longer be added to the formation","That’s why you should leave this resurrection formation to us. At this time, a female voice sounded from Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","Then, a branch sprouted from his back.","This branch grew extremely fast, extending until reaching the black lake.","Strangely, Skylark, Senior White, and Sister White Dragon did not do anything to stop it.","The branch bloomed in the lake.","Afterward, that fake Fairy Yuanyuan emerged from the top of the branch.","She looked at Thrice Reckless and smiled sweetly. “I’m sorry, Fellow Daoist. You are a good person, so... I used you.”","“You were on my body this entire time?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber turned his head and said in a sad tone, “You planted a seed on me and birthed new life. You need to take responsibility!”"]},{"number":2214,"title":"Chapter 2214 And so I just followed suit","paragraphs":["2214 And so I just followed suit","After understanding what Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was hinting at, the fake Fairy Yuanyuan froze.","She was at a complete loss for words and did not know how she was supposed to answer.","In this confrontation of words, she had already suffered a crushing defeat.","“Hahaha!” Seeing this scene, Skylark laughed happily. In the past, when she was in the Nine Provinces Number One Group, she enjoyed witnessing similar scenes.","“This fairy has picked the wrong person to provoke.” Sixteen looked at the fake Fairy Yuanyuan with pity.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said seriously, “Unless you have Senior Yellow Mountain’s muting technique, chatting with Senior Thrice Reckless... will simply leave you at a loss.”","In retrospect, the muting technique developed by Senior Yellow Mountain was truly the best way to deal with people like Doudou, Senior Thrice Reckless, Senior Copper Trigram, and Senior Song.","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan secretly gritted her teeth.","She did not want to talk nonsense with Thrice Reckless anymore as she was no match for him in this field. No matter how much nonsense she spouted, she would only end up humiliating herself.","However, it did not matter as she had already completed her mission.","When her branch sprouted from Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s back and reached the lake, she placed the magical treasure containing the data of the Venerable Emperor into the black lake, making this top-tier resurrection formation “whole” again.","That magical treasure was something left behind by the Venerable Emperor before he disappeared, and it was also the key to his resurrection.","Her mission was over!","She looked at Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s group and smiled slightly.","You did not stop me when you could. That was your biggest mistake.","“Seeing your blooming smile, I know that you must have accomplished your mission.” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, who was still in the form of Azure Reckless, stood up and smiled back at the fake Fairy Yuanyuan.","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan had learned from her earlier experience, so she did not dare to carelessly reply to the other party for fear that she would be tricked.","“She threw a magical treasure into the lake.” Skylark narrowed her eyes slightly. She had been squatting on the edge of the black lake the entire time with her fingers dipped in the water.","Senior White squeezed his chin, deep in thought.","Then, he reached out and snapped his fingers, summoning a magic lamp from his cosmos bag.","There was smoke spewing out from the magic lamp, then Demon Venerable Lushan Street emerged from it.","After Demon Venerable Lushan Street appeared, he took out a chair and a table, and placed them in front of Senior White.","Sage ‘Song Shuhang’ White sat down grandly with his fingers interlocked and his chin resting on top of them.","Beside him, Demon Venerable Lushan Street floated quietly.","Seeing this, Sixteen did not know whether to laugh or cry.","Senior White, you’re leaning into the act a bit too much.","“The magical treasure she threw into the black lake should contain the Venerable Emperor’s information. It should be similar to the Imperial Pearls that the Heavenly Emperor had given the members of the Heavenly City before the Heavenly City collapsed.” Senior White spoke with a particularly oppressive tone.","Hearing this, the fake Fairy Yuanyuan turned to look at Senior White, who had disguised as Song Shuhang.","Her heartbeat accelerated slightly.","She experienced a heart-thumping feeling that she had not felt for thousands of years.","“Fairy, before you threw that treasure containing the Venerable Emperor’s information into the lake, did you ever stop to think of the possibility that someone else’s data or information has already been buried under this black lake? For example, the Heavenly Emperor’s?” Senior White continued to speak.","This Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation had been in the hands of the members of the Ancient Heavenly City for so many years. If the resurrection formation could be completed by just throwing in a magical treasure containing the information of a certain person, then what was stopping the members of the Ancient Heavenly City from throwing the Imperial Pearl into it earlier?","The number of Imperial Pearls in the hands of the members of the Heavenly City was not small.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber interjected, “So, is it the Heavenly Emperor who will be resurrected or the Venerable Emperor?”","The black-skinned Soft Feather thought seriously and said, “Perhaps before the resurrection takes place, the Heavenly Emperor’s information will fight with the Venerable Emperor’s information?”","Skylark said with a grin, “That’s an excellent idea. Why not have them do that?”","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan clenched her fists lightly. However, no panic could be seen on her face, and she sported a look of confidence instead.","Of course, they had thought of this possibility when they had discovered that the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation was in the hands of the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City.","When they attacked the base and sneaked into the resurrection formation, every step they took was carefully planned.","The magical treasure that she threw into the lake had been modified, and there was something installed into it that could deal with the Heavenly Emperor’s information.","Nonetheless, she herself did not really understand the modifications or principles relating to the magical treasure. After all, that was not her field.","Her task was to throw the Venerable Emperor’s information into the water and have her branches take root at the bottom of the lake. Then, she would just wait for the magical treasure containing the Venerable Emperor’s information to do its work.","?????","At this time, Sister White Dragon said, “This fairy and little friend Song have something in common.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather looked puzzled. “What?”","“She has an honest face just like Song Shuhang.” The corners of Sister White Dragon’s mouth curled up.","Despite the disguise, the expressions on this fake Fairy Yuanyuan’s face were very vivid.","If the disguise mask on her face was torn off, her face would probably be the same as Song Shuhang, with its own set of easily readable information.","The black-skinned Soft Feather: “...”","The face-reading technique is extremely unfriendly to people like Senior Song.","Sixteen asked, “Sister White Dragon, do we really not need to stop her?”","“Remember, I’m neutral,” replied Sister White Dragon.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “But this fake Fairy Yuanyuan belongs to the Venerable Emperor’s faction and is a third-party force.”","“You do have a point, but that does not change the fact that I cannot do anything.” Sister White Dragon patted Sixteen’s head lightly with her little claw and said, “I have not come back to life yet.”","She had already planned her resurrection way back then. If she took part in the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation and resurrected now, her plan would be disrupted.","Sister White Dragon said, “Besides, Fairy Skylark has not panicked from beginning to end. She is the person most involved in this, so you don’t need to worry.”","“Huh?” Skylark suddenly turned her head and said, “I have not panicked all this time because I saw that Fellow Daoist White Dragon and Fellow Daoist White have been very calm, so I followed suit.”","Senior White said, “Well, I saw that Fellow Daoist White Dragon and Fellow Daoist Skylark were calm, so I followed suit.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “...”","The black-skinned Soft Feather: “...”","Sixteen: “...”","“Fwoosh~” While they were discussing, the water in the black lake surged.","The Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation was restored and activated.","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan beamed.","Senior White, Sister White Dragon, and Skylark still maintained calm looks on their faces.","A golden beam of light shot up into the sky from the lake.","The beam then split into four rays, and inside every ray was a tall figure.","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan was taken aback.","Four people are resurrecting together?","Are the Heavenly Emperor and the Venerable Emperor both resurrecting?","But then, who are the other two?"]},{"number":2215,"title":"Chapter 2215 The backup plan arranged by the Sage","paragraphs":["2215 The backup plan arranged by the Sage","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan stared closely at the four figures in the beam of light.","She was trying to figure out which among the four figures was the Venerable Emperor.","It was only after recognizing him that she could go and protect him while he was being resurrected.","However, the four beams of light were way too dazzling, and they contained the laws and principles behind resurrection. The fake Fairy Yuanyuan strained her eyes, but she could only see a vague outline of the four tall figures.","After staring at the beams for a while, she felt her eyes begin to swell, just as if they could burst apart at any moment.","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan hurriedly closed her sore eyes, bloody tears flowing down from her eye sockets.","The resurrection formation laid down by the Scholarly Sage was simply too high level. It contained the mysteries behind the resurrection of Immortals. With her strength, if she were to look at it for a long time, let alone her eyes, even her soul may end up getting damaged.","Due to her insufficient strength, she was forced to stop looking at the four beams of light.","In fact, the fake Fairy Yuanyuan was very fortunate that she had a strong will—if her will had not been firm enough, she would not have been able to draw her eyes away from the four beams of light, and her eyes may have directly exploded.","When the fake Fairy Yuanyuan turned her head and opened her sore eyes again, she saw the fake Tyrannical Song, White Dragon, Sixteen, Skylark, and the black-skinned Soft Feather staring at the four pillars of light.","It was as if they were not feeling any discomfort at all!","How can this be? Several of these people are far weaker than I am. Why can they keep staring at the beams of light of the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation while I can’t?","Are they all cheating or something?","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan turned her head again to look at her last possible consolation—the fake Venerable Azure Reckless.","There is nothing special about this fellow. When he was suppressed by the Tribulation Transcender’s aura earlier, he curled up into a ball. If it’s him, he’d definitely do worse than me, right?","When she looked at Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, she saw that he was also staring at her.","The two pairs of eyes looked at each other.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was holding a very large saber in his hand, dragging it back and forth while sawing a branch. This branch was the one that had sprouted from Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s back.","“You finally found out?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber smiled brightly and began to speed up his sawing.","Fake Fairy Yuanyuan: “...”","“Fairy, let me ask you a question. When I saw through this branch, does it hurt?” asked Thrice Reckless Mad Saber. He sawed even harder with his saber, sparks flying from the branch.","This guy does not play by the rules at all!","Why is he not attracted to the laws of the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation?","Does he have a firm will, or are there other reasons?","The golden light shining from the four pillars of light became stronger and stronger, congealing into substance. The four figures wrapped by the pillars of light were completely submerged by the light.","Sister White Dragon said curiously, “By the way, is this resurrection supposed to be a buy one get three free?”","“If the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation was completed with the data and information of the Heavenly Emperor and the Venerable Emperor, then it should be a buy two get two free,” said the black Scarlet Heaven Sword.","The virtuous lamia was floating behind Senior White, and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword moved past her, also looking at the four beams of light.","Sixteen raised her doubts and said, “The question is, are the Heavenly Emperor and the Venerable Emperor really being resurrected?”","[I have a way to verify it.] Song Shuhang in the Universe Hiding Sleeve said to them using group sound transmission.","He quickly opened his Cultivation chat and sent a drop of energy to the Heavenly Emperor.","Then, he added a postscript. [Fairy Heavenly Emperor, are you there? I have a question for you... Have you begun resurrecting?]","It was a rude thing to ask, but the most effective method to verify the situation was to simply ask one of the involved parties.","After a while, the Heavenly Emperor sent back a drop of energy, and wrote: [Senior Song, I am not dead, so why would I need to resurrect? Are you cursing me? Be careful or I will kill you!]","Song Shuhang nodded silently. After that, he sent a voice transmission to Senior White and the others, “The Heavenly Emperor is still alive and well, and she is not resurrecting. It is certain that she is not among the four figures.”","After saying that, he thought of Fairy Cheng Lin—I almost forgot about that sneaky woman. She’s the one behind this incident, so she probably knows why four people are being resurrected by the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation.","When he thought of that, Song Shuhang quickly sent a drop of energy to Fairy Cheng Lin, with a postscript: [Fairy Cheng Lin, the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation has been activated. Someone from the Venerable Emperor’s party has completed the resurrection formation, and now there are four beams of light rising from the black lake, and it seems like there are four people who are resurrecting.]","Fairy Cheng Lin replied very quickly: [What? There are four people being resurrected? How can that be?!]","She looked shocked.","As the mastermind behind the scenes, she did not seem to expect that four beings would be resurrected at the same time.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Fairy, you are so unprofessional.","Song Shuhang sent another point of energy and postscript: [Fairy Cheng Lin, you’re the one who lured the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates into attacking the base of the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City and made them bring a modified magical treasure containing the Venerable Emperor’s information. Who were you planning on resurrecting?]","The Venerable Emperor’s subordinates naturally wanted to resurrect the Venerable Emperor.","The survivors of the Heavenly City want to revive the Heavenly Emperor, who was still alive by the way.","Fairy Cheng Lin and Daozi had joined forces, and there had to be someone or some people who they wanted to resurrect.","However, Fairy Cheng Lin did not reply to him right away. She was currently busy looking for Daozi and several others.","At this moment, Senior White said, “They are being revealed.”","The light of the four pillars of light began to dissipate.","After that, four tall and elegant men materialized in mid-air.","The four men were standing right next to one another.","The first man was gentle and elegant, and he looked easy to approach.","The second man appeared to be high-spirited and confident, and he looked brilliant.","The third man was handsome, and he looked quite refined.","The fourth man had a blank face, and he looked like a bookworm at first glance.","“Eh?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","He actually knew the four men.","To be precise, Song Shuhang once saw the corpses of these four people.","Last time, he had personally brought the bodies of these Tribulation Transcenders back to the scholarly faction, and then the scholarly faction had arranged their burial.","These four were a part of the scholarly faction’s Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders.","The resurrection of these four people could be said to be beyond everyone’s expectations.","Neither the survivors of the Heavenly City, the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates, nor Cheng Lin, the mastermind behind the scenes, thought that this would be the outcome.","“Who are you? Where is the Venerable Emperor?!” The fake Fairy Yuanyuan stared at the four men wide-eyed.","The greater the expectations, the worse the disappointment.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber chuckled. He raised the saber in his hand, and chopped off the branch that he had sawed down until there was only a thin strip of it left.","Skylark’s hand had never left the black lake, a calm expression on her face.","It seemed she realized what was happening earlier on.","Skylark said, “This is the backup plan he had left behind for his disciples.”","From the very beginning, this was not a formation for the Scholarly Sage’s own resurrection—this large formation was arranged for his disciples.","Song Shuhang asked, “In other words, this is a resurrection formation designed for the Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders that have died... If that’s the case, what about the lustrous scholar?”"]},{"number":2216,"title":"Chapter 2216 Apologies, Junior Sister","paragraphs":["2216 Apologies, Junior Sister","Didn’t the lustrous scholar, who had scammed him of his ghost spirit, die as well?","Since it was the resurrection formation left by Scholarly Sage for his disciples, the dead lustrous scholar should also be resurrected by this formation, right?","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair replied, “There are three possibilities.","“The first possibility is that he is so dead that even the resurrection formation failed to bring him back. His soul might have perished forever, and there is no longer any possibility for him to be resurrected or be reborn.","“The second possibility is that the lustrous scholar has not completely died yet. Since he has not died completely, there is naturally no way for him to be resurrected.","“As for the third possibility, it may very well just be his luck. Maybe the lustrous scholar has poor luck. You must know that when it comes to resurrection formations, it’s not guaranteed that they will resurrect their target. The higher the power of the cultivator, the more difficult it is to resurrect them, and the lower the chance of a successful resurrection. It is not easy to be like you and be able to resurrect successfully every time.”","Song Shuhang nodded thoughtfully and said, “That is to say, the next time I require a resurrection magical treasure, I’d better get one that has a 100% chance of resurrection, lest the resurrection result in failure. Or maybe I should prepare several other resurrection plans at the same time, so that should one plan fail, plan two or three may be successful, and so on and so forth.”","When it heard Song Shuhang’s words, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword could not help but voice out its thoughts, “No, Shuhang. I think it would be best if you did not prepare any means of resurrection at all! I am being completely serious with you here.”","Every time he got a resurrection item, Song Shuhang would use it dutifully as if he was afraid of wasting it. If Song Shuhang went ahead and made resurrection plans 1, 2, 3, and so forth, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword felt that every year for the next few years would be Song Shuhang’s death anniversary.","And if he really went hard with the resurrections, the next 365 days of the year might be filled with funerals.","One funeral in the morning, one funeral at noon, and another funeral in the evening.","“Why?” Song Shuhang asked doubtfully.","After thinking for a while, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword replied solemnly, “As a cultivator, it is not good if you become too reliant on certain types of treasures. It will be detrimental to your future development. As such, you should not rely too much on unconventional things like resurrections. What if you get used to resurrecting, and then one day, you no longer have any resurrection magical treasures?”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword’s words were very reasonable, making everyone feel somewhat shocked at its change in character.","Song Shuhang nodded thoughtfully again.","Pavilion Master Chu reminded him, “Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword is not wrong. However, as it is an inner demon, you should be careful of its words and not trust them fully.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","It did indeed speak in half-truths and half-lies.","However, the half that it made up was also for the good of Song Shuhang!","It just did not mention Song Shuhang’s innate ability that made him use resurrection items as soon as he got them.","I’m just helping him out here... Wait!","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword suddenly slammed its hilt hard into the spatial wall in the virtuous lamia’s stomach.","I am an inner demon, an inner demon!","Despite being an inner demon, it showed great care for Song Shuhang. It had become an embarrassment to all inner demons through all generations!","But... that ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? is really just too refreshing.","?????","In the space above the black lake, the golden light had completely dissipated.","The four Tribulation Transcenders opened their eyes all at once.","“How could this be?” The fake Fairy Yuanyuan stood at the tip of the branch, her heart sinking into what felt like a bottomless abyss.","The four Tribulation Trasncenders slowly walked towards the shore.","They passed by the fake Fairy Yuanyuan.","Among them, when the bookworm-like Tribulation Transcender passed by her, he reached out and patted her on the head. “Thank you, Fairy.”","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan felt the warm hand on her head and raised her head stiffly, looking at the bookworm-like Tribulation Transcender.","The bookworm-like Tribulation Transcender gave her a blank smile, and then continued walking forward.","The four Tribulation Transcenders arrived at the shore together and they stopped beside Skylark.","They then bowed to her.","Skylark had mysterious origins, and she taught the Scholarly Sage back when he was very young. In fact, she may have even been the reason why the Sage began to tread the path of cultivation.","Therefore, in terms of status, she deserved the respect of the Thirteen Tribulation Transcenders.","Skylark glanced at the four of them, frowning slightly. “You...”","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender nodded slightly, and then he said softly, “Yes, Senior Skylark. Generally speaking, our resurrection... is a failure.”","The handsome Tribulation Transcender added, “The formation left by our teacher had been destroyed. Although it has been restored, it has been changed too much.”","The gentle Tribulation Transcender said softly, “Besides, it has been too long.”","If the resurrection formation had been activated immediately after they died, then the four of them could have been resurrected nearly perfectly due to the incredible skills of the Sage.","But now... The ancient era had long since ended, and tens of thousands of years had already passed since the era of the Scholarly Sage.","Time was like a blade.","Even with the methods left by the Scholarly Sage, it was impossible to completely resurrect his disciples who had fallen so long ago.","Skylark was an expert in the field of resurrection. From the ancient era to the current one, there was no one with a richer experience in resurrection than her. Therefore, she could see the incomplete state of these four disciples at a glance.","After they were resurrected, they had not been able to rid themselves of the state of death.","They were like candles that had been relit. After a few days at most, they would disappear once again.","And once they disappeared this time, they would be gone forever.","There would be no way to bring them back to life again.","“We want to make use of these final moments to visit the scholarly faction,” said the high-spirited Tribulation Trasncender, and then he asked, “Does the scholarly faction... still exist?”","“It does.” Song Shuhang’s voice sounded from afar.","Senior White flicked his sleeve lightly, and Song Shuhang and Fairy Creation were thrown out together.","Song Shuhang landed steadily.","Fairy Creation shrank behind him, hiding her petite figure.","She seemed afraid to see her four elder brothers.","While in the Universe Hiding Sleeve, she had heard the news that the four had failed to be resurrected completely.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender looked at Song Shuhang and Fairy Creation behind him, and for the first time, a normal smile appeared on his dull face.","He raised his foot and instantly appeared beside Fairy Creation.","Then, he stretched out his hand toward the top of Song Shuhang’s head and patted it. “Apologies, Junior Sister. We agreed that should we meet again, we would never be separated by death once more. However, it seems that we will not be able to honor that agreement...”","Song Shuhang: “???”","Why are you stroking my head while apologizing to Fairy Creation?","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender’s hand patted Song Shuhang’s head repeatedly.","Song Shuhang looked all around him suspiciously.","...Could it be that he has poor eyesight?"]},{"number":2217,"title":"Chapter 2217 You are all my eyes","paragraphs":["2217 You are all my eyes","Or could it be that my true identity is finally coming to light?","Could I actually be the reincarnation of Fairy Creation?!","If that were to be true, things would make a lot more sense. For example, why did Fairy Creation rarely ever go back to Dharma King Creation’s body after transferring to mine?","Song Shuhang was imagining all sorts of scenarios, mainly due to his mind still not having recovered from the impact of Sister White Dragon’s draconic might, which left it slightly fuzzy. He was like a drunk person at the moment, and that led to some illogical thoughts popping out.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender said, “When I touched Little Friend’s head, I noticed that my teacher’s eyes were watching me. This gave me an indescribable feeling, and I could not help but think of him. I truly do miss him.”","The corner of Song Shuhang’s mouth twitched.","Believe it or not, I can make your teacher’s eyes shine and make you feel even more nostalgic!","Suddenly, Song Shuhang realized that the bookworm Tribulation Transcender was speaking in the language of the ancient era, yet he did not have much difficulty understanding what he said.","Could it be because his learning ability had improved and he could already understand most of the language of the ancient era, or was there someone secretly helping him translate the words?","While Song Shuhang was in thought... Fairy Creation finally emerged from behind him.","She looked at the bookworm Tribulation Transcender and the other three in the distance.","The three Tribulation Transcenders smiled at her.","Fairy Creation sighed and kept staring at her four senior brothers for a long while, just as if she wanted to engrave their features in her mind.","After a long time, she turned around and dove into Song Shuhang’s arms.","She looked sad.","Song Shuhang subconsciously stretched out his arms, wanting to catch the sad Fairy Creation. He even came up with some lines to comfort her... However, Fairy Creation passed through his arms and dove straight into his body.","Song Shuhang was left with his arms stretched out, now feeling a little embarrassed.","Seeing this, the bookworm Tribulation Transcender stepped forward and gave Song Shuhang a warm hug, timely alleviating his embarrassment. “Little friend, I will trouble you to take care of our junior sister. Although she is a little troublemaker who even swore that she would never have children in her life, she has a kind heart.”","Song Shuhang opened his mouth to say something, but a heavenly voice came out when he spoke.","The lyrics he sang were in the language of the ancient era.","The singing became louder and louder, spreading throughout the entire resurrection space.","The fascinating power of the sound of nature was embodied in this singing, making everyone addicted to it.","The four Tribulation Transcenders cooperated with her and clapped according to the beat.","During their lifetime, they were masters of arts and poems.","If it was not for the lack of musical instruments, the four would definitely have provided accompaniment to Fairy Creation’s singing.","The three Tribulation Transcenders standing beside Skylark hummed softly and drummed beats according to the rhythm.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender, who was hugging Song Shuhang, slapped his back like a drum.","Song Shuhang was hit so hard that his blood and qi went into turmoil. He felt that this bookworm Tribulation Transcender must be doing all this on purpose.","After a while, the three top-tier body tempering cultivation techniques he practiced activated one after the other to protect his body.","The ?Variant Steel Hands Technique? added a black metallic sheen to Song Shuhang’s back.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender’s slaps, which sounded like drumming earlier, now sounded like the tolling of a bell. The sound changed from the thud of a leather drum to the sound of metal clanging.","The sudden change in the sound surprised the bookworm Tribulation Transcender and he nearly missed the beat.","Not only that, 123 holy apes in scholarly robes with books in their hands appeared on the top of Song Shuhang’s head.","The holy apes formed a three-dimensional, triangular pyramid above Song Shuhang’s head. This time, in order to not damage their master’s reputation, they did not use that formation used to praise the dead.","After the holy apes appeared, they immediately entered choir mode and proficiently followed the rhythm.","When Fairy Creation’s vocals needed chords, they would synchronize with her and accompany her with waves of vocals.","The leading large holy ape played the role of the conductor this time.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender looked up at the massive Holy Ape Choir and was stunned. “This is the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? of the Breast Realm... Wait a minute, why does it look like our ?Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha ? is also there?”","In his entire life, he had never seen anyone who had practiced these two great skills to produce such an appearance.","No wonder their junior sister would be willing to attach herself to this little friend.","It turned out that they had similar tastes!","Shuhang carried a whole choir with him, and every holy ape could perfectly follow the rhythm, allowing for the best display of their junior sister’s singing.","When Song Shuhang saw the shocked appearance of the bookworm Tribulation Transcender, he felt happy.","It’s not over yet!","Following Song Shuhang’s command, the virtuous lamia got up and swam over. Her tail coiled up, and she ‘sat’ on the virtuous fat whale.","The Immortal Goose’s Zither among the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure flew out of Song Shuhang’s original dantian and landed on her snake tail.","The virtuous lamia started playing the zither. After a little adjustment, it perfectly merged with everything, providing a perfect accompaniment for Fairy Creation. The virtuous lamia’s attainments in music were also top-notch.","At the same time, the black-skinned Soft Feather got up.","If she wanted to become a qualified inner demon, her dancing ability must not be lacking. The black-skinned Soft Feather started to dance alongside the tune. She was tall and had long, slender legs, so she was naturally suited to dancing.","If it wasn’t for my Inner World being unavailable, I could have added even more flavor to the performance, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Lead singer, choir, band, backup dancer, and even special lighting effects, as long as Song Shuhang was given time, he could prepare everything.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender said admiringly, “You’re amazing, little friend.”","Throughout the universe, it was not difficult to find people who could perform better than Song Shuhang, but the bookworm Tribulation Transcender could see that Song Shuhang’s choir was all part of him!","The song eventually concluded, and everyone was satisfied.","Aside from that, the four Tribulation Transcenders were also quite satisfied with Shuhang’s “muscles”. After all, this powerful choir of his could immediately switch modes and display top-tier offensive power.","They could be at ease with their junior sister staying with this little friend.","“Senior Skylark, Fellow Daoists, we shall bid you our farewell then.” The bookworm Tribulation Transcender bowed to everyone. The time that they could remain in this world was limited, so they wanted to go back to the scholarly faction before they completely disappeared.","If possible, they wanted to help the scholarly faction before going. The most important thing for them was to pass on their knowledge as knowledge was the greatest wealth.","Song Shuhang cupped his hands and said, “Have a safe journey, Seniors.”","As soon as he finished speaking, in his eyes, two slender arms stretched out from his eye sockets.","Those were Fairy Creation’s arms.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Fairy Creation’s opened up her palms, and in each palm lay a beautiful eye that looked like it was made of glass.","“Are these Junior Brother’s eyes?” The bookworm Tribulation Transcender was taken aback.","Song Shuhang said in a deep voice, “No, these are my eyes.”","Above Song Shuhang’s head, Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said, “She wants the four of you to attach yourselves to this pair of eyes. These eyes contain the resurrection power of the General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?. They may allow the four of you to exist in the world for a little longer.”","The handsome Tribulation Transcender said in surprise, “A... A strand of hair that has become a spirit?”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","You idiot, take my Immortal’s hair stab!","Under the surprised eyes of the handsome Tribulation Transcender, the strand of hair stretched out with a swish and stabbed at him."]},{"number":2218,"title":"Chapter 2218 A water ghost?","paragraphs":["2218 A water ghost?","Then, the four Tribulation Transcenders were all neatly impaled by a single strand of hair.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender: “...”","The gentle Tribulation Transcender: “...”","The confident Tribulation Transcender: “...”","Why were the three of us also stabbed by the strand of hair? We didn’t do anything!","“That’s too much, Fairy Chu. It was only one of them who offended you with his words, why did you have to stab all four of them?” Sister White Dragon reprimanded. “Besides, this fellow daoist from the scholarly faction did not say anything false. Are you not just a strand of hair right now? If you want to blame someone, blame Song Shuhang for sticking you on the top of his head!”","Song Shuhang: “???”","So, is it my fault now?","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair slowly retracted, and then she wrapped herself around Song Shuhang’s neck.","However, the strand of hair did not tighten its grip this time, choosing to act as a Sword of Damocles. If he behaved well in the future, perhaps he would not have to suffer death!","“Fine, it’s my fault! It’s all my fault!” Song Shuhang sighed, looked at the four Tribulation Transcenders, and asked, “Seniors, are these two eyes enough for you?”","There were only two eyes, but there were four of them.","When he had used the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique? to regenerate his body, Fairy Creation had only gouged out two eyes. If he had known his eyes were so precious, he would have asked her to gouge out a few more.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender said, “To be honest with you, it would be better if there were two more eyes.”","Fairy Creation’s small hands protruded from the top of Song Shuhang’s head like a pair of antlers, swaying left and right. Even if Song Shuhang’s current eyeballs were gouged out, they would not have the same effect as these two lustrous eyes.","The only way to get some more was to make Song Shuhang go through the whole process again. His body would need to be destroyed, then he would have to use the General Principles Chapter to forge it anew. It was only with this method that they could get another pair of lustrous eyes.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender said, “However, two should be enough to ‘sustain’ us.”","He took the two lustrous eyes, cupped his fists at Song Shuhang, and said, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, we will borrow these eyes for a while. After the four of us disappear, we will let the scholarly factions return them to you. At that time, we will leave a small gift inside these eyes of yours. We sincerely hope that the gift we leave behind will be to your liking.”","When Song Shuhang heard this, he felt a strong sense of dread in his heart. He felt as if his precious pair of lustrous eyes were about to disappear forever.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender said, “Then Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, let us say our goodbyes here.”","Song Shuhang said, “When you leave this place, pay attention to your safety. Right outside is a base of the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City, and they have placed all kinds of spatial restrictions.”","While Song Shuhang was talking, the bookworm Tribulation Transcender casually stretched out his hand and created a spatial gate.","The dazzling spatial gate shone with white light.","They were currently inside the resurrection formation set up by the Scholarly Sage specifically for his disciples.","In order to ensure the safety of his disciples after they were resurrected, the Scholarly Sage made it so that his disciples could use spatial energy even when inside.","Aside from his disciples, no one else could use spatial abilities while inside the resurrection space.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender smiled at Song Shuhang and said, “Don’t worry, Fellow Daoist. We will leave this place through this spatial passage and return directly to the location of the scholarly faction in the main world.”","The gentle Tribulation Transcender waved at Song Shuhang and the others. “Farewell.”","“Wait a minute!” Song Shuhang hurriedly shouted. “Take us with you! Let’s go together!”","If there was a spatial passage that could let them leave directly, then it would be much better for them to make use of it. Otherwise, when they left the resurrection space, they would have to break out of the base of the members of the Heavenly City.","The bookworm Tribulation Transcender smiled and said, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song wants to go together with us? That would be great.”","They had been dead for tens of thousands of years, and they were not aware of the current situation of the scholarly faction. If this little friend Tyrannical Song, who had strong ties with the scholarly faction, was willing to go with them and brief them on the current situation, that would be excellent.","Song Shuhang turned his head and asked, “Senior White, should we leave now? If you want to return to the Beast Realm to fish, it would not be too late to do so after our trip to the main world.”","“I have no problem with that,” said Senior White. Anyway, it was just a quick spatial trip to get back to the Beast Realm.","“Then, let’s go!” Song Shuhang laughed.","“Little friend Tyrannical Song, please.” The bookworm Tribulation Transcender kept the spatial gate open and gestured for Song Shuhang to enter the gate.","Song Shuhang canceled the holy ape projections that filled the sky, then stuffed the virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and the black-skinned Soft Feather back into his body.","After getting ready, he walked toward the spatial gate and jumped lightly.","Right after Song Shuhang jumped into the spatial gate, another spatial gate opened above the black lake, and Song Shuhang fell out of this spatial channel, straight into the black lake.","Song Shuhang: “???”","As he floated in the black lake, his left eye glared at the bookworm Tribulation Transcender.","This Tribulation Transcender is quite black-bellied.","Was he taking revenge for Senior Chu stabbing him with her strand of hair?","“Huh?” The bookworm Tribulation Transcender was stunned.","He could swear that the location where his spatial gate led was the scholarly faction, which was located in the main world.","But when little friend Tyrannical Song jumped into the spatial gate, the gate distorted, and little friend Tyrannical Song fell into the black lake.","At this time, the handsome Tribulation Transcender said, “It should be a safety measure left by our teacher.”","The Sage had truly taken great measures to ensure the safety of his disciples.","In this resurrection space, his disciples had the ability to open spatial passages, but to prevent enemies from using these spatial gates to chase after his resurrected disciples, the Sage made it so that should someone other than his disciples enter the spatial gate they had created, the gate would distort. If the enemy jumped into a spatial gate created by any of the Thirteen Tribulation Immortals, they would be affected by the distorted space and fail to leave through that passage.","“Teacher has worked so hard for us. It really is a pity...” the bookworm Tribulation Transcender said in a depressed tone.","The gentle and elegant Tribulation Transcender said, “Sorry, little friend Tyrannical Song. I’m afraid we won’t be able to take you with us.”","Song Shuhang, who was in the black lake, reacted and nodded. “As expected of the super duper amazing Sage. His methods are quite sophisticated.”","The insurance measures left by the Sage for Skylark were equally good. Even the ruler of the Netherworld was surprised by the means left by the Sage and got tricked twice in a row.","“Super duper amazing Sage?” The face of the bookworm Tribulation Transcender twitched.","?????","After some time, the four Tribulation Transcenders bid their farewell to Song Shuhang and the others, leaving the resurrection space through their spatial passage.","Song Shuhang said, “Now, we have to think about how to get out of here.”","He began swimming toward the shore to join Senior White and the others.","But just when he was about to get out, he felt a large hand grab his hairy leg and try to drag him to the bottom of the lake!","A water ghost?!"]},{"number":2219,"title":"Chapter 2219 Installment payments, real-time updates","paragraphs":["2219 Installment payments, real-time updates","That’s going too far!","How dare a mere water ghost stretch out his filthy hand and grab my thigh?","And the strength of this hand was not weak.","Song Shuhang kicked hard at the hand clinging to his leg, and a water column shot up from the black lake.","With Song Shuhang’s current strength, a single punch of his could cause a waterfall to flow backward, so it was only normal that his kick caused such a commotion.","At the same time, his divine sense swept the depths of the lake to see what was lurking down there.","Just in case, he also made a hand seal and cast the Lightning Drawing Technique.","A total of three lightning bolts were drawn toward Song Shuhang’s body. Come, let us taste this sweet lightning together!","With his strength at the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, even something ordinary like the ?Lightning Drawing Technique? could unleash terrifying power. And as his cultivation realm improved, he felt that his mastery over the ?Lightning Drawing Technique? was improving as well. It would not be long before he could draw four lightning bolts, and then five and use the Five Lightning Explosion.","Regardless, the purpose of these three bolts of lightning was to notify Senior White and Sister White Dragon that he was being attacked. If that hand at the bottom of the lake was too strong, then Senior White and Sister White Dragon would be able to come to his aid immediately.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, which was wrapped around his neck, had also noticed something strange. It unraveled itself from Song Shuhang’s neck, locked onto the large hand at the bottom of the lake, and stabbed at it like a sword.","Then came the virtuous lamia. Affected by the black lake, she had failed to protect her master when he got attacked earlier.","The virtuous lamia felt like she was being provoked. She wrapped around Song Shuhang and clasped her palms together to cast a powerful virtuous technique—the ?Virtuous Giant Sun?.","Water columns shot up, lightning descended, an Immortal’s sword intent exploded, and a dazzling display of virtue lit up the black lake.","The scene was breathtaking.","The hairy hand in the black lake never thought that Song Shuhang could unleash such a terrifying attack in an instant.","Gurgling bubbles rose to the surface.","The hairy hand unwillingly let go of Song Shuhang, retreating to the bottom of the lake after being attacked by the ?Virtuous Giant Sun? and Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair.","Song Shuhang took this opportunity to jump up and have black lotuses appear beneath his feet to support his body.","“What was that just now?” Song Shuhang frowned and looked at the black lake.","As the core of the resurrection formation set up by the Scholarly Sage, the black lake severely limited the range of a cultivator’s divine sense.","Song Shuhang’s divine sense barely managed to get an image of the hairy hand, which seemed to be the claw of a beast.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said, “It’s an ugly water beast, and this water beast can survive in the resurrection space arranged by the Scholarly Sage.”","“It now seems to be heading toward the fake Fairy Yuanyuan,” said Skylark. Her fingers were still in the black lake... It was unknown what she wanted to do.","At this time, the fake Fairy Yuanyuan was standing on the tip of a branch, right above the surface of the black lake.","When she heard Skylark’s voice, she jumped up and stepped into the air to avoid the water beast.","“Splash~”","After the water beast got close to where the fake Fairy Yuanyuan was, it stretched out its hand and pulled the branch toward the bottom of the lake.","Song Shuhang looked at the fake Fairy Yuanyuan and asked, “Is this your doing?”","Hearing his question, the other party shook her head.","“Could this be the doing of the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City?” Song Shuhang looked at his leg. There were still a few tufts of fur attached to it, which had been cut off by Pavilion Master Chu when she attacked the beast.","Song Shuhang stretched out his right hand. The ends of the Defiant Whale Warrior’s Glove receded, revealing his fingers. He bent down and pinched the fur while activating the ?Secret Appraisal Technique?.","After the secret appraisal technique was activated, a shallow wound appeared on his wrist, and a few drops of blood spilled out of the wound and fell into the black lake.","Song Shuhang said with a tone of heartache, “I forgot to switch to my smoke mode and wasted these drops of blood.”","He was now a genuine Seventh Stage Venerable, and he had also tempered his body to a great degree. Moreover, he had practiced the General Principles Chapter of the ?Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique?, so every drop of his blood was a treasure and had the same medicinal value as that of a spiritual beast.","If one were to take out a tube of his blood and add some medicinal materials to it, they could refine a great pill.","The secret appraisal technique quickly transmitted back the information about the water beast.","Meanwhile, the wound on his arm had already healed.","[Mutated Water Beast: It was originally an ornamental pet adopted by the Scholarly Sage. A herd of water beasts had once been kept in the black lake of the resurrection formation, adding a little beauty to the gloomy lake. After the fall of the Sage, the herd of water beasts met with many accidents and mutated many times. Now, there is only one mutant water beast left.]","An ornamental pet? The Scholarly Sage must’ve felt that the black lake was too dull and desolate, so he added a group of ornamental pets such as goldfish to it. Unexpectedly, they mutated after generations of reproduction and turned into this thing...","Raising goldfish in the resurrection place of his disciples, something like this could only be done by the Sage.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand to throw away the several tufts of fur he had just grabbed. Then, he prepared to relay the information to Senior White and the others.","But before he could say anything, the shallow wound on his arm opened again, and several drops of blood spilled out.","Song Shuhang: “???”","Since when was the price of the secret appraisal technique paid in installments?","[Modified Mutated Water Beast: The survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City captured the lone mutated water beast, buried an Imperial Pearl in its body, and hid a magical treasure containing the Heavenly Emperor’s information beneath its scales. When the time is right, the Heavenly Emperor would be able to return with the help of the resurrection formation.]","Song Shuhang sighed and said, “The survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City put a lot of effort into it.”","But the problem is... the Heavenly Emperor isn’t even dead. She is alive and kicking and has no need for a resurrection formation.","However, it is really enviable to have such a group of loyal subordinates and allies.","So many years after the fall of the Ancient Heavenly City, these old subordinates of the Heavenly Emperor have still not given up. I really wonder what kind of bewitching soup the Heavenly Emperor gave them back then.","“Senior White, this mutated water beast was raised by the Scholarly Sage— Ahhh!” While Song Shuhang was in the middle of speaking, the wound on his arm opened again. This time, the cut was much deeper.","He felt a sharp pain like when one stubbed a toe on the leg of a table. Obviously, the injury was not that serious, but it hurt a lot.","Another drop of blood flowed from his arm and dripped into the black lake.","“It’s still not over?!” Song Shuhang was pissed.","How many installments do I have to pay?","Don’t tell me it’s the one where I have to pay twelve installments in a year! It’s better to just have it done all at once so I don’t have to worry about it anymore!","[Modified Mutated Water Beast that has swallowed the source information of the Venerable Emperor: Out of greed, the mutated water beast swallowed the branches under the fake Fairy Yuanyuan’s feet. The water beast’s body now contains the information that would allow for the Venerable Emperor’s resurrection. The beast now possesses two powerful source data that are clashing within its body.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","He knew that his ?Secret Appraisal Technique? must have evolved as its result was now updated automatically.","“Is it finally done updating?” Song Shuhang looked at his arm.","After the water beast ate the branches, there should be nothing else for it to devour. The current data that it has should already be all that it can get...","While he was in thought, the wound opened up again.","Song Shuhang: “...”"]},{"number":2220,"title":"Chapter 2220 Showdown between source data","paragraphs":["2220 Showdown between source data","Besides the branch, what else did this water beast eat?","What did it find in this black lake?","Song Shuhang looked at his aching arm, a bad feeling arising in his heart.","A cultivator’s gut feeling was often quite accurate.","The appraisal information was transmitted to his mind.","[Mutated Beast that contains the information of the Heavenly Emperor, Venerable Emperor, and Tyrannical Song. The resurrection information of the Heavenly Emperor, Venerable Emperor, and Tyrannical Song are clashing in the body of the water beast. This is an incredible occurrence.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","Every time the mutated water beast changed, the information about it would be immediately updated and sent to him through the secret appraisal technique.","If the mutated water beast were to fart, take a nap, or drink water, would that also trigger the ?Secret Appraisal Technique??","Song Shuhang said, distressed, “The ?Secret Appraisal Technique? is not evolving in a good direction. If these real-time updates are not handled properly, I could die.”","If the updates could not be stopped manually, and he ended up appraising a ball today, a strand of hair tomorrow, and a ghost the day after that...","Then, even if he was not doing anything and just laying on his bed, he could be receiving countless real-time updates of balls, hairs, and ghosts, and end up bleeding uncontrollably due to the price of the appraisal.","But then again, the fact that the mutated water beast was able to store the conflicting resurrection information of the Heavenly Emperor, Venerable Emperor, and himself was indeed beyond his expectations.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair asked, “Are you okay?”","“I’m just in a little bit of pain. As long as the appraisal technique stops sending me updates... I should be fine.” Song Shuhang glanced at his arm. The wound on his arm had healed, and there wasn’t even a scar left.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said, “I’ll take you ashore first.”","Afterward, Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair started to spin like a propeller, bringing Song Shuhang back to shore.","Song Shuhang: “...”","It turned out that Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair gave him the ability to move on the Z-axis freely.","?????","After they got back to shore, Sixteen stepped forward and helped up Shuhang. “Shuhang, you were talking about the water beast just now, right? Is the water beast related to the Scholarly Sage?”","Song Shuhang nodded. Then, he told everyone about the water beast’s origin and its mutation process.","Upon hearing this, Senior White became interested. “So, the water beast is an ornamental pet raised by the Scholarly Sage...”","“I did not get a good look at the water beast, but Pavilion Master Chu said that it looked ugly. The water beast has mutated from generation to generation, so it should no longer look like the original pet,” Song Shuhang guessed.","After thinking for a while, Senior White said, “Forget it then, our time is almost up. We should leave this resurrection space first.”","Song Shuhang said, “Sure.”","Sixteen turned to look at Skylark and called out, “Senior Skylark, Senior Thrice Reckless, we’re heading out.”","Skylark nodded and pulled her hand out of the black lake.","She had been trying to instill spiritual energy into the black lake, wanting to see if there would be any new changes in the resurrection formation if she did so. She wondered if there was some secret that the Scholarly Sage had left deep in the black lake.","However, it seemed like everything related to the Scholarly Sage had been wiped clean.","After getting up, Skylark looked at her wrist and said curiously, “If I drop some of my blood into the lake, do you guys think something would happen?”","Scanning things with one’s mental energy scan and pouring spiritual energy into items were basic operations that all cultivators were familiar with, but after these two basic operations came “blood dripping.”","A cultivator’s blood contained a part of their self, and it could sometimes lead to unexpected surprises in cases mental energy scanning or spiritual energy proved useless.","“Well, something will definitely happen,” Song Shuhang said. “For example, there will be a giant turtle in the lake competing with the mutated water beast for the status of lord of the lake.”","If Senior Skylark did drip her blood into the lake, the mutated water beast might end up swallowing her blood, which would cause his secret appraisal technique to send him another update.","Then, the mutated water beast could end up being swallowed by a giant turtle of disaster, and another update would come.","When he thought of this possibility, his brain started hurting.","Skylark smiled awkwardly when she heard this and gave up on the idea.","??????","Next to them, Senior White took out a stack of the wooden body’s branches and began to carve them. He made one small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword after the other, handing one out to everyone.","Song Shuhang asked, “Senior White, where is the destination of these disposable flying swords?”","After a moment of thought, Senior White said, “To Earth’s moon in the main world. I’m going to set up a new immortal cave there to carry out my Beast Realm fishing plan. Right, Shuhang, you’ve already reached the Seventh Stage Realm, so it’s time for you to officially set up your own immortal cave.”","“I don’t need an immortal cave. I have my Inner World. Also, the scholarly faction gave me a small immortal cave before,” replied Song Shuhang. When he mentioned the Inner World, he switched to secret sound transmission.","“An immortal cave is directly related to the reputation of a cultivator. Since you’re going to attend the Spirit River Su Clan’s annual meeting this December, you will need a formal immortal cave to back you up. You better not embarrass the fellow daoists in the group. As for the immortal cave that the scholarly faction gifted you, that’s too small. It might be enough as a vacation or rest house, but it is not suitable for your current status,” Senior White said. “When the time comes, I will help you carve out a piece of land on the moon. You can learn from me and set up an immortal cave that suits your status.”","Senior White made a good point.","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “At that time, I will trouble Senior White to teach me how to set up an immortal cave.”","“It’s actually very simple to set up an immortal cave. First, come up with a name for the cave, and then make a hole in the plot of land you’ve chosen. For example...” Senior White’s eyes blurred as he spoke.","Sixteen shouted, “Oh no...!”","“Don’t panic!” Song Shuhang stepped forward, activated his three top-tier body-tempering cultivation techniques, and reached out to support Senior White.","“Boom~”","Song Shuhang managed to stop Senior White, but his body was driven into the ground by the powerful force.","The entire space shook, and the black lake churned.","The water beast in the lake was frightened and jumped out of the water.","The water beast was an ugly yet cute creature that resembled a blobfish. It had scales on its abdomen and a thick hand covered in fur on each side.","These hairy hands were what had grabbed Song Shuhang’s thigh earlier.","Coincidentally, the eyes of the mutated water beast met Song Shuhang’s eyes.","“Heh, I didn’t think that you would come out of the water on your own...” Song Shuhang chuckled.","Then, his left eye lit up.","He thought that he would leave this space without ever getting to meet the water beast, but Senior White’s sudden fall caused the mutated beast to jump out of the lake.","Naturally, he wasn’t going to let go of this opportunity and would let the water beast experience what his left eye could do.","Seeing Song Shuhang’s left eye light up, the ugly yet cute water beast let out a cry of terror.","The fear engraved in its genes was triggered.","Meanwhile, inside it, the resurrection data belonging to the Heavenly Emperor, Venerable Emperor, and Song Shuhang became active.","A battle between the different source data broke out!"]},{"number":2221,"title":"Chapter 2221 Senior, you only need to raise the average attractiveness of our group","paragraphs":["2221 Senior, you only need to raise the average attractiveness of our group","This blobfish-like water beast was the result of millions of mutations that those ornamental pets had gone through.","This creature had never seen the Scholarly Sage, nor had it ever encountered the Sage’s eye.","Nevertheless, the fear in its genes, which had been passed down from generation to generation, erupted at this moment.","Unfortunately, it was too late to escape.","The moment its fat body jumped out of the water and met Song Shuhang’s eyes, it was done for.","Song Shuhang said majestically, “The time has come to witness whether you are an expert or not!”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, which was on top of his head, became a tick mark.","It was obviously just a name change, but calling the move “Expert’s Appraisal” rather than “Impregnating Gaze” felt so much better. The meaning behind the move had changed completely... This was why choosing a proper name for something was very important.","Behind him, Sister White Dragon whispered to Sixteen, “Are you betting big or small?”","Sixteen looked puzzled. “What big or small?”","Is Sister White Dragon betting on how big this mutated water beast’s belly will become?","“I bet big,” answered Skylark.","“Me too,” said Thrice Reckless Mad Saber quickly.","Sister White Dragon grinned and said, “Then, I’ll bet small. I believe that the Expert’s Appraisal will result in a single-child pregnancy unlike the Twins Impregnating Gaze or any of the other gazes that are of higher level. And for fish, to be pregnant with one child would mean to only carry a single fish roe. Therefore, I bet that this mutated water beast’s belly won’t grow in size at all.”","Sixteen said, “I’m of the same opinion as Sister White Dragon. I bet small.”","On the side, Senior White thought for a while and said, “I bet...”","“Shh~ Fellow Daoist White, don’t say anything,” said Skylark while placing her finger in front of her mouth.","Senior White looked puzzled.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber patted his chest and said, “Senior White only needs to raise the average of our group’s attractiveness and prevent Shuhang from lowering it. You should leave the gambling to us.”","Once Senior White participated in the betting, the game would be completely unplayable.","Senior White: “...”","He felt wronged.","Seeing this, Sixteen thought for a while, then quietly took a few steps back, distancing herself from Senior Thrice Reckless Mad Saber so as to not be affected by any disasters.","Sister White Dragon mentally approved of Sixteen for her cautious behavior.","Meanwhile, at the front, Song Shuhang wished he could turn around and send out another Expert’s Appraisal, this time at Senior Thrice Reckless. What does he mean by ‘and prevent Shuhang from lowering it’?!","Besides that, the mutated water beast in front of him seemed to be somewhat strange.","After it received the Expert’s Appraisal, it floated on the water’s surface, screaming in pain and fear. However, the effect of the technique was not reflected in its body at all!","Normally, after seeing the light from the Sage’s eye, the effect of the Impregnating Gaze would become apparent within ten seconds at most.","But now, Senior White and the others behind him had already finished talking, yet there were no signs of pregnancy on the mutated water beast.","Pavilion Master Chu guessed, “Could it have inherited some antibodies?”","“It would be impossible even for me to develop antibodies to something like this,” replied Song Shuhang, and Shuhang was very confident about his body’s ability to produce antibodies and resistance.","While they were talking, something finally happened to the mutated water beast.","Its body began to inflate and expand like a pufferfish.","It quickly swelled into a sphere.","“It seems that you are not a peerless expert.” The virtuous lamia quickly emerged from behind Song Shuhang and said in a cold voice.","Not wanting to be outdone, Fairy Creation came out with great momentum. “Song~ Stupid!”","Song Shuhang: “???”","Fairy Creation, I don’t mind you snatching my lines, but why did you have to insult me?","But seeing that Fairy Creation was still alive and kicking, Song Shuhang felt relieved as he did not know how to comfort her after the failed resurrection of the four Tribulation Transcenders.","“It seems that I have won,” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber said confidently. “Even if it is a stone tire, it will swell after being hit by the Impregnating Gaze, let alone a mere water beast.”","Sister White Dragon turned into a scarf, wrapped herself around Sixteen’s neck, and said with a smile, “I admit my loss. As the price for my loss, I can do you and Fairy Skylark a small favor. If you ever need something from me, just contact me.”","Senior White looked at everyone resentfully.","He pointed to the belly of the fish and said, “Then allow me to be the dealer of another bet. How many babies are in the belly of this water beast? If you guess right, I will give you a box of virtuous fruits. Do not use your divine sense or any magical techniques to scan the water beast.”","His virtuous tree had borne fruit once more, which was perfect to give out as the prize to whoever guessed right.","“One child?” In the belly of the virtuous lamia, the voice of the black Scarlet Heaven Sword sounded.","“Wait!” Sixteen noticed a key point and asked, “Is the water beast really pregnant?”","Shuhang’s Expert’s Appraisal was only supposed to have its target experience the pain of pregnancy, but it did not actually have the ghastly effect of making the target pregnant.","Could it be that this water beast had a special physique, which made it so that after being hit by the Expert’s Appraisal, it would really become pregnant?","Sister White Dragon patted Sixteen lightly and smiled. “Fellow Daoist White only asked us to bet on how many babies there are in its stomach. He never said that it was the effect of Shuhang’s Impregnating Gaze.”","“I’m guessing that there are two babies.” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber thought about it and said, “The members of the Ancient Heavenly City and the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates have tampered with the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation. An important thing to take note of is that inside this mutated water beast, there are two rays of light, corresponding to the energies of the Heavenly Emperor and the Venerable Emperor.”","Sixteen took a look, and sure enough, she saw two rays of light shining in the bulging belly of the water beast.","The brightness of the two rays of light was comparable, and they seemed to be fighting.","Sister White Dragon nodded. “Indeed, one of the rays of light belongs to the Heavenly Emperor.”","And there was no question that the light that was clashing with that of the Heavenly Emperor was the Venerable Emperor’s.","Sixteen asked, “Then, are we also going to bet that there are two?”","On the side, Skylark stretched out three fingers and said, “I bet that there are three as you guys have already placed bets on one and two. Considering Fellow Daoist White’s luck, it would be best for us to avoid guessing the same number twice to avoid being killed by the dealer.”","“That makes sense. Then, I’ll bet that there are four babies,” said Sister White Dragon.","“Okay, then I’ll bet that there are five babies,” answered Sixteen casually.","Senior White: “...”","Ahead of them, Song Shuhang had a solemn look on his face.","In the mutated water beast, the information belonging to the Heavenly Emperor and the Venerable Emperor was in a fierce fight against one another. The information belonging to him was completely suppressed by the other two.","This was very normal, as he was the weakest of the three parties.","But when his information was suppressed, the information belonging to the Heavenly Emperor and the Venerable Emperor actually began to encroach on his portion.","This encroachment faintly extended to his body.","If he allowed the Heavenly Emperor’s and the Venerable Emperor’s information to continue to fight, he would also be implicated.","“In that case, don’t blame me for being rude.” Song Shuhang put his hand on his forehead.","The eye gifted to him by the three-eyed young man opened.","Have a taste of my barrage of spam!"]},{"number":2222,"title":"Chapter 2222 Are all big shots so perceptive?","paragraphs":["2222 Are all big shots so perceptive?","Unfamiliar the first time, familiar by the second time.","After using the third eye a few times, Song Shuhang had become quite good with it, and he even managed to unlock several new functions despite not having a teacher.","This time, he shuffled and jumbled up all of the questions from the speech before sending them out.","It was a real spam attack.","All of this information was virtually worthless, and the more there was of it, the stronger the attack would be.","After preparing everything, he injected this huge amount of information into the targets—the mutated water fish, the Heavenly Emperor’s information, and the Venerable Emperor’s information.","There have hardly been any cultivators in the entire universe that had encountered this kind of attack as this was a relatively new form of attack.","The mutated water fish was the first to experience it.","Its eyes rolled upward, its inflated belly bobbed up and down, and its arms drooped weakly.","Immediately afterward, a huge amount of junk information flooded the Heavenly Emperor’s and Venerable Emperor’s data.","You followed my data to harm my main body? Fine, then mutual destruction it is!","Song Shuhang was looking forward to seeing what would happen to the Heavenly Emperor’s and Venerable Emperor’s data once they were filled with junk.","The spam attack turned out to be very effective. With the attack being unleashed through Senior Three Eye’s divine eye, which was not weaker than the Scholarly Sage’s eye, the Heavenly Emperor’s and Venerable Emperor’s resurrection information could not resist at all.","The two rays of light began to dim.","Song Shuhang laughed heartily.","[Beep~ The Heavenly Emperor has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Senior Song, did you do something to me? I suddenly had goosebumps just now and felt that someone was targeting me. I performed a divination, and it showed me that Senior Song was the one attacking me! What are you doing? Believe it or not, I will kill you!]","Song Shuhang: “...”","Was the Heavenly Emperor always so perceptive? She sensed that she was being targeted after I filled her resurrection information with junk?","Big shots whose cultivation realm has reached a certain level are truly terrifying. Maybe if you say something bad about them behind their back, they would be able to sense it, and then they would be able to pinpoint you with just a single divination.","“Are all big shots as perceptive as the Heavenly Emperor?” An interesting thought suddenly popped up in Song Shuhang’s mind.","When he had this thought, he sent a message back to the Heavenly Emperor.","[PS: It was an accident. I will explain it to you when I have the time. Anyway, I was not targeting you.]","After replying, Song Shuhang checked the Blacklist of his [Cultivation] chat group.","Taking advantage of the fact that he had some spare time, he wanted to experiment with something.","Theory will always be groundless without practice.","If you have an idea, you have to test it out thoroughly to check its validity!","Song Shuhang said, “Demon Emperor Hezhi, I’ll try with him first.”","After concentrating on Demon Emperor Hezhi’s name, he cursed at him vigorously in his mind. He took out all the curse words in his vocabulary and threw them at Demon Emperor Hezhi.","Song Shuhang discovered for the first time that cursing someone remotely was quite tiring and not that easy.","“Now, I’ll send a message to Demon Emperor Hezhi to ask about the situation.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, sent a point of energy to Demon Emperor Hezhi, and attached a message.","[PS: Senior Hezhi, did you feel chills all over your body just now?]","Demon Emperor Hezhi, who was recuperating in a forbidden area in the Infernal Realm, suddenly received a new message.","With a thought, he opened it.","“Tyrannical Song!” Demon Emperor Hezhi gritted his teeth.","When he saw this name, his mind became clouded and his whole body felt uncomfortable.","Why did Tyrannical Song send me a message?","Is he scheming something?","[Beep~ Tyrannical Song has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Senior Hezhi, did you feel chills all over your body just now?]","Demon Emperor Hezhi: “???”","Chills all over my body?","What did this Tyrannical Song do to me?","I have been trying to murder this Tyrannical Song all along, and Tyrannical Song must be of the same idea. As long as the opportunity presents itself, he would definitely try his best to murder me!","Demon Emperor Hezhi gritted his teeth and returned a point of energy to Song Shuhang, with a postscript: [What did you do to me?]","At the same time, Demon Emperor Hezhi quickly organized his thoughts and tried to figure out what might have happened.","Could it be that Tyrannical Song learned some scary curse and cast it on me remotely?","Or maybe he found some powerful magical treasure, locked onto my location, and launched a cross-world attack?","?????","In the Sage’s resurrection space, Song Shuhang received a reply from Demon Emperor Hezhi while keeping up the spam attack with his third eye.","Song Shuhang murmured, “Eh? Demon Emperor Hezhi didn’t feel anything. It seems he’s not as perceptive as the Heavenly Emperor. Even if I cursed him behind his back, he didn’t notice. Is this a difference between men and women?”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair on the top of his head was speechless.","There were thousands of words in her mind that she wanted to say right now, but she felt that none of them were suitable.","In the forbidden area in the Infernal Realm.","Demon Emperor Hezhi performed a long divination, and after a lot of calculations, he was left with one answer.","The result of the divination was: A few minutes ago, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song cursed you fiercely behind your back.","The cursing lasted for about three minutes. One should not look at the time and take it lightly as Tyrannical Song’s cursing was very fast. In three minutes, he used a total of six countries’ languages plus two dialects to swear at Demon Emperor Hezhi.","After obtaining the answer, Demon Emperor Hezhi held the divination stick in hand and remained silent for a while.","“Motherf*cker!” Demon Emperor Hezhi threw the divination stick at the ground.","I can’t believe how stupid I am! I was even worried that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song might have cast some technique on me or made some big move.","But in fact, that darned guy was just cursing at me behind my back...","There is seriously a problem with that guy’s brain!","After finally calming down, Demon Emperor Hezhi suddenly felt a chill.","He asked himself in a deep voice, “Was he testing me...?”","No one who can ascend to the Profound Sage Realm would mess around like this.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song could be deliberately setting me up. Could he have just been testing the waters?","It’s possible that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s real attack might be concealed in some sort of probing move.","Demon Emperor Hezhi murmured to himself, “I need to be careful. I should bring forward the plans of changing locations.”","??????","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang finally stopped the third eye’s spam attack.","The resurrection information belonging to the Heavenly Emperor and the Venerable Emperor had been tossed around to the point of death and had weakened significantly.","“Since their resurrection information is already so weak...” Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","He said in a deep voice, “Fairy Virtue, Fairy Creation, Pavilion Master Chu, please protect me!”","At the same time, he summoned Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, and along with one instance of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique?, the two of them entered the Tablet With the Saber state.","Once everything was ready, Song Shuhang’s right eye opened. Compared with the Scholarly Sage’s eye and Senior Three Eyes’ third eye, Song Shuhang’s right eye lagged behind.","However, his right eye had potential.","“Embryonic Gaze!” Song Shuhang’s right eye also had an exclusive innate magical technique!"]},{"number":2223,"title":"Chapter 2223 Path fruit","paragraphs":["2223 Path fruit","This innate skill had unlimited potential and one day, its prestige would resound throughout the universe!","The Embryonic Gaze locked onto the mutated water beast and then took it one step further, locking onto the Heavenly Emperor’s resurrection data inside it.","After all, he was more familiar with the Heavenly Emperor, and he had relatively greater confidence in dealing with her.","In addition, from the Heavenly Emperor’s messages just now, he could infer that while the Heavenly Emperor could somewhat sense what was happening to the resurrection information, she wasn’t really affected by it.","Of course, the message may also be a smoke screen to confuse him, so in the end, it was all up to him.","However, the reply that Song Shuhang had given to the Heavenly Emperor was pretty vague. There was no useful information in that reply.","The Embryonic Gaze worked quickly.","A series of scale-like patterns appeared on the body of the mutated water beast, and a flower bud sprouted on its belly.","As the bud bloomed, the Heavenly Emperor’s resurrection information in the mutated water beast’s body was plundered and pulled away.","“Success.” Song Shuhang temporarily closed his right eye, letting his right eye take a short rest.","After successfully extracting the Heavenly Emperor’s resurrection information, the next step was to extract the one belonging to the Venerable Emperor.","Song Shuhang did not dare to extract their resurrection information at the same time for fear of giving rise to a clash that could cause an unforeseen incident when the flower bore fruit.","?????","On the other side of the black lake, the fake Fairy Yuanyuan was staring at the mutated water beast and the flower on its belly. She wanted to move, but she dared not to. In front of her, there was a sentient flying sword, happily swimming around in the air like a fish.","The flying sword’s pattern was erratic, but its sharp sword intent was steadily locked onto her.","This flying sword was Senior White’s Meteor Sword.","As long as the fake Fairy Yuanyuan dared to do anything, this divine weapon that had already gained intelligence would mercilessly cut her down.","At first, the fake Fairy Yuanyuan dared not move because of the threat of the flying sword, but eventually, she could not move even if she wanted to.","When Meteor Sword was flying around in circles, it had covertly set up a formation around her. Now, she was bound in place so tightly that she could not even move a finger.","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan fell into a panic.","It was a kind of skill that she had never come across. She had not been able to see when and how the formation had been set up at all.","Unknowingly, she became a fish on a chopping board, ready to be slaughtered at any time.","She quietly glanced at the Song Shuhang close to her and at the one in the distance, wondering how these two Fellow Daoist Song would deal with her when the time came.","??????","On the belly of the mutated water beast, the flower of the Embryonic Gaze finally bloomed.","It then withered and bore a pearl-shaped fruit.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand, catching the fruit containing the Heavenly Emperor’s resurrection information.","The pearl was warm in his hand, and there was a faint aura similar to that of the Heavenly Emperor emanating from it.","Song Shuhang commented, “It looks like a large Imperial Pearl.”","Speaking of the Imperial Pearl, he remembered that before, every time he touched one, the Imperial Pearl would crack and shatter. For this reason, he was almost beaten up several times.","The black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from his shadow, looked at the pearl, and said, “Senior Song, this fruit is giving me a sense of familiarity.”","“Familiarity?” Song Shuhang guessed after a little thought, “Maybe it’s because it has a connection with the Heavenly Emperor. The Heavenly Emperor and Soft Feather’s ghost spirit are temporarily in one body, so that might be the reason.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather nodded.","“If we want to verify whether there is a connection between this fruit and the Heavenly Emperor, we can do a small experiment.” After Song Shuhang said that, his right hand stroked the fruit slightly.","An instance of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? was applied to the fruit.","“We just need to wait and see whether the effect of the ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? will be passed on to the Heavenly Emperor. From that, we can easily deduce the answer,” Song Shuhang said. “Now, let’s see if the Heavenly Emperor will contact me again. ”","As soon as he finished speaking, the big pearl in his hand shattered with a pop.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","The black-skinned Soft Feather reminded him, “Senior Song, the pearl broke.”","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky. “I can see that, Soft Feather.”","After the large Imperial Pearl was broken, a fruit covered in patterns was left in his hand.","The Embryonic Gaze produced different treasures each time.","Senior White looked at the fruit and commented, “It looks edible.”","Sister White Dragon said, “It smells good too.”","Pavilion Master Chu said, “There seems to be a ‘path’ hidden in this fruit.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “Then we can call it path fruit. It is a fruit condensed from the resurrection information of the Heavenly Emperor, so it may contain her secrets.”","“Does this fruit count as a single child?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s thoughts were always unpredictable.","Skylark shook his head and said, “It does not.”","“It would be great if I could open my Inner World right now.” Song Shuhang looked at the fruit. If he could access his Inner World right now, as long as the lotus roots came and inserted themselves into the fruit, the path of the Heavenly Emperor could be extracted from it and merge with the Inner World.","The black-skinned Soft Feather reminded him, “Senior Song, the fruit seems to be disappearing.”","Song Shuhang took a look, and sure enough, the patterned fruit on his palm was gradually melting.","“Shuhang, how about you appraise it and then eat it?” said Senior White.","“I’ll try that.” Song Shuhang activated the secret appraisal technique.","Drawing from his previous experiences, he switched to his smoke mode before using the secret appraisal technique.","The results of the appraisal were quickly transmitted to his mind.","[Mysterious Path Fruit: This fruit may be too hot and is evaporating. Why don’t you cut it open and eat it?]","Song Shuhang: “...”","He opened his mouth and swallowed the fruit.","Senior White asked expectantly, “Is it delicious?”","Song Shuhang thought about it and said, “It does taste quite good.”","“Then, can you use the Embryonic Gaze on the mutated water beast again?” Senior White pointed at the water beast. The water beast still had the Venerable Emperor’s resurrection information, so it could theoretically produce another fruit.","“I was already planning on doing that!” Song Shuhang turned around, his right eye lit up, and he released another Embryonic Gaze at the mutated water beast.","But this time, no new patterns appeared on the body of the mutated water beast.","Instead, the inflated belly of the water beast exploded like an over-inflated balloon.","The power of the explosion set off a large wave in the lake.","The body of the mutated water beast was blown into more than ten different parts and scattered across the lake.","“Is it dead?” Song Shuhang was taken aback.","Could it be that after two instances of the Embryonic Gaze were used consecutively, the hidden skill “autodestruction” would be activated?","“Plop~ Plop~” More than a dozen pieces of the mutated water beast’s corpse fell into the black lake.","Afterward, every piece of the water beast’s corpse began to change. Soon, there were a dozen mutated water beasts that were all smaller than the original.","“Does this thing reproduce by division?” Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was distressed.","With this type of reproduction, how many babies would there be?","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “Ten babies in one go? Anyway, you all lost.”","Smiling and laughing, he landed back on shore.","The path fruit that he had eaten began to take effect.","Slowly, its side effects were emerging.","The main reason for this was that the instructions clearly suggested that the path fruit should be cut open before it was consumed, but Song Shuhang had swallowed the fruit whole, so the side effects would inevitably be worse."]},{"number":2224,"title":"Chapter 2224 It’s time to enter a long retreat","paragraphs":["2224 It’s time to enter a long retreat","“Joy can always turn into sorrow.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair gently swayed.","Song Shuhang’s body twitched slightly. He could not get up from the ground.","When he landed, his face had been facing the ground. This caused half of his face to be buried in the sand now, rendering him unable to speak. If he was not a cultivator, he would have very likely suffocated by now.","The black-skinned Soft Feather squatted next to Song Shuhang and asked, “Do you want to take some pills, Senior Song? Maybe fasting pills or healing pills?”","Song Shuhang stretched out his arm tremblingly and waved it.","The effects of the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit had fully revealed themselves. Every inch of his body felt as if it was burning. If he were to take any pills at this time, he might just explode and die.","He did not have any resurrection methods or magical treasures left, so he could not make any mistakes.","The virtuous lamia lifted Song Shuhang with both of her arms and flipped him over.","Sixteen took out a handkerchief and wiped the sand off of Song Shuhang’s face.","“Would you like a healing technique?” Sister White Dragon asked from beside him.","Song Shuhang continued to wave his trembling hands.","He rejected the healing technique for the same reason he rejected the pills. He was afraid that the healing technique would cause him to implode.","Senior White stepped forward, stretched out his hand to feel Song Shuhang’s pulse, and scanned him with his divine sense.","Divine sense was very handy. This was why, in the past, cultivators often liked to pretend to be wandering doctors when they were experiencing the life of a mortal as they were able to pinpoint any illnesses or injuries with a simple scan of their divine sense. This ability was just perfect to build the persona of a genius doctor.","After the scan, Senior White said, “There is no problem with his body, and there are no hidden dangers.”","Sister White Dragon said, “It must be the fruit. After all, it contains the resurrection information of the Heavenly Emperor, and he’s lucky he didn’t die on the spot after swallowing it whole.”","Song Shuhang tremblingly stretched out his hand and made an ‘OK’ gesture.","Senior White said, “It does not seem like that much of a problem. As long as you go into seclusion and digest the fruit, you should be able to recover.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said earnestly, “You’ve already reached the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, Shuhang. It’s time for you to close up for real.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior White smiled and said, “If you want to close up, I can lend you my makeshift stone room.” While saying that, he extended his arm","Makeshift stone room?","What kind of magic treasure is that?","Soon, Song Shuhang learned what the makeshift stone room was. It was the stone box that Senior White had built from the Lock Immortal Prison’s stone tiles.","To his surprise, this stone box had been brought into the Sage’s resurrection space along with everyone.","The stone box opened.","Senior White stretched out his hand toward Song Shuhang. Then, he used his spiritual energy to lift Song Shuhang up and put him into the stone box.","By the side...","Sixteen, Sister White Dragon, the virtuous lamia, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword, Fairy Creation, Skylark, and Thrice Reckless Mad Saber surrounded the stone box and watched Song Shuhang being put into the stone box.","This scene really gave off the feeling of a ritual for some reason.","Senior White said, “Have a nice meditative session. Your seclusion this time may last quite a while.”","[How long will it take?] Song Shuhang asked with some concern by using the secret sound transmission technique.","He did not want to stay closed up for hundreds of years.","He still had a lot of things to do, and before closing up for a long time, some mortal matters and cultivation-related matters had to be dealt with, only then could he properly enjoy his session.","“It depends on how long it takes you to absorb the fruit. You have eight nascent souls and a fat whale golden core, so you should have a certain advantage when it comes to absorbing energy. In addition, you do not need to concern yourself about any mundane or cultivation matters.” Senior White pointed at his face. He had not taken off the disguise mask yet, and he still had Song Shuhang’s appearance.","In other words, during Song Shuhang’s seclusion, he could cosplay as him.","Senior White said, “So, you can close up with peace of mind.”","He then stretched out his hand and sealed the stone box.","The insides of the stone box plunged into darkness.","Right before the box was sealed shut, Song Shuhang saw Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet from the corner of his eye. It was standing firmly in front of the stone box, and beginning to activate its guarding powers.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Heavens, I finally realized why it felt like a ritual.","It’s because I’m literally being buried, with a tombstone and coffin!","This stone coffin seems to have some fate with me... I will refine it later and see if I can turn it into a magical treasure. Whenever I encounter someone I do not like in the future, I can bury them alive in the stone coffin.","Anyway, with Senior White taking care of all of my matters, I can close up with peace of mind, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","He closed his eyes and began to circulate the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?. Although he had the complete version of this cultivation technique with him, due to his own reasons, every time he ascended a realm, he had to do some fine-tuning to the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique?.","If he did not do so, he would not be able to exert the power of his eight nascent souls.","At the same time, his three top-tier body-tempering cultivation techniques were also circulating, assisting Song Shuhang in digesting the medicinal effects of the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit.","As his cultivation techniques circulated again and again, Song Shuhan entered a true state of meditation.","In this state, one would experience the feeling of “one day in a retreat, a thousand years pass outside.”","The Seventh Stage Venerable Song finally entered a true and genuine seclusion for the first time in his life.","[Beep~ The blacklisted “Demon Emperor Hezhi” has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: .]","Song Shuhang, who had finally gone into seclusion, was suddenly brought out of it.","What is Demon Emperor Hezhi doing?","[Beep~ The blacklisted “Fairy Cheng Lin” has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Shuhang, what are you doing? I can feel that the Cultivation chat group is changing!]","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","Is the Cultivation chat group evolving?","Why does Fairy Cheng Lin have a much clearer grasp of the state of the Cultivation chat group than me?","[Beep~ Your buddy “Heavenly Emperor” has remotely transferred you 1 point of energy. PS: Senior Song, what are you playing at this time? I’ve been tossing and turning uncomfortably for a while now. Can’t you calm down a bit?]","Three people sent him messages in quick succession. It seemed that these big shots noticed the change in the Cultivation chat group.","The reason for this change must be the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit he ate.","Immediately afterward, even Senior White Two sent him a postscript: [Shuhang, did you provoke or confront the fat ball again?]","No, not at all!","Song Shuhang sent a postscript back to Senior White Two: [Nope, not at all! I just ate a path fruit, and that seems to have caused these changes in the Cultivation chat group.]"]},{"number":2225,"title":"Chapter 2225 Do you need technical support?","paragraphs":["2225 Do you need technical support?","A path fruit?","Senior White Two heaved a long sigh. He was guessing that the path fruit that Song Shuhang was referring to was not the same path fruit that he was thinking of.","Senior White Two said softly, “Forget it then. As long as he is not provoking the fat ball, it’s all good.”","At the same time, he casually sent another point of energy to Song Shuhang, along with a postscript: [What is this ‘path fruit’ that you ate?]","Why had it caused such a huge commotion in the Cultivation chat group?","For a moment, he thought that Song Shuhang had quietly gone to fight the fat ball, causing the fat ball to take notice of the Cultivation chat group.","Among Song Shuhang’s enemies, he believed that only the fat ball had the ability to forcibly interfere with the Cultivation chat group and cause such a violent disruption.","Song Shuhang replied, [It was a path fruit produced by my Embryonic Gaze after I targeted the Heavenly Emperor’s resurrection information. It tasted quite good, but I grew very full after eating it... I’m currently closing up to digest it.]","At the same time, he copied and pasted this message, sending it to Fairy Cheng Lin as well.","Finally, he had to say something to the Heavenly Emperor, but it would be bad if he simply copy-pasted the reply.","Still, he had to reply. If the Heavenly Emperor saw that he did not reply to her for a long time, she could start making guesses and figure out that her resurrection information had been turned into fruit and eaten. At that time, he would definitely be in big trouble.","After some thought, Song Shuhang sent a postscript to the Heavenly Emperor: [It’s nothing. This is pretty normal as the Cultivation chat group is often evolving. It is possible that the upgrade is causing some problems, but there is no need to worry. The chat group will definitely be faster and easier to use after the upgrade is completed. In order to update it smoothly, I am going to close up for a while.]","After sending the reply, Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","In this way, the Heavenly Emperor should be appeased.","As for the message sent by Demon Emperor Hezhi, he could just ignore it.","After all, Demon Emperor Hezhi could not bite him through the Cultivation chat group.","“Now, time to close up for good.” Song Shuhang closed his eyes and circulated the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? again. He adjusted his mental state and prepared to enter the retreat state again.","But just then...","[Beep~ Your buddy “Heavenly Emperor” has remotely transferred you a drop of energy. PS: Senior Song, you liar! What are you hiding from me?]","Song Shuhang’s heart skipped a beat.","Did Heavenly Emperor notice something?","Damn... How am I supposed to answer?","If he gave the wrong answer, it was completely possible for him to explode and die right on the spot.","While he was in thought, another message was sent, this time it was a postscript from Fairy Cheng Lin: [You are the most courageous young man I have ever seen. You even dared to eat a fruit containing the Heavenly Emperor’s resurrection information. You’re probably suffering from heat stroke.]","I’m not. I’m healthy, I take my medicine on time every day, and I don’t eat much.","Song Shuhang had not had time to reply to Fairy Cheng Lin yet when he received another message.","This time it was a postscript sent by the Dragon Network of the Black Dragon World: [Admin Tyrannical Song, do you need technical support? Your Cultivation chat is assimilating some data and evolving. Do you need technical support from the Dragon Network’s Fat Ball? Y/N?]","The evolution of the Cultivation chat group had alerted even Lady Kunna.","In addition, it appeared that the group chat was assimilating some data.","Song Shuhang immediately noticed this point.","From the looks of it, the data in the Heavenly Emperor’s resurrection information was similar in nature to his Cultivation chat group.","The path of the Heavenly Emperor was the path of the Heavenly City.","The entire Heavenly City was her path, and every member of the Heavenly City was a part of her path.","As for his Cultivation chat group, it gave him the ability to add people he knew as friends.","There were indeed certain similarities between them, but they were pretty different at the same time.","Assimilating data and evolving...","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand to tap on [Yes]. He could really use the support from the Dragon Network.","[Beep~ The Dragon Network’s Fat Ball will now provide you with technical support. Establishing connection... Using the Inner World Assistant as a relay point... Connection successful.]","The mechanical female voice of the Black Dragon World’s Fat Ball repeatedly sounded in Song Shuhang’s mind.","Because of the barrier between the Black Dragon World and the main world, when she provided technical support to Song Shuhang, she had to use the Inner World Assistant as a relay point.","The Inner World Assistant was a copy of the Dragon Network Assistant which had been integrated with Song Shuhang’s Inner World.","As such, using the Inner World Assistant as a relay station could improve efficiency and reduce the consumption of the connection.","When the Dragon Network began helping him, Song Shuhang felt a cool stream circulate in his brain for a moment.","During that short moment, a vast sea of information and data merged with his mind.","Song Shuhang felt as if his body, or more specifically, his Cultivation chat group had turned into a large and greedy snake.","The voracious snake slithered in a dark space.","In this dark space, there were countless clusters of light of different sizes. These clusters were born from the information contained in the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit and contained a part of her path.","Under Song Shuhang’s control, the huge, voracious snake swiftly moved around, devouring the clusters.","In the meantime, the Dragon Network also provided some navigation assistance, directing Song Shuhang to avoid certain clusters that contained information that he could not yet swallow.","It was important for the Cultivation chat group to selectively absorb the information that would allow it to evolve. While doing so, it had to avoid being assimilated into the Heavenly Emperor’s path.","[This technical support is amazing. Thank you, Dragon Network’s Will.] Song Shuhang replied with a postscript.","[It’s really nothing much, but please call me by my nickname, Fat Ball,] the Will of the Dragon Network replied.","The corners of Song Shuhang’s mouth twitched.","Only the heavens knew why the Dragon Network’s Will came to like the name ‘Fat Ball’.","Every time he heard the words ‘fat ball’, Song Shuhang had two opposite reactions—one was to fight it, and the other was to run and hide.","[Beep~ Fairy Cheng Lin has sent you a postscript: Do you still have resurrection items on your person?]","Song Shuhang: “???”","What is Fairy Cheng Lin planning on doing?","Song Shuhang quickly replied, [Nope, I don’t have any. Originally, I had a Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune, but it was used by the fat whale golden core when I was ascending to the Seventh Stage Realm. Right now, the Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Rune is still recharging. Fairy Cheng Lin, please do not be impulsive!]","Fairy Cheng Lin sighed and added: [That fruit with the Heavenly Emperor’s resurrection information definitely contains her path, and her path is very domineering. Once you get involved in her path, you cannot escape unless you die. Fellow Daoist White Dragon and Fellow Daoist Northern Emperor are examples of this. Do not be in a hurry to absorb the path fruit. You should first find a way to get yourself a resurrection item. At that time, after absorbing the path fruit, you should prepare to die and escape.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","He silently glanced at the Cultivation chat group which had transformed into a voracious snake.","Well, it might be... too late."]},{"number":2226,"title":"Chapter 2226 It’s really tiring to close up","paragraphs":["2226 It’s really tiring to close up","My beloved senior is urging me to go die, but I do not have any means of resurrection ready, what should I do? Waiting online, very urgent!","Song Shuhang quickly sent a point of energy to Fairy Cheng Lin, with the following postscript attached: [It might be too late, Sister Cheng Lin. This gluttonous snake has already grown to more than sixteen times its original body size, and it is still growing. It looks like it can no longer be stopped.]","Fairy Cheng Lin, who had just received Song Shuhang’s postscript, was stunned.","...What in the world do you mean by ‘gluttonous snake’?","I’m having a serious talk with you, yet you suddenly start talking about snakes?","We aren’t on the same topic at all! How am I supposed to save you?","For a moment, Fairy Cheng Lin wanted to give up on Song Shuhang and leave him to fend for himself.","If it was not for the cute fairy maiden beside her constantly urging her, she might have crawled through the Cultivation chat group and pinched Shuhang hard enough to turn him into a long snake from a little mouse.","After calming herself down, Fairy Cheng Lin sent a point of energy to Song Shuhang with this postscript attached: [I’m talking to you about the dangers of the Heavenly Emperor’s path, so why are you suddenly talking about snakes? If you don’t take what I’m saying seriously, just wait and see how I pinch you into a long snake!]","Song Shuhang: “...”","He discovered that text messages could fail to properly relay a message at times.","As long as there was enough distance between them, even Fairy Cheng Lin could not use her face-reading and mind-reading skills on him, failing to keep up with his thoughts. If he did not explain some things clearly, Sister Cheng Lin would have no idea what he was talking about.","Song Shuhang hurriedly explained, [It’s my fault for not explaining clearly just now. When I was absorbing the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit earlier, Lady Kunna from the Black Dragon World provided me with remote support. She is currently helping me—]","After evolving from a hard-to-crush bug to a hard-to-crush mammal, he did not want to degenerate into a reptile.","However, when he tried his best to explain, he was faced with the word limit of the postscript function again.","Song Shuhang: “...”","He was trying to give an explanation when it was cut off.","Being cut off at crucial times like this really made people feel anxious.","Fortunately, he noticed that his message got cut off. Otherwise, if he only posted this half of his explanation without following up with the rest, he might really end up being pinched into a strip by Fairy Cheng Lin tomorrow.","So he followed up with another postscript: [—absorb the data contained in the fruit. With her help, my Cultivation chat group transformed into a voracious snake and is now devouring the data from the path fruit. Fairy Cheng Lin, can I still be saved?]","After receiving the messages, Fairy Cheng Lin fell into deep thought.","She did not reply to him for a long time, which scared Song Shuhang.","After a while, Fairy Cheng Lin finally replied, [This snake, is it selectively swallowing parts of the Heavenly Emperor’s information, or is it swallowing all of the Heavenly Emperor’s information?]","Song Shuhang replied, [Currently, it is selectively swallowing parts of the information. Lady Kunna seems to be guiding it to avoid the dangerous parts of the Heavenly Emperor’s information.]","On the other end, Fairy Cheng Lin went silent again.","After a while, she replied, [I will contact this Lady Kunna and talk to her directly. Where is she on your friend list? Open a connection.]","It was a matter that concerned his safety, so Song Shuhang quickly complied.","He quickly linked Fairy Cheng Lin to Lady Kunna, who was in his ‘Allies’ friend list.","Lady Kunna didn’t hesitate and swiftly accepted the connection with Fairy Cheng Lin.","The two big shots began to communicate secretly.","Meanwhile, Song Shuhang observed silently, not disturbing the big shots’ meeting.","?????","About six minutes later, Lady Kunna’s voice sounded in Song Shuhang’s mind once again.","[Beep, the Dragon Network’s Fat Ball has provided new instructions after importing Fairy Cheng Lin’s input.]","The technical support had upgraded.","In the next moment, the snake game taking place in Song Shuhang’s sea of consciousness underwent a change.","The snake’s ability to distinguish the clusters with the Heavenly Emperor’s information had been enhanced.","The clusters were now divided into red, yellow, and green, just like traffic lights.","Green was for secure information, which was the group of data that could be swallowed without worry.","Red was for the dangerous information, which was the group of data that must not be absorbed.","Yellow was for ambiguous information, which was the group of data that Fairy Cheng Lin could not identify for the moment. It will take some time to identify and classify them, but when they were successfully classified, then they would change to either green or red.","As the Jade Lake Empress who had once been involved in the collapse of the Heavenly City, Fairy Cheng Lin possessed a deep understanding of the Heavenly Emperor.","She even knew the Heavenly Emperor’s path as if it were the back of her hand! That was why it was so easy for her to distinguish the content of the data in the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit.","With the addition of Fairy Cheng Lin’s input and Lady Kunna’s navigation function, the greedy snake swam around confidently.","It ate the green clusters, avoided the red ones, and left the yellow clusters alone for the time being...","In this way, the gluttonous snake grew even faster, and the speed at which it was absorbing the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit increased as well.","[Thank you, Fairy Cheng Lin.] Song Shuhang sent another postscript.","Fairy Cheng Lin calmly replied, [You’re welcome. This is your reward for taking care of @#%×. At the same time, I would like to thank you all for breaking in and allowing the four scholarly Tribulation Transcenders to recover.]","Song Shuhang replied, [Unfortunately, those four Tribulation Transcenders will die soon.]","Fairy Cheng Lin: [What?]","Song Shuhang replied, [Huh? You didn’t know, Fairy Cheng Lin? The resurrection of the four Tribulation Transcenders is not perfect, and I am afraid that they will disappear within the next few days.]","He thought that Fairy Cheng Lin, the mastermind behind their resurrection, knew everything.","Yet, Fairy Cheng Lin appeared to be unaware of some things.","After a while, Fairy Cheng Lin sent him another message, [Daozi asked me to thank you for the eyes you gave to the four Tribulation Transcenders. After you leave your seclusion, he will reward you properly. You should think carefully about what you are lacking as of now.]","When Song Shuhang saw the first half of the sentence, the corners of his mouth twitched—I didn’t gift you those eyes. I just lent them to you!","Also, what am I lacking lately?","He was lacking the materials for an immortal cave.","Senior White was going to help him build an immortal cave on the moon so that he would have greater qualifications when he participated in the Su Clan’s annual meeting.","This was something to keep in mind.","[Anyway, good luck. Close up well and continue playing snake. Enjoy absorbing the useful information from the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit.] Fairy Cheng Lin sent one last message before ending her connection with Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang sighed.","He changed his posture in the stone coffin and returned to his business.","He kept playing snake until its body grew twentyfold.","[Beep~ Heavenly Emperor: Senior Song, can you tell me why there are so many familiar flavors in the evolving Cultivation group chat?]","Song Shuhang felt guilty.","He felt as if he had stolen a fruit and got caught by the owner."]},{"number":2227,"title":"Chapter 2227 In a dark space, requesting for help online","paragraphs":["2227 In a dark space, requesting for help online","Every lie required ten times as many new lies to cover it up.","Knowing that, Song Shuhang didn’t lie to the Heavenly Emperor earlier. She was a top-tier big shot, and low-level tricks such as lies were unlikely to work.","Instead, he chose to mislead her while concealing part of the truth.","But now, it seemed he got caught regardless.","And to give the Heavenly Emperor a proper answer, he would need to mislead her again, which would only serve to create more holes in his side of the story.","It feels like no matter how I answer, there will be problems.","Sigh, I don’t have too much experience in handling these matters.","Song Shuhang said softly, “It seems I can only seek help from the seniors who are familiar with the Heavenly Emperor.”","For example, Sister White Dragon and Fairy Cheng Lin.","They understood the Heavenly Emperor the best, and they might be able to help him think of a perfect way to answer the Heavenly Emperor’s questions.","But how should he ask them for help?","‘Senior, I’ve got a problem. When the Heavenly Emperor learned that my Cultivation chat group was upgrading, she found many things that seemed awfully familiar. She’s currently questioning me about it, how should I answer her?’","Song Shuhang thought to himself, Hmm, this seems to be good enough. I’ll send this to the seniors. It’s a pity that I didn’t get to add the Great Northern Emperor as a friend. Otherwise, there would be another big shot that I could consult on this matter.","While he was in thought, the Cultivation group automatically sent a request for help...","The big shots on the VIP blacklist were the first ones to receive the message.","Demon Emperor Hezhi, who was in a bad mood, received the second request for help of the day.","[Beep~ Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is in great distress. He needs help in explaining something to the Heavenly Emperor. Are you willing to help him? Y/N?]","Demon Emperor Hezhi didn’t even give it any thought and immediately clicked on No, before replying with a disdainful “Hehe” in the postscript.","But as soon as he made his choice, he pounded the ground hard—a violent earthquake shook the ground in a radius of ten miles.","“I should have chosen ‘Yes’!” Demon Emperor Hezhi felt heartbroken.","This kind of situation where he was being asked for help on “resolving misunderstandings” was the perfect situation for him to involve himself in. Once he interfered, he could cause even greater misunderstandings between Song Shuhang and the Heavenly Emperor until their relationship was completely ruined.","Even if he failed, he did not have much to lose.","When facing Song Shuhang, even if it meant suffering a loss, he would willingly take the hit as long as it made things worse for Shuhang.","After Demon Emperor Hezhi... the Indestructible Lord, Striped Dragon Two, the Almighty Merchant, I Really Want to Take a Color Photo, and Venerable Yellow Mountain all rejected Song Shuhang’s request for help.","Fairy Cheng Lin sent a postscript: [What did you do this time? Didn’t you say that you were going to close up for good?]","However, Song Shuhang did not have any time to reply to Fairy Cheng Lin.","The sudden operation launched by the Cultivation chat group sent shivers through Song Shuhang’s kidneys.","Notifications about the rejections of the big shots in the VIP blacklist filled his mind.","“Stop, stop quickly!” Song Shuhang hurriedly called out.","For now, it seemed that only the members of the VIP blacklist had received the request for help. The members on other lists should follow soon.","Stop before it’s too late!","I cannot allow this request to reach the Heavenly Emperor!","Otherwise, I’m really dead!","But at that moment...","[Beep~ Your Buddy “Heavenly Emperor” has accepted your request for help. Initializing the process... opening new function modules... activating beta video call function.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","I swear that after the Cultivation chat group finishes upgrading, I must install an AI bot to manage it.","My liver hurts, and so do my kidneys.","In front of him, a window the size of a mobile phone screen gradually took shape. As it was a new function, it was still in an experimental stage and could not be turned off.","Applications always had to be tested thoroughly before they were pushed to the market. Even then, they would likely still have bugs that needed to be addressed.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair coiled on top of Song Shuhang’s head. Her intuition told her that Song Shuhang was done for.","On the small screen, two windows appeared.","In the large window was a projection of the Heavenly Emperor, who had come to “help” Song Shuhang.","The small window was pitch black, with a barely visible face that was illuminated by the screen that had materialized in mid-air... This face belonged to none other than Song Shuhang, who was currently stuffed in a coffin.","“Hi, Senior Song. Is this a new function of the Cultivation chat group? This chat group doesn’t have a proper text chat, but it already has a video call function. Senior Song, your skill tree and technology tree is honestly quite skewed.” In the big window, the Heavenly Emperor could be seen sitting on a throne, resting her chin on one hand while her slender legs were crossed.","She had the same appearance as Soft Feather, but the way they carried themselves was completely different.","Song Shuhang: “...”","He tried his best to keep a straight face to avoid giving the other party any information.","Also, he had no idea what to say.","“Senior Song, don’t be so tense. Although I’m busy, I don’t mind having a good chat with you. Anyway... It’s quite dark over there.” The Heavenly Emperor narrowed her eyes.","“That’s because I’m closing up.” Song Shuhang nodded vigorously and said, “I was enlightened and urgently needed to go into seclusion to absorb all the information. How about we talk again after I’m done?”","“It’s fine, I can just watch you as you’re closing up.” The Heavenly Emperor chuckled.","Song Shuhang: “...”","The Heavenly Emperor said slowly, “Sure enough, you are absorbing my path. As for the source of the path, it should be the data kept in my resurrection information.”","I’m dead, I couldn’t hide it from her!","“Senior Song, my path is very dangerous.” The Heavenly Emperor leaned over and said seriously, “It is very, very dangerous. If possible, I hope that you can stop what you’re doing immediately.”","“How dangerous is it?” Song Shuhang asked. He had already absorbed most of it, so he felt the need to ask this question.","The Heavenly Emperor said, “You are acquainted with the Ancestral Golden Dragon and the Great Northern Emperor, right? You should already know that my path embraces all things, and while it is easy to become part of it, it is very difficult to leave it.”","“Indeed.” Song Shuhang nodded.","“However, that’s not the real danger.” The Heavenly Emperor pointed to the sky and said, “The real danger comes from over there. My path is part of the self-completion plan of a certain someone. Since you have absorbed my path, it is very likely that you have become a part of that completion plan.”","“Eh? You actually know about that?” Song Shuhang was surprised.","The Heavenly Emperor: “!!!”","She could no longer keep up her majestic and dignified appearance.","What the hell?! Senior Song, why does it seem like you’ve known about this detail for a long time?"]},{"number":2228,"title":"Chapter 2228 A man must be full of mystery","paragraphs":["2228 A man must be full of mystery","Song Shuhang and the Heavenly Emperor fell silent","Song Shuhang was a powerhouse of his own inside the group, and he could easily chat people to death.","The Heavenly Emperor stared at Song Shuhang and asked him carefully, “Senior Song, why does it seem that you knew about this matter already? How did you know that my path was a part of the completion plan?”","This matter was obviously her biggest secret. She had never told anyone about it, so how did Song Shuhang know about it?","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the... lid of the coffin.","The coffin was sealed and stuffy, and his heart felt the same way.","After a while, he nodded and said, “Due to special circumstances, I do know some things about the completion plan.”","One of those ‘special circumstances’ was his entering the dreamland of a prototype version of the Heavenly Emperor.","In retrospect, it was a painful memory second only to Lady Onion’s hundreds of years of living as a green onion.","To be honest, when he entered the dreamland of the prototype Heavenly Emperor and became an experimental subject, the pain and loneliness he felt were even worse than when he experienced Lady Onion’s life.","It was just that his will was already very firm by then, and he was no longer the rookie who had just come into contact with the world of cultivation. Therefore, although the pain and loneliness were greater, the impression that it left on him was weaker than Lady Onion’s life as a green onion.","Song Shuhang personally experienced the various experiments that Wielder of the Will Liquid Metal Ball performed on the prototype Heavenly Emperor.","And these memories may be lost to the Heavenly Emperor as she was in a state similar to that of an embryo back then.","So when it came to the information about the origin of the Heavenly Emperor, Song Shuhang was the most knowledgeable person in the universe. The Wielder of the Will was not a ball and not a person, so they did not count.","Experiment after experiment, the embryo eventually grew to become the ‘Heavenly Emperor 01 Boy Version’. This version of the Heavenly Emperor was set to start cultivating in the human world. Finally, this version of the Heavenly Emperor heard Tyrannical Song’s mysterious call, looked into the abyss, and then took a leap of faith.","It could be said that Song Shuhang had a clear understanding of everything that happened back then.","But as for what happened after, and as for why the boy version of the Heavenly Emperor became a woman... These questions could only be answered if Song Shuhang got to enter the Heavenly Emperor’s dreamland once more.","?????","After a long silence, the Heavenly Emperor said, “Suddenly, I can’t see through you, Senior Song.”","With the screen and Song Shuhang’s deliberately stern face, she could not read any useful information from his face.","Song Shuhang said in a low, mature voice, “A man must be full of mystery.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair above his head suddenly said, “It’s supposed to be a woman, not a man, thank you.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","“Since Senior Song knows about the completion plan, then you also should know about the danger that absorbing my path will bring you.” The Heavenly Emperor fell back and leaned against her throne.","She didn’t really want to involve Song Shuhang in the plans of the current Wielder of the Heaven’s Will as she had placed a bet on Song Shuhang. Or rather, she was betting on Song Shuhang’s steel manifestation.","In addition, when Song Shuhang spoke with a deep and mature voice just now, she got a familiar feeling.","Song Shuhang nodded slightly.","He did know about the danger, but it was too late.","The Cultivation chat group had already absorbed a majority of the Heavenly Emperor’s path, so it made no sense to stop now. Moreover, it was impossible for it to spit out the parts it had already absorbed.","Fortunately, during the absorption process, Lady Kunna provided him with some technical support and managed, along with Fairy Cheng Lin’s input, to classify the Heavenly Emperor’s path into three different colors. At present, the only clusters he absorbed were the green ones, and this should allow him to avoid the worst outcome.","“Then, I have nothing else to say. Now that I think about it... This is a good thing for me. Senior Song, since you are also involved in the completion plan, you can move to the front and draw most of the firepower. I will cheer for you from behind,” said the Heavenly Emperor with a happy smile.","Song Shuhang: “...”","The Heavenly Emperor waved her hand and said, “The next time we meet, we might even be on the same side. Alright then, goodbye.”","With that, the video call ended, and the screen of light dissipated.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin. He thought he was going to die this time, so it was unexpected when his call with the Heavenly Emperor ended on good terms.","The Heavenly Emperor’s position was hard to gauge.","Above his head, Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said lazily, “You could say that you’ve passed another test.”","“Mm-hm.” Song Shuhang nodded.","In his mind, he began to recall the experiments of the Liquid Metal Ball when he was dreaming of the life of the prototype Heavenly Emperor.","With those experiments, Wielder of the Will Liquid Metal Ball might have been trying to leave a backdoor in the prototype to eventually gain full control of its body. Perhaps I can find some useful clues in the information to ruin Wielder of the Will Liquid Metal Ball’s completion plan.","??????","Meanwhile, on the asteroid where the Heavenly Emperor was residing...","The Heavenly Emperor sat on her throne, lost in thought.","There was a divination trigram in front of her, but the result of the divination was vague. It lacked a clear result.","“A man has to be full of mystery...” she murmured, imitating the deep, mature voice of Song Shuhang during the video call just now.","Her intuition told her that this voice was the key to Song Shuhang’s secret. It was just that she could not figure anything out for the time being.","Therefore, the Heavenly Emperor chose to give up for now.","She got up and went to the room behind the throne.","This room contained the Sun Boat that she had taken from the Black Dragon World. Song Shuhang’s steel manifestation was sealed inside.","[What is troubling you?] A mechanical voice came from the Sun Boat.","This sound had a special power, like a demonic sound capable of penetrating straight into one’s brain.","“Nothing is troubling me. It’s just that my impression of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song has slightly changed today.” The Heavenly Emperor chuckled and said, “Don’t waste any more time. Return to Earth. There is an important fragment of the Heavenly City there that needs to be retrieved.”","The electronic voice asked, [The mysterious island?]","“Yes, the mysterious island.” The Heavenly Emperor nodded.","As she stepped forward, a door opened on the Sun Boat, and the Heavenly Emperor strode into it.","The mechanical voice continued, [Departing... Inputting the coordinates of the sky over the East China Sea on Earth in the main world...]","The small sun-shaped Sun Boat lifted off, and after a swift acceleration, it traversed space.","??????","At this time, in the stone coffin.","Fairy Cheng Lin sent another message: [Were you talking with the Heavenly Emperor just now?]","[The crazy operations of the Cultivation chat group almost killed me,] Song Shuhang replied with a postscript.","Then, he briefly shared the content of the chat between him and the Heavenly Emperor with Fairy Cheng Lin. He also shared information about the Wielder of the Will’s self-completion plan.","At the same time, he summoned Senior White Two..."]},{"number":2229,"title":"Chapter 2229 Saying everything out loud takes the fun out of things","paragraphs":["2229 Saying everything out loud takes the fun out of things","He opened several different chat windows in one breath, conversing with multiple people at the same time.","Song Shuhang felt as if he had returned to the time when he was still a teen, back when he had first come into contact with various chat software.","Back then, he could spend all night just chatting with his friends. Most, if not all of it, was pointless chatting as by the next day, or even by the end of the same day, he had no idea what exactly they had chatted about.","But after a while, he became obsessed with reading, and the time that he had for chatting with his friends decreased.","This was the charm of knowledge!","Song Shuhang briefly described Wielder of the Will Liquid Metal Ball’s completion plan to Senior White Two.","At the same time, he described what he experienced when he entered the Heavenly Emperor’s dreamland and the experiments the Liquid Metal Ball performed on him.","Senior White Two replied with a postscript: [And you were saying that you were not provoking the fat ball?]","You’re literally going for the main body of the fat ball!","Song Shuhang: “...”","I was not!","I was just minding my own business when I got involved in this mess for no reason.","I did not want any of this trouble!","At the same time, Fairy Cheng Lin replied to him with a postscript: [I did not think that the Heavenly Emperor would discover that she is a part of the Wielder of the Will’s completion plan. This is completely outside of my expectations.]","Song Shuhang: “...”","Fairy Cheng Lin, did you also know about the completion plan?","Why does it feel like everyone in the world knew about this secret except for the Heavenly Emperor herself?","While Song Shuhang was dwelling on his thoughts, Senior White Two sent him another postscript: [You can continue with your seclusion with peace of mind and absorb what you need to absorb. However, when absorbing the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit, remember to record everything. After returning to the main world, transfer that data to me, and I will study it for you. In addition, try to recall as much as you can about the experiments performed on the prototype Heavenly Emperor. Nobody in the universe knows the fat ball better than me. As long as you give me time to study the data, I should be able to get something useful out of it.]","Although there was still a difference between Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball and Wielder of the Will Fat Ball, they were one before ascending to the position of Wielder of the Heaven’s Will, and their modus operandi was not going to change too much after the split.","By following the train of thought of Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball, one could roughly deduce what Wielder of the Will Liquid Metal Ball was planning or thinking.","Combining this info with Song Shuhang’s memory of the experiments performed on the prototype Heavenly Emperor and the data contained in the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit, Senior White Two was sure he could devise a plan with a 20% success rate that could ruin the fat ball’s completion plan.","Of course, he did not tell Song Shuhang about the success rate.","Saying everything out loud would take the fun out of things.","And for Song Shuhang, Senior White Two’s reply was like a wonder pill.","His mind suddenly became at ease.","Song Shuhang said boldly, [No problem, Senior White. I will record as much data as I can. When the time comes, we can overturn the completion plan of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball!]","Senior White Two replied calmly, [You got this. In addition, I would like to remind you that my main body is still sealed by the fat ball, so don’t get too excited, lest I be unable to save you.]","Song Shuhang’s heroic aura lost most of its confidence.","?????","After finishing talking with Fairy Cheng Lin and Senior White Two, Song Shuhang changed to a side-lying position and continued his seclusion.","This time, no big shot interrupted his seclusion with any postscripts.","In his sea of consciousness, the greedy snake, which represents the Cultivation chat group, had grown into a giant snake.","All of the data in the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit that suited the chat group had been absorbed.","Song Shuhang had a premonition that after this seclusion, the chat group would finally be complete!","The posture he was currently in was a bit awkward, but this did not affect his seclusion.","Circulating the ?Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Technique? and his three top-tier body-tempering cultivation techniques, Song Shuhang entered, once again, a state of meditation.","This time, he could finally lie in his coffin without being disturbed.","??????","Inside the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection space.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “We finally caught it.”","She raised the big net in her hand, and an ugly water beast could be seen struggling inside.","Sixteen said, “This should be the last one we have to catch, right?”","Before leaving the Sage’s resurrection space, Senior White casually decided to capture and take away some of the smaller water beasts after the split.","Since this black lake was rather weird, it took some time to capture the small water beasts.","Sage ‘Song Shuhang’ White smiled slightly and said, “Yeah, that should be enough. I don’t intend to capture every single water beast.”","He used the Universe Hiding Sleeve to put away the twelve water beasts they had captured together with Song Shuhang’s coffin and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","The black-skinned Soft Feather, Fairy Creation, and Fairy Virtue returned to Song Shuhang’s physical body.","“Are you ready?” Senior White asked as he took out a disposable flying sword.","Sixteen, Fairy Skylark, and Thrice Reckless Mad Saber all nodded. Then, they grabbed onto the wooden swords that Senior White had given them.","“Our destination is the moon of the main world. Let’s go!” Senior White activated a sword art.","Meteor Sword returned, and the fake Fairy Yuanyuan was released from the formation binding her.","Immediately afterward, the disposable flying swords in everyone’s hands lit up, and they began to traverse space.","The figures of Sixteen and Senior White were the first to disappear.","“Let’s go, Thrice Reckless,” called out Fairy Skylark. She took one last look at the black lake before leaving as well.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber was the last to leave.","Holding the shiny wooden sword in his hand, his eyes fell on the black lake.","In the black lake, a fat fish leaped up. It was a clone of the water beast that was lucky enough not to be caught.","The water beast leaped out of the water, intending to attack the fake Fairy Yuanyuan and devour her.","But the moment it jumped out of the water, its eyes met those of Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber grinned and looked at the surviving water beast.","The water beast froze in the air for two seconds, then fell back to the black lake with a plop. It did not expect that there was still someone who had not left!","“Whoosh~” The wooden sword in Thrice Reckless’s hand shone brightly, bringing him away through space, out of the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation.","The freed fake Fairy Yuanyuan hurriedly fled from the black lake.","She did not have Senior White’s ability to traverse space, and she did not have Skylark’s privileges. If she wanted to leave the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation, she could only do it the normal way.","??????","Outside the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation space.","The bald Tribulation Transcender who was among the survivors of the Heavenly City had a bitter expression on his face.","No one expected that the Scholarly Sage’s space would take the initiative to drive people out and lock itself.","The bald Tribulation Transcender was now waiting for the space to open up again.","At the same time, his people had surrounded the area.","In this way, when the first Sage in a thousand years, Tyrannical Song, and the person disguised as Azure Reckless came out, they would have no way of escaping.","“Fwoosh~”","Shortly after Skylark’s departure, the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation space was unsealed.","The place could be accessed once again.","The bald Tribulation Transcender was the first to seize this opportunity to enter. He could not wait to punch Tyrannical Song in the face."]},{"number":2230,"title":"Chapter 2230 Digging out a cave","paragraphs":["2230 Digging out a cave","However, other than Fairy Yuanyuan, there was no one left inside the space, not even a single trace of Tyrannical Song.","In order to prevent Tyrannical Song and the others from escaping through the “backdoor”, the bald Tribulation Transcender had his men surround the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection space.","Yet, Tyrannical Song and the others still managed to leave without a trace.","In other words, they did not exit the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection space through normal means but used spatial abilities to directly traverse space.","“There must be loopholes in our spatial confinement system...” The bald Tribulation Transcender gritted his teeth. This spatial confinement system was something that he and his colleagues were very proud of, and they believed that it could trap even an Immortal for quite some time.","Yet, Tyrannical Song and his party could seemingly come and go as they pleased even with the spatial confinement in place. It was as if this place was their backyard.","For this reason, the bald Tribulation Transcender believed that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and the others must have found a loophole in their spatial confinement system.","“Bring her to me first!” The bald Tribulation Transcender glanced at the fake Fairy Yuanyuan and ordered.","The fake Fairy Yuanyuan did not resist, and she was very cooperative with the members of the Heavenly City as they brought her away. What awaited her was the infamous Lock Immortal Prison.","The bald Tribulation Transcender said, “Notify our companions scattered across the universe! Tell them to pay close attention to the whereabouts of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. If there is any news of him, it must be passed on to us immediately... However, tell them to be extra careful when facing him. They must not act rashly.”","The first Sage in a thousand years, his reputation was well-deserved, and his strength and means were also extraordinary.","The bald Tribulation Transcender recalled the first time he saw “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song”. The real Profound Sage Tyrannical Song turned out to be a lot more impressive than his self that appeared on the screen. It almost made people not want to be enemies with him.","Moreover, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song seemed to be related to “Cheng Lin”.","Therefore, when dealing with Tyrannical Song, it might even be necessary to ask Zither Master Phoenix Bearing to personally make a move.","After he finished voicing out his instructions, the bald Tribulation Transcender began to carefully inspect the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation and the black lake.","After his inspection, his face turned even uglier.","The Heavenly Emperor’s resurrection information that they had placed in the black lake had disappeared.","Moreover, a large part of the energy of the resurrection formation had been consumed.","“Tyrannical Song! Cheng Lin!” The bald Tribulation Transcender punched the air violently.","?????","After the bald Tribulation Transcender and the remaining members of the Heavenly City left, a branch sprouted at the bottom of the black lake.","The remaining water beasts swam over to the budding branch.","A seed appeared on the branch, which quietly attached itself to a water beast, concealing itself. This was one of the tricks of the fake Fairy Yuanyuan.","Since she had been willing to break into the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation space, she naturally would not let herself be caught so easily.","The Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation revived four Tribulation Transcenders at once, which was extremely expensive in terms of energy. However, it had not collapsed yet, and it could still carry out resurrections. After all, when the Scholarly Sage had set up this formation, it was meant to resurrect all thirteen of the scholarly faction’s Tribulation Transcenders.","I still have a chance. The real body of the fake Fairy Yuanyuan was hidden in the seed, waiting for an opportunity.","??????","On Earth’s moon, in the main world.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s sword light was the last one to arrive.","The disposable flying swords had opened a spatial rift that brought the user directly to the moon’s coordinates.","When half of Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s body exited the spatial rift, he saw that Senior White, now disguised as Shuhang, Sixteen, the black-skinned Soft Feather, and Skylark were all on the ground, waiting for him.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Senior Thrice Reckless, you’re so slow.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber replied solemnly, “I was thinking about something, Soft Feather.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “What problem was Senior Thrice Reckless thinking about?”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber pointed at himself, and said, “Half of my body is currently in the main world, while the other half is still in the spatial rift. When the spatial rift closes, what will happen to me?”","The black-skinned Soft Feather replied seriously, “You will die.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber waved his hand and said, “Death is only one of the possibilities. I’m thinking about another possibility. Will the upper and lower parts of my body be able to move freely after being cut in half by space? Like two individuals?”","“Stop seeking death.” Skylark reached out and pulled Thrice Reckless Mad Saber out of the spatial rift.","After Thrice Reckless landed on the ground, the disposable flying sword in his hand turned into sawdust and disappeared—the energy in the disposable flying sword had been completely exhausted. If he had wasted any more time, the spatial rift would have really closed.","Sister White Dragon chuckled. “Little Friend Thrice Reckless, if you had taken any longer to come out of the spatial rift, you would become just like Fellow Daoist White.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber looked at Sister White Dragon in puzzlement. “Same as Senior White? Why?”","“Because I’m now in the very state that you desire,” said Senior White. He stretched out his hand and lifted his waist up... Then, the upper and lower parts of his body were separated.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber’s eyes widened.","Senior White placed his body back calmly and asked, “Where is Fellow Daoist Skylark going next? Do you need me to give you a ride?”","After thinking for a moment, Skylark said, “I’m going to head back to Earth first. Afterward, I might visit the scholarly faction.”","Senior White asked, “Shall I send you off?”","Skylark shook her head. “There is no need for that. This is not that urgent.”","??????","Skylark and Thrice Reckless Mad Saber chose to fly back to Earth.","After bidding farewell to everyone, the two rushed into space with their sword and saber.","Sixteen took out her phone and shook it slightly.","There was a branch of the Spirit River Su Clan on the moon, and her mobile phone had a signal.","She said softly, “It’s December 1st.”","“Sixteen, are you planning to go back?” asked Senior White. The Spirit River Su Clan’s annual meeting was about to start, and as a genius who inherited a numeric number, Sixteen would be one of the protagonists of the annual meeting. Generally speaking, it would be necessary for her to rush back in advance to help the clan.","“Mm-hm.” Sixteen nodded.","Senior White patted Sixteen’s head and said with a smile, “If Shuhang has exited his seclusion by the time the annual meeting starts, I will send him over.”","Sixteen said softly, “Thank you, Senior White.”","Senior White’s charm coupled with Song Shuhang’s appearance was almost deadly for her.","As a result, she could not even speak properly.","Senior White asked, “Do you need me to send you back to the Spirit River Su Clan? I know where their base is located.”","Sixteen nodded after some thought.","Song Shuhang was still closing up, and she did not want to fly back to Earth alone.","Senior White reached out and placed his hand on Sixteen’s body. Then he activated his spatial abilities and sent her to a location close to the Su Clan back on Earth.","Senior White smiled and said, “Speaking of which, Sixteen is radiating with luck today. It seems that she will encounter good things.”","Beside him, the black-skinned Soft Feather was making use of this time to try to communicate with her main body, wanting to share her recent experiences.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked casually, “What about me, Senior White? Am I lucky lately?”","Senior White said seriously, “I can’t tell.”","That was because the area between the eyebrows of the black-skinned Soft Feather was naturally black.","The black-skinned Soft Feather: “???”","Senior White smiled and said, “Let’s go. Let’s find a place on the moon and dig out an immortal cave for Shuhang.”"]},{"number":2231,"title":"Chapter 2231 Form ties, end ties","paragraphs":["2231 Form ties, end ties","Senior White took the black-skinned Soft Feather and wandered on the moon’s surface, looking for a suitable place to dig out an immortal cave.","Since human technology had already extended its “hands” to space, to the moon, and to the other planets in the solar system, some cultivators, who were not fond of being disturbed, hid their immortal caves deeper in the ground or simply moved elsewhere.","Compared with hundreds of years ago, the moon was now much more lonely, and there were many areas that had since become vacant.","Senior White took the black-skinned Soft Feather on a walk around the moon for about half a day—it could be seen from this that he was in a relatively good mood.","When he saw that most cultivators were either lowering their heads or moving away after seeing him, Senior White found the experience novel and amusing.","In the past, due to his charm being too strong and him being unable to control it, it was always as if there was a spotlight on him regardless of where he went, so he had never enjoyed this kind of treatment.","It was especially interesting when Senior White saw that some fellow daoists who he had met several times in the past hundreds of years were also avoiding “Song Shuhang”, keeping a distance.","Sometimes, Senior White would even go out of his way to greet some of his old friends.","He was having a great time.","“Senior White, we’ve been strolling for a long time. Have you found a suitable site yet?” The black-skinned Soft Feather asked. She felt that while Senior White was having a blast, he seemed to have forgotten that they were supposed to be looking for a suitable location for an immortal cave.","Senior White, who was leading the way, visibly froze.","The black-skinned Soft Feather sighed inwardly. Sure enough, Senior White was having too much fun and forgot about choosing a location.","“Hahaha, while I did spot several good locations when wandering around, their overall layouts were not imposing enough!” Senior White said solemnly, “We should go to another area. We’ll definitely find a location with great geomancy before Shuhang exits his seclusion.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather: “...”","The entire time, Senior White kept talking about rich lands with great geomancy and sites for digging.","Why do I keep on getting the feeling that we aren’t even looking for a place for Senior Song’s immortal cave?","Senior White, who was leading the way, said, “Hey! I see another acquaintance.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather sighed and followed silently. Until Senior White had not played enough, it seemed that he would not be able to concentrate on doing business.","So after much deliberation, she decided that she would simply let Senior White have fun before mentioning the task at hand once more.","“The acquaintance this time is also acquainted with little friend Shuhang. When I sent Shuhang to space, I asked him to help arrange a trial so that Shuhang could also practice in space. But later, that formation ended up becoming useless.” Senior White explained to the black-skinned Soft Feather while they were flying.","After hearing Senior White’s introduction, the black-skinned Soft Feather became slightly interested and flew forward with Senior White. “What is the name of this senior?”","Senior White explained, “His daoist name is Sobbing Old Man. He is a very interesting fellow daoist, but if you stay with him for quite some time, he quickly becomes quite unbearable.”","?????","Ahead, the Sobbing Old Man had just returned from a nearby cultivator market, and he was carrying a box of natural treasures and medicinal pills.","He returned to his small immortal cave on the moon, made a hand seal, and opened the door.","“Fellow Daoist Sobbing, long time no see.” At this moment, a familiar voice came from behind him.","As soon as the Sobbing Old Man turned his head, he saw Profound Sage Tyrannical Song approaching him, and behind Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was a fairy with very long legs.","He quickly recognized the little fairy maiden to be the daughter of Profound Sage Spirit Butterfly, Fairy Soft Feather.","However, he could not help but wonder why Fairy Soft Feather suddenly had such dark skin.","“It’s you, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.” After seeing Song Shuhang, the Sobbing Old Man was so excited that he burst into tears. Tears kept flowing down his face.","He had a bit of history with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","A few months ago, the Sobbing Old Man wanted to join the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion, and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song helped him significantly in this regard. Unfortunately, Pavilion Master Chu ultimately refused to accept him as an apprentice.","As such, the Sobbing Old Man took the second best option and decided to become Shuhang’s disciple, which would allow him to indirectly achieve his purpose of joining the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion.","But during this period of time, some of his memories became blurred, and he ultimately lost the opportunity to become Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s disciple.","The Sobbing Old Man had been wanting to find Profound Sage Tyrannical Song for quite some time, but hadn’t had the chance to do so.","Today, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song came to his door in person, and he could not help but cry out loud due to how moved he was.","Senior White slammed on the brakes.","He was worried that the over-excited weeping man would rush at him and drown him in tears.","Senior White also feared that the Sobbing Old Man would end up dying of dehydration from all the crying.","The black-skinned Soft Feather greeted the other party respectfully, “Greetings, Senior.”","“Fairy Soft Feather, hello to you too.” The Sobbing Old Man managed to control his emotions and greeted Soft Feather.","Senior White stepped forward and patted the old man. “How have you been doing recently?”","He remembered that Song Shuhang once promised to think of a way to help the Sobbing Old Man join the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion. Now that Pavilion Master Chu had become Song Shuhang’s strand of hair, there might be some hope for him.","The Sobbing Old Man replied while sobbing, “I’ve been good. Besides, a fairy maiden came to my door a few days ago to guide me on the follow-up chapter of the ?Tome of Never-Ending Tears?. I am going to close up soon and push for the next realm.”","[Someone guided his practice of the ?Tome of Never-Ending Tears?? Who was it?] Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair had been slightly sticking out from Senior White’s sleeve, checking the outside world.","She was taken aback when she heard the Sobbing Old Man’s words.","Senior White also showed a puzzled expression. “A fairy guided you in your cultivation? Who was it?”","“Yes... yes...” Sobbing Old Man subconsciously started to reply, but when he was about to answer, he frowned.","To his horror, he found out that he could not remember who that fairy was.","It was something that had happened just recently when he met that fairy who guided him on the sequel of the ?Tome of Never-Ending Tears?. However, he could not remember anything about her at all.","“How could this happen?!” Sobbing Old Man scratched his head, crying anxiously.","“Fellow Daoist Sobbing, don’t worry.” Senior White smiled and patted him.","His smile carried a calming power.","Daoist Sobbing soon calmed down.","Senior White asked, “Where is that fairy now?”","“I... don’t remember.” Daoist Sobbing smiled wryly and shook his head.","“Don’t worry, Fellow Daoist Sobbing. Maybe that fairy does not want you to know her identity. There are always this kind of fellow daoists who choose not to leave their names behind after doing good deeds.” Senior White comforted.","Daoist Sobbing pondered for a moment, then nodded.","??????","After a while, Senior White and the black-skinned Soft Feather were invited by the sobbing daoist to enter his immortal cave for a short rest.","Daoist Sobbing turned around and went to make tea for his two guests.","After the Sobbing Old Man left, Senior White suddenly turned around and said with a smile, “Mysterious fairy maiden, why don’t you come out and meet with us?”"]},{"number":2232,"title":"Chapter 2232 Finding a suitable hole","paragraphs":["2232 Finding a suitable hole","Hearing Senior White’s words, the black-skinned Soft Feather quickly turned around and looked back.","She had not even sensed that a person had appeared behind her!","The other party’s ability to restrain their aura was so powerful. Could she be a powerful senior?","When she turned around, she saw a graceful fairy maiden sitting quietly in a corner, holding a thick book in her hand, watching them from afar.","She was wearing a long lavender dress, her long brown hair was braided, and her long fringe slightly covered her eyes. She looked quite charming.","However, the black-skinned Soft Feather immediately noticed that the other party was not restraining their aura at all.","Their sense of existence was actually so weak that she had not sensed them from the very beginning. Seeing the scene, Butterfly Song White Creation Yellow Trigram Lychee Six Dou Phoenix could not help but recall a certain forgettable senior from the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","After thinking of that senior, Butterfly Song White Creation Yellow Trigram Lychee Six Dou Phoenix felt a slight ache in her heart.","This fairy’s sense of existence is too weak. Even after teaching the Sobbing Old Man his cultivation technique, the Sobbing Old Man could not remember her. How heart-stifling must that feel?","Senior White and the black-skinned Soft Feather both stared at the mysterious fairy maiden.","At the same time, the mysterious fairy stared right back at Senior White and the black-skinned Soft Feather without blinking.","“How did you notice me?” the mysterious fairy asked in confusion.","Senior White replied, “I saw you as soon as I came in.”","The mysterious fairy blinked and smiled sweetly.","Senior White added, “Long time no see, Fairy Ye Si.”","The mysterious fairy was taken aback for a moment.","Because she had just been called by her name!","“I had been wondering previously. Who might it be that could teach the Sobbing Old Man about the ?Tome of Never-Ending Tears?? After some thought, only one person came to mind. But in the end, it was merely speculation.” Senior White’s voice changed back into his own voice.","“Senior White, you really are special.” Ye Si put away the big book in her hand. Similarly, as soon as she saw this ‘Tyrannical Song’, she knew that he was not Song Shuhang.","There was a contract between her and Song Shuhang, and the unique connection of this contract could not be fabricated. From the inexplicable and intense charm the other party was exhibiting, she was able to quickly deduce that he was Senior White.","Senior White asked, “Is it an effect similar to that of the Wielder’s small black room?”","However, what was special about the current situation was that Ye Si could still move around and interact with the main world even with the effect of the Wielder’s small black room shrouding her body.","“Mm-hm.” Ye Si nodded slightly, and then she added, “This is a special clone I have that can still interact with the outside world.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather did not make a sound and silently recorded everything that she was seeing for her main body.","“Do you want to meet Shuhang? He’s in my sleeve.” Senior White waved his sleeve.","Ye Si shook her head lightly. “There’s no need. Actually, I’ve been by his side all this time.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather blinked repeatedly.","“Then, do you want to meet Pavilion Master Chu? Though, she is currently only a strand of hair. Hmm, that tip of hair is hers.” Senior White pointed to the tip of hair sticking out of his sleeve.","Ye Si did not know whether to laugh or cry.","The tip of Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair twitched slightly.","The black-skinned Soft Feather continued to record everything silently.","“Why did you suddenly teach the Sobbing Old Man the ?Tome of Never-Ending Tears??” Senior White finally got to the point.","“Ending ties.” Ye Si sat upright and replied softly.","She had numerous ties of karma, and she had secretly begun ending them one by one.","Senior White said, “It seems that you are planning on doing something big...”","Forming ties, ending ties.","After ending ties, there will no longer be an entanglement brought about by karmic ties. Coupled with Ye Si’s current state, where she was under the Wielder’s small black room’s effect, it implied that she was about to do something big.","“Mm-hm.” Ye Si nodded slightly.","“Be careful. And if you ever need help, you can find me through Shuhang,” said Senior White softly. He did not explicitly ask Ye Si about what she was planning.","As long as it was truly a big deal, then he would naturally be very interested in participating.","Ye Si replied, “Thank you, Senior White.”","Senior White smiled and said, “It’s nice to be young.”","In the middle of the conversation, the Sobbing Old Man who had gone to make tea finally came back.","When he saw Ye Si, he was taken aback for a moment, and then seemed to be lost in thought. After a long while, he finally remembered something.","“Fairy, you’re still here!” The Sobbing Old Man was so moved that tears streamed down his face.","This was the normal reaction of a normal cultivator seeing Ye Si nowadays.","Ye Si said, “I’ve always been here.”","The Sobbing Old Man excitedly said to Senior White, “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, this is the fairy that taught me the follow-up chapter of the ?Tome of Never-Ending Tears?.”","Senior White replied with a smile, “Yes, I know.”","The Sobbing Old Man held a teapot and poured everyone a cup of spirit tea.","Ye Si took the cup of spirit tea and took a sip, “I have already taught you the rest of the ?Tome of Never-Ending Tears?. Now you need to practice it step by step. I’m hopeful, but the rest will be up to you.”","“Yes, thank you for your teachings, Fairy,” said the Sobbing Old Man with a nod. He took out a book and recorded all of Ye Si’s words, lest he somehow forget the fairy’s teachings.","Ye Si smiled slightly and said, “And so, this is the end of our fateful meeting. In the future, it shall be up to fate once more should we meet.”","The Sobbing Old Man took out a box and handed it to Ye Si.","That was the ?Tome of Never-Ending Tears?’s Inheritance Fragment that he had acquired when he was young, as well as the location where he got the inheritance.","Ye Si took the box and put it away. Then, she turned to look at Senior White and the black-skinned Soft Feather. “Well then, Senior W—”","“Ahem!” Senior White coughed lightly, and said in Song Shuhang’s voice, “Then, Fairy Ye Si, we shall meet again later.”","Ye Si immediately understood Senior White’s intention.","“Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, Fairy Soft Feather, may we meet another time.” She waved at Soft Feather and Senior White.","Then, a spatial passage opened right beside her.","At this time, the black-skinned Soft Feather suddenly asked, “Fairy Ye Si, where are you heading next?”","“I’m heading to Wenzhou City next,” Ye Si replied. “Does Fairy Soft Feather wish to come with me?”","The black-skinned Soft Feather shook his head. “No, I was just asking.”","Ye Si lovingly rubbed the head of the black-skinned Soft Feather, and then stepped into the spatial gate and disappeared.","“Then, we shall not interrupt Fellow Daoist’s training any longer.” Senior White stood up, bid farewell to the Sobbing Old Man, and got ready to leave.","The black-skinned Soft Feather touched the top of her head with an enigmatic expression and also bid the Sobbing Old Man farewell.","?????","Senior White left the Sobbing Old Man’s immortal cave together with the black-skinned Soft Feather.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Senior White, where are we going next?”","“Hmm...” Senior White pinched his chin and pondered for a moment. He then took out a branch cut off from Shuhang’s wooden body from his spatial magical treasure, and lightly threw it into the air.","The branch spun in the air.","After landing, it pointed to their three o’clock.","Senior White said, “Very well, let’s go in this direction. We will definitely find a suitable hole.”","While speaking, he glanced back at the Sobbing Old Man’s immortal cave..."]},{"number":2233,"title":"Chapter 2233 Are you a demon?","paragraphs":["2233 Are you a demon?","Someone was spying on them.","“Interesting.” Senior White found the whole thing rather amusing. While it did seem that nobody dared to meet Tyrannical Song’s gaze directly, there were still people trailing him in secret.","Senior White reached out and flipped the small silver token on his wrist.","This silver token was connected to the stone coffin in his Universe Hiding Sleeve. In this way, when he was disguised as Song Shuhang and cultivators from wherever it may be in the universe looked at him, they would not sense the sage name White, but rather the sage names Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, and Tyrannical Demon.","However, because Song Shuhang had four sage names, Senior White had to flip the silver token every once in a while to switch sage names. He found this little game of switching sage names somewhat fun.","Senior White led the way, holding the branch in his hand as he shook it gently.","The black-skinned Soft Feather followed closely behind him.","Meanwhile, the stalker in the shadows kept following them from afar.","Senior White walked at a controlled pace. If he walked too fast, the stalker might lose them.","As he was walking, a sword light streaked across the sky and fell towards him.","Fairy Butterfly Song White Creation Yellow Trigram Lychee Six Dou Phoenix shouted, “Senior, watch out!”","“Don’t panic, it’s not an enemy.” Senior White stretched out his hand, and the sword light in the sky fell into his hand.","It was Meteor Sword.","There was also a piece of paper hanging from Meteor Sword with a large “OK” written on it.","The black-skinned Soft Feather blinked, puzzled.","Senior White explained, “I just ordered a table of immortal dishes from Immortal Fairy Bie Xue as she also happened to be on the moon. When we find a good location, we can have a meal before starting to dig out the immortal cave.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather nodded.","?????","After over half an hour, Senior White and the black-skinned Soft Feather left the cultivator gathering area, stepping out of the protection range of the formation that covered the gathering area.","After flying for some time toward the location where the branch pointed, they arrived at a desolate area.","“Hmm, this place is not bad... Soft Feather, go wait over there,” Senior White nodded and said to the black-skinned Soft Feather through voice transmission. Without the protective formation, communication on the moon became slightly more troublesome.","Then, Senior White took out a compass like a professional, looked left and right, muttered some words, and did some calculations with his fingers.","The black-skinned Soft Feather did not know much about geomancy and such, so she sat quietly by the side and waited.","After quite a long time...","“It should not take much longer,” said Senior White while putting away the compass and nodding.","In order to facilitate communication, Senior White casually drew a formation on the ground with his feet while taking measurements. Those inside the formation could communicate with each other normally without needing to use the secret sound transmission technique every time.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Senior, have you found a good location?”","Senior White replied, “No, I was talking about the dishes that I ordered from Immortal Fairy Bie Xue. They are about to arrive.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather blinked.","While they were talking, a magical treasure in the form of a moving vehicle suddenly came hurtling toward them from a distance.","This moving vehicle had a total of ten carriages, and it was moving at incredible speed.","“Don’t tell me that that is Immortal Fairy Biexue’s food truck!” the black-skinned Soft Feather said. This food truck was like a siege engine, seemingly wanting to smash everything in its way.","Senior White nodded and said, “That’s right, it’s a dining car. When Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was designing this dining car, she contacted me. I gave her advice on how to make the dining car faster, more stable, and more impactful.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather looked up at the sky.","Suddenly, the dining car slammed on the brakes, just as if it had hit something.","Immediately afterward, a painful scream sounded. “Aahhh!”","Sure enough, it had crashed into something!","That cry of pain sounded so miserable.","Under the effect of Senior White’s formation, the screams echoed again and again.","The virtuous lamia emerged from Senior White’s Universe Hiding Sleeve, holding up a sign that said [3.2 points].","Fairy Creation then came out as well, holding up a sign that said [3.3 points].","The words “Full score: 10 points” were also written in the lower right corner of the sign.","After raising their signs, the two fairies looked at the black-skinned Soft Feather.","“Huh? Do I have to score it too?” Fairy Butterfly Song White Creation Yellow Trigram Lychee Six Dou Phoenix pointed at herself.","Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia nodded sternly.","The black-skinned Soft Feather thought for a while, then stretched out four fingers and said, “Well, I’ll give it 4 points. Although it was a rather short scream, the despair within was rather nice, so I’ll give them a bit more points for that.”","At this moment, the black-skinned Soft Feather finally sounded like an inner demon.","As an inner demon, the more pain that others were in, the calmer she should be, and she should even ridicule them from the sidelines.","Fairy Creation and the virtuous lamia glanced at each other, and then finally nodded in approval. The black-skinned Soft Feather had passed the test.","The dining car came to a steady stop amidst the flashes of light on the screen.","At the front of the dining car, a figure emerged from a state of invisibility, and it was evident that the screams had come from this person.","Because they were on the moon, and they were at a location where there was no protective formation like the one at the cultivation market, the scene of this person being knocked into the air was rather exaggerated.","After several consecutive 10-point somersaults in the air, the figure fell onto the ground embarrassingly, and then lay there motionless.","“Are they dead?” asked the black-skinned Soft Feather.","The voice of the black Scarlet Heaven Sword sounded from the virtuous lamia’s belly. “They’re still alive. You can still sense their aura. It’s not so easy for a cultivator to die.”","“It seems that their injuries are quite serious, but there doesn’t seem to be any value in healing them,” the black-skinned Soft Feather said seriously after giving it some thought. Her inner demon nature only resurfaced when dealing with certain groups of people.","The fingers of the stalker who was knocked to the ground kept twitching—he felt that he could still be saved.","“We should not just give up on treating him. Life is very precious,” said Senior White as he took out an artifact from his cosmos bag.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword looked at the artifact questioningly. “What is that?”","Senior White explained, “It’s a medical X-ray machine. This is something I got in a lottery draw previously. It’s been in my spatial magical treasure all this time. It seems that it’ll finally come in handy today.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword: “...”","I’ve never heard of a lottery where something like that could be won.","The virtuous lamia floated forward. She scooped up the guy who had been knocked over by the food truck with her tail before sending him to the X-ray machine.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “How are you going to use this machine without any power?”","Senior White grabbed a power inlet. “I’m right here, so I can just use the battery charging technique to power it.”","With Senior White acting as the power source, the X-ray machine began scanning the stalker.","Soon, an X-ray film came out.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “According to the X-ray, he has suffered some fractures... Look, you can see several broken ribs over here.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said, “A healing technique will do, but it would be best to fix his bones first.”","“Leave the repairing of the bones to me,” said the black-skinned Soft Feather. While saying that, she borrowed Senior White’s phone and opened a photo-editing software.","Soft Feather’s main body was good at making emoticon packs. As an inner demon, she had some talent in this aspect as well. She could easily adjust broken bones based on the X-ray."]},{"number":2234,"title":"Chapter 2234 The quality of this cultivator is not good","paragraphs":["2234 The quality of this cultivator is not good","The black-skinned Soft Feather said enthusiastically, “Give me a minute, I can use an app to fix his bones.”","The body of the cultivator who had been knocked into the air by the food truck slightly convulsed when he heard what she said.","She’s going to use an app to fix my bones?","Did I hear wrong?","Or could it be some advanced healing magical treasure that has its own app?","The black-skinned Soft Feather added, “Hmm... After fixing his bones, I’ll also polish his skin and adjust the brightness on the X-ray film so that the light in the film looks softer and does not hurt the eyes of those who look at it.”","The cultivator who had been knocked into the air: “!!!”","Fairy, are you a demon?","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword exclaimed loudly, “Beautiful job, Butterfly Song White Creation Yellow Trigram Lychee Six Dou Phoenix. You’re finally starting to look like a proper inner demon.”","Ever since it got to know her, today was the day that the black-skinned Soft Feather resembled an inner demon the most.","The cultivator who had been knocked into the air could not handle it any longer; his eyes rolled as he fainted on the spot.","Is this my inner demon?","?????","“Did he just pass out? This cultivator’s mental endurance is so weak,” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword commented, feeling rather surprised at how weak this cultivator’s mind was. “It’s a lot worse than Song Shuhang.”","Senior White, who was opening the door of the dining car, slightly paused. He was currently acting as Song Shuhang, so should he say a few words?","The black-skinned Soft Feather reminded them, “Senior Song’s endurance cannot be used as a reference for ordinary cultivators. After all, one is a professional and the other is an amateur. The two are simply not on the same level.”","Her words made a lot of sense, and Senior White, who wanted to refute Scarlet Heaven Sword’s words for Shuhang’s sake, found himself with nothing to say.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair was speechless.","Are you guys not really going to save this poor cultivator who just got steamrolled by a vehicle?","Senior White entered the dining car and brought out the immortal dishes he ordered from Immortal Fairy Bie Xue.","There were ten carriages in total, and only one immortal dish was placed in each carriage.","Senior White said, “Next time, we should design a small food truck for Immortal Fairy Bie Xue.”","He then took out another dining table and neatly arranged the immortal dishes.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “What should we do with this cultivator? Should we wake him up?”","“I’ll wake him up. As long as I make a hand seal, this dining car will turn around and return to the Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s immortal cave. You guys can place this fellow daoist on the path of the dining car, and when the dining car heads back, he should wake up soon enough,” suggested Senior White.","“Great idea!” the black-skinned Soft Feather said. “I’ll look for somewhere on the path back to place him.”","“Cough, cough, cough!” The cultivator began coughing violently. His strong desire to survive had brought him back to consciousness.","If he did not wake up, he might really just end up dying.","Since when did people wake others up by placing them on the path of a speedily moving vehicle?!","Senior White clapped his hands lightly.","In the next moment, the train-style dining car began rumbling. Then, it passed by the injured patient and headed back to Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s immortal cave.","The injured cultivator broke out in a cold sweat.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said judgingly, “His mental strength is too poor.”","As a qualified inner demon, its goal was to break down the hearts of normal cultivators and allow for little inner demons to be born within them.","“Tell me, who are you, and why are you following me?” Senior White sat at the head of the table.","The virtuous lamia put a table napkin beside him; she was responsible for opening the immortal dish lunch boxes.","As for Fairy Creation, she was responsible for feeding Senior White.","And as for the black-skinned Soft Feather, she was responsible for serving the tea.","Senior White did not even need to move his hands. The tacit understanding between him, Fairy Creation, the virtuous lamia, and the black-skinned Soft Feather was incomparable. When he wanted to eat or drink, he did not even need to issue a single instruction as what he wanted would immediately come.","“I feel that Shuhang will definitely be turned into a spoiled brat in the future.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair sighed.","These three fairies could attack and defend, sing and dance, snatch lines and poses, and now they could even feed and serve tea.","With that being the case, what was the point of Song Shuhang’s existence?","What else did Song Shuhang need to do?","On the ground, the injured cultivator gulped.","“Are you not going to speak?” Senior White looked down majestically at the injured cultivator, his left eye imitating a dazzling light.","“Wait... wait a minute, Senior Tyrannical Song! Please show me some mercy! No, no, no, wait, don’t show me mercy.” The wounded cultivator revealed a sorrowful expression. “I am not that unwilling to speak, and there is nothing that I cannot say. I am just an ordinary loose cultivator, and sometimes I work part-time as an intelligence officer to earn some extra money.”","“Someone wants to buy my information?” Senior White tapped his fingers on the table and asked, “Who is it?”","“I do not know much about the buyer. In the business of buying and selling information, the buyer generally hides their identity, and sometimes they even issue tasks through an intermediary. My mission was to merely provide your coordinates, Senior Tyrannical Song, and then I would receive a lot of spiritual stones.” The wounded cultivator smiled bitterly. “I was so blinded by money that I did not even think twice before following you, Senior Tyrannical Song.”","As soon as he finished speaking, Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair curled up. “He’s not telling the truth!”","The injured cultivator said urgently, “Fairy, you’re mistaken. I have already said everything I know. Really!”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested, “Let’s just use the mind-reading technique, or directly extract his memories.”","At this time, the black-skinned Soft Feather raised her hand again and said, “Seniors, I have a plan. Why don’t you let me try it?”","Senior White glanced at her. He then nodded and said, “Sure, we’re not too pressed for time anyway.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather smiled and walked towards the wounded cultivator.","When the wounded cultivator saw her approaching him, his heart started beating faster.","He badly wanted to escape.","But at this moment, the strand of hair in the sleeve of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was pointing at him, and his body was as if petrified, unable to move.","After the black-skinned Soft Feather reached the injured cultivator, she opened the contact list in Senior White’s mobile phone and dialed a senior’s number.","“Eh, Senior, why did you think of calling me today? What can I do for you?” A hearty laugh came from the phone.","“Senior Creation, it’s me, Soft Feather.” The black-skinned Soft Feather continued, “Senior, did you come up with any new songs recently, maybe one that is similar to the ?Seven Deaths Song??”","Dharma King Creation laughed and said, “Yes, of course! I just wrote a new song the day before yesterday called ?Killing the Nine Heavens Again?. I just finished recording it today.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked cutely, “Senior, can you sing it for me?”","“No problem. Wait for me for a moment, I’ll go get my instruments...” Dharma King Creation agreed without hesitation. He was so happy that he even ignored the fact that the other party was the black-skinned Soft Feather.","After a while, piano music could be heard coming from the phone.","The black-skinned Soft Feather moved her hands in a flurry. She took out a headset cable that she had prepared earlier and plugged it into the phone.","Next, she put the earphones into the ears of the wounded cultivator.","Behind her, the black Scarlet Heaven Sword was dumbfounded. The black-skinned Soft Feather today was pure evil."]},{"number":2235,"title":"Chapter 2235 Don’t panic, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, it’s fine","paragraphs":["2235 Don’t panic, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, it’s fine","Even Senior White had begun seeing the black-skinned Soft Feather in a new light.","Anyway, it appeared Dharma King Creation’s new song, ?Killing the Nine Heavens Again?, was working really well!","Although none of them could hear the song themselves, it was evident from the expression of the wounded cultivator how stimulating the new song was.","The injured cultivator’s face changed colors from red to orange, to yellow, green, blue, indigo, and purple.","“Hmm, it seems that Fellow Daoist Creation’s new song has the effect of making those who listen to it change colors.” Senior White nodded while commenting on the new song of Dharma King Creation.","After a while, the injured cultivator’s eyes rolled upwards and he started frothing at the mouth. Even after being inflicted with a binding magical technique, his body still managed to convulse and tremble.","Body language could be very powerful, far greater than any words. And the injured cultivator was very expressive with his body language. From his small movements, those who were looking at him could easily tell just how horrible it was to listen to the song.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword added, “Without Fairy Creation’s sound of nature, Little Friend Dharma King Creation’s singing carries an even greater destructive force.”","Fairy Creation nodded and said, “Song~ Stupid~”","Two minutes soon passed...","The black-skinned Soft Feather methods worked wonders, and the injured cultivator confessed everything.","“The faction that is purchasing Senior Tyrannical Song’s coordinates is an ancient faction in the Beast Realm, the Imperial Palace. They only wanted Senior Tyrannical Song’s coordinates. Moreover, they have highlighted that whoever is to carry out this task is not to disturb Senior Tyrannical Song. With that being the case, I believed this to be a relatively easy task... I have done business with the Imperial Palace several times in the past, and they have always been great to deal with.","“Originally, I wanted to provide them with the coordinates when I was still at the moon’s cultivator market. But before I knew it, I ended up following Senior Tyrannical Song all the way here while watching his back. Maybe I really was too obsessed with money...” The wounded cultivator confessed desperately.","When they heard this, everyone’s eyes turned to Senior White.","“Cough... Well, it seems like this is partly my fault.” Senior White looked up at the sky.","Even when disguised as Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, someone whose name alone could make babies stop crying, his charm was too much. As long as someone were to pay attention to him for a long time, they would end up getting charmed.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said curiously, “What kind of force is the Imperial Palace? When did Song Shuhang offend this... power?”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair smiled slightly. “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet is panicking now.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was paying attention to the outside world through her.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “Don’t panic, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, it’s fine. I used to panic like you all the time, but I eventually got used to him provoking big shots left and right. In fact, now it feels uncomfortable when he does not offend a big shot for just a day.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said doubtfully, “But why is Song Shuhang the only one they are targeting?”","Among the people present at the time were Skylark, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, Senior White disguised as Song Shuhang, as well as others such as the black-skinned Soft Feather, the virtuous lamia, etc.","But perhaps his being disguised as Song Shuhang had caused him to be the most conspicuous, resulting in the Heavenly City mainly targeting Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Technically speaking, we are no longer safe on the moon. Maybe someone has already reported the information to the Imperial Palace, and a cross-space attack from the members of the Ancient Heavenly City may be coming at any moment. Senior White, what do we do now?”","Senior White thought for a while and said, “Don’t worry, I’m here. If things get dangerous, we can escape as quickly as possible.”","They could go wherever they wished with the Space-Time Traversal of the giant turtles of disaster. Senior White was confident that he could keep everyone safe.","Senior White added, “It’s best to first deal with this matter of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song being watched by the Heavenly City. Otherwise, with the fact that he is a wanted man, Song Shuhang would be facing a lot of trouble in the future.”","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword nodded. “Shuhang also does not have any means of resurrection at the moment, so he has to be careful.”","“So, do we fight?” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair asked. “However, I have not recovered much of my energy. If the Immortal on the other side makes a move, I can only help Fellow Daoist White block two attacks at most.”","“Two is enough.” Senior White nodded and said, “Anyway, let us focus on digging out an immortal cave first. I have a great idea for a magical technique. It is something I wanted to use to catch a big fish in the Beast Realm, but maybe I can test it out on these fellow daoists from the Imperial Palace first.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “Can we help you in any way?”","Senior White nodded and said, “I’m going to need a large number of disposable flying swords to set up the formation. I’ll need everyone to carve some wooden flying swords for me.”","“Leave it to us,” the black-skinned Soft Feather said and turned to face the injured cultivator again. “Is there anything else you can tell us?”","After the injured cultivator finished spitting out the white foam in his mouth, he began to spit out all the information he had.","He not only talked about this stalking incident, but even all the other sensitive information that he knew about. He poured everything out.","[A raw secret treasure was unearthed from a certain mine of the newly-ascended Sage that goes by the name of Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue. It is said that this secret treasure is related to a talented Immortal of the Jet-Black Sect. The birth of the secret treasure destroyed the restrictions placed on the mine, resulting in several miners escaping with the secret treasure. Among the escaped miners were Loose Cultivator Qiao Yan, a humanoid monster named Mo Ran, Peak Lord Bao Ming of the Limitless Demon Sect, and seven other peak lords also from the Limitless Demon Sect. Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue sent out a message asking for the coordinates of these escaped miners.]","[Daoist Monarch Li from the Western part of the moon returned from the depths of the universe with a treasure. It is said that this treasure can stimulate a cultivator’s life-bound magical treasure, giving it a small chance to condense a weak consciousness, or allow for magical treasures with weak consciousnesses to advance, with a small chance to evolve into an item with a proper consciousness. Some people have come forward willing to pay a huge amount of spirit stones in hopes of borrowing Daoist Monarch Li’s treasure. At the moment, Daoist Monarch Li’s whereabouts are uncertain. Daoist Monarch Li is powerful, and it is recommended to avoid conflict so that everyone can benefit from the exchange.]","[On Earth in the main world, the mysterious island is showing signs of revealing itself once again. A group of unconvinced fellow daoists and a few seniors who want to retrieve their memories are seeking the coordinates of the mysterious island at a high price.]","[The large demonic sect named Limitless Demon Sect recently held a grand demonic ceremony. After the grand ceremony, the sect will go ahead with their enlistment process, which only takes place once every two hundred years. There are some loose cultivators who plan to join, and they are willing to buy enlistment tokens for high prices in the hope to join the Limitless Demon Sect and further their cultivation.]","One piece of information after the other was spat out from the mouth of the wounded cultivator.","They honestly did not expect such a weak-willed guy to be a professional intelligence dealer."]},{"number":2236,"title":"Chapter 2236 I’ll be giving your family some new members","paragraphs":["2236 I’ll be giving your family some new members","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword said, “This little fellow knows a lot of things.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather nodded and said, “He’s a professional, after all.”","She then took off the earphones of the injured cultivator’s ears.","It appeared that Dharma King Creation had already stopped singing.","Since the earphones had been worn by the injured cultivator the entire time, the black-skinned Soft Feather did not know when the song came to an end.","As soon as the earphones were taken off, the injured cultivator revealed a look of relief, his eyelids twitching happily. He finally could not hold on any longer and truly passed out.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword suggested, “I feel like these earphones can be further enhanced. They might come in handy again sometime in the future.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather: “...”","“Is it not a bit too cruel to be using Fellow Daoist Creation to torture people every time?” Senior White recalled the scene in his mind, feeling the actions that had transpired to be rather cruel.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword let out a cute laugh and explained, “I was doing it for Shuhang’s sake. Last time, Netherworld White Two told Shuhang that it was best for him to fight head-on and force his opponent to compete with him in terms of spiritual energy. Shuhang has a great advantage when competing with those in the same realm as him.”","Senior White and the black-skinned Soft Feather nodded when they heard its words; Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair seemed to agree as well.","While in the same realm, if he forced others to compete with him in terms of spiritual energy, with his eight nascent souls and ì fat whale golden core, together with all the other cheats that he had, he could easily overwhelm any opponent.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword continued, “Just think about it. If he does manage to force his enemy into a competition of spiritual energy, it would be the perfect opportunity to suddenly bring out these earphones and stuff them into his enemy’s ears. Once they’re on, they could then play the singing of Dharma King Creation in a loop. Does that not sound perfect for him?”","When the black Scarlet Heaven Sword voiced out its explanation, a vivid scene emerged in everyone’s mind.","It was an explanation that one could almost ‘see’.","“Cultivation deviation,” said Senior White.","“Rampaging spiritual energy,” added Pavilion Master Chu.","“Song, so so stupid,” said Fairy Creation.","The black-skinned Soft Feather nodded and said, “What Fairy Creation said is very reasonable.”","Forcing people into a competition of spiritual energy while making them listen to Dharma King Creation’s singing would destroy the enemy both physically and mentally.","“I’ll find a way to enhance this pair of earphones after I’ve dealt with the Imperial Palace.” Senior White was intrigued by what the black Scarlet Heaven Sword had suggested.","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Senior White, I suggest that you forge a pair of wireless earbuds for better effect and easier concealment.”","Pavilion Master Chu added, “I think it’s best to give the item the ability to lock onto the enemy’s ears. After bringing it out, it would actively seek the enemy’s ears and cling to them. Maybe, you could even make two pairs... While some fellow daoists of the monster race do transform into humans, there are some who choose to remain in their beast form. As such, there should also be a pair for those with animal ears. Moreover, with four different channels, there will be double the experience and thus double the excitement.”","After some thought, Senior White took out a notebook and started recording all the suggestions that were provided. At this point, he had already come up with a prototype of the magical treasure in his mind.","Senior White said, “It is not that difficult to make something like this. We can also record all of the classics of Fellow Daoist Creation. After all, Fellow Daoist Creation is not online all the time, and he won’t be always available to torture the enemy. If the need arises, the recorded songs can take his place. Despite not being as lethal as a live broadcast, they should still do the job.”","Moreover, with the item not being that difficult to make, if it was effective, he was planning on making a hundred sets during the Chinese New Year and give two pairs to all members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group as gifts.","When the members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group encountered an enemy, they could throw out two or four wireless earbuds and have them lock onto the enemy’s ears.","As long as the enemy was not a fan of Dharma King Creation, they would be headed toward defeat.","?????","After eating, Senior White began setting up the immortal cave.","As for the wounded cultivator, Senior White sent him toward Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s mine with his disposable flying sword version 005.","It would be nice to send Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue a miner seeing that he had just lost so many.","Senior White attached a note to the disposable flying sword, asking Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue to have this fellow daoist work in the mines for three months.","For cultivators, three months was but a fleeting time.","This cultivator had already experienced the baptism of the dining car and was then tortured by the singing of Dharma King Creation, so he had been punished enough.","Senior White only sent him to work in the mines for three months to make sure that he stayed put for a while.","“We need to dig a large hole.” Senior White went to the location he had selected, stretched out his hand, and then lightly pressed it against the ground.","As if responding to his call, the ground sank automatically, creating a hole that satisfied Senior White.","Senior White’s attribute was earth, and the earth-type magical technique that he was most familiar with was the Ground Leveling Spell.","The Ground Leveling Spell should not be underestimated. In the past, if Senior White cast this spell seriously, an entire city could be leveled in an instant. In addition, now that Senior White has ascended to the Eighth Stage, the lethality of the spell was even greater.","“Eh? You could do it without tripping and falling to the ground?” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword blurted out. When it heard Fellow Daoist White say that they needed to dig a large hole, it thought that once Fellow Daoist White found a suitable location, he would throw himself to the ground and create a crater.","Senior White: “...”","The virtuous lamia blinked and stretched out her hands, taking out several virtuous fruits that had been growing on Senior White’s Virtuous Tree. Song Shuhang’s Inner World still had some in stock.","Then, she swallowed these fruits in one gulp. Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword, I can only help you so much.","“Oh, Fairy, please stop messing around!” shrieked the black Scarlet Heaven Sword. It was an inner demon, and these virtuous fruits would cause it a ton of damage.","Next to it, the black-skinned Soft Feather quickly entered into cute mode. She sat next to Senior White and began to sharpen wooden swords. A bundle of ten swords was soon handed over to Senior White.","Senior White took the wooden flying swords and gently patted the black-skinned Soft Feather’s head.","He began to redesign these flying swords into the small-black-room-breaking version. He then placed them in the pit of the immortal cave, having them act as the foundation.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said curiously, “Could it be that Fellow Daoist White intends to create an immortal cave that can traverse space?”","Senior White nodded and said, “Exactly.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked, “However, if you want to make an immortal cave that can move in space, can’t you just use a batch of ordinary disposable flying swords version 005 as the foundation?”","“That would indeed be fine if it were just an ordinary spatial jump...” said Senior White.","While speaking, he unlocked his cell phone and sent a message to Fellow Daoist When the Bright Moon Appears: “Scholar, I’ll be giving your family some new members.”"]},{"number":2237,"title":"Chapter 2237 Venerable Song","paragraphs":["2237 Venerable Song","“My goal this time is to allow the immortal cave to perform an ‘unconventional’ spatial jump. As such, I must use the small-black-room-breaking version.” Senior White smiled slightly at the black-skinned Soft Feather as he explained.","The black-skinned Soft Feather and Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair fell into thought after hearing this.","?????","Meanwhile, when “Scholar When the Bright Moon Appears” received a private message from someone for the first time in half a year, he was so elated that he nearly cried.","In the second half of this year, he had successfully broken through, and his cultivation realm had risen to a higher level... But then, he realized that his sense of presence had gotten even weaker as a result of the breakthrough.","In the past, when chatting in the Nine Provinces Number One Group, the fellow daoists would, at most, fail to remember his daoist name, but they could still answer or reply to him. But in the past six months, it was as if he had become completely invisible.","Whenever he was sending important information to the group, he could only spam the message until it covered the whole screen; otherwise, his messages would end up being ignored by the fellow daoists in the group.","To be honest, Scholar When the Bright Moon Appears was starting to develop inner demons lately.","But today, someone in the group suddenly sent him a private message!","Scholar When the Bright Moon Appears quickly opened the message.","The scholar said emotionally, “It’s Senior White. Sure enough, Senior White is really special.”","After seeing the sender, he quickly glanced at the content of the message.","Wait, what does this message even mean?","Senior White is asking me to get ready to have members be added to my family?","“Since when did I have a family?” Scholar When the Bright Moon Appears was confused.","Could Senior White have sent the message to the wrong person?","Could it be that he wanted to send it to another scholar in the group, perhaps Scholar Xian Gong? Or was this message meant for a scholar from some other group?","After some thought, the scholar sent a message back to Senior White, “Senior White, did you send the message to the wrong person?”","Senior White replied, “Not at all... In the past few days, I’ve created a batch of buddies for you.???”","After that, Senior White sent a message to the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","White: “@Venerable Yellow Mountain, Fellow Daoist Yellow Mountain, do you have the current address of the immortal caves of the people in the group? I will be preparing Chinese New Year gifts over the next few days and plan to send them to the fellow daoists in the group.”","Some fellow daoists in the Nine Provinces Number One Group changed immortal caves quite frequently, so it was important to confirm their addresses.","As usual, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator was the first to reply. “Senior White is back from the Beast Realm? Do you need my help with the addresses?”","White: “I just got back today~”","Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire: “I have some of the addresses of our fellow daoists. However, there are a few who do not have a fixed residence. @Everyone, all of you who have no permanent residences like Copper Trigram, the scholar who just exited his seclusion, Dongfang Snow, and so on... I won’t name the rest of you one by one, but remember to send Senior White an address where you can receive the gifts.”","In addition, Venerable Yellow Mountain noticed that Senior White’s nickname in the group had changed again... What happened, Senior White could not have ascended again, right?","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “Senior Yellow Mountain, I have an incomplete list with the addresses. I will send it to you first.”","Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire: “Thanks!”","Currently, in the Nine Provinces Number One Group, it was only Northern River’s Loose Cultivator who could still give Senior Yellow Mountain some sense of comfort—provided that the shady fortune teller did not show up.","Fairy Lychee: “[Soft Feather Reporting Emoji], Reporting to the group owner and Senior White, I will rush back to Earth before the New Year. I am currently forming a group with my junior and senior sisters for a mission.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain: “Sure!”","White: “Sure!”","Immortal Visitor Amidst Clouds: “Eh? It seems that I’m quite lucky. I get to receive a New Year’s gift from Senior White the same year that I leave my seclusion!”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “Senior White is going to give everyone a New Year’s gift? What kind of gift will you be giving this year? [Song Shuhang Spiral Ascension Emoji]”","I am the little White Crane at the edge of the world: “As long as it is a gift from Senior White, I’ll like it.”","White: “The specifics of the gift will be kept secret for the time being... I had a lot of fun this year, so there may be more than one gift. I may prepare a package for everyone.”","The harvest was plentiful this year, and he had managed to go around and have a lot of fun as well. Therefore, besides the “wireless earbuds” that he was going to be producing soon, Senior White also planned to add some other gifts to create a New Year’s gift package.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer appeared and replied, “I’m suddenly looking forward to the coming New Year.”","As soon as he thought of Senior White’s New Year’s gift package, he could not help but become excited... But at the same time, he felt a chill in his heart and he had no idea how to make it go away.","It seems the weather is getting colder. Should I change homes?","Hmm, I should look for little friend Shuhang and order some spirit beast fur from him when I have time. I heard that Shuhang has begun breeding spirit beasts in his Inner World, and I can help his business out a bit while I am at it.","Dongfang Snow: “[Soft Feather knocking on the door emoji] By the way, for the coming New Year, do you want to hold a large-scale gala event? Doudou and I can go on stage and sing a song for everyone.”","[System message prompt: Dongfang Snow has been muted for 5 minutes by the group owner, Venerable Yellow Mountain.]","I am Mr. Yellow Mountain’s loyal dog: “...”","Fairy Dongfang Snow was the embodiment of admitting one’s mistakes and never repenting.","Just as everyone was communicating, another person with a new nickname came online.","Venerable Song: “Senior White is going to give out a New Year’s gift package? Then, is it too late for me to apply for my disciples to join the Nine Provinces Number One Group?”","Medicine Master: “...”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “...”","Fairy Lychee: “...”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “...”","True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon, True Monarch Eternal Fire, True Monarch White Crane, True Monarch Fallout, and True Monarch Ancient Lake Temple also followed with a string of ellipses.","Venerable Song!","It was obviously a tier lower than “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song”, but the impact of the words “Venerable Song” was far greater for some reason.","White: “???”","Isn’t Shuhang supposed to be closing up? Why did he suddenly pop up in the Nine Provinces Number One Group?","Senior White was considering whether to forcefully isolate Song Shuhang by cutting off the Internet, confiscating his phone, or disabling all of his communication channels with the outside world.","“Eh? Why did my nickname change?” Venerable Song asked in confusion.","“I changed it~ Do you like it?” Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark went online and replied.","Fairy Skylark was also an administrator.","Fairy Dongfang Six: “My heart hurts, Senior Skylark.”","White: “I’m going to cut off Shuhang’s Internet. [Waving hand expression]”","Venerable Song: “Wait a minute, Senior White! Listen to my explanation. I’m still closing up; I’m not lazing about! Please don’t cut off the Internet!”","Venerable Song explained desperately, “I came online because there is something important I must tell everyone. My Cultivation Chat Group is being upgraded as we speak. Lady Kunna asked me if there was a specific template I wanted to upgrade it to. And so, I went online to introduce the basics of chat softwares to her.”"]},{"number":2238,"title":"Chapter 2238 So are we all your wings?","paragraphs":["2238 So are we all your wings?","Song Shuhang was speaking the truth.","With the swallowed data having accumulated to a certain extent, the Cultivation chat group now needed to adjust its overall framework.","Lady Kunna, who was the one providing him with remote assistance, asked Song Shuhang to choose a template that he liked. Fortunately, when she had been making adjustments to the Cultivation chat group, she had tried her best to make it so that the template would be to his liking, which would make it easier for him to manage the chat group later.","That was the reason Song Shuhang had taken some time out of his busy schedule to go online and write in the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","His real purpose was to show the layout of the app to Lady Kunna.","Song Shuhang was not hoping for anything too grand and briefly explained the basic functions of the app to Lady Kunna, such as direct messaging, group chats, chat options, voice inputs, and so on.","Other functions could be added to the main framework after the Cultivation chat group was done upgrading in the future.","It just so happened that while he was showing the Nine Provinces Number One Group to Lady Kunna he saw that Senior White was planning on giving everyone New Year’s gifts, so he could not help but chime in.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked, “Shuhang, is the Cultivation chat group that you’re talking about the QR code Golden Core Composition?”","Venerable Song: “Yes, that is exactly what I am talking about. Senior White suggested several names for it, but in the end, I settled with the name ‘Cultivation’. I felt that this name was the most appropriate... Now the Cultivation chat group is gradually being upgraded.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber appeared and said, “So you are going to be the new group owner? @Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire, Senior Yellow Mountain, Shuhang wants to usurp your throne.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain looked at his computer screen but did not respond to Thrice Reckless Mad Saber. To be honest, he was enjoying himself right now!","He felt that it was indeed about time for him to retire. He looked at the medicinal bottles on the table, feeling that it was time to say goodbye to them.","Song Shuhang retorted, “Senior Thrice Reckless, don’t talk nonsense! In the Cultivation chat group, I would not take the role of a group owner. I would merely be acting as a server, medium, or main body!”","After seeing this message, I’m that little white crane at the edge of the Earth’s End replied, “A main body? Like a bird’s torso?”","True Monarch White Crane’s main body was that of a white crane, so it was normal for it to subconsciously think of a bird’s torso when the words ‘main body’ were mentioned.","Song Shuhang replied, “It’s alright for Senior White Crane to think of it as such. Anyway, that is pretty much what it is.”","“So... Are we all Senior Song’s wings?” Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island (Soft Feather) suddenly came online.","Venerable Song: “What? [Confused Emoji]”","True Monarch White Crane quickly replied, “[Soft Feather Shaking Head Animated Emoji]. No, I’m Senior White’s wings.”","Cave Master Snow Wolf: “I just grew out a pair of wings. Now, I don’t want them anymore.”","Song Shuhang replied, “I’m still closing up!”","White: “...”","Venerable Song: “I’ve been closing up from yesterday all the way until now. Although it seems that I’m just chatting, I am multitasking. At this time, I’m still controlling the snake to devour information, so I’m still closing up.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator said calmly, “Leaving your phone outside when going into seclusion is a basic practice nowadays.”","White: “That’s enough.”","In the next moment, Song Shuhang’s profile picture dimmed.","Senior White had cut off his Internet connection.","?????","In the stone coffin, Song Shuhang held his phone, which had lost signal now, and lay on his side like a salted fish.","He could not control himself just now. He hadn’t gotten to chat in the Nine Provinces Number One Group for some time now, so he was tempted to do so. But in the end, he spent too much time in the group and Senior White cut off his Internet connection.","[After the data collection is complete, I will adjust the framework of the Cultivation chat group to make it match the needs of Administrator Tyrannical Song.] Lady Kunna’s prompt sounded soon after.","“Closing up, closing up.” Song Shuhang put the phone away.","At the same time, he had a new goal in mind. In the future, he wanted to connect the Cultivation chat group to the Internet.","It would be best to seamlessly integrate it with the several apps currently on the market.","At that time, he would truly be able to chat in group chats while closed up and cultivating, and even Senior White would not be able to cut off his connection.","However, his realm, knowledge, and experience were still lacking.","Luckily for him, he was still young and had a lot of room to grow.","If you have no goal in life, then what is the difference between you and a salted fish?","??????","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Stressed by Spirit Butterfly Island (Soft Feather): “Senior Song, safe travels. [Waving Emoji]”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked, “Speaking of which, Soft Feather, did you not choose a new daoist name today? Is Senior Spirit Butterfly off today?”","As soon as he said that, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly sent him the picture of a mushroom cloud in a private chat.","In the next moment, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly sent a series of violent pictures to Thrice Reckless Mad Saber.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “...”","It seems that Senior Spirit Butterfly is quite irritable at the moment. That’s not good.","Well, then why don’t I make him even more angry?","And so, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber took a screenshot of Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly’s private chat with him... and forwarded it to Soft Feather.","When sending a photo of the messages, he also used the annotation function to circle the specific time when Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly sent him the messages.","As long as Soft Feather saw the time of the chat records and then compared them with the time that Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly’s messages were sent, she should be able to quickly understand the meaning.","This picture would speak much louder than words.","Even after sending Soft Feather the picture privately, it appeared that Thrice Reckless hadn’t had enough fun just yet.","He then forwarded his private conversation with Soft Feather to Senior Spirit Butterfly.","Thrice Reckless left a message, “Senior Spirit Butterfly, there’s no need to thank me~ I’m a born messenger.”","Ah~ How refreshing.","Thrice Reckless, who was currently in space, put his phone away.","Then, he suddenly began trembling.","“What’s wrong?” Skylark asked suspiciously through voice transmission.","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber replied via voice transmission, “Just now... I could not control myself and sought death three times in a row. I feel that I have offended Senior Spirit Butterfly thoroughly this time. Senior Skylark, how about we don’t go back to Earth and take a stroll around space for a while?”"]},{"number":2239,"title":"Chapter 2239 A tower built in this way has no soul!","paragraphs":["2239 A tower built in this way has no soul!","Skylark smiled slightly. She flicked her long blue hair and extended her slender hand to Thrice Reckless.","Skylark said softly, “Grab my hand.”","Rather than immediately grabbing Skylark’s hand, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber asked warily, “Senior Skylark, do you agree with me?”","After all, he had been tricked several times in the past.","But before he could react, Skylark reached out and grabbed him. “Stop spouting nonsense.”","Then, she increased the flight speed of her flying sword. “My time is precious. How can I waste it strolling around in space? We are now speeding up our return to Earth. Hurry up, Thrice Reckless!”","With that, two rays of light streaked across the void and rushed toward Earth.","One of the lights flickered happily, while the other betrayed a feeling of despair.","Meanwhile, on Spirit Butterfly Island.","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly looked at his phone, speechless.","After a while, he took out a divination stick. He had gotten word that Thrice Reckless was returning from the moon. As such, he decided to calculate when he would return to Earth.","The world better not let him complete this divination or else he might really kill Thrice Reckless Mad Saber to celebrate the Chinese New Year on Spirit Butterfly Island this coming year!","He would kill Thrice Reckless this year, kill Frice Reckless next year, and kill every other Reckless the year after that so as to reinforce the fortune of Spirit Butterfly Island.","?????","On the moon.","Senior White stretched himself. At this time, there was already a layer of disposable flying swords in the hole.","Senior White was truly the embodiment of chatting while working.","He could use the branches of the wooden body to chat while his own hands were constantly making small-black-room-breaking disposable flying swords.","As the chat group started quieting down, the hole that was the immortal cave had become completely filled with disposable flying swords.","The first step was complete!","She might just be the first inner demon to work so hard.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Is the next step to build the immortal cave? What does Fellow Daoist White plan to do?”","Senior White stretched out his hand and flicked it lightly, creating a simple optical illusion.","Several different designs of immortal caves were displayed to fill the hole.","The first design was an immortal cave with a simple style. This style was common on the moon, with it being in line with the aesthetics of cultivators from hundreds or even thousands of years ago.","With a swipe of Senior White’s hand, the previous design was replaced with a sci-fi immortal cave made of steel.","Then came a fantasy design, a rural design, a primitive and savage design...","All kinds of styles were displayed one after the other.","Is Fellow Daoist White trying to build an illusory cave for Song Shuhang? the black Scarlet Heaven Sword thought to itself.","At this time, Senior White asked, “Which design do you think is best?”","It turns out that he was not trying to add any tricks to the immortal cave but just checking which design looked good! The black Scarlet Heaven Sword felt somewhat disappointed.","But it had learned the lesson earlier, so it replied cutely, “I feel that the mountain cave style suits Shuhang quite well.”","If such an immortal cave were built, Song Shuhang could stand at the entrance of the cave every day, look up at the sky, and shout. Would that not be exciting?","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair said in a lazy voice, “Actually, I feel like this pit is already good enough. Just place Song Shuhang’s stone coffin inside and cover it up. Then, place Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet on top of it and plant some virtuous trees all around. With that, a simple and practical immortal cave will have been built.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Pavilion Master Chu, Senior Song will cry.”","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair smiled and said, “No, his band of monkeys will be responsible for crying. If not, the crying old man from before is very suitable for the role as well. Anyway, we are still on the moon, so it won’t take too long for him to come over if we ask.”","“You must have all been infected by Thrice Reckless... I will give you all a checkup later,” said Senior White. The immortal cave he was going to build now would be used as bait, and it would be him disguised as Song Shuhang who would be living in it.","Since it was the bait, he could not do a half-assed job.","“Seriously speaking, I think the tower shown earlier was beautiful; its cylindrical structure was very conspicuous,” the black-skinned Soft Feather said seriously. “In addition, I suggest that a huge flaming eye be installed on top of the tower as a symbol. Senior Song is known through the Sage’s eye. When others see the cylindrical tower and the flaming Sage’s eye, they should immediately be able to guess that this is Senior Song’s immortal cave.”","Once the tower was erected, the cultivators in this area of the moon would be under the gaze of the flaming Sage’s eye, and they would recall their frightening experience from when they were struck by it.","After thinking for a while, Senior White nodded. “Okay, it’s settled then. Soft Feather, I’ll give you credit for that. When I give out the New Year gifts, I will send one to you and one to your main body.”","“Thank you, Senior White.” The black-skinned Soft Feather revealed a reserved, ladylike smile.","“Now... Time to start working.” Senior White used the Ground Leveling Spell, and the hole in the ground was completely filled, concealing all of the disposable flying swords.","But Senior White was not done just yet, and spiritual energy continued to move about.","“A tower built in this way has no soul!” the black Scarlet Heaven Sword could not help but complain.","Senior White explained, “We do not have that much time... We have to make a rough shell first.”","The survivors of the Heavenly City had likely already assembled and begun searching, so it was impossible to seriously build a high tower brick by brick.","The best they could do with the little time they had was to create an outer shell and disguise it.","After everything was over, it wouldn’t be too late to build another one.","Amidst the rumbling sound, a tower about 500 meters tall soon took shape.","“This should be enough.” Senior White stopped the Ground Leveling Spell and nodded in satisfaction.","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair asked, “But how are you going to add the flaming eye?”","Fairy Creation blinked her eyes, and then she made a gesture of plucking out an eye. “Song~ Yalasuo~”","The black-skinned Soft Feather said, “Senior Song’s lustrous eyes were given to the four Tribulation Transcenders. If you pluck out his eyes again, what if they don’t grow back?”","The virtuous lamia froze; she had received an order from Song Shuhang.","Afterward, she reached out to open Song Shuhang’s Inner World and pulled out a huge flaming eye from it.","The origin of this eye was rather special.","It used to be an eyeball deity equivalent to a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender.","Back then, Senior White Two had lent Song Shuhang 2346 holy ape projection, and only thanks to that was the eyeball deity defeated. It ended up leaving behind this huge burning eyeball, which had been left sitting in Song Shuhang’s Inner World doing nothing since then.","“Not bad.” Senior White took the eyeball with a smile.","Then... he completely sealed Song Shuhang’s stone coffin, preventing even divine sense from seeping through so as to stop him from peeking at the outside world."]},{"number":2240,"title":"Chapter 2240 The long-lost heart-thumping feeling","paragraphs":["2240 The long-lost heart-thumping feeling","So dark, so dark, so dark...","The virtuous lamia, Fairy Creation, and the black-skinned Soft Feather were all outside.","“Pavilion Master Chu... Are you still there?” asked Song Shuhang. Right now, the only foreign entity that remained on his person was Pavilion Master Chu.","Pavilion Master Chu, who had always stayed above his head in the past, did not respond to him.","Song Shuhang hastily stretched out his hand to grab the top of his head... The place where Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair would always stay was currently empty.","“Could it be that Pavilion Master Chu also moved over to Senior White?” Song Shuhang scratched his head.","There was nothing that he could do. Now, he could only close up for real and play with his voracious snake.","?????","Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair got out of Senior White’s sleeve. In order to help Song Shuhang focus on his seclusion, she could no longer stay on top of his head.","Otherwise, whenever she peeked outside, she would end up sharing information about what she saw with Song Shuhang.","Senior White reached out and grabbed Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair, placing her on the top of his head. Then, he said to everyone, “Let’s go place this flaming eye on the top of the tower. With that, this temporary immortal cave can be considered complete.”","All of Song Shuhang’s external aids were currently gathered around Senior White.","Senior White willed it, and his spatial ability was activated; everyone was instantly transferred to the top of the tower.","At the top of the cylindrical tower, there were two huge, palm-shaped structures. The two palms were like blooming lotus flowers, made to perfectly hold up the flaming eyeball.","Senior White held the huge flaming eyeball and placed it in between the two palm-shaped structures.","He then turned to look at the virtuous lamia and asked, “How do I activate it? Do I just fill it with spiritual energy?”","The virtuous lamia shook her head.","She leaned forward, curled up her tail, and slapped the flaming eyeball with it.","“That hurts! Take it easy!” The black Scarlet Heaven Sword changed its voice to imitate the eyeball.","After being whipped hard, the eyeball was activated.","The flaming eyeball began to rotate slowly on its own, and its gaze was like a radar, sweeping in all directions.","It looked as if a strange light was constantly at the ready within the huge flaming eye, giving people an inexplicable sense of oppression.","“It’s done.” Senior White clapped his hands.","“Want to take a group photo?” suggested the black-skinned Soft Feather. After all, this was the first immortal cave built by ‘Senior Song’ on the moon.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword’s eyes lit up, and it praised, “When Song Shuhang comes out of his seclusion, we can use this group photo to rend his heart. Good idea, Soft Feather!”","The black-skinned Soft Feather: “...”","That was not what I had in mind, so don’t put the blame on me.","“Alright, let’s take a photo together before the tower gets destroyed. It’s a nice memory.” Senior White once again brought out a magic lamp and gently rubbed it to summon Demon Venerable Lushan Street.","After Demon Venerable Lushan Street was summoned, he silently took the phone from Senior White and floated away from the tower. He then pointed the camera at Senior White and tried to capture as much of the tower as possible.","Senior White, who was disguised as Song Shuhang, stretched out his hands and activated a magical technique that allowed him to grow two additional arms.","The virtuous lamia, the black-skinned Soft Feather, and Fairy Creation floated up, each heading toward one of Senior White’s palms.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword was also temporarily released and caught by Senior White’s right hand.","Meanwhile, Meteor Sword swirled around Senior White like a swimming fish.","Demon Venerable Lushan Street adjusted the angle and took a series of pictures.","He took group photos of everyone from various angles.","After taking the photos, Demon Venerable Lushan Street silently returned to the magic lamp. He no longer asked about when he would be freed.","During his time in the magic lamp, he discovered something special about Sage White.","Originally, Demon Venerable Lushan Street’s lifespan was about to run out, so he closed up one last time to see if he could break through to the next realm. However, he knew that his chances were slim.","If the Eighth Stage Profound Sage Realm was so easy to reach, then there would not have been a thousand-year period where not a single Profound Sage appeared.","But as long as he continued to stay by Sage White’s side, he might just be blessed with enough luck to encounter an opportunity that would push him to the Eighth Stage Realm.","The only thing that worried him at the moment was that... Sage White was not that good at raising pets.","Regardless, he could only hope to stay alive long enough to break through.","??????","Senior White took his phone back and nodded with satisfaction.","Senior White opened the Nine Provinces Number One Group, selected a close-up photo and a long-range photo, and sent them to the group. After that, he uploaded the pictures to his personal space.","“Everything is ready. Now, we only have to wait.” Senior White put away his phone.","While waiting for the fish to take the bait, the bored Senior White began to improve the tower, painting various rune patterns to increase its beauty and strengthen it.","??????","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","The group members were discussing Senior White’s New Year’s gift package and ‘subtly’ made it clear that the group owner, Senior Yellow Mountain, should also send everyone a gift.","While this was going on, White suddenly sent two photos to the group.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “Huh? Is this on the moon? I’ve never seen this building before. Which fellow daoist’s immortal cave is this?”","Fairy Lychee: “These photos were taken pretty well.”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “Am I seeing things? Why does it feel like Shuhang has become so handsome all of a sudden? The moment I saw the photos, my heart thumped.”","Fairy Dongfang Six: “@Young Master Phoenix Slayer, so I wasn’t the only one that felt that way. I too got that long-lost heart-thumping feeling.”","Dongfang Snow: “Once a little guy, he’s grown into a fine man.”","Medicine Master: “...” (He tried his best to type the word ‘Once?’)","Palace Master Seven Lives Talisman: “Could it be that after ascending to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, little friend Shuhang’s bearing has changed?”","When the Bright Moon Appears: “That’s nonsense. There won’t be such a big change after becoming a Seventh Stage Venerable.”","I’m a little white crane at the edge of the Earth’s End: “Where is Senior White? Since this is a group photo, why isn’t Senior White in it? I don’t want to look at Shuhang.”","Immortal Master Copper Trigram: “I can’t help but feel like something is wrong with this photo. Shuhang is closing up, and he was disconnected from the Internet by Senior White. So, why did Senior White suddenly pull him out to take these pictures? Moreover, this Song Shuhang gives a vibe similar to that of Senior White.”","Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire: “Perhaps, that really is Fellow Daoist White?”","??????","Meanwhile, after Senior White finished beautifying the tower, spatial fluctuations spread from the place above their head.","“They’re finally here,” Senior White said happily."]},{"number":2241,"title":"Chapter 2241 What is meant to come will come in the end","paragraphs":["2241 What is meant to come will come in the end","The cultivators on the moon were feeling particularly unsettled today.","Half a day later, when a 500-meter-tall tower rose out of nowhere in an open area not far from the market area, the ominous premonition of this group of foresighted cultivators finally came true.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had decided to build an immortal cave on the moon and live there.","Based on how Eighth Stage Profound Sages perceived time, he may live in this residence for hundreds of years.","What made everyone even more alarmed was that a flaming eyeball suddenly appeared on the 500-meter-tall tower.","The flaming eyeball was filled with Tyrannical Song’s aura, and it was obvious that it belonged to him. Seeing it, people could not help but recall a certain unbearable memory of the past.","Moreover, the flaming eyeball was spinning nonstop.","It would’ve been fine if it were merely floating on the top of the tower; in that case, the psychological pressure that everyone was under would not have been that great. However, this eyeball was constantly spinning, and every time it turned, those in its line of sight felt as if it was looking at them.","And it was spinning really fast, like an electric fan set at max speed. It did not leave anybody a way to survive.","“Is anyone brave enough to join me in talking to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?” A prestigious cultivator stood up bravely.","He was going to gather a group of cultivators to speak to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. He wanted to ask if it was possible not to make the flaming eyeball spin so fast.","The eye was currently spinning way too fast. He hoped that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song would listen to them and lower the speed.","Just when this prestigious cultivator was about to make a move, some sharp-eyed cultivators discovered that a huge spatial rift had emerged at the top of the tower that was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s new immortal cave!","“Spatial fluctuations? Could it be that a Tribulation Transcender is coming?” The prestigious cultivator was taken aback.","“Could it be that there is a Senior Tribulation Transcender who is closing up in our area and they could not stand the eyeball at the top of Senior Tyrannical Song’s tower and came to visit?” A western magic practitioner speculated.","When everyone thought of it, that did seem to make sense.","“Wonderful! Even Senior Tyrannical Song has to give a Senior Tribulation Transcender some face, right?” A daoist priest touched his chest, feeling that his wildly beating heart could finally calm down a little.","However, a monster cultivator reminded them, “It’s too early to relax... Don’t forget, there has been a rumor circulating in the cultivation world. According to that rumor, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song might not actually be a Profound Sage. He might be a Tribulation Transcender in disguise. Moreover, he is the kind of Tribulation Transcender who wants to step onto his own path. The reason he held a Divinity Show again and again might be because he was strengthening his path.”","A childlike fairy beside the monster cultivator added, “Besides, what is even more terrifying is that this Senior Tribulation Transcender came to visit in person... That means that even they could not stand the pressure of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s eyeball constantly scanning around.”","In other words... Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was probably even more terrifying than the Senior Tribulation Transcender.","A loose cultivator said, “But if we think about it carefully, maybe Profound Sage Tyrannical Song will end up giving the Senior Tribulation Transcender some face. After all, a Senior Tribulation Transcender’s opinion will definitely hold more weight than ours.”","Within a few breaths, news of a Tribulation Transcender visiting Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s tower spread throughout the entire moon.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue came out of her immortal cave, looked at the 500-meter-tall tower in the distance, and frowned. “Is Sage White in trouble?”","Meanwhile, inside Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s residence.","The meditating Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was awakened by Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue and hurried out of the immortal cave.","He quickly forwarded this matter to the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","?????","At this time, the flaming eye turned upward, locking onto the cracks in the sky.","The spatial rift slowly widened.","In the next moment, a gigantic phoenix emerged from it.","The body of this phoenix was nearly two hundred meters long, and when its wings were spread out, they covered the entire sky.","She only had one claw and a small eyeball growing on it.","It was the big shot among the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City in the Beast Realm; Zither Master Phoenix Bearing, who was an Immortal.","Previously, when she appeared and grabbed Song Shuhang, only a shrunken claw had been sent over.","This time, she came with her real body.","Her appearance meant that the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates had failed to take over the lair of the survivors of the Heavenly City.","As they had failed, the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates must have already retreated.","The flames on Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s body were burning with rage.","Senior White, who was disguised as Shuhang, had his arms crossed and a calm expression on his face.","The virtuous lamia floated behind him.","Fairy Creation cleared her throat, ready to sing a song at any time and manually play some background music.","In the sky, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing lowered her head slightly. Her pair of phoenix eyes and the eye on her claw fixed on Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Then, another spatial gate opened right beside her.","These two Eighth Stage Profound Sages were both masters of Tribulation Transcender weapons and could easily dish out Tribulation-Transcender-level attacks.","“You’re here.” Senior White smiled slightly.","His eyes swept over the lineup of the Heavenly City. The number of members that came over was fewer than he expected.","It made sense though. The survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City had just finished battling with the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates, so some of them must have remained in their base to prevent the Venerable Emperor’s forces from launching another attack.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing, the bald Tribulation Transcender, and the two Profound Sages... This was already the limit of what the survivors of the Heavenly City could bring out at the moment.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing gritted her teeth and said, “I do not want to talk to you.”","To be honest, she was filled with anger when she came here. Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, who was suspected to be Cheng Lin’s reincarnation, not only blew up the Immortal Lock Prison but also destroyed the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection formation, completely ruining her plan.","When she came over, she planned to directly crush him to death.","But when they actually met, and she looked at ‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’...","The anger in her heart unexpectedly began to subside.","The flames burning on her body also gradually weakened.","For this reason, she could not allow herself to speak with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song any further.","She had to act immediately.","If they continued chatting, she was afraid that she would become soft-hearted and become unable to do anything to him.","So, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing no longer hesitated.","Her claw directly pressed down onto the tower.","With this kind of attack, the tower and Tyrannical Song would be crushed directly.","At the same time that Zither Master Phoenix Bearing made her move, there was a faint spatial fluctuation in the void.","Then, the projection of a black stele quietly emerged.","There was a black shadow supporting the black stele that blended into the shadows of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s attack, launching its own attack at ‘Song Shuhang’.","Senior White’s eyes lit up.","Unexpectedly, the fish had taken the bait!"]},{"number":2242,"title":"Chapter 2242 I, Tyrannical Song, acknowledge you","paragraphs":["2242 I, Tyrannical Song, acknowledge you","This was truly a surprise.","Senior White had only wanted to use the survivors of the Heavenly City as guinea pigs to see how feasible his plan of fishing for prey by building an immortal cave on the moon was.","After the experiment was over, he would build another immortal cave, go to the Beast Realm to spread some news, and then catch the real fish he was looking for.","Unexpectedly, the big fish had directly delivered itself to his door.","A bright smile emerged on Senior White’s face, and he said softly, “It seems that I’m quite lucky today.”","When the black Scarlet Heaven Sword heard what he said, it wanted to speak but couldn’t find the right words. After all, Fellow Daoist White was very lucky every day, and what he said was not wrong, so it was hard to say anything about it.","?????","The claw of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing came down at them.","The space could not bear her strength and began to tear apart.","Spatial rifts emerged beneath her claw. When these rifts appeared, pitch-black electric arcs flowed out of them like liquid. The electric arcs were a side effect of the space being forcibly torn apart. They were not truly lightning, but rather “blood” that flowed out after space was “injured”. If one were to come into contact with these pitch-black electric arcs, unless they were a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender, they would die immediately.","Every time there was a battle between genuine powerhouses, the first to be injured was always the innocent space.","Down below, the newly built tower could not bear the pressure of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw and began to crack.","After all, it was only a temporary building made by Senior White, and it was already impressive that it had not directly collapsed into a pile of rubble as soon as the other party had appeared.","The main reason it had been able to hold on for so long was the rune patterns engraved onto it by Senior White earlier.","At the same time that Zither Master Phoenix Bearing attacked with her claw, the flaming eye on the tower shot out a blazing beam of light toward her.","With it being under attack, it automatically began defending itself.","Unfortunately, the beam of light stood not the slightest chance against Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw; it was directly crushed into light particles by the claw.","The flaming eye immediately froze and did not shoot out any more beams.","At the same time, the shadow hidden in Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s attack raised a black stele high up, locking down the space below. It did this to prevent ‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’ from escaping by traversing space.","It was doing its best to boost Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s attack without being a hindrance.","The escape-proof net together with the bald Tribulation Transcender watched everything from the sidelines.","From their perspective, it looked like an utterly hopeless situation for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","At this moment, all the cultivators who could still remain standing in this area of the moon focused their eyes on Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s flaming eye tower.","The cultivators who were not strong enough had already fallen down the moment when Zither Master Phoenix Bearing launched an attack.","The remaining cultivators who managed to resist were absolutely shocked by the sight they were bearing witness to.","None of them expected the big shot who stepped out of the spatial gate to attack Profound Sage Tyrannical Song without saying a word. Moreover, judging by the power of their attack, the entity that had launched the attack was, at the very least, someone at the pinnacle of the Tribulation Transcender Realm.","They all began to wonder how Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was going to fare against such a terrifying existence.","[It’s time to verify the rumors!]","Such a thought emerged in the minds of some of the cultivators. Was Profound Sage Tyrannical Song truly a Tribulation-Transcender-level existence as the rumors suggested?","??????","On the tower, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was wearing a white windbreaker that fluttered due to the wind.","Under the pressure of the claw attack, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s short hair suddenly began to grow, and it grew until it reached his back.","Facing the desperate and world-destroying attack, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song did not show any fear. He handsomely flared out his arms and faced the attack.","In an instant, all the cultivators, no matter if they were cultivators, monsters, beasts, wizards, or holy knights... As long as they were capable of feelings, they all found their heartbeats speeding up.","Their breathing began to speed up as well.","[Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, how is he going to defend against the attack? Nothing is going to happen to him, right?]","Those who were watching found themselves worrying about Profound Sage Tyrannical Song for some reason.","“Rumble~”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw was only ten meters away from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s head.","However... She discovered that her claw could no longer press down any further.","“What’s going on?” Everyone looked at Profound Sage Tyrannical Song with confused and questioning gazes.","“It’s... It’s a strand of hair!” A cultivator with sharp eyes saw the details of the scene.","On the top of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s head, there was a single straight strand of hair that had extended until reaching a length of ten meters. This strand of hair was currently blocking Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw.","A single strand of hair had blocked Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s furious attack!","It was almost a comical scene.","In a duel between cultivators where they engaged in close-quarters combat, one side blocking their opponent’s full-powered attack with one finger would be very visually impactful.","However, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song managed to do something that was even more outrageous.","He blocked the attack of the huge phoenix with only a single strand of his hair!","“Immortal’s hair stab!” At this time, a melodious voice sounded from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s side, announcing the name of his attack.","“You should be honored to die under the power of my hair!” Another melodious voice sang. It was the virtuous lamia, not wanting to be outdone.","But after interjecting, she noticed that the line and scene did not seem to match.","So the virtuous lamia said another line, “I did not expect that you would manage to block my strand of hair... I, Tyrannical Song, acknowledge you!”","“You idiots, I’ll strangle you to death later.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair fumed.","The black-skinned Soft Feather, who was about to follow in her sisters’ footsteps, immediately stopped.","For some reason, the particularly handsome Profound Sage Tyrannical Song wasn’t affected in the slightest by the lines of the two fairies today.","He still had a temperament of an otherworldly immortal.","The long strand of hair on top of his head flicked lightly, parrying the attack of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing.","“Pavilion Master Chu!” The voice of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing sounded in the void.","She recognized the aura on the strand of hair.","Some time ago, the survivors of the Heavenly City living in the Beast Realm had plotted against the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion.","Now, Pavilion Master Chu ended up joining forces with Cheng Lin’s successor.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw clenched lightly.","In the next moment, a total of five super-scale attacks formed at the tip of her claw.","“Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword,” Senior White said lightly and stretched out his hand.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword moved to his right hand.","In the meantime, Meteor Sword returned to Senior White’s left hand.","Senior White brandished the saber and the sword, swinging down.","The top of the tower was chopped off, and the flaming eyeball was stored away by the virtuous lamia.","Next, Senior White took everyone and jumped into the cylindrical tower.","“Bye bye~” Senior White descended into the tower and blew a kiss at the people above.","At the bottom of the cylindrical space, all the disposable flying swords were activated.","A shocking amount of spatial energy gathered in the next moment.","The figure in the shadows said anxiously, “Not good, he is planning to escape through the spatial formation... What kind of formation is this? It can’t be stopped!”","After pondering for a moment, it jumped out of the shadows and straight into the cylindrical tower in an attempt to pursue the other party.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing snorted coldly, and she launched her claw forward. Her claw flew toward the tower like a spear."]},{"number":2243,"title":"Chapter 2243 From today onwards, we’ll be forgotten by the world","paragraphs":["2243 From today onwards, we’ll be forgotten by the world","The bald Tribulation Transcender said sternly, “We should chase after them!”","The claw of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing would need their help, after all.","This time, they absolutely had to capture Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Just like that... Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw, the figure hidden in the shadows, the bald Tribulation Transcender, and the two Profound Sages jumped down one after the other.","Inside the tower, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song fell rapidly.","Even when he was in the middle of falling, he didn’t panic in the least and remained very calm.","The bald Tribulation Transcender roared, “Tyrannical Song, do you think you can escape?!”","He followed closely behind Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw, his fists clenched and ready to punch Tyrannical Song in the face.","“What a pity that only so few of you followed.” Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, who was ahead of them, turned his head and looked right back at them. There was a hint of regret on his face.","Despite having a regretful face, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song looked very handsome.","“Fwoosh~” At this time, hundreds of sword lights gushed out from the bottom of the tower.","A strange and unstoppable spatial ability was activated, which caused the entire tower to become transparent.","Immediately afterward, the tower and everyone inside disappeared.","In place of the tower, only a huge hole was left.","?????","The cultivators in the surrounding area gulped.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song truly was a Tribulation Transcender!","The rumors had been confirmed today.","Facing the terrifying attack, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song managed to escape safely and even took away the new immortal cave that he had just built. If he were a Tribulation Transcender, it would be enough to explain why he was able to remain so calm throughout the confrontation.","The cultivators who were still standing began to discuss what had just happened amongst themselves.","However, just as everyone took out their phones or magical treasures and was about to relay the news, their fingers stopped.","“Was it Profound Sage Tyrannical Wood?” A daoist priest frowned and asked.","“No, I think it was Profound Sage Bong,” the demon cultivator next to him retorted.","“All of you have misremembered his name. I’m pretty sure it was Profound Sage Pregnancy,” a wizard said in a deep voice.","All the cultivators looked at each other with confused faces.","After looking at each other for about ten seconds, someone asked, “Wait, what happened just now?”","“Why are we here?”","“It seems that there was a big battle. It was a battle between this Senior Phoenix and another person. But, who was that Senior Phoenix fighting?”","Everyone’s memory was becoming increasingly blurred.","In the distance, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, who had been secretly watching, frowned. He used to be the owner of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber, so he knew some secrets that others did not.","“Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue, has your memory been affected as well?” asked Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue.","Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue nodded silently.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue said softly, “Even you were affected. That must mean that all the information about their existence has been erased from the root.”","He looked at the huge phoenix in the air.","“Where am I? Why am I here? What am I doing here?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing wondered while floating in the air.","She wanted to scratch her head with her claw, but when the thought came, she realized that she had no claws.","The place where her claw should have been, was now empty, which made her feel very uncomfortable.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing was silent for another moment.","Then, she suddenly realized, “Oh, right. I don’t have claws.”","After a short while, it waved its wings, opened a spatial gate, and left the moon.","The space above the moon returned to its original calm.","The space that was torn apart by Zither Master Phoenix Bearing earlier was also slowly recovering and healing.","??????","Su Clan’s Sixteen, who was taking a bath, suddenly stopped.","“Shuhang...” she murmured.","She frowned and quickly wrote the words “Song Shuhang” on the bathroom wall with her fingers.","However, the words she had written slowly disappeared after only a second, as if they were being erased by an invisible hand.","Sister White Dragon emerged and asked, “Shuhang’s existence seems to have been erased. What is he doing?”","“Shuhang is closing up. It should be Senior White who went on another adventure.” Sixteen immediately defended Song Shuhang—but her voice lacked confidence, and she seemed to not believe in what she said.","As she spoke, she stretched out her hand to rewrite the word “Su-hang” on the wall.","These two words did not get erased like the previous ones.","Sixteen nodded in satisfaction and smiled sweetly.","If she could not remember Song Shuhang, then she would remember him as Suhang first.","Anyway, whether she pronounced his name as Shuhang or Suhang, Song Shuhang, who was from Wenzhou, would not be able to tell the difference.","??????","In Wenzhou City.","Papa Song and Mama Song had finished their trip and returned.","The two were going to rest at home for a while, and then set off for the next place. Since their eldest son Song Shuhang was on vacation, they went out more often.","The couple sat on the sofa intimately, leaning against each other.","“Do you think Shuhang will like it when our second child is born?” Mama Song rubbed her stomach.","Papa Song was slightly taken aback. “Second child? Isn’t this our first child?”","Mama Song was also slightly taken aback, and after a while, she smiled sweetly. “Yes, this is our first child.”","The couple smiled at each other and leaned together.","Not far behind them, an invisible fairy choked up with tears and wept silently.","Shuhang was forgotten by his parents again.","Fortunately, this time, the younger sister or younger brother had yet to be born. Otherwise, after Papa Song and Mama Song forget about Shuhang, they might want to have another “second child”.","When the second child became the third child, Shuhang might find himself in a rather embarrassing position.","??????","At Spirit Butterfly Island.","Soft Feather, who was asking her father for today’s daoist name, froze.","Her connection with the black-skinned Soft Feather was cut off, and her memories of her were disappearing, along with her memories of Senior Song and Senior White.","Soft Feather said softly, “Is it the small black room’s effect?”","Fortunately, she left the black-skinned Soft Feather with Senior Song. This way, when Senior Song and Senior White came out of the Wielder’s small black room, she would be able to learn about the fun experience from her clone.","“Father,” Soft Feather said, “today, my daoist name should be Fairy Forgetful.”","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly had a confused look on his face.","??????","At this time, the flaming eye tower was silently floating in a pure white space.","All the small-black-room-breaking disposable flying swords were detonated by Senior White, blocking Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw again.","After the explosion, the claw paused along with the bald Tribulation Transcender and the two Profound Saints.","“What is this place?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw said in a deep voice.","She felt that the connection between herself and the main body had been cut off.","“This is a corner that has been forgotten by the world,” ‘Song Shuhang’ said with a reminiscent tone. “As long as we’re here, you, me, and everyone else will be completely forgotten by the people outside.”"]},{"number":2244,"title":"Chapter 2244 Turning into light","paragraphs":["2244 Turning into light","“What do you mean?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw asked gravely.","After Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw heard the words ‘Wielder’s Prison’, the expression in its eye changed dramatically.","Although she had never been in contact with this place, she had heard rumors about it.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw said uneasily, “Is it the space where once you’re locked inside, any information about you is wiped and you’re forgotten by all living beings in the universe?”","Behind Senior White, Fairy Creation opened her mouth. “Silasol~ This is the Wielder’s small black room~”","After a moment of silence, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw suddenly said, “My main body is still outside!”","“Your main body will definitely think that it was born without any claws... Because all the memories of her claw will have been erased. Your main body originally only had one claw, but now it has become a clawless bird.” Pavilion Master Chu’s strand of hair took advantage of this opportunity to pierce the other party’s heart.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw trembled.","“Why were you able to get inside?!” said the strange evil demon. Due to it being a product of the Fat Ball’s research on the bone of eternity and Tyrannical Song’s necrotic kidney, the body of this evil demon exuded a faint aura of mist that was similar to Song Shuahng’s pseudo-eternity mode.","Right, how is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song able to open the Wielder’s Prison that is supposed to only be openable by the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will? The bald Tribulation Transcender and Zither Master Phoenix Bearing both stared at Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","The virtuous lamia replied quickly, “Because I’m handsome~”","Senior White stretched out his hand, and stuffed Fairy Creation and Fairy Virtue back in his Universe Hiding Sleeve.","He was not Song Shuhang, and he would not let the two fairies embarrass him any further.","“What trick did you use?!” The evil kidney demon then thought of a possibility.","Currently, the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will was missing a piece of itself, so its thinking was robotic and not very nimble.","In such a case, it was possible that as long as certain conditions were met, the principles of the Heaven’s Will would move on their own to lock people inside the Wielder’s Prison.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song probably knew of these conditions and exploited them to open the prison and drag everyone inside in a desperate attempt to save his life.","When the kidney demon said that, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing immediately thought of this possibility as well.","On the opposite side, after Senior White dealt with the two fairies, he flicked his windbreaker lightly and said, “You should not be worrying about how I opened this space but rather about the fact that you are now trapped inside. The people in the outside world have completely forgotten us, so it would be best to let go of all of our grievances and take this opportunity to have a heart-to-heart talk and become friends. Because in the time to come, we will have each other to rely on.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","The two Profound Sages: “...”","It was possible to enter the Wielder’s Prison but leaving was impossible, unless the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will let them go.","It was completely possible that they would end up staying here forever and never get back to the outside world.","If that were the case, how they would deal with the other people stuck in the prison would indeed be a big problem.","The strange evil demon sneered and said, “Have a heart-to-heart talk with each other? I don’t even have a heart, how can I do such a thing?!”","Scarlet Heaven Sword in Senior White’s hand nodded and said, “That’s right. That guy only has a kidney but no heart.”","“So, do you still want to fight me?” Senior White looked at the demon.","The strange evil demon said in a deep voice, “I will, at the very least, capture you.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw flicked lightly. “I was thinking the same.”","While speaking, the claw sprang forward; the spiritual energy in the area where Senior White was located began to twist.","The bald Tribulation Transcender launched two punches at Senior White in quick succession. The terrifying punches shot forward like mortar shells.","“Alright, you can try to chase after me.” Senior White laughed and raised Meteor Sword. His body turned into light and he shot into the distance.","At the same time, the scabbard, which the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure had transformed into, took the form of two jet engines and further propelled Meteor Sword.","Senior White had obtained his set of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure in the mysterious sealed space close to Heavenly Field Island. It was the product of Wielder of the Will White.","At this time, this set of Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure revealed its true power, instantly increasing Senior White’s flying speed by over ten times.","??????","And so, Senior White, who had taken the appearance of Song Shuhang, flew at the front.","Meanwhile, the strange evil demon, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing, and the bald Tribulation Transcender all chased after him.","From time to time, peals of Senior White’s joyful laughter and the roars of the engine attached to his flying sword could be heard.","He was greatly enjoying the speed and excitement the event brought him.","For Senior White, the feeling of having an enemy chasing after him crazily, forcing him to use his speed to the extreme, was indescribable.","The more fiercely the enemy chased after him, the greater the potential that he could release, and the faster his flying sword would fly.","At this time, not even Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw could catch up to the speed of his blade light.","This game of cat and mouse went on for a whole day.","Every time she accelerated and felt that she was about to catch up with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, the engine would roar and push him forward with explosive force, causing Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s speed to rise to another level.","At this moment, Senior White, who was flying ahead of them, suddenly said, “I’m done.”","No matter how fun a game was, things would start to get boring after one played it for a long time.","Despite the exciting chase, Senior White eventually felt bored after playing for an entire day and a night.","“I’m not playing anymore,” Senior White said.","Then, he stretched out his hand and threw out a wooden sword.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw revealed a hint of doubt in its pupil.","In the next moment, ‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’ turned into a layer of light.","He didn’t turn into a blade light like before but he became a true beam of light this time.","Then, ‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’ simply disappeared.","“How is that possible?!” the kidney demon, who was several steps behind, roared.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song actually escaped from the Wielder’s Prison?","How was he able to escape from the Wielder’s Prison? It’s something that even the Netherworld Ruler can’t do!","Unless...","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will?","But that was impossible, there was no way that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song could be the Wielder of the Will. As a product of the ruler of the Netherworld, it was aware of this point.","He was not the Wielder of the Will, but had the same authority...","Could he be... The missing part of the Wielder of the Will?","A bold guess emerged in its mind.","Could the part that was ‘bitten away’ by the Scholarly Sage with his innate ability have reincarnated as a human after thousands of years?"]},{"number":2245,"title":"Chapter 2245 An old friend requests to meet","paragraphs":["2245 An old friend requests to meet","Senior White turned into light and disappeared, leaving Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw, the bald Tribulation Transcender and that strange evil demon with dazed expressions.","The male Profound Sage asked, “Is there a way for us to turn into light and leave like him?”","The kidney demon said bitterly, “Unless the Wielder of the Will sees us one day and releases us, we will not be able to get out of this place...”","The female Profound Sage frowned and said, “Then, does that mean that we’re trapped here forever?”","After a moment of silence, the kidney demon suddenly said, “So, shall we talk to each other and become friends?”","The bald Tribulation Transcender: “...”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s claw: “...”","The male Profound Sage asked, “Alright, why are you so intent on dealing with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?”","And so, they began chatting.","??????","Senior White did not directly bring Song Shuhang and others back to the main world.","Instead, he drove the disposable flying sword into a gap between the Wielder’s small black rooms.","In reality, there wasn’t only one Wielder’s Prison; there were many such places with different sizes.","When in a smaller Wielder’s Prison, one could fly for around ten minutes before reaching the edge and returning to the starting point, just like an infinite loop. As for larger Wielder’s Prisons, such as the one that they were in today, Senior White had been able to fly a whole day and night inside before reaching one of its ends.","However, every Wielder’s Prison did have one thing in common; they were all very clean. This was mainly because whenever the prisoners died or were released, everything inside was absorbed and stored in this layer between each of Wielder’s small black rooms, keeping the space inside clean.","Nearly anything could be found in these gaps.","There were highly poisonous underworld waters, fragments of magical treasures, a large quantity of golden sand... Some were relics left by the people that were inside, and some were substances that existed when the Wielder’s Prisons had been created.","There was useful stuff, useless stuff, harmful stuff, and so on.","Senior White landed on a large clod of soil.","The soil was very ordinary, and it was unknown how it ended up in the gap between the Wielder’s small black rooms.","“Senior White, are we not going out?” The black-skinned Soft Feather emerged from the shadows and looked around.","“Not yet. I want to prepare a good place where Shuhang can close up.” Senior White placed his feet firmly on the soil and activated a magical technique.","This piece of land wildly swelled in size, and a lot of the ‘garbage’ around was swallowed into the soil as it was growing to enhance its stability.","After about ten breaths of time, the clod of soil had grown into a big island.","The large island floated above the poisonous underworld waters.","The water did not damage the island and simply supported it.","Senior White stretched out his hand to cast another magical technique, summoning golden sand from a distant place and spreading it across the island.","Senior White said with some regret, “I already took most of the good stuff left in the gaps. Now, there aren’t many useful things left.”","While they were discussing, he had collected various treasures, which were mostly spatial magical treasures of Eighth Stage quality or higher.","“Once we’re out, each of you will have a share.” Senior White patted the spatial magical treasures.","The black-skinned Soft Feather asked curiously, “Do I also get a share?”","“Of course.” Senior White gently patted the black-skinned Soft Feather’s head.","The virtuous lamia emerged from Senior White’s sleeve, and the black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “Are you going to leave Song Shuhang here?”","Senior White nodded and said, “I’m going to have him stay here for the duration of his seclusion. This place still carries the influence of the Wielder’s small black rooms, so the memories of Song Shuhang in the minds of his enemies will fade away.”","For example, the main body of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing would not remember Song Shuhang at all.","Once he was back outside, he would look for a way to send Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s main body to this place. Only then he would let Song Shuhang out.","There was also the black stele from the Beast Realm that had to be sent here to avoid problems","Fairy Creation also emerged from Senior White’s sleeve.","The three fairies stood side by side in the pit in the center of the island—this was the place Senior White reserved for Song Shuhang when he was making the large island.","Senior White’s Universe Hiding Sleeve opened wide.","The stone coffin Song Shuhang was in was released and placed inside this pit.","The surrounding golden sand seemed to come alive, and it took the initiative to cover up Song Shuhang’s coffin.","Subsequently, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was also released by Senior White to guard the place where Song Shuhang was closing up.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet promised, “Leave it to me! With me here, Tyrannical Song’s safety is guaranteed.”","The black-skinned Soft Feather thought for a while. “How about I stay here and take care of Senior Song?”","“No, Soft Feather, you have to come out with me. I’ll need your and Fellow Daoist Scarlet Heaven Sword’s powers for the next part of my plan.” Senior White smiled slightly. “Don’t worry, it won’t take long. It won’t be too late to come back and take Shuhang out at that time.”","In addition to Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, Senior White left another fellow daoist to stay behind and take care of Song Shuhang.","Demon Venerable Lushan Street, who was inside the magic lamp, was left in front of Song Shuhang’s grave.","After setting up Song Shuhang’s retreat location... Senior White activated the disposable flying sword again, leaving the gap between the Wielder’s Prisons.","??????","At this time, in the secret realm within the base of the Imperial Palace, which was the base of the survivors of the Heavenly City in the Beast Realm.","After Zither Master Phoenix Bearing returned to the Beast Realm from the moon, she returned to the place where she normally practiced, which was her parasol nest immortal cave.","After returning to her immortal cave, her huge body lay down on a large, nest-shaped bed.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing murmured, “Something feels really off.”","Although in my memory, I have never had a claw, what is this strange feeling?","Without any claws, my stomach lays directly on the bed, and it feels very uncomfortable.","Eventually, after she finally got used to her current state, she began to focus on various matters of the Imperial Palace.","As they had just had a fight with the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates, the Imperial Palace had a lot of things to deal with.","“Strange, why do I have to handle these things? Wasn’t there someone who handled these things for me before?” complained Zither Master Phoenix Bearing. “It seems that I must promote someone and delegate this task to them.”","“Zither Master, someone has requested to see you. They said that they were an old friend of yours from the era of the Heavenly City.” At this time, someone said via voice transmission.","“Old friend from the era of the Heavenly City?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing frowned slightly, and her consciousness flitted outward.","She saw a golden man standing at the entrance of the secret realm... The man was holding a brush in his left hand."]},{"number":2246,"title":"Chapter 2246 If I were you, I would have already pecked myself","paragraphs":["2246 If I were you, I would have already pecked myself","The golden man had a brush in his left hand and a bucket in his right one. He was rather slim, and he seemed to be an ascetic.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing frowned. She did not remember having such a friend when she was in the Ancient Heavenly City. However, the golden skin of the other party was a bit familiar. There were several fellow daoists since the era of the Heavenly City who had such golden skin.","As if sensing Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s divine sense, the golden figure suddenly raised his head and smiled slightly in her direction.","He sensed me? Zither Master Phoenix Bearing was a little surprised. When she scanned the other party with her divine sense, she tried to do so as sneakily as possible to avoid being noticed by the other party.","However, she did not expect the other party’s senses to be so strong.","He’s very strong!","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing could feel that the golden man’s thin body contained a terrifying energy. She felt that he was not any weaker than her.","If the other party wanted to force his way in, the defenses of the secret realm would not be able to stop him.","Considering that she had just had a fight with the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing did not want any more trouble for the time being.","“Let him in. Bring him directly to my immortal cave,” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said via voice transmission.","This immortal cave was a fragment of her palace from the Heavenly City. This was a place where she could fully display her strength.","??????","After a few minutes, the thin golden man arrived at the entrance of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s immortal cave under the guidance of a member of the Imperial Palace.","The little daoist priest who had led the way had walked slowly on purpose—as they had just fought with the Venerable Emperor’s subordinates, everyone was still quite vigilant.","The thin golden man did not mind. He followed behind the guide very cooperatively, admiring the surrounding scenery while walking.","The guide who led the way said respectfully, “Here we are, Senior. This is Zither Master’s immortal cave.”","As soon as the words fell, the little daoist priest was taken aback. When facing this thin golden man, his tone unknowingly became respectful.","From the beginning to the end, the thin golden man did not release any pressure. He maintained a kind demeanor and smiling expression the entire time.","The little daoist priest thought to himself, How terrifying. This might be another senior who has survived from the era of the Heavenly City just like Zither Master!","“Thank you, little friend. Would you like to have golden skin? As a thank you for leading the way, I can paint a layer on for you for free. Domineering gold is the fashion of olden times.” The thin golden man lifted the bucket in his hand with a smile. It was filled with dazzling gold paint.","“What a pity, you missed a rare opportunity.” The golden man put away the paint bucket and said, “This is a treasure that even Immortals envy. In the era of the Ancient Heavenly City, when others begged me to paint them with it, I would be reluctant to do so.”","That golden paint was so precious?","“I’ll see you later, little daoist priest. You’re a nice person.” The golden man put the brush in his trouser pocket and pushed the door open.","When the door was pushed open, the brush in the trouser pocket swung left and right in an eye-catching manner.","The daoist priest stood at the entrance of the cave and stayed there for a long while.","He touched his chest, recalling what the golden man said, and could not help but feel a sense of loss.","He truly felt that he had just lost a great opportunity.","??????","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing watched the entire scene carefully.","Era of the Ancient Heavenly City... Paint... Valuable gold paint... Domineering gold...","Following these keywords, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing searched her mind for anything relevant.","Soon, a classic picture appeared in her memory.","It was a man whose face she could no longer remember, screaming and being beaten from one end of the Heavenly City to the other. It was quite the spectacle.","The screams of that man could be heard throughout the entire Heavenly City.","And from that day on, the White Dragon Emperor became the Golden Ancestral Dragon.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said softly, “Slow-Witted Song?”","However, that should not be the case.","This thin golden man was very different from Slow-Witted Song in terms of image, temperament, and physical appearance.","While she was in thought, the golden man had already arrived before her.","He wasn’t afraid in the least, and he casually sat down on the spot.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing had shrunk in size at this time, but her body was still nearly ten meters tall.","The golden man was thin and small. As such, when he sat in front of her, he looked like a bug in front of a chicken.","The golden man said with a smile after sitting cross-legged, “Tsk, I can’t help but feel that you might just lower your head, and peck me and eat me at any moment.”","The golden man raised his hand and said, “Is that some kind of secret code? I am me, a firework with a different color!”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing stared fiercely at the other person, thinking whether or not she should really peck and eat him.","“You already have guesses in your mind, so why ask more?” The golden man grabbed his feet with both hands, and sat on the ground shaking like a tumbler.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","The golden man asked suddenly, “By the way, where is your claw? Why is it missing?”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said coldly, “I don’t have claws.”","“Huh?” The golden man was taken aback for a moment, and then he burst out in laughter.","He laughed so hard that tears even came out of his eyes.","“What are you laughing at?!” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing exclaimed angrily. The flames on her body flared up.","“Fairy Phoenix Bearing, you’re a phoenix with the bloodline of a Bifang[1]. Right now, your only leg has been removed, yet you do not even know it. It seems that you have been tricked.” The golden man was still shaking like a tumbler as he added, “Don’t you feel somewhat uncomfortable as of late, as if something was missing?”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s eyes turned serious.","If no one had reminded her, she would probably have kept feeling that she truly did not have claws.","But as long as soon as someone pointed it out, with her realm, she could immediately sense that something was indeed wrong.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing asked, “So, where’s my claw?”","The golden man laughed and said, “You ask me, but how am I supposed to know?”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","“By the way, Fairy Phoenix Bearing, do you want to be painted with golden paint? Today I can give you a discount, half price for a layer of gold skin.” The man suddenly took out the brush in his trouser pocket and waved it around.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said with annoyance, “Get out!”","She did not want to change her name to Zither Master Golden Phoenix.","“You missed a rare opportunity.” The golden man shook his head.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said sternly, “Stop fooling around. Tell me, what are you here for?”","The golden man smiled and said, “You really can hold your temper... I’ve been chatting with you for so long, and only now did you ask to get straight to the point. If I were you, I would’ve already pecked myself until getting under my skin.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","If you continue to talk about your skin, believe it or not, I might really peck it off clean!","The golden man stood up and stretched out his hand. The bucket of golden paint and the brush were stored in his spatial magical treasure.","Then, he made an embracing gesture in Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s direction and said, “Come, be my bird!”","[1] A legendary crane-like bird with only one leg."]},{"number":2247,"title":"Chapter 2247 A handsome Tyrannical Song appears","paragraphs":["2247 A handsome Tyrannical Song appears","And so, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing pecked at the other party without hesitation.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s blow was merciless. She wanted to peck The golden man into pieces like a mere bug!","“As soon as I say peck, you start pecking? As an Immortal, are your means of attack really so poor?” the golden man said happily. He did not move away or dodge at all, letting Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s beak peck at him.","“Clang~” A sound similar to a bell being struck sounded.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing struck hard, but only caused a small scratch to appear on the golden man’s body, revealing his silver body beneath the golden paint.","How is this possible? Zither Master Phoenix Bearing stared at the golden man. She had not shown any mercy in that blow, but when she hit the golden man, instead of pecking him apart, the rebound force made her beak hurt.","At this time, her beak was nailed into the ground by the golden man’s side. If this was not her immortal cave, which had numerous layers of strengthening, her beak would have pecked a hole through the cave and caused a high-intensity earthquake in the secret realm.","The golden man continued to roll forward and backward like a tumbler. He stretched out his arms that had been grabbing his feet and shook them in front of the eyes of Zither Master Phoenix Bearing. Then, he said triumphantly, “Did you see that? If I punch you now, your eyes would get infected with my dermatophytosis.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing quickly shut her right eye, glaring at him through a slit.","“I have no malice toward you, so you should not react so aggressively,” said the golden man. He took out a bundle of tape and carefully pasted the tape on the area around the scratch on his body.","Afterward, he took out the bucket of golden paint and the brush, carefully covering the scratch on his body with paint before polishing it with sandpaper.","After patching up the scratch, the golden man removed the tape around the scratch and polished and waxed the area.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing did not even know what expression to make to express her broken heart.","“Did you see that? I was only using golden paint no.1 this time, which is why you were able to leave a scratch on my body. If I used the golden paint that I used back in the Ancient Heavenly City, your attack would not have even managed to leave a single scratch on my body.” The golden man waved the paint bucket in his hand.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","She slowly raised her head and looked down at the golden man again.","At the same time, she replayed the scene of her previous attack in her mind.","“When I struck you just now, my power was weakened when my beak reached you.” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s voice was calm again. After returning to her senses, she raised her doubts.","The golden man said slowly, “That is because you relied on the path of the Heavenly Emperor to step into the Immortal Realm. Therefore, you are limited by the path of the Heavenly Emperor. This is a matter of course.”","When Zither Master Phoenix Bearing joined the Ancient Heavenly City, she was not an Immortal. She was different from big shots like the four Great Emperors, White Dragon Emperor, and Fairy Cheng Lin, who were already Immortals.","When she was enlightened and stepped into the Immortal Realm, she made use of the path of the Heavenly Emperor as a base.","When Zither Master Phoenix Bearing heard this, she suddenly thought of a possibility.","“Yes, you have guessed correctly.” The golden man spread his arms out wide. “Right now, I... am the Heavenly Emperor! The path of the Heavenly City and the path of the Heavenly Emperor have been inherited by me!”","After Zither Master Phoenix Bearing leaped up into the air, she remained suspended in mid-air and did not fall. She shook her head vigorously and said, “This is impossible.”","“There is nothing impossible in this world. The wheel of fate continues to turn; it has simply favored me this year.” The golden man sat upright and put on a majestic display. “In fact, you should be able to sense it if you try hard enough, the fact that I am the Heavenly Emperor that is.”","The clawless bird looked like a hydrogen balloon, nearly floating to the roof of her immortal cave; this was because she instinctively wanted to hide and stay away from the golden man.","“Don’t worry, I’m different from the Heavenly Emperor... Be good, come down, I won’t eat you.” The golden man waved to Zither Master Phoenix Bearing.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing did not reply and still continued to act like a balloon.","The golden man said slowly, “I came here this time to set you free.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","The golden man raised his head and said, “You have been collecting Ancient Heavenly City Fragments, and you even planned to resurrect the Heavenly Emperor. Frankly speaking, you and your fellow daoists were probably doing so due to the limitations placed on you by the path of the Heavenly Emperor. Without the help of the Heavenly City Fragments, there would be no path of the Heavenly Emperor to support you. Your path to immortality will collapse, and you may even fall back down to the Tribulation Transcender Realm.”","Existences like Zither Master Phoenix Bearing were the biggest victims of the fall of the Ancient Heavenly City.","Her path heavily relied on the Ancient Heavenly City, leaving her more restricted than the four Great Emperors and the Ancestral Golden Dragon.","“I have a way to free you... In fact, the Great Northern Emperor and the Great Western Emperor have already regained their freedom.” The golden man stood up and looked at Zither Master Phoenix Bearing. “This is your only chance.”","“What do I need to do?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing asked cautiously. Facing such a temptation, it was impossible not to be moved.","“It’s very simple.” The golden man showed a bright smile. “You only need to die once, and I will arrange the rest for you.”","“...” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing fell silent, and after a while, she said, “Give me some time to think about it.”","The golden man said slowly, “No problem. Such matters need to be considered thoroughly, after all. But don’t ponder on it for too long since I don’t have many opportunities to show up and contact you directly like I am doing right now. I cannot guarantee when I will be able to show up like this before you in the future.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing nodded silently.","The golden man said, “If you’re considering freeing yourself, then you can let go of some things. You do not have to plan how to revive the Heavenly Emperor, and you also do not need to be so obsessed with gathering the Heavenly City Fragments. You can live an easier life.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing asked, “You want the Heavenly City Fragments?”","The golden man shook his head. “I’m different from the Heavenly Emperor. The Ancient Heavenly City fragments are meaningless to me.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said, “In that case, let me collect some more.”","She may become free, but among the old members of the Heavenly City that she had gathered, there were many who simply wanted to reproduce the Heavenly Court from back then.","At the very least, she wanted to give them a place to stay.","The golden man said frankly, “You are as kind as ever. This is why you always suffer when you meet someone like me. You are easily tricked into selling yourself and counting the money for me.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","Can we not have a good chat? Will you die if you chat normally?","“Are you saying that as long as you are freed, you will no longer pursue the matter regarding the resurrection formation?” At this moment, a voice suddenly sounded beside the golden man and Zither Master Phoenix Bearing.","A handsome Tyrannical Song stepped out of a spatial rift."]},{"number":2248,"title":"Chapter 2248 From today onwards, I am Profound Sage Tyrannical-Song","paragraphs":["2248 From today onwards, I am Profound Sage Tyrannical-Song","This handsome Tyrannical Song was wearing an equally handsome windbreaker and holding an umbrella in his hand.","If the umbrella was swung around, scary barbs would pop out and cause piercing and tearing damage to the enemy.","It was a terrifying murder weapon!","“Who are you?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing stared at the man who had appeared with extreme vigilance.","This was a secret realm made from Heavenly City Fragments. Additionally, there were spatial seals everywhere, especially around her immortal cave.","Her immortal cave was located at the very center, and every inch of space here had been carved with spatial seals.","However, this man had appeared out of nowhere and easily traversed space until reaching her immortal cave.","It appeared as if they had no trouble entering her immortal cave at all.","Are my spatial confinement skills that bad? Zither Master Phoenix Bearing wondered.","Senior White said seriously, “Well, you can call me... Tyrannical Song.”","Acting had to be done dutifully. Even if Song Shuhang was locked up in the gaps between the Wielder’s small black rooms and the universe did not remember the reputation of Tyrannical Song, as long as he was still acting as Song Shuhang, he had to go through with it until the very end.","Originally, Senior White was planning to find an opportunity to send Zither Master Phoenix Bearing and the other important figures from the Heavenly City into the Wielder’s small black room.","However, he changed his mind when he heard the conversation between the golden man and Zither Master Phoenix Bearing.","??????","“Tyrannical Song?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing stared at ‘Tyrannical Song’, who was in front of her.","In the next moment, the ‘Nobody Under the Heavens Doesn’t Know of Me’ effect activated.","“Sage Monarch White!” cried Zither Master Phoenix Bearing.","Senior White’s hand froze. It was such an embarrassing moment when his Sage Name was spoken out loud.","How could he continue his act now?","He raised his hand and touched the small silver token on his wrist and sighed. “Sure enough, after leaving Shuhang in the small black room, I’ve lost the ability to change Sage Names with just the flip of a token. This is no fun.”","The golden man: “...”","Looking at the Sage Seal, Senior White fell into deep thought.","Half of the black-skinned Soft Feather’s body came out of the shadows and said, “Oh, no. Senior White has gotten distracted again!”","“I’m not distracted. I’m just thinking about something.” Senior White bent down and patted the black-skinned Soft Feather’s head.","Then, he looked at the golden man and asked, “Fellow Daoist, are you selling that golden paint of yours?”","“Of course it’s for sale. The discount today is particularly large. It is on sale for half price. Buy one and get one free.” The golden man smiled brightly as if he had found a bosom friend.","Senior White nodded and said, “Please give me a bucket.”","The golden man took out another bucket of golden paint and handed it to Sage White along with a row of brushes of different sizes. “A bucket of Golden Paint No. 1 is usually one Ninth Stage spirit stone, meaning that I will only charge you 5 Eighth Stage spirit stones since it is half price. If you are interested, I have several other versions. The supreme version only costs 888 Ninth Stage spirit stones!”","Senior White took the bucket of golden paint and flipped his Sage Seal.","He coated the seal with a thick layer of golden paint with one of the smaller brushes, covering up his original Sage Name, ‘Sage Monarch White’.","What is he doing? Zither Master Phoenix Bearing looked confused.","Sage White was painting his Sage Seal with the golden paint.","But the Sage Seal of an Eighth Stage Profound Sage was akin to a concept. As long as it was resummoned, it would look brand new. Even if it were painted with golden paint, it would not turn it into a golden seal, would it?","In the meantime, Sage White had already painted a centimeter-thick layer of golden paint on his Sage Seal.","Then, he began to write on the layer of paint, engraving the words [Tyrannical-Song] on the seal’s surface.","There was one more character than ‘Tyrannical Song’, but it basically sounded the same.","“Done,” said Sage White as he blew on the Sage Seal.","This blow was like a blessing, infusing new spirituality into the Sage Seal.","The seal shone brightly.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing found that while staring at Sage White, the “Nobody Under the Heavens Doesn’t Know of Me” effect was activated again, and this time she recognized him as “Tyrannical-Song”.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “!!!”","What the hell happened?","She had lived for so long, from the ancient era to the current era, and she had never heard of someone who could change their Sage Name in such a way.","This was going too far.","Was the golden paint really that amazing?","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing turned her head and looked at the golden man... However, the golden man was also staring at Sage White with his eyes and mouth wide open. There was a bewildered expression on his face.","The meaning of the expression on his face was very obvious. The golden paint did not have the effect of changing one’s Sage Name.","“Very good~ Now, I am Profound Sage Tyrannical-Song.” Senior White was satisfied. He handed his Sage Seal over to the black-skinned Soft Feather for her to keep.","This was because if the Sage Seal were to be unsummoned, it would be restored to its original state the next time it was summoned. In order to maintain the effect of the golden paint, the Sage Seal needed to remain outside for the time being.","“Now, let’s talk.” Tyrannical-Song said to Zither Master Phoenix Bearing and the golden man.","The golden man smiled slightly. “Fellow Daoist, please speak.”","“How did you get in here?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing asked eagerly.","Senior White said, “I came in using my spatial skills. Don’t worry, your spatial confinement methods are very complex and most people would not be able to break in, so you have nothing to worry about.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","Senior White asked, “Just now, I heard bits of your conversation. Fairy Phoenix Bearing, as long as you are freed, will you really no longer care about the resurrection formation? Will you be able to let go of what happened in the past?”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing asked in a confused manner, “In the past?”","Senior White explained, “Hmm, you probably have no memory of what happened. Still, it is mainly because of the Scholarly Sage resurrection formation that everything even happened. In fact, I am the reason why your claw is gone... However, it was you who came to confront us first, so in other words, you losing your claw was ultimately your fault.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing tried her hardest to remember what happened, but she could not recall a thing.","“How about everyone sit down, and then we can have a good talk and discuss a solution? There’s no need to talk about writing off anything for now. Let’s just have a good talk and see if we can resolve things.” Senior White put his hands in the pockets of his windbreaker, secretly making a hand seal for a sword art.","Before Zither Master Phoenix Bearing could answer, the golden man said, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, may I talk to Fairy Phoenix Bearing first?”","Senior White looked at Zither Master Phoenix Bearing.","The golden man said, “I would like to have a talk with Fairy Phoenix Bearing in private.”","He seems to have noticed Senior White making the hand seal.","“Alright.” Senior White nodded.","The golden man said, “Fairy Phoenix Bearing, there is indeed some misunderstanding between you and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.”","Fairy Phoenix Bearing asked directly, “Do you know this Tyrannical Song?”"]},{"number":2249,"title":"Chapter 2249 A man, Tyrannical Song is a man!","paragraphs":["2249 A man, Tyrannical Song is a man!","After the golden man heard this question, he quickly replied, “A man, Tyrannical Song is a man!”","“That isn’t right. Wait a minute, let me explain.” The golden man stretched out his hand and waved it repeatedly. “I’m a little allergic to the question you asked me just now.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing asked, “What’s wrong? Is Tyrannical Song a fairy maiden?”","“That’s not what I meant. Don’t jump to conclusions.” The golden man sat upright and entered into serious mode. “What I will be saying next is a huge secret. It is related to the identity of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, and it’s best not to spread this secret.”","“Tell me,” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said. “I’m not a gossipy person. If his identity is truly as important as you say, then I won’t spread it.”","“Actually, Fairy Phoenix Bearing, you should’ve also heard of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, for he is the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage!” the golden man said gravely. “That is why he was able to barge into the tightly guarded resurrection formation. It’s because that resurrection formation is something he arranged as a backup plan in his previous life. In this life, he would naturally return to it. It is similar to how ordinary human beings continue to eat and drink when they grow older, it becomes an instinct.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing mused, “The reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage?”","On the side, Senior White pinched his chin and pondered. The reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage? And it’s natural for a person to return to where they set up a backup plan in their previous life?","“Yes, there is no doubt about it. The information about Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is temporarily blocked, so you won’t be able to recall any memory about him for the time being. However, you only need to remember what I said just now. When your memories of him return in the future, you will find many clues that will line up with what I just said. Whether it’s his eyes or his abilities, he carries the characteristics of the Scholarly Sage everywhere.” The golden man had a serious look on his face as he explained.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing pondered shortly and said, “If he really is the reincarnation of Scholarly Sage, then I can’t make a fuss about him barging into the resurrection formation.”","The golden man said, “If you do not believe me, you can look for information in the scholarly faction yourself. The scholarly faction is very strict about this matter, but with your means, if you just want to confirm this information, it should not be too difficult.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing replied, “Even if you did not say that, I would have tried my best to confirm your words.”","The golden man continued, “Also, there is something else that I must mention to you.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said, “I’m listening.”","The golden man added, “When you recall the information about Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, you might associate him with Cheng Lin. However, do not be impulsive. Cheng Lin’s aura has only tainted his body by accident. The aura does not originate from him; he was simply infected with it... Once this month is over, the aura of Cheng Lin that is on his body will dissipate.”","As soon as the words “Cheng Lin” were mentioned, Zither Master Phoenix Bearing failed to control her aura.","Her resentment toward Cheng Lin was unchanged.","“Why did the reincarnation of Scholarly Sage get involved with Cheng Lin?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing stared at the golden man.","“They have nothing to do with each other. The reincarnation of the Sage merely visited the ruins of Cheng Lin and got tainted with her aura, that’s all,” the golden man replied. “Besides, the Jade Lake Empress Cheng Lin... She has died for real.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing sneered and said, “You think I would believe that?”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing fell silent.","Senior White replied, “I used to feel that he was simply an ordinary junior... But now, I feel that Tyrannical Song is very special.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing asked, “Is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song really the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage?”","Senior White replied, “I have seen him appear in the form of the Scholarly Sage when facing off against enemies.”","A virtuous person like Senior White would naturally make the best choice at this time—he chose to let the events take their course.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing went silent for a moment, then suddenly asked, “What about my claw?”","Senior White nodded and said, “The next time we meet, I will bring you your claw back.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing said, “Fine... When the information about Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is restored, I will personally confirm whether he is the Scholarly Sage or not. If he’s, he and I can sit down and have a good talk.”","“That’s great. Now that the matter is settled, I’ll take my leave.” The golden man laughed and got up. He seemed to be in a hurry, as if he wanted to leave as quickly as possible.","“Wait, what is the relationship between you and Tyrannical Song?” Zither Master Phoenix Bearing stared at the golden man again. “Since Profound Sage White is Tyrannical Song’s friend and has a very good relationship with him, it is reasonable for him to come to me and try to resolve the issue between me and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song. But what about you?”","Regarding the matters revolving around Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, the golden man clearly cared about them.","From what she could remember, the golden man said he had various plans to help her free herself, and that paved the way for resolving the possible grievances between her and Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Looking back, it truly appeared as if he was looking out for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","But from what she could recall, he should have nothing to do with the scholarly faction.","“So you still took notice, Fairy Phoenix Bearing. You are still as careful as ever.” The golden man sighed and turned around.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing stared at him closely.","The golden man said triumphantly, “Actually... I am Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s mother.”","In the next moment, a sharp strand of hair shot out from Senior White’s sleeve like a spear and fiercely pierced his waist.","The long hair attacked while accompanied by the principles of life and death, and of prosperity and adversity.","“Ding~”","A sharp and pleasant sound rang out.","The golden man said proudly, “Depending on the personality of the one who hits me, the sound is different. Fairy Phoenix Bearing produced the sound of a long bell when she hit me, but this strand of hair produced a tinkling sound.”","While he was speaking, the long hair curled into a spiraling sword and began to spin wildly.","The twirling long hair paused for a moment.","“I’m sorry. Next time, I’ll change to a weaker body and let you beat me so that you can calm down. I’m currently quite confident when it comes to taking a beating.” The golden man lightly patted Pavilion Master Chu’s long hair.","Afterward, he stepped back and disappeared from where he was standing. “Fairy Phoenix Bearing, please make a decision as soon as possible...”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing: “...”","It seems that I need to strengthen my spatial confinement formations tenfold!"]},{"number":2250,"title":"Chapter 2250 Light among the chaos","paragraphs":["2250 Light among the chaos","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing looked at Profound Sage White again. “Are you also going to use your spatial ability and whoosh away?”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing rubbed her head with the tip of her wings, feeling a headache coming. “Forget it, it would be better if you just whoosh away as well.”","If you were to exit through the main entrance, how am I supposed to explain to the others how you got here in the first place?","“Then Fairy Phoenix Bearing, I shall take my leave.” Senior White bid his farewell with a smile and cupped his fists.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing suddenly said, “I’m sure we will meet again in the future. Although you have snagged away my claw, I feel that you’re an honorable person. I do not dislike fellow daoists with your personality. Perhaps we can even be friends in the future.”","Senior White smiled slightly. “If fate brings us together again, I would like to have a drink with you.”","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing nodded and said, “Sure.”","Senior White stretched out his hand. Sword light flashed, then his figure merged into space and disappeared.","Zither Master Phoenix Bearing’s huge body slowly landed back down in her nest.","“Is that a special escape technique? Just now, I vaguely saw the flash of a sword light... and that sword light contained strange spatial fluctuations.” She waved her wings lightly and wrote a series of magical runes in the air.","She wanted to upgrade her immortal cave and modify her spatial confinement formations.","The special escape technique Sage White used just now would also be taken into account while carrying out the modifications.","??????","After Senior White escaped from the secret realm of the survivors of the Heavenly City, he arrived at a mountaintop in the Beast Realm.","The black-skinned Soft Feather came out and asked curiously, “Senior Chu, who was that golden man just now?”","Pavilion Master Chu’s long hair had retracted to its normal length, silently circling around Senior White’s head.","After hearing Soft Feather’s question, Pavilion Master Chu thought for a while and replied, “Slow-Witted Song.”","“Oh, the culprit that causes Senior Song to often get beaten for no reason.” The black-skinned Soft Feather recorded this information and marked it with a red circle, ready to share it with her main body when she got the opportunity to do so.","The black Scarlet Heaven Sword asked, “However, this Slow-Witted Song does not look similar to Shuhang, and even his temperament is very different.”","“He was not like this in the past... and that was not his true face just now,” replied Pavilion Master Chu. She did not seem to be in a great mood today.","The black-skinned Soft Feather no longer tried to dwell on the topic.","Senior White shook his head and said, “I’m not distracted. I’m thinking about the Scholarly Sage.”","“I am not 100% sure, so I can’t answer that question.” Senior White’s eyes narrowed and he looked down.","There was a particularly strong presence of evil energy of the Netherworld beneath this mountain peak.","The matter regarding the survivors of the Heavenly City had been resolved thanks to Slow-Witted Song.","So before Shuhang exited his seclusion, they could try and see if they could resolve the hidden dangers in the Beast Realm. If that big black stele was able to continue what it was doing unhindered, things would become very unfavorable for Song Shuhang.","After thinking for a while, Senior White asked, “Fairy @#%×, can you apply for some authority over the Inner World from Shuhang? We will be needing the cooperation of Shuhang’s Inner World for our next actions.”","The virtuous lamia nodded slightly.","With Song Shuhang advancing, it was almost time for the Inner World to be fed again.","??????","In the gaps between the small black rooms, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet looked up at the sky.","Above its head was a blue sky, while below was a very prosperous city.","This city was located near the sea.","In this prosperous city, there was a constant flow of people and traffic along with reinforced concrete buildings and spacious streets.","From Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s point of view, this place was very exotic.","“Is this the city where Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song lives?” the stone tablet muttered.","All the scenes it saw were displayed by Song Shuhang, who was closing up.","These scenes were a display of Shuhang’s illusory reality.","The illusory reality that Song Shuhang had summoned was no longer the pseudo-Desert-World formed with the help of the demonic god pillars or the projection of his Golden Core Composition. This time, Song Shuhang was truly relying on his power as a Seventh Stage Venerable to form the projections of his illusory reality while he was closing up.","Song Shuhang hadn’t gone into deep seclusion in the past, but this time, it was different.","This was a milestone!","In the illusory reality, all kinds of characters acted out their lives as if they were real.","Perhaps, even the people in the illusion believed that they were real.","Throughout the ages, many big shots found the illusory reality of Seventh Stage Venerables to be very special.","Whether it was their understanding of the principles or their mastery of energy, it was reasonable to say that Seventh Stage Venerables did not have what it took to produce something as miraculous as an illusory reality.","However, the practitioners of the universe immediately grasped how to use the illusory reality after they stepped into the Seventh Stage Realm.","The image projected by Song Shuhang at this time was an exact copy of his hometown, Wenzhou City.","But soon, the illusory reality changed.","The scene switched from Wenzhou City to Jiangnan University Town.","High-rise buildings transformed into teaching buildings, the square transformed into playgrounds and sports fields, and residential buildings transformed into dormitories...","At the same time, the residents of Wenzhou City who were present in the previous scene, underwent rapid changes.","As they walked forward, the clothes on their bodies changed, and the same went for their appearances.","Before they could take ten steps, all residents transformed into students, teachers, and various other staff. They had all become part of the university.","The entire transformation process was very smooth.","If someone entered this illusory reality and came into contact with these characters, they would find that the people within the illusion were now fully convinced that they were the students of a university.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet sighed silently.","This was the illusory reality of Seventh Stage Venerables.","All living beings were like dreams.","Everything was like a dream.","The world was like a dream.","Earlier, in the room behind the Throne of Wealth Distribution, Senior Three Eyes had reminded Song Shuhang not to rush to the next realm after ascending to the Seventh Stage.","He advised Song Shuhang to try to master and understand the illusory reality.","Song Shuhang listened to what Senior Three Eyes said and seemed to be trying to construct a framework of an illusory reality that truly belonged to him.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was very curious about what kind of world Song Shuhang would eventually create.","While it was in thought, the sky of Jiangnan University City in the illusory reality turned dark.","A great darkness covered the whole world, swallowing its sky.","Chaos befell the illusory reality.","After a long time, a light emerged from the chaos.","That light was a character. And one after the other, more of those characters appeared.","Soon, countless 0s and 1s filled the space of the illusory reality.","“What is this?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet looked confused."]},{"number":2251,"title":"Chapter 2251 Being rich allows one to be willful","paragraphs":["2251 Being rich allows one to be willful","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet called “What is this? Shuhang, come out. I’m going blind.”","If they were all written down, even several books wouldn’t be enough.","It was a dazzling sight to see.","When Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet called out, a series of human silhouettes composed of 0s and 1s looked toward it. “Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, don’t panic. Do you need me to give you a hug?”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","It did not answer Song Shuhang, but the large words “Song Shuhang’s Tombstone” that were engraved on its body began to shine brightly.","It discovered that these words on its body were quite useful sometimes!","At this time, Song Shuhang began to explain. “These are numbers. The round ones are 0s, and the vertical ones are 1s.”","“You’ve been working for so long just to come up with an illusory reality like this?” The words on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body shone even brighter.","If the bright lights in the chaos were just ones and zeroes, then this was probably the most weird and useless illusory reality that it had come into contact with.","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, do not underestimate these two numbers. In the eyes of humans called programmers, these two numbers have the ability to create anything!” Song Shuhang replied passionately. “As long as it is something that you can think of, it can be represented with just these two numbers!”","His roommate Li Yangde was one of such programmers. That was why Song Shuhang had some knowledge regarding this topic.","“They can represent anything?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was taken aback.","That sounded pretty great!","If that was the case, then this illusory reality had unlimited potential. It could be used to advance, attack, retreat, or defend. Its uses were endless.","However, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet quickly thought of another key point and asked, “So, are you familiar with these creatures you call programmers? Do you know how to turn these 0s and 1s into what you need?”","“When I was in university, I studied mechanical manufacturing and automation. I’ve only read a few books on programming, so I don’t have a deep understanding of it.” Song Shuhang looked up at the sky.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was taken aback. “What’s a university?”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “Hm, wait a minute. You don’t need to answer, I can already see the answer from your face.”","Song Shuhang’s face was composed of thousands of 0s and 1s.","But now, these 0s and 1s could directly combine into words, basically writing Song Shuhang’s thoughts on his face.","“So, after all that talk, your illusory reality is still useless,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said weakly. “You should hurry up and rebuild your illusory reality while it’s not finalized.”","A Seventh Stage Venerable’s illusory reality generally gave life to the memories that left the strongest impression in one’s mind, and it would fully only form after decades or even hundreds of years of pondering and refining.","As such, there was still time for Song Shuhang to rebuild his illusory reality right now.","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “There’s no rush. With my current learning ability, I can definitely spare some time to learn programming in the future. Just give me ten days to half a month, and I can become a proper programmer.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “In around ten days up to a half month later, you might have already ascended to the next realm.”","Song Shuhang said seriously, “No way. I entered the Throne of Wealth Distribution after my tribulation and met with the three-eyed big shot. That senior told me not to rush to advance while I’m in the Seventh Stage Realm. Instead, I should spend my time studying my illusory reality and grasp it properly. And that’s exactly what I intend to do.”","“I believe in you, Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song. You are the best.” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said in encouragement. At the same time, the words “Song Shuhang’s Tombstone” on its body began to flash rhythmically.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, can you stop being so showy when we’re trying to have a serious conversation?","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet stopped flashing the words on its body and said, “You are closing up right now, so how are you going to learn how to become a programmer?”","Song Shuhang said, “That is indeed a big problem.”","Maybe I should consider leaving my seclusion early?","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “If you want to leave, you will have to wait until you have completely absorbed the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit.”","The amount of information contained in the path fruit was too large, and Song Shuhang had yet to absorb it completely.","“If I have no other option, I can always start rebuilding my illusory reality.” Song Shuhang’s face made of 0s and 1s shook.","After a while, he said suddenly, “By the way, thinking about the illusory reality, I suddenly got an idea.”","The topic has changed again. Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet sighed inwardly.","Fortunately, this jump was not too abrupt nor too big.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “Tell me, what bold idea do you have in mind?”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “In this world composed of 0s and 1s, if I were to summon another illusory reality, what would happen?”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was baffled. “Huh?”","How could such a thing be possible?","Song Shuhang said, “My first illusory reality was born with the help of external forces while I was in the Sixth Stage. As such, theoretically speaking, it should not conflict with my current illusory reality, which solely belongs to me.”","After saying it, he tried it out; he summoned the projection of his pseudo Desert World.","In the world composed of 0s and 1s, demonic god pillars emerged one by one.","Song Shuhang laughed and said, “It’s really working!”","Among the chaos, demonic god pillars rose and supported the world.","Soon, a vast desert world took shape.","The chaos and the countless flickering 0s and 1s wrapped around this desert and became its sky.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet fell into the desert.","Beside it, Song Shuhang’s face, which was composed of 0s and 1s, also landed in the desert.","Song Shuhang said proudly, “Look, I succeeded!”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","The digital face of Song Shuhang shouted in the desert world, “Senior White, Senior Little White!”","Soon, they found Little White by the water in the oasis.","Little White was quietly flipping through a book, his face expressionless.","After hearing Song Shuhang’s voice, he turned his head.","Little White asked, “An illusory reality?”","Song Shuhang said, “Yes, I am constructing my own illusory reality. However, I am still trying to figure things out.”","“So it seems.” Little White nodded slightly. “You already have this pseudo Desert World and the illusory realities that originate from the Golden Core Compositions of your seven small dantians. As such, you have no need to worry about the lethality of your personal illusory reality. You can study it well and try to understand it, all the while reinventing your illusory reality repeatedly until you arrive at something that you are content with.”","This was the capital that belonged exclusively to Song Shuhang.","To put it bluntly, being rich allowed him to be willful."]},{"number":2252,"title":"Chapter 2252 Do you wish to appoint Mama Yellow Mountain as the group administrator? Y/N?","paragraphs":["2252 Do you wish to appoint Mama Yellow Mountain as the group administrator? Y/N?","“That makes sense.” Song Shuhang nodded and said, “While I’m in seclusion, I’ll continue to try and see if I can find anything new.”","“Goodbye, Senior Little White.” Song Shuhang turned around, then prepared to leave while dragging Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet with him.","“Wait a moment.” Little White seemed to have suddenly thought of something and called out.","Song Shuhang’s digital face turned around, and the word “doubt” appeared on his face.","Little White stretched out his small hand and said, “Shake my hand.”","The digital Song Shuhang involuntarily glanced at the book in Little White’s hand. He wondered if Senior Little White was reading an encyclopedia on how to raise pets.","Senior Little White sighed and said, “Don’t overthink it. Just shake my hand.”","Song Shuhang smiled awkwardly, and a hand appeared under his digital face, shaking Little White’s hand.","When their hands touched, Song Shuhang felt as if he had read a lot of information from Little White.","The 0s and 1s that made up his body increased slightly.","Song Shuhang said curiously, “What was that?”","Little White said slowly, “It is a magical technique I created to integrate with your illusory reality... To be more precise, it is a way to digitize a portion of one’s memories to allow it to merge with an illusory reality. This technique has many uses, and I’m letting you read it as I believe that you will find it pretty useful.”","Song Shuhang nodded thoughtfully.","After bidding farewell to Little White, he returned to the chaos and canceled the pseudo Desert World illusory reality.","??????","Song Shuhang fell into deep thought.","After receiving the magical technique from Little White, he seemed to have figured out something and entered a state similar to enlightenment.","The stone tablet quietly stood by his side without disturbing him.","After a long time, Song Shuhang suddenly exclaimed, “It really does seem feasible!”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “What did you figure out?”","Song Shuhang replied, “I’ve been thinking about installing artificial intelligence into my Cultivation chat group after it has been upgraded. That way, it would be much more convenient for me to learn how to use the new features of the group chat, making it much easier to manage. Now, with the magical technique that Senior Little White imparted to me, it might really happen.”","Song Shuhang said, “I will first make some calculations in my illusory reality to see if the plan is feasible or not.”","“Have you learned the ability of a programmer?” The stone tablet was taken aback.","Song Shuhang replied, “No, but it is my illusory reality, after all, so it’s a given that I can still perform some simple operations. In addition, I received that magical technique from Little White.”","He began to use the magical technique imparted to him by Little White to digitize a portion of his memory. He then stored it in the illusory reality and tried to construct a special existence in his illusory reality similar to Little White, who lived in the pseudo Desert World.","At the same time, he tried to contact Lady Kunna through the Cultivation chat group.","Even if he had entered the Wielder’s small black room and the entire universe had forgotten him, due to Lady Kunna being a really special existence, she could continue to provide him with remote assistance.","In the Black Dragon World, Lady Kunna’s existence was equivalent to the Wielder of the Will. Perhaps it was because of such an identity that she was not affected by the Wielder’s small black room.","Song Shuhang tried to remotely transfer some energy to Lady Kunna and leave a message in the form of a postscript with his ideas.","However... His message fell like a stone into the ocean.","Lady Kunna did not reply to him.","Did she not receive my message, or did she receive my message but could not reply to me? Song Shuhang frowned.","From the looks of it, the Wielder’s small black room still placed certain restrictions on his connection with Lady Kunna.","If she received the message but could not reply... Could it be that Lady Kunna had changed the framework of the Cultivation chat group according to his suggestion?","Song Shuhang’s attention shifted to his Cultivation chat group, which was in the middle of an upgrade.","He was right!","Lady Kunna was truly powerful.","The framework of the Cultivation chat group was currently undergoing some adjustments.","Song Shuhang maintained his illusory reality of 0s and 1s so that Lady Kunna could directly extract the information she needed to set up the artificial intelligence he wanted.","This was something that Lady Kunna was particularly good at; examples of this were the Dragon Network Assistant, the Dragon Network System, and the Dragon Network Management System. Lady Kunna had designed and set all of this up in the past.","Anyway, the core remained the same. She simply changed the shell of the Dragon Network Assistant, injected Song Shuhang’s information into it, and created the Cultivation Chat Assistant.","The Cultivation Chat Assistant and Song Shuhang’s Inner World Assistant had the same structure. In the future, Song Shuhang could connect the two artificial intelligences if necessary.","??????","Time quickly flew by.","In China, it was already December 3rd.","[System Prompt: After the completion of the Cultivation Chat Assistant, the debugging stage will begin. Would you like to give it a name? Y/N?]","“Let’s call it Tyrannical Song... Wait, that’s not quite appropriate. That name would cause newbies to feel quite a lot of pressure, so how about something more friendly like... Little Song?” asked Song Shuhang.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said softly, “It might be better to call it Hard-To-Crush Little Mouse.”","Song Shuhang: “...”","Senior, you are underestimating me. I have evolved from a hard-to-crush bug to a hard-to-crush mouse in a short time, so I will definitely evolve again in the future.","[Would you like to name it Hard-To-Crush Little Mouse? Y/N?] A prompt appeared again.","It seemed that even Lady Kunna liked the name.","“No, no, little mouse isn’t that cute. Change it to a cuter animal if you want to keep the same style.” Song Shuhang thought about it.","[Would you like to name it ‘Hard-To-Crush Little Squirrel’? Y/N?]","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, “That’s not bad.”","“Okay, that should do for now. I can change it to something else in the future if needed.” Song Shuhang compromised.","The important thing was that it was functional; the name could be settled later.","[Cultivation Chat Assistant “Hard-To-Crush Little Squirrel” is at your service. Would you like to see the new features after the upgrade?] A childish voice sounded in Song Shuhang’s mind.","It was the voice of kid Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang asked, “There are new functions? What do they do?”","The young voice asked, “There is now a chat group feature. Would you like to create a chat group?”","“Of course.” Song Shuhang said, “Try to create a group chat called [Nine Provinces Number Two Group].”","Hard-To-Crush Little Squirrel replied, “System Prompt: Group Chat [Nine Provinces Number Two Group] has been created successfully.”","Song Shuhang asked, “Then, can you locate Mama Yellow Mountain in my blacklist and make him the group administrator?”","Hard-To-Crush Little Squirrel replied, “Do you wish to appoint Mama Yellow Mountain as the group administrator? Y/N?”"]},{"number":2253,"title":"Chapter 2253 Turn around. There is a surprise","paragraphs":["2253 Turn around. There is a surprise","Song Shuhang replied loudly, “Yes!”","Even Northern River’s Loose Cultivator and True Monarch Eternal Fire were not as reliable as Senior Yellow Mountain when it came to managing a group.","Hard-To-Crush Little Squirrel: [Executing the command. The group chat “Nine Provinces Number Two Group” has been successfully created. The group administrator has been set to Venerable Yellow Mountain nicknamed “Mama Yellow Mountain”. Current member list: “Venerable Tyrannical ‘Scholar Dragon Demon’ Song. Would you like to add new members to the group chat? Y/N?]","Song Shuhang said, “Yes! Let me see which members I can add to the Nine Provinces Number Two Group. In addition, you should send a message to Senior Yellow Mountain first. No one is better than Senior Yellow Mountain when it comes to managing a group.”","As for who to add, he could try adding the seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One Group first, as well as those seniors who were already ‘dead’. As for the others, he would leave that up to Senior Yellow Mountain.","Hard-To-Crush Little Squirrel: [Executing the command.]","??????","On Earth in the main world, inside an overseas immortal cave of Senior Yellow Mountain.","Doudou was wearing a magical collar around its neck. It was flinging pieces of cherry-flavored dog food up into the air and catching them with its mouth.","These cherries were sent to it by Senior White with a flying sword previously. It was something that Senior White promised to give it when he left his seclusion.","Venerable Yellow Mountain refined the cherries into dog food, turning them into little treats for Doudou.","“Doudou, I might be able to train a new administrator by the end of this year. At that time, I’ll leave the managing of the Nine Provinces Number One Group to the new group leader.” Venerable Yellow Mountain leaned against the chair, holding a cup of wine and gently taking a sip.","“Woof~” Doudou responded casually.","Recently, it felt that its mating season was approaching, causing it to become rather irritable.","In addition, it was now a Fifth Stage monster dog, so it could already be considered an adult.","Now that it was an adult, it became meaningless for it to run away from home. Adult dogs were responsible for their actions, even if he ran away from home, Yellow Mountain would no longer send someone to bring it back.","Moreover, not to mention running away from home, Stupid Yellow Mountain was even considering whether or not to create a separate immortal cave for Doudou and have it become independent.","Doudou could not help but feel flustered and scared with all these changes quickly taking place.","It found it difficult to adapt to the challenges that came with growing up.","This was the trouble of becoming an adult!","The cherry-flavored dog food flew up and bounced off Venerable Yellow Mountain’s computer screen.","“Pfff~” Venerable Yellow Mountain, who was sipping the wine, suddenly spewed out all the wine in his mouth.","A mixture of wine and saliva was sprayed all over Doudou’s body and face.","He had been completely caught off guard!","“Woof?” Doudou turned his head and stared at Yellow Mountain. “Stupid Yellow Mountain, did you do that on purpose?”","“No... I didn’t mean to do that.” Venerable Yellow Mountain put down the wine and wiped his mouth.","At the same time, he murmured, “It must be my mind playing tricks on me. I must’ve been too tired recently, which caused me to start imagining things.”","He closed his eyes and checked his state carefully.","[Beep~ System Prompt: The group chat “Nine Provinces Number Two Group” has been successfully created. Congratulations to Mama Yellow Mountain, you have become the group administrator of the “Nine Provinces Number Two Group.” The current group members are: empty, empty, empty, empty.]","Venerable Yellow Mountain: “...”","Doudou asked doubtfully, “Are you sick, Stupid Yellow Mountain?”","Venerable Yellow Mountain stretched his hand out tremblingly and grabbed the medicine bottle on the table. He took out a pill and swallowed it down.","What the hell is this Nine Provinces Number Two Group, and why am I its administrator?","Also, what is with these empty slots?","While he was lost in his thoughts, a series of prompts sounded in his mind.","Familiar names were added to the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.","Sage Monarch White, Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly, Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue, Fairy Sixth Cultivator of True Virtue, Fairy Lychee, Xuan Nu Sect’s Skylark.","Then there was Daluo Sect’s True Monarch Rain Moon, Northern River’s Loose Cultivator, Su Clan’s Seven, Thrice Reckless Mad Saber, Immortal Master Copper Trigram, Medicine Master, Riverly Purple Mist, Young Master Phoenix Slayer, Fairy Dongfang Six, Scholar Xian Gong, True Monarch Ancient Lake Temple, True Monarch White Crane, True Monarch Tyrant Flood Dragon, True Monarch Eternal Fire... as well as other old friends from the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Then Su Clan’s Sixteen, Soft Feather, Yu Jiaojiao, Doudou, Little Guoguo, Shi, Zhu, Chuchu, Lady Onion, and Little Cai were added as well.","The originally empty Nine Provinces Number Two Group quickly became lively.","After almost all the old members of the Nine Provinces Number One Group were added, the addition of members slowed down a bit.","But it did not take long for another batch of new members to be added to the group.","Pavilion Master Chu, Fairy Cheng Lin, Fairy White Dragon, Lady Dragon Network “Fat Ball,” the Almighty Merchant, the Divine Dragon of the Beast Realm, Dragon Eye...","Of course, he excluded the Heavenly Emperor and the members of the Heavenly City that were added to his friends list not long ago.","Hezhi and the Indestructible Lord were also blocked for now.","There was also Senior White Two who was not added. Senior White Two had a special identity, and Song Shuhang would chat with him privately to ask his opinion before proceeding any further.","There was also Striped Dragon Two who was in a similar situation.","The Nine Provinces Number Two Group had only just been created, and various functions were still being loaded.","The members who were added to the group could only see the names of the other members at the moment. They could not yet communicate with each other.","Since they could not speak in the Nine Provinces Number Two Group, some members quickly took out their phones and opened the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “@Yellow Mountain is very tired and wants to retire, Senior Yellow Mountain, what is this Nine Provinces Number Two Group that just popped up in my mind? Is it something you created?”","Because Song Shuhang was still in the Wielder’s small black room and thus forgotten, the seniors could not remember him for the time being.","As a result, everyone’s eyes naturally focused on the group administrator, Venerable Yellow Mountain.","Cave Lord Snow Wolf asked, “Nine Provinces Number Two Group... Senior Yellow Mountain, have you awakened a new skill?”","Young Master Phoenix Slayer: “[Voice] Meow~”","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue: “I see a group of special people in that group.”","“What is this Nine Provinces Number Two Group that you’re talking about?”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “There are some new names in that group... Senior Yellow Mountain, did you make this second group chat? I can’t wait to chat with these new members!”","Sage Monarch Spirit Butterfly: “Fellow Daoist Thrice Reckless, turn your head and look behind you at five o’clock. There will be a surprise.”","Thrice Reckless Mad Saber: “???”"]},{"number":2254,"title":"Chapter 2254 The world has begun to collapse from an unknown corner","paragraphs":["2254 The world has begun to collapse from an unknown corner","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: “What did Thrice Reckless do this time?”","Su Clan’s Seven said, “I’m afraid Thrice Reckless might be dead in a few days... Speaking of which, I had already locked onto his coordinates with satellites and was going to find him. I did not expect Senior Spirit Butterfly to be one step ahead.”","The Forgotten Fairy (Soft Feather) suddenly went online and said, “That’s right, today is the beginning of a new day, and my father hasn’t given me my daoist name yet. Thank you for reminding me, seniors~”","Cave Lord Snow Wolf: “[Silent Husky Emoji].”","Am I going to die too?","Fairy Dongfang Snow said curiously, “By the way, what about Senior Yellow Mountain? Has he responded yet?”","Senior Yellow Mountain had obviously created the Nine Provinces Number Two Group, but he had been silent all this time. He had not even replied to the pings from the fellow daoist in the group.","At this time, Vexed Doudou replied, “Stupid Yellow Mountain just took a few pills and is still in a daze. He seems to be studying the functions of the Nine Provinces Number Two Group. In addition, judging from his reaction, this Nine Provinces Number Two Group does not seem to be something he created.”","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator asked doubtfully, “But isn’t Senior Yellow Mountain the administrator?”","Vexed Doudou: “[Soft Feather Shaking Her Head Animated Emoji], I don’t know exactly what happened. Wait until Stupid Yellow Mountain wakes up from his daze.”","??????","Meanwhile, in the Spirit River Su Clan’s base.","Sixteen was standing on a tall tower with earbuds in her ears. She seemed to be listening to music.","“Wait, what’s with this Nine Provinces Number Two Group?” Sister White Dragon, who was around her neck, said when a system prompt appeared in her mind.","Sixteen opened her eyes, which were filled with tranquility and devoid of any emotion.","“Is there something wrong with this group?” she asked in a low voice.","[I sensed something similar to the Heavenly Emperor from it.] Sister White Dragon furrowed her brows, switching to telepathic communication.","She escaped from the Heavenly Emperor’s path through death and was added to this Nine Provinces Number Two Group right after.","Had she gotten out of the tiger’s den just to enter the wolf’s den?","Sixteen replied, [It’s not the Heavenly Emperor’s path, Sister White Dragon. You don’t need to panic.]","Then, she inspected the group carefully.","“No, I have to study this thing. If there is any danger, I will pull you out of it immediately.” Sister White Dragon was still worried.","“Okay.” Sixteen nodded calmly.","??????","At the same time, in the gap between the Wielder’s small black rooms.","Song Shuhang received several prompts from ‘Hard-To-Crush Little Squirrel’.","[Group Administrator Mama Yellow Mountain wishes to activate the “group text chat function.” Will you allow it to be activated? Y/N?]","“Yes!” Song Shuhang nodded. He had been waiting for this very moment after creating the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.","[Group Administrator Mama Yellow Mountain wishes to activate the “administrator authority.” Will you allow it to be activated? Y/N?]","“Yes, yes, yes.” Song Shuhang responded repeatedly.","Various functions of the Nine Provinces Number Two Group were activated one after the other.","“Huh? It seems that we can chat now.” Northern River’s Loose Cultivator sent the first message in the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.","Ever since he was added to the Nine Provinces Number Two Group, he had been trying various things.","As soon as the first reply was sent out, the entire group became lively.","Fairy Lychee: “You can only send text messages, no pictures. There is no voice function either, and the overall framework is still very raw. It only has the most basic functions.”","Doudou: “There are no emojis either. I feel for @Great Master Profound Principle.”","Dharma King Creation said, “There is no @ function either, but I do get what Doudou means. If we cannot send emojis, Great Master Profound Principle won’t be able to use this Nine Provinces Number Two Group at all. It seems that he will need to practice his silent meditation... all the way to the Eighth Stage.”","Fairy Lychee: “My condolences to Great Master Profound Principle.”","Almighty Merchant: “What is this Nine Provinces Number Two Group? Why am I included here?”","Behind the scenes, Song Shuhang was delighted to see the Almighty Merchant appear.","Song Shuhang asked, “Hard-To-Crush Little Squirrel, can you add a cool colorful effect to the nickname of the Almighty Merchant and make him stand out?”","Hard-To-Crush Little Squirrel: “Order received and executed successfully.”","Afterward, the Almighty Merchant’s name began to release colorful lights.","In addition to the Almighty Merchant, several other big shots and members were also secretly paying attention to what was happening in the group chat.","If there is a chance, I must bring in Senior Northern Emperor, Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven, and the other big shots. If a big shot of such a level is in the mood to give some advice, it would be a great opportunity for everyone, Song Shuhang thought to himself.","Afterward, his consciousness temporarily withdrew from the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.","In the next moment, another voice sounded in his mind.","[Beep~ Your buddy “Heavenly Emperor” had remotely transferred you one point of energy. PS: Senior Song, here is today’s energy.]","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","The Heavenly Emperor was also not affected by the Wielder’s small black room!","Is she as special as Senior White?","??????","Back on Earth, in the sky above the East China Sea.","The Heavenly Emperor rested her chin on one hand and sat in the Sun Boat.","The Sun Boat was restraining its light and heat while it remained hidden in a gap in space.","In the Heavenly Emperor’s left hand, there was an ancient mirror.","In the mirror, the words “Senior Song” were reflected.","The Heavenly Emperor said softly, “My memory has become very blurred. Is it the effect of the Wielder’s prison?”","After a while, she tapped on the mirror again.","Words that had been “stored” ahead of time appeared in the mirror.","She then sent another drop of energy to “Senior Song” and added the words to her message.","[Senior Song, when you received this message, you should have already integrated a lot of my information. You should have come into contact with something like a path, right? With that being the case, you must have felt something... The world, starting from a corner that people do not know of, has begun to collapse. This is a sign that the current Wielder of the Heaven’s Will is beginning to lose their authority. I’ll pray for Senior Son’s safety.]","Her path was something that Wielder of the Will Liquid Metal Ball came up with to complete itself.","Therefore, as soon as he came into contact with her path, Shuhang should have sensed the state of the Wielder of the Will.","The current Wielder of the Will was nearing its end.","[Sorry, but I didn’t sense anything... Can you tell me how to sense it?] At this time, Song Shuhang’s reply popped up."]},{"number":2255,"title":"Chapter 2255 Remains of the Wielders of the Heaven’s Will","paragraphs":["2255 Remains of the Wielders of the Heaven’s Will","The originally calm Heavenly Emperor froze.","There should be no need to learn any method to sense those things at all.","In that case, why could Tyrannical Song not sense the changes happening to the Wielder of the Will?","Could it have something to do with the Wielder’s prison, or was Tyrannical Song’s path just different?","The Heavenly Emperor stretched out her hand again and touched the ancient mirror.","Unfortunately, there was no suitable answer to Song Shuhang’s stupid question in the ancient mirror.","So, after thinking for a while, she replied to Song Shuhang with three words: [You got this!]","??????","In the gaps between the small black rooms.","Song Shuhang looked at the Heavenly Emperor’s reply with a dazed expression.","You got this?","Not everything in this world could be accomplished by encouragement.","Shuhang felt that all the big shots in the universe had somehow developed the habit of not finishing their sentences.","Perhaps that contributed to making them appear more mysterious...","However, communicating in such a way was seriously detrimental to the newbies who listened to them. If their interpretation was wrong, they would fall into a bottomless abyss, as taking the wrong direction would inevitably lead to treading the wrong path.","Fortunately... I can ask for help!","Song Shuhang tried contacting Senior White Two through the Cultivation chat group.","As a ruler of the Netherworld, Senior White Two knew a lot about the Wielder of the Will.","Moreover, it just so happened that he wanted to ask Senior White Two if he wanted to join the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.","Song Shuhang said, “As long as my Cultivation chat group keeps evolving, even the Wielder’s small black room won’t be able to stop me from contacting the outside world!”","Senior White Two sent a reply after a while: [If you have something to say in the future, don’t ask me if I’m there. It will save me from wasting time replying to your ‘Are you there?’.]","Well, that makes sense.","Alright then, I’ll cut to the chase and get straight to the point.","[Senior White, do you know what happens when a Wielder of the Will begins to gradually lose their authority and the universe begins to collapse from places that people do not know of?] Song Shuhang relayed the message that the Heavenly Emperor had sent him just now.","[The Wielder of the Will has begun to gradually lose their authority...? Where did you get the information?] Senior White Two asked in a postscript.","The abdication of the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will was imminent, and the big shots in the universe had felt it. A lot of them had already mentally prepared themselves.","However, regarding this matter of the Wielder of the Will gradually losing their authority, even Senior White Two had not noticed it yet.","Song Shuhang replied: [The Heavenly Emperor.]","Senior White Two replied, [It seems that the Wielder of the Will is in a worse state than I imagined. In fact, similar things have happened in the past. When the old Wielder of the Will disappears and the new one has yet to inherit the position, the Heaven’s Will becomes something without an owner, so starting from unknown corners of the world, the laws of the universe begin to collapse.]","But in the past, this kind of thing only happened after the disappearance of the Wielder of the Will.","For such a thing to happen when the Wielder of the Will was still in their seat... One could imagine just how bad the current state of that Wielder of the Will was.","Song Shuhang asked, [Senior White, is there anything I need to pay attention to during this process?]","During their conversation earlier, the Heavenly Emperor wished him good luck and then encouraged him.","He got the feeling that there was something that he had to watch out for.","Therefore, Song Shuhang asked this question.","Senior White Two replied, [Hmm... If your ‘location’ happens to be in the range of the part of the world that is collapsing, then you have to be careful. Some scary remains may appear in the areas where the principles and laws of heaven have ceased to exist.]","The ‘remains’ he was referring to were the remains of the Wielders of the Heaven’s Will.","However, these things were different from primordial treasures such as the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and the big-eyed planet.","The remains that appeared in the collapsed parts of the universe could be considered the spiritual corpses left after the “death” of a Wielder of the Will.","There was no fixed name for them because almost no creature in the universe had ever come into contact with such things.","Every time the Wielder of the Will changed, the remains of the Wielders would appear in the collapsed areas. But to begin with, the collapse only took place in corners of the universe that nobody knew of.","Senior White Two briefly explained.","After listening to Senior White Two’s words, Song Shuhang replied, [I am currently in the proximity of a Wielder’s small black room, which should be a location where the Heaven’s Will is pretty strong. This kind of place should not belong to the parts of the universe at risk of collapse.]","A special space that would never be remembered by the people of the universe, and those who enter it would be erased from everyone’s memory—this kind of place was the most dangerous one.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","I can’t be so unlucky, can I?","Moreover, this place was hand-picked by Senior White.","Some of Senior White’s luck should have been passed onto him, right?","While Song Shuhang was in thought, on the small island where he was closing up, the river with the Yellow Spring churned.","It seemed that something was about to drill out of it.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said gravely, [No Tyrannical Song, be careful. Something is coming out.]","The stone tablet began to release its authority, firmly suppressing and protecting Song Shuhang’s location.","Song Shuhang: “...”","Is this what Senior White Two was referring to?","If that was the case, the ferocious remains of a Wielder of the Will would emerge from the Yellow Spring River next.","Song Shuhang quickly consulted Senior White, [Senior White, these remains... Are they the corpses of the past Wielders of the Will, right?]","If that was the case, would he encounter the corpses of Wielder of the Will White, Wielder of the Will Striped Dragon, Wielder of the Will Senior Three Eyes, or Wielder of the Will Daoist Virtue?","If it was the corpse of Wielder of the Will White, would it become Senior White Four?","Senior White Two replied, [I don’t know. In principle, there should be remains of all the past Wielders of the Will.]","Fwoosh~","The figure finally emerged from the Yellow Spring River.","It was a silver spherical object. Its body seemed to be made of metal, but it also had the fluidity of a liquid.","Song Shuhang said bitterly, [Oh, no. That... looks like the corpse of the fat ball.]","The remains of the Liquid Metal Ball emerged from the Yellow Spring River.","It stopped for a while in the air and then landed on Song Shuhang’s grave.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked via voice transmission: [Shuhang, who is this guy?]","[It should be the remains... of the current Wielder of the Will. Don’t worry. That’s not the Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball, nor is it Wielder of the Will Fat Ball! Senior Stone Tablet, don’t panic!] Song Shuhang replied via voice transmission. [Speaking of which, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, this is the first high-level boss we are going to face without help. Are you burning with excitement?]"]},{"number":2256,"title":"Chapter 2256 As long as there are enough golden thighs in my friends list...","paragraphs":["2256 As long as there are enough golden thighs in my friends list...","[You want me to burn?] Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet suddenly said via voice transmission. [Do you have spirit stones?]","His intuition told him that this was definitely not something that he could fight alone.","However, while he was indeed feeling nervous, he didn’t lose his calm.","One reason for this was his rich experience in fighting against such enemies. He had fought against the Netherworld Fat Ball so many times, and things tended to lose their mystery once you became familiar with them.","Although the ball in front of him wasn’t the Netherworld’s Fat Ball, it still originated from [Wielder of the Will Liquid Metal Ball] and was similar in a way.","Normally, these remains would only emerge when the current Wielder disappeared, but that was not the case this time, as they started appearing even though the current Wielder was still in charge.","Moreover, people would turn extremely calm in desperate situations. It was similar to accepting that the worst that could happen was death.","Song Shuhang was now in such a state. His heart was beating like crazy, but his mind was very calm. It was a very contradictory state.","[Spirit stones? I might have some,] answered Song Shuhang. There was indeed a sizable amount of spirit stones in his Inner World which were meant to be paid to the Ruler of Shadows as compensation.","It was just that he had not had the chance to meet him again, so the spirit stones were still stored in his Inner World.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said passionately, [If you have enough spirit stones, you can activate my hidden abilities. As long as there are enough spirit stones, we can even fight Immortals!]","Song Shuhang: “...”","Another wasteful item!","The “if” part hurt the most.","If I had a large number of spirit stones or treasures, I could fight Immortals head-on for dozens of rounds just by using my Pay-To-Win Strike!","[Come on, this is not the time to be stingy. Take out your spirit stones. Let’s burn!] Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet replied quickly.","Although the remains of Wielder of the Will Liquid Metal Ball stood motionless in front of Song Shuhang’s grave, a world-destroying aura kept emanating from its body.","It was the opposite of all matter.","Even if it did not make a move and simply stood still, everything around it would collapse.","The stone tablet was fully activating its suppressing ability at this time. If it was not for it, Song Shuhang’s grave would have already crumbled to pieces.","If the Inner World could be opened now, he would have escaped into it with Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","This fellow sure is unlucky. Senior White Two went silent, and then he replied, [Did it attack you?]","Song Shuhang hurriedly said, [No, it’s just standing still, as if paying a visit to my tomb. But even if it’s just standing still, its terrifying aura is enough to destroy my tomb. Senior White, is there any way to help me?]","Senior White Two replied, [Calm down, and don’t be reckless. When the remains of the Wielders of the Will appear, they follow fixed patterns. Since it did not attack you, it means that you did not meet the conditions for it to do so. As such, do not move and stay right where you are.]","[Additionally... ×&%¥$] Senior White Two sent two postscript messages.","However, the second postscript was a mess of characters.","If the one he was chatting with was Senior Medicine Master and a mess of characters was sent out, it might be that his head had been smashed onto the keyboard by Riverly Purple Mist.","But who would dare to do that to Senior White Two?","Nothing should have happened to Senior White Two, right?","Thinking that Senior White Two was still sealed by the fat ball, Song Shuhang’s heart tensed.","The voice of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet rang in his ears again. [If we do not have any spirit stones, we are done for. If the worst comes to the worst, I’ll protect you while you look for a way to leave. Do you have a way out of this prison?]","[Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, don’t be reckless! Don’t do anything!] Song Shuhang hastily relayed the words of Senior White Two.","At the same time, he quickly sent a message to Senior White Two, asking about his status.","Senior White Two replied quickly. However, his reply was a mess of characters again.","He could still reply, which meant that he was fine.","Then that meant the problem might be on his side...","Song Shuhang frowned.","Could it be that the connection between Senior White Two, who was in the Netherworld, and him was disturbed by the remains in front of his grave?","Thinking of this, Song Shuhang quickly contacted the main world’s Senior White. If he wanted to leave the Wielder’s prison, he would have to rely on Senior White’s small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword.","As long as the number of golden thighs in my friend list is enough, the remains of the Wielders of the Will cannot stop me from contacting my seniors!","Song Shuhang got in contact with Senior White and sent out a distress signal. [SOS! Senior White, come and save me! I’m going to die!]","Senior White: [☉⊙●〇◎¤]","Damn, it was a bunch of garbled characters again.","One day, when my Cultivation chat group is fully upgraded, no one will be able to stop me! Song Shuhang thought to himself.","If the messages he sent were normal, the two Senior Whites should be able to see his call for help.","But if the messages that he sent out became garbled, he would have to deal with his current dilemma on his own.","While thinking this, Song Shuhang sent several distress signals to Senior White Two and Senior White even if the messages might become garbled characters.","Since he sent so many strange messages in one breath, Senior White would definitely be able to figure out that he was in a dangerous situation.","??????","[Shiet, it has begun to move!] Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said via voice transmission.","Two metal arms extended from the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball, which had been standing motionless until a moment ago.","The metal arms pierced into the golden sand and began to dig.","“Fwoosh~” With a lift of its metal arms, a large clump of sand was lifted.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said, [We cannot wait any longer!]","If they waited any longer, there would only be one end for them.","“Boom~”","As soon as Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet finished speaking, the lid of Song Shuhang’s stone coffin exploded and shot toward the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball."]},{"number":2257,"title":"Chapter 2257 Life or money?","paragraphs":["2257 Life or money?","The coffin’s lid exploded?","I am neither Newton nor Isaac, so why can’t my coffin stay put?","Without the coffin lid, he would be facing the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball directly. Just how stressful was that?","At this time, the fragments of the lid reached the Wielder’s corpse; every piece was covered with sharp sword qi as it slashed at the ball.","The sky was filled with sword light, which then turned into a sword net as it covered the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball in an attempt to stall it.","At the same time, a wooden sword slipped through the cracks in the stone coffin and landed in Song Shuhang’s hand.","It was Senior White’s small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword.","The exploding lid was a defense mechanism left by Senior White before he left.","As long as the golden sand where Shuhang’s grave was located was touched, this defense mechanism would be activated.","The exploding coffin lid could buy Song Shuhang some time and wake him up from his state of meditation, although the second function was not needed at this moment.","When the coffin exploded, the disposable flying sword would be activated, taking Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet out of the gaps between the small black rooms.","In order for Song Shuhang to close up safely, Senior White had arranged everything very carefully.","At this point, the disposable flying sword was ready.","The wooden sword turned into a rainbow, engulfing Song Shuhang and the stone tablet.","The duo turned into light and were swept up into the sky.","The remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball stood blankly, enduring all the sword light slashes... It failed to stop the disposable flying sword’s escape light.","“Hahaha!” After turning into light, Song Shuhang let out a hearty laugh.","I’m safe!","As long as Senior White’s small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword was activated, even Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball could not stop it.","Song Shuhang’s panicked heart finally calmed down.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet also let out a breath of relief.","The light formed by the disposable flying sword pierced through space and began to make its way to the main world.","This gave him a real sense of security!","If the Inner World was no longer hiding, that meant that the crisis was over.","As long as he could open the Inner World, Song Shuhang could do thousands of things. He could fight or retreat, attack as he advanced, or defend as he retreated.","Just when these thoughts flashed through his head, a terrifying suction force emerged from behind him.","The sword light, which had already broken out of the Wielder’s prison, was abruptly dragged back.","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","Even the small-black-room-breaking disposable flying sword could not break free from the suction force!","His divine sense swept back, and as a result, strands of his mental energy were locked onto by the powerful suction force and swallowed up.","Behind him, the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball had turned into a black hole. Right now, its existence could only be sensed in an indirect manner.","Near the black hole, everything was swallowed.","Sands, islands, poisonous water... and even light!","Even the light that the disposable flying sword had transformed into could not break free from the black hole’s suction and was forcibly dragged back.","As the sword light was dragged back, Song Shuhang sensed that his Inner World was gradually being cut off; he was losing his connection with it.","[Inner World, open!]","Taking advantage of the fact that the Inner World was still accessible, he had to escape. Or else, he might never be able to.","The Inner World opened quickly... but Song Shuhang failed to enter it.","The suction force coming from the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball could bend and collapse space. Additionally, this force contained a trace of incomplete power from the Heaven’s Will.","This was why the disposable flying sword also got pulled back.","The power of the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will was above all things; this was an absolute rule.","The Inner World failed to take Song Shuhang and the stone tablet away safely. Not only that, but there were many shiny objects in the Inner World that were pulled out by the black hole’s suction force.","The shiny objects were spirit stones!","Boxes of spirit stones and the gemstone fruit cores that he had planted in the Inner World could be seen—these gemstone fruit cores were practically the same as spirit stones.","His heart hurt so much that he could not even utter a word.","These were the spirit stones that he was going to use to repay his debt to Senior Ruler of Shadows, and it was the only money he had.","However, he couldn’t simply close his Inner World.","Between life and money, he would obviously choose money... No, life.","If the entrance to the Inner World was closed, it would be equivalent to destroying his only path to survival.","With it open, there was at least a small chance that he could survive this ordeal.","So, Song Shuhang couldn’t close the entrance even with the spirit stones being sucked out continuously. All he could do was let the Inner World Assistant quickly transfer his assets, treasures, and spirit stones to reduce his losses as much as possible.","“Spirit stones? Perfect!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was overjoyed.","It rolled violently while enveloped by the light.","It caught all of the spirit stones that were pulled out from the Inner World and merged them into its body.","Song Shuhang was heartbroken... but he still found some comfort from this.","It was better for the spirit stones to be swallowed by Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet than ending up in the black hole.","After Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet devoured a large number of spirit stones, patterns lit up on its body.","Its body was actually divided into an inner and outer layer.","The inner layer hid mysterious attack methods, but a large number of spirit stones was needed to activate them.","It was a magical treasure for the rich. To be honest, a person like Song Shuhang could not afford the upkeep of such an item at all.","A large number of spirit stones were burned.","“Divine Suppression!” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet uttered in a grave voice.","In its inner layer, two immemorial characters lit up—these were not characters of the ancient era as they belonged to an even older time.","Afterward, the projection of a large white tablet emerged from the body of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","When the white tablet first emerged, it was the same size as Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s body. Soon, a white light shone from it.","This pure white light was like a flame, crazily burning all the substances that could be burned around it.","In an instant, it turned into a dazzling white sun.","Within the sun, the ancient words “Divine Suppression” contained unparalleled might, suppressing the black hole that the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball had turned into.","Behind him, Song Shuhang felt the suction force on his body lighten.","However... It was not by much.","If the suction force was reduced a little bit more, he would be able to escape into the Inner World.","In Song Shuhang’s mind, many plans appeared.","First, he thought of using the Sage’s Impregnating Gaze, but it would definitely have no effect on the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball.","The ?Heaven Burning Flaming Saber Technique? required the cooperation of Senior Scarlet Heaven Sword, but it was not around right now.","The ?Saber-Nurturing Technique? required his hand to slide on something, but it was too late for him to do that now. Entering melee range against the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball would spell his death.","An attack with the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure? No, that was his life-bound magical treasure. If it was sucked into the black hole, his losses would be huge.","The Karmic Saber? No, it took too long to store power, and that would be a test of his luck. If there was no big shot willing to help him, the Karmic Saber would not be effective at all.","After much deliberation, the skill that Song Shuhang least wanted to use was the one that was most suitable and had the power to cause damage to the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball... the Pay-To-Win Strike.","Is life more important than money?","Of course, money is more important... No, wait, life is more important!"]},{"number":2258,"title":"Chapter 2258 This is the last of my...","paragraphs":["2258 This is the last of my...","In fact, before he reached the Sixth Stage, money really might have been more important for Song Shuhang.","The main reason for that was that resurrection magical treasures were much cheaper for those who were beneath the Sixth Stage.","He was very familiar with the Almighty Merchant, and he’d done business with Fairy Almighty Seller as well. Whenever he bought Resurrection Gold Coins in large quantities, he got a discount from the fairy. As long as he bought 10, he would get 2 free.","For this reason, before the Sixth Stage Realm, money was more important than life for him.","But after the Sixth Stage Realm, resurrecting became a lot more troublesome.","Ordinary resurrection magical treasures could no longer meet the needs of Sixth Stage cultivators.","If a Sixth Stage True Monarch wanted to be resurrected, they would need to set up a resurrection formation somewhere in the universe, and go through the whole process of extracting their blood, binding their soul, and so on before they could be resurrected.","In this way, the price of resurrection naturally rose.","As Song Shuhang was now a Seventh Stage Venerable, the price of a suitable resurrection formation was something he couldn’t afford.","“Pay-To-Win Strike—Divine Strike!” Song Shuhang stretched out his finger and pointed forward tremblingly.","Following Song Shuhang’s instructions, the Inner World Assistant collected all the remaining boxes of spirit stones that it had just transferred away and threw them out of the Inner World.","There were also the last few spirit stones that Song Shuhang kept in his secret stash. The Inner World Assistant dug them out as well...","At the same time, furs and other forging materials that had been harvested from the Inner World’s spirit beasts and demonic beasts were also thrown out.","After this strike, Song Shuhang would not even have a single spirit stone to his name. He would be completely bankrupt!","All the spirit stones and the assets that Song Shuhang had accumulated were funneled into the Pay-To-Win Strike, fused into the light ball between his fingers.","Because he was worried that the power of the Pay-To-Win Strike would be insufficient even with all the resources he put into it, Song Shuhang also poured all his spiritual energy into it to enhance its might as much as he could.","Song Shuhang said in a deep voice, “Fat Ball, take this. This is the last of my assets!”","When Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, who was right next to Song Shuhang, heard his words, it felt an inexplicable sadness.","Anyway, the Pay-To-Win Strike was unleashed!","An inverted pyramid-like structure appeared behind him. On the top of the inverted pyramid, there was a throne, a phantom of the Throne of Wealth Distribution.","Song Shuhang’s hair shot upward. His originally short hair grew instantly, and each strand was dyed a golden color.","The power of the Throne of Wealth Distribution, now attached to Song Shuhang’s back, had turned into a pair of huge wings of light.","A beautiful eye emerged on the wings. The wings were like a bridge that allowed the power of this eye to be projected over.","The eye on the wings opened slowly, staring at the remains of the Wielder—at the same time, the third eye on Song Shuhang’s forehead also opened.","Song Shuhang’s third eye originated from Senior Three Eyes.","And this Pay-To-Win Strike also originated from Senior Three Eyes.","The two complemented each other!","Song Shuhang felt that the power of his Pay-To-Win Strike was strengthened—he did not expect the third eye to have such a hidden effect.","“Eat my poor self’s Pay-To-Win Strike!”","The light between his fingers shot fiercely at the black hole that the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball had transformed into.","When he attacked, all the treasures in the gaps between the prisons seemed to be attracted. The golden sand, the fragments of magical treasures, the poisonous waters from the Yellow Spring, and all the other items that had not been sucked into the black hole were attracted by the Pay-To-Win Strike, sacrificed, and fused into Song Shuhang’s attack.","This was another effect of the third eye on his forehead.","It actively pulled all the treasures that could be “sacrificed” in the surroundings to enhance the power of Song Shuhang’s Pay-To-Win Strike.","The Divine Suppression of the dazzling stone tablet.","The Divine Strike of the blinding Pay-To-Win Strike.","The two luxurious and wasteful attacks hit the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball with great force.","These two attacks were the embodiment of the famous saying claiming that money was power!","As long as you were willing to spend coins, the enemy would be weakened by the power of money.","With everything they had thrown at the black hole, the suction force of the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball acting on Song Shuhang had weakened once again.","“Now’s our chance!” Song Shuhang seized the opportunity.","He took Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet with him and jumped.","The Inner World was very courageous today, and it coordinated with Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet by pulling them in. At the same time, from the depths of the Inner World, several strands of hair rushed out, wrapped around Song Shuhang, and dragged him inside forcefully!","“Boom~”","A loud explosion echoed behind him, but all this no longer had anything to do with Song Shuhang.","The remaining suction force managed to take away the shoes on his feet, but Song Shuhang and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet had managed to enter the Inner World safely.","The Inner World instantly closed, preventing the remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball from breaking in.","“Hah!” Song Shuhang fell barefoot beside the living spring. “I’m alive...”","He had poured all his spiritual energy into the Pay-To-Win Strike, so he was exhausted.","Pavilion Master Chu slowly retracted her long hair, looked at Song Shuhang’s sorry state, and asked, “Who did you piss off this time? If I had not pulled you in, you might have been pulled back.”","To make Song Shuhang suffer so much, the other party’s strength must be incredible.","Song Shuhang said weakly, “The remains of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball...”","Pavilion Master Chu blurted out “What?”","When she heard the words “Wielder of the Will”, she felt her scalp go numb.","Song Shuhang said, “According to Senior White Two, when the authority of the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will begins to fade, the spiritual corpses of the past Wielders will appear in the collapsed parts of the universe. Anyway, that thing was super scary.”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Not only did he provoke the Netherworld’s Fat Ball, but he’s also messing with Wielder of the Will Fat Ball? Shuhang has improved again...","“I really thought that I was going to become a dead tablet today,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said weakly. Its state was not much better than Song Shuhang’s. Its Divine Suppression was a very demanding move. After using it, it felt as if it had been completely hollowed out.","“How was it, Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet? Was it exciting?” Song Shuhang turned to look at Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet and said cheerfully. Because of his bare feet, his toes could be seen wriggling and twitching—the aftereffects of the momentary overstimulation.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet refused to reply.","When it was released by Song Shuhang from the Beast Realm’s Garre Holy Mountain’s trial grounds, it had a feeling that Tyrannical Song was bad news and that the big shots he had provoked might have been stronger than it imagined.","But in the end, the stone tablet discovered that it had underestimated Tyrannical Song.","How can you provoke big shots of this level, little bro?","Fighting big shots should be done while following basic rules, okay?","It knew that Song Shuhang was a fake Profound Sage and was only a Seventh Stage Venerable.","Despite that, a Seventh Stage Venerable like him dared to fight against the remains of a Wielder of the Will!","So, it did not want to speak.","It only wanted to be quiet.","Lady Onion took some of the living spring’s water with a cup and poured it into Song Shuhang’s mouth.","Song Shuhang drank anxiously. “Ah, so refreshing... Thank you, Lady Onion. I feel alive again.”","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber flew out from behind Lady Onion, circling around Song Shuhang intimately.","Lotus root projections also appeared, seemingly fiddling with the outside world.","“Eh?” Song Shuhang discovered that the roots appeared to be absorbing energy."]},{"number":2259,"title":"Chapter 2259 The fairy’s actions are still so upsetting","paragraphs":["2259 The fairy’s actions are still so upsetting","A steady stream of evil energy of the Netherworld was extracted by the roots and integrated into the Inner World.","“Eh, where is this evil energy coming from?” Song Shuhang closed his eyes and tried to sense where the energy was coming from. Soon, he discovered that the lotus roots were in the Beast Realm, greedily absorbing high-quality evil energy of the Netherworld.","With evil energy of such a high quality, even with his brain turned off, Song Shuhang could guess that it came from the Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball.","He fought the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball among the gaps between the small black rooms while his Inner World fought the Netherworld Ruler Fat Ball in the Beast Realm... He was going against the black and white balls in one go!","Pavilion Master Chu replied lazily, “It was Fairy @#%×. She sent you a request to activate the lotus root projection function of the Inner World to devour a batch of evil energy. From the looks of it, she should have started sucking in the evil energy.”","“Heavens, Fairy Virtue actually sent me a request?” Song Shuhang was surprised.","Did the Sun rise from the West today? The virtuous lamia actually knew how to follow proper procedures?","This did not fit her naughty character at all!","The same virtuous lamia that always snatched his lines cared about his feelings enough to submit an application to him?","The virtuous lamia was Song Shuhang’s light of virtue, and she was one with him, so Song Shuhang gave her a part of his authority over the Inner World. This was so that in times of crisis, the virtuous lamia could operate the Inner World on his behalf and save his life if the need arose.","However, due to the low level of the Inner World in the past, there weren’t many functions. Even if the virtuous lamia did have some authority, she could not do anything once she was too far from Song Shuhang.","But now, with the repeated evolutions of the Inner World, the virtuous lamia and Song Shuhang had already gained the ability to open entrances to the Inner World at different locations.","In this way, just like Song Shuhang and his clone before, they could use the Inner World as a transit point to perform long-distance spatial jumps.","“Still, I did not receive any application...” Song Shuhang recalled that when he was in the gaps between the small black rooms, he did not receive the request of the virtuous lamia.","Pavilion Master Chu explained, “That was because Fairy @#%×’s application could not be submitted to you. Your signal at that time was blocked. The application ended up being sent to the Inner World Assistant. With the help of the Inner World Assistant, Fairy @#%× successfully opened a small exit in the Beast Realm and led the root roots there to plunder the evil energy of the Netherworld.”","Through constant refinement, her strand of hair had become like a special clone. That strand of hair was currently planted on the top of Sage Monarch White’s head, so Pavilion Master Chu could always get first-hand information.","“So that’s the case.” Song Shuhang stretched out his hand to the right.","The cute Inner World Assistant was summoned over.","Song Shuhang stretched his hand to the top of its head. “You’ve worked hard.”","The Inner World Assistant rubbed Song Shuhang’s palm with its head.","“By the way, Pavilion Master Chu. What is Senior White doing?” asked Song Shuhang after drinking the water from the living spring and recovering some strength.","Pavilion Master Chu said slowly, “Fellow Daoist White’s short-term goal is to clean up the evil energy of the Netherworld in the Beast Realm and provide enough energy to your Inner World to allow it to upgrade once again. I’ve already told him that I safely took you out of the gaps between the small black rooms.”","Song Shuhang’s heart felt warm.","Afterward, he sent a postscript to Senior White through the Cultivation chat group: [Senior White, I’m out. My seclusion was interrupted, but my snake game is still going on. I have not stopped absorbing the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit. It’s just that it is now a background process.]","Then, he also sent a postscript to Senior White Two telling him that he was safe.","Senior White quickly replied: [That’s good. I’ll ask Fairy @#%× to send you two small-black-room-breaking disposable flying swords in case of any accidents.]","Song Shuhang: “!!!”","He wants to send me two more small-black-room-breaking disposable flying swords?","With the incident with the Wielder’s corpse that just took place, Senior White would definitely not be cruel enough to send him back into a small black room. Still, he gave him two flying swords in case of any accidents.","“Then... Doesn’t that mean that I will end up in more accidents?” Song Shuhang panicked.","While conversing, two wooden swords wrapped in light of virtue were sent into the Inner World. They were then transferred by the Inner World Assistant and placed in front of Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang touched the two wooden swords, and after thinking for a while, he put one of them into his magical bracelet.","[I’m a little busy here... If you want to come to me, please contact me in advance. I have to make sure that the location is safe before you come over. In addition, there are a few things I wanted to tell you—you seem to have forgotten to add Scholar When the Bright Moon Appears to the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.]","[You’re already at the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm. After I finish collecting this batch of evil energy in the Beast Realm, we’ll quietly go back to Earth and get the Jade Lake Secret Realm. At that time, you can store it inside your Inner World. According to my calculations, after you bring the Jade Lake Secret Realm into your Inner World, it should be able to evolve again... Moreover, when recovering the Jade Lake Secret Realm, we might be able to make use of that opportunity to attack the Limitless Demon Sect, hitting two birds with one stone.]","[We also have to reconsider the matter of building an immortal cave on the moon. You are in the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm now, and although you have only been cultivating for a short time, you can still be regarded as a senior figure in the world of cultivation. As such, you have to make arrangements for things in the secular world, so that secular matters do not drag you down in the future.]","Senior White carefully explained things to him.","He explained every matter in a different paragraph. Every time, he sent some energy along with the postscript.","For Song Shuhang, whose body was currently drained, the energy that Senior White sent was like water in the desert, bringing him quite a bit of joy.","Song Shuhang replied, [Okay, Senior White.]","Then he opened his friend list in the Cultivation chat group and began searching for Scholar When the Bright Moon Appears.","He looked through the entire list, from top to bottom.","“I remember that I added the scholar, but why can’t I find him? Wait, it feels like I have not added him yet...” Song Shuhang rubbed his temples.","It seems that I will need to send the scholar a QR code.","With that being the case, this matter would have to wait until he was able to leave the Inner World and return to the main world.","As for the Jade Lake Immortal Realm, that was Fairy Cheng Lin’s base.","If it was before, when he did not even know Fairy Cheng Lin, there would not have been any psychological burden even if he were to take the place away. But now that he was acquainted with Cheng Lin, should he first ask her about it before taking her home away?","After some thought, Song Shuhang found Fairy Cheng Lin in the blacklist and sent her a message: [Hello, are you there? Fairy Cheng Lin, in a few days, I’m planning to move the Jade Lake Immortal Realm into my Inner World. Are you fine with that?]","[Beep~ The blacklisted “Fairy Cheng Lin” has shut down her phone. The message has been transferred to the blacklisted “Stripey”.]","Fairy Cheng Lin’s actions were still so upsetting.","??????","In the gaps between the Wielder’s prisons, the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball canceled its black hole state. It held a shoe in one of its liquefied hands and fell silent again."]},{"number":2260,"title":"Chapter 2260 Confusion","paragraphs":["2260 Confusion","There were originally two shoes, but one of them was obliterated during the collision between the black hole, the Divine Suppression White Sun, and the Pay-To-Win Strike. As such, only one was left now.","Both the Divine Suppression White Sun and the Pay-To-Win Strike had complex origins, so the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball could not deduce any useful information from the two attacks.","On the other hand, a lot of things could be deduced from this seemingly ordinary shoe.","The corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball grabbed the shoe and began to act instinctively—the corpse did not have the ability to think, so it acted according to predetermined patterns.","With this shoe, it could perform a series of operations such as aura detection, information tracking, and remote targeting to lock onto the owner of the shoe.","However, because it was currently in the gaps between the Wielder’s small black rooms, a lot of its skills were restricted to the small black rooms, and it could not trace the shoe back to Song Shuhang.","But the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball did not give up, or it could be said that it did not know what giving up was at all.","Until there was no new “event” to attract its attention, it would keep holding onto the shoe, constantly using various magical techniques and skills to find its owner—even if it took a hundred years or a thousand years, it would continue with the task.","Moreover, with it being the corpse of a Wielder of the Will, the number of tracking skills at its disposal was as numerous as the stars. It began to try its skills one by one, casting various magical techniques on the shoe over and over again.","The brilliance of magical techniques bombarded the shoe continuously.","If this shoe could survive the baptism of this constant barrage of magical techniques, perhaps it would become a magical treasure.","After all, the shoe was practically being blessed by the remains of a Wielder of the Heaven’s Will!","Some time later, and after an incalculable number of magical techniques, the shoes in the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball’s hands began to glow with a golden light.","It had been enhanced.","It was now a [Sports Shoe +10].","After being strengthened, a “thread” separated from the shoe. The thread plunged into the void and began to follow something.","The corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball continued to hold on to the shoe, motionless.","??????","Meanwhile, in the Inner World, Song Shuhang was meditating to recover his spiritual energy. He now had 1 big and 7 small nascent souls. Along with the resurrected fat whale golden core, it made it so that he had the equivalent of 1+7+1 nascent souls. As a result, the recovery speed of his spiritual energy was much faster than other people.","The true embodiment of the saying ‘strength in numbers’.","At this moment, a prompt popped up in his mind.","[Beep~ The blacklisted “Stripey” has agreed to the transfer from Fairy Cheng Lin. The private chat module has been loaded.]","Song Shuhang opened his eyes. “Eh? Striped Dragon Two actually accepted the call?”","A while ago, he tried contacting Fairy Cheng Lin to ask her if he could move her Jade Lake Secret Realm to another place.","In the end, Fairy Cheng Lin used a new function, revealing her call-forwarding card.","And Striped Dragon Two, as usual, had not seemed to care at all about the call transfer.","Therefore, Song Shuhang gave up on calling Fairy Cheng Lin and began to meditate to recover his spiritual energy.","Unexpectedly, Striped Dragon Two now answered the forwarded call.","It was said that a big shot’s view of time was different from that of newbies.","Perhaps for Striped Dragon Two, all the time that passed was just a moment.","[It’s that ugly Tyrannical Song again. What do you want from me? Eh, this Cultivation chat group of yours has been upgraded again?] Striped Dragon Two talked first.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin. He did not care too much about his appearance. After all, he was a man, so it did not matter if he was a bit rough around the edges.","Besides, Striped Dragon Two was a dragon, and the aesthetics of dragons were different from that of ordinary people. So even if Striped Dragon Two pointed out that Song Shuhang was not beautiful enough every time they chatted, Song Shuhang did not care at all.","Song Shuhang replied, [Actually, I was looking for Fairy Cheng Lin, but she turned off her phone... I don’t know what she did, but she somehow transferred my call to you, Senior.]","Striped Dragon Two: [What kind of plane is she operating?]","[Perhaps an amphibious aircraft?] replied Song Shuhang subconsciously. Although Striped Dragon Two had been staying in a special secret realm, he seems to have been paying attention to information related to the outside world recently. Because of that, when communicating with it, there was no sense of a generational gap.","Striped Dragon Two: [Be careful or I’ll karate chop you... Let’s put Cheng Lin’s matter aside for now. What kind of plane are you using?]","Song Shuhang replied, [I don’t operate any kind of airplane. I just wanted to ask Fairy Cheng Lin about moving her Jade Lake Secret Realm and see if she would be fine with it.]","Striped Dragon Two asked, [Where do you plan to move it?]","[To my Inner World,] said Song Shuhang honestly.","Striped Dragon Two quickly replied, [No problem, just go ahead and move it. Move it as soon as you can so that she becomes homeless. That way, she will know that it’s time to go home and see this old, widowed dragon. I give you permission for this matter. If Cheng Lin asks about it afterward, just say that I asked you to do it.]","[Understood~] Song Shuhang laughed.","Anyway, the forwarding of the call was Fairy Cheng Lin’s own doing. This was karma!","Striped Dragon Two: [Does Cheng Lin have any other bases? If there are any, I give you permission to move them as well. If you cannot move them, I can help you remotely.]","Song Shuhang replied, [Currently, I only know about this one.]","Striped Dragon Two: [Alright, is there anything else?]","Song Shuhang thought for a while, and could not think of anything else he needed for the time being... However, he did not end the call with Striped Dragon Two right away.","It was rare to get in touch with Striped Dragon Two, so he had to think carefully. If there was anything else he wanted to ask, he should do so right away.","While Song Shuhang was thinking hard...","[What the, what is this?] Striped Dragon Two suddenly sent a message.","Song Shuhang was confused. [What’s wrong, Senior Stripey?]","Striped Dragon Two replied, [Have you been followed? Bah, this corpse-like existence actually dares to plot against me...]","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded.","What happened? Had someone launched an attack against Striped Dragon Two through him?","Striped Dragon Two exhorted, [If you have nothing to do, end the conversation. Also, don’t contact me for a while so that I don’t get exposed.]","[Okay, Senior.] Song Shuhang scratched his head and ended his conversation with Striped Dragon Two."]},{"number":2261,"title":"Chapter 2261 Virus alarm function","paragraphs":["2261 Virus alarm function","Song Shuhang scratched his head, then turned to look at Pavilion Master Chu, Senior Turtle, and Lady Onion.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, who was by the side, could not help but say, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, it’s fine if you don’t want to close up, but can you not even properly practice for a few hours?”","Song Shuhang said, “There’s a reason for it. Senior Little Stripey contacted me just now, so I had to withdraw from my state of meditation. But it doesn’t matter anymore. After practicing for so long, I’ve already recovered most of my spiritual energy. In addition, I still have a ghost spirit in my body. Even if I don’t take the initiative to cultivate, my ghost spirit can take over. I can simply have my nascent souls and golden core cooperate with my ghost spirit to recover my spiritual energy as quickly as possible.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","Ghost spirits had always been regarded as a hack for cultivators and that reputation was not for nothing.","Song Shuhang said seriously, “Besides, someone just tracked me down and launched a sneak attack on Striped Dragon Two through me. Seniors, did you sense anything?”","“They were able to target you even when you’re in the Inner World?” Pavilion Master Chu frowned.","She was very clear about the power of the Inner World. As long as the Inner World was closed, even Immortals could not force their way in!","One should not see the Inner World as weak just because it was often in hiding. The main reason it had to hide so much was due to its upgrade speed being unable to keep up with the refresh rate of Song Shuhang’s enemies, which led it to being repeatedly blocked by the powerful spatial confinement of those big shots.","If Song Shuhang had upgraded it to a level that matched his enemies, it would definitely not behave like a coward.","Senior Turtle said, “How about I lie on my stomach and try to sense whatever you’re talking about?”","Lady Onion giggled and said, “Then I’ll lie down and watch.”","“Senior Turtle and Lady Onion, stop messing around. I am being serious.” Song Shuhang waved his hand.","At the same time, he thought of a possibility.","To confirm this possibility, he needed to check things with Pavilion Master Chu first. “Senior Chu, did you feel as if something was locked onto my body just now?”","“I didn’t feel anything.” Pavilion Master Chu shook her head. When she shook her head, her long hair splashed water around her. Also, her body floated up slightly, revealing her collarbone that Senior Turtle envied.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “Did you figure something out?”","“Yeah,” Song Shuhang said, “I suspect that the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball is attacking me from a distance. It is normal for ordinary big shots to be able to follow a connection to attack people, and it would make sense if it was the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball who tracked me down all the way here. It is possible that it used certain means that only the Wielder can use, which is why even Pavilion Master Chu is unable to sense anything.”","After all, he had just provoked it.","Therefore, the first suspect that Song Shuhang thought of was the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball.","In hindsight, the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball was indeed the most likely to be responsible for such actions.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said solemnly, “If it was able to lock onto you even after you’ve hidden in the Inner World, you’re in a very dangerous situation.”","This was equivalent to having a sharp sword hanging above one’s head that may fall at any time.","Song Shuhang sighed and said, “So Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, let’s not provoke big shots too easily. These big shots have too many tricks up their sleeve. Every time they are provoked, there are consequences. Last time, I was so miserable that I was left with only my head. That was because I provoked a big shot and triggered the Heavenly Punishment!”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet: “...”","With what courage do you dare to say that?","Senior Turtle turned over and asked seriously, “How are you going to deal with this?”","After thinking for a while, Song Shuhang said, “I’ll contact Lady Kunna to see if she sensed something.”","Lady Kunna, or Lady Dragon Network, had been assisting him remotely, helping him absorb the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit and upgrade the Cultivation chat group.","Moreover, Lady Kunna possessed, to a certain extent, power equivalent to that of the Wielders of the Will.","Song Shuhang opened his friend list and contacted Lady Kunna.","Since the private chat function has already been activated, Song Shuhang could directly communicate with the big shots on his friend list. They no longer needed to communicate through a roundabout way such as postscripts attached to bits of energy.","Lady Kunna replied, [Administrator Tyrannical Song, it will take 60 days and 3 hours before the Heavenly Emperor’s Path Fruit is completely absorbed. Is there anything else you need?]","Song Shuhang asked, [The corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball might have tracked me down remotely. Lady Kunna, do you have anything that can capture signals?]","If Song Shuhang was instantly notified of the long-range attacks, then he had several ways to deal with them.","Lady Kunna replied, [Administrator Tyrannical Song, please wait a moment.]","After about five or six minutes, Lady Kunna wrote: [Comparison of all signals completed... Converting to the units of time of Administrator Tyrannical Song’s world... Nine minutes ago, there was interference from an external signal. Do you need a more precise time?]","After Song Shuhang got the reply, he was overjoyed. [The exact time is unnecessary as the approximate time will be enough. Lady Kunna, can you flag this external interference signal so that I’m immediately notified next time it interferes with me?]","Lady Kunna replied, [Creating framework, starting calculations... The calculations have been completed. The task appears to be feasible. I will add it as a function to the Cultivation chat group.]","Song Shuhang finally let out a breath of relief. [Thank you, Lady Kunna. I won’t forget this big favor!]","Lady Kunna replied, [Log update, confirmation: ‘Administrator Tyrannical Song owes me a big favor’ +1.","Song Shuhang: “Hahahaha.”","Lady Kunna was fun.","After ending his conversation with Lady Kunna, Song Shuhang opened his eyes.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked, “Have you dealt with it?”","Song Shuhang nodded. “Lady Kunna recorded the remote interference in her logs. I asked her to develop a sort of virus alarm. Now, as long as the ‘remote interference’ appears again, I will be notified immediately.”","“It’s not a bad function.” Pavilion Master Chu nodded, and then pointed out a critical flaw. “But you also need to consider how you’re going to deal with the other party’s long-range attack.”","Having an alarm was good and all, but there was still a need to deal with the interference.","“Actually, I’ve already got a solution to that.” Song Shuhang smiled slightly, drawing out his own blacklist. “Just now when I was communicating with Senior Striped Dragon Two, the long-range attack of the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball was diverted and ended up at Senior Striped Dragon Two’s location.”","He only had a virus notifier at the moment, and it would be nice to create an anti-virus function in the future, but for now...","Senior Turtle’s eyes lit up. “That is to say...”","Pavilion Master Chu added, “You can use the same method again...”","Lady Onion continued, “Just divert the interference.”","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said curiously, “But who are you going to transfer it to?”","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “Not everyone on my friend list is a friend.”.","After all, there were people such as Demon Emperor Hezhi and the Indestructible Lord in his friend list.","If those were not enough, there were still the survivors of the Ancient Heavenly City.","“Shuhang, you are really nasty.” Lady Onion crossed her arms and said in an accusing tone.","Song Shuhang flicked her onion sprout lightly. “Then, how about I transfer the signal to you?”","Due to Song Shuhang having already become a Seventh Stage Venerable and having mastered three top-tier body-tempering cultivation techniques, although he only lightly flicked Lady Onion’s sprout, he flicked it off of her body..."]},{"number":2262,"title":"Chapter 2262 Status","paragraphs":["2262 Status","Song Shuhang swore to god that he did not mean to do it.","Lady Onion’s onion sprout spun around in the air, before finally inserting itself into the ground beside the living spring like a sharp blade.","“Huh? What happened? Why did the world suddenly turn black?” Lady Onion asked in bewilderment.","Senior Turtle: “...”","Pavilion Master Chu: “...”","Before the silly onion could react, Song Shuhang acted without thinking.","He used the ?Virtuous Man’s Ten Thousand Mile Walk? and instantly flashed to the position of the sprout that he had flicked off of Lady Onion’s body. Then, he stretched out his fingers to grab it.","Afterward, he flicked it lightly again. This time, he made sure to control his strength.","Lady Onion’s sprout spun around again and landed firmly back on her body.","At the same time, Song Shuhang subconsciously took out a small scotch tape from the Inner World.","The moment Lady Onion’s onion sprout fell back on her body, he moved to Lady Onion’s side again and dexterously wrapped the tape around the broken part of the sprout.","The whole process was as smooth as flowing water, and everything was completed within a second.","While it would have indeed been better to use super glue on it, there was unfortunately no glue in Song Shuhang’s Inner World.","After sticking the onion sprout back onto Lady Onion’s body, Song Shuhang returned to where he originally was with a smile on his face.","“My vision is back, but... I feel a little dizzy,” said Lady Onion. Then, she reached out to grab her onion sprout without even thinking.","When she did this, she touched the glossy scotch tape...","“...” Lady Onion’s little hand poked the tape.","She raised her head and looked at Song Shuhang again.","Song Shuhang averted his gaze with some guilt.","Lady Onion said angrily, “Surnamed Song, what did you do to my onion sprout?!”","Song Shuhang promised that he would never touch her onion sprout again.","Sure enough, men were liars.","Song Shuhang said with a guilty conscience, “It was an accident. It was really an accident!”","“Since it’s already broken, let’s just take it off. There’s no point in sticking it back,” Senior Turtle comforted her softly.","When Lady Onion heard this, she could not help but start shedding bitter onion tears.","Fortunately, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was not present.","“A salary increase.” Lady Onion reached out and tore off the scotch tape on her body and protested to Song Shuhang.","In addition to practicing hard recently, Lady Onion had also worked together with the Inner World Assistant to take care of the Inner World.","As an employee, she was quite competent.","“No problem!” Song Shuhang gestured with his hand.","A salary increase was a trivial matter.","Although he was currently penniless, his Inner World was a gold mine. As long as he developed it reasonably well, money would come flowing in very quickly.","Even if he did not have any talent in business, he could start selling land and become a big real estate developer in the world of cultivation.","After comforting Lady Onion, Song Shuhang got up and took a deep breath.","He then performed a set of ?Basic Buddhist Fist Technique? to warm his body up.","Pavilion Master Chu asked, “What are you doing?”","Song Shuhang said, “We cannot hide in the Inner World forever. We have to go out. I’m going to open an exit to see where we are right now.”","The Inner World had escaped from the gaps between the small black rooms, but he had no idea if it had actually left the scope of the Wielder’s small black rooms.","If they were still within range, they had to be careful of the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball.","Hearing this, Pavilion Master Chu and Senior Turtle readied themselves for any surprises.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and carefully opened a small exit.","It was pitch black on the other side of the small hole.","It did not seem to be the space between the small black rooms, and there was no trace of the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball.","Song Shuhang asked curiously, “What is this place?”","A strand of hair of Pavilion Master Chu slipped through the hole into the outside world.","After a while, she speculated, “It seems that you are now stuck between the Wielder’s small black rooms and the main world.”","To put it simply, it was similar to getting stuck in a wall while performing spatial teleportation.","If it was not for Song Shuhang having the Inner World, being in such a situation would have claimed his little life.","“We’re stuck between the Wielder’s small black rooms and the main world? Then is the effect of the Wielder’s small black room still active on me?” Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up.","“I’m not sure.” Pavilion Master Chu shook her head.","Song Shuhang said cheerfully, “I’ll look for someone to check.”","He stretched out his hand and brought up “Demon Emperor Hezhi” from his friend list. Then, he initiated a private chat with him—he had to let Demon Emperor Hezhi experience this new function.","Song Shuhang sent a message, “Senior Hezhi, guess who I am~”","Demon Emperor Hezhi quickly replied, “Scram!”","With just one word, Song Shuhang knew that Demon Emperor Hezhi still remembered him.","He said regretfully, “It looks like the effect of the Wielder’s small black room is gone.”","To be honest, he kind of missed running into the Wielder’s small black room with Senior White and being forgotten by everyone—it was practically a strengthened version of Scholar DM’s cultivation technique.","In that forgotten state, he could do many things.","“Do you want to return to the main world? I can sense that my spatial abilities are not restricted in this location. You can step out of the Inner World and into the outside space, then I can immediately send you back to the main world,” said Pavilion Master Chu.","Song Shuhang raised his hand and asked, “Pavilion Master Chu, if I step out of the Inner World, will I be stuck in the spatial wall?”","“With your physique, you should be able to last for a while. That period of time is enough for me to send you back to the main world.” Pavilion Master Chu yawned, looking a little sleepy.","After Song Shuhang thought for a while, his eyes suddenly lit up. “Wait... I might have a way to return to the main world directly.”","After that, he started to fiddle with the ?Divine Weapon Appraisal? technique.","It was a technique developed by Slow-Witted Song, and it could imprint a personal brand on a divine weapon and recover the weapon through a spatial ability.","In Song Shuhang’s hands, when combined with the Inner World, the branded weapon could be turned into a coordinate.","“Search... found... lock!” Song Shuhang opened his eyes and gestured with his right hand.","Far away in the main world, a treasured saber on Heavenly Field Island faintly trembled.","A fairy maiden in a black skirt who was carefully making immortal dishes turned her head and looked at her treasured saber.","The girl washing vegetables next to her raised her head and asked in confusion, “Sister Chu Chu, what’s the matter?”","This fairy maiden washing vegetables looked like a child, and she gave off a naive and childish vibe.","“The saber let out a sound,” Chu Chu said softly.","This saber should have been left by someone important to her, but her memory of them seemed to be a little fuzzy. She could not remember the specific appearance of the owner of the saber.","At this moment, a spatial gate appeared beside the saber.","Song Shuhang stepped out of the spatial gate together with the headless Lady Onion, who was standing on his shoulder.","The moment he stepped into the main world, the memories of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song flooded the minds of the people in the universe like a tidal wave.","“We greet Senior Tyrannical Song!” At the same time, all the cultivators present stood up and greeted Song Shuhang respectfully."]},{"number":2263,"title":"Chapter 2263 This is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!","paragraphs":["2263 This is Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!","Song Shuhang froze.","To be honest, he was not used to being greeted so respectfully by so many people.","“Chu Chu greets Teacher.” Chu Chu put down the immortal chef knife in her hand and greeted Song Shuhang just like the others.","During the time Song Shuhang was locked inside the Wielder’s prison, the memories that the practitioners of the universe had of him were blurred.","But when he got stuck between the prison and the main world, the effect of the small black room began to gradually fade. However, most of the practitioners in the universe still carried a deep sense of unfamiliarity with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","When he truly returned to the main world, their memories related to Tyrannical Song flooded back into their minds.","For this reason, when everyone came face to face with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, they all felt strange.","Shuhang felt both familiar and unfamiliar.","Their memories of him were vague yet clear.","With this strange feeling in mind, the cultivators of Heavenly Field Island that were present subconsciously greeted him when they saw him appear.","“Hello, fellow daoists. There is no need to be so polite with me.” Song Shuhang flicked his fingers and used his saber controlling technique. The treasured saber Broken Tyrant returned to him, landing firmly in his hands.","After hearing Profound Sage Tyrannical Song speak in such a gentle tone, all the cultivators present let out a breath of relief for some reason—they felt as if they had just escaped a calamity.","At the same time, a cultivator quietly raised his head and looked at Profound Sage Tyrannical Song; anyone who dared to do this could be regarded as courageous.","This one look left the practitioner astounded!","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song seemed to be surrounded by a faint radiance, the radiance of principles and paths.","Song Shuhang had just fought against the corpse of Wielder of the Will Fat Ball, and he had unleashed two extremely powerful moves before leaving. It was thus inevitable that he would be tainted by the aura of the moves.","In addition, the gap between the small black rooms was a special place, and the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will’s authority had just recently receded from there. With Song Shuhang having just come out from such a place, he ended up carrying bits of its special aura.","Moreover, there was also Lady Onion, who was rooted in the enlightenment stone and currently on Song Shuhang’s shoulder, adding to his presence.","After all the various special effects were added together, the brilliance produced made him look very mysterious.","After these brave cultivators glanced at Song Shuhang, they felt as if they had seen the light.","Some difficulties that they had encountered during their practice, parts of their cultivation techniques that they had overlooked, or a little bit of enlightenment that they needed to make a breakthrough... After taking a look at Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, they got everything they needed.","This was the first Sage in a thousand years, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!","A senior with great wisdom who had dared to answer the doubts in the hearts of all the practitioners in the universe in one go during his Divinity Show!","After the courageous cultivator took the lead, the others also sensed something, and one after another, they raised their heads to look at Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Then, they all fell into a state of enlightenment from which they could not extricate themselves.","The whole place became silent, so quiet that it was frightening.","No one made a sound, and those who were still conscious even subconsciously held their breath.","Song Shuhang: “...”","What’s with this strangely silent and awkward scene?","“Congratulations, Teacher. Your realm has improved again.” Chu Chu was the first to sober up and sent Song Shuhang a voice transmission.","She did not speak directly, so as to not affect the state of enlightenment of the cultivators around her.","She was born in a small family of cultivators, and she knew very well how important this state was to ordinary cultivators.","If one made proper use of it, it may even change their fate.","Song Shuhang nodded slightly to Chu Chu, motioning her to put away her cookware and follow him.","While doing their best to not disturb the cultivators present, Song Shuhang slipped away with Chu Chu.","A foolish-looking fairy maiden followed closely behind them.","“Eh? Vice-Island Master Tian Tianwei, is that you? Are you awake?” Song Shuhang discovered that this silly-looking fairy was actually Senior Tian Tianwei.","Tian Tianwei’s soul had been damaged during the incident that took place on Heavenly Field Island previously, and she had been unconscious since then.","“Hmm?” Tian Tianwei tilted her head and looked back at Song Shuhang curiously.","Chu Chu explained, “Teacher, Senior Tian Tianwei is still recovering. According to Senior Tian Tiankong, she will take about a year to fully recover. Right now, she still acts like a child at times.”","“I see.” Song Shuhang nodded slightly, and then asked Chu Chu, “Chu Chu, how is your cultivation going?”","Chu Chu was the first student he had taken in, and he was quite inexperienced when it came to providing her with guidance on cultivation.","Chu Chu nodded and said, “Recently, my cultivation has been progressing very smoothly. After I came into contact with the chef heart you gave me, I have also made rapid progress in immortal cooking. Moreover, Senior Tian Tiankong has provided me with all the ingredients I need to practice.”","To be honest, Chu Chu felt as if she had advanced by leaps and bounds recently.","She had a great aptitude for the path of immortal chefs, and ever since she had begun practicing both immortal cooking and cultivation, she had broken through several small realms.","In the past, never would she have even dreamed that cultivation could be so easy... She didn’t need to worry about pills, nor did she need to run around for resources.","Not long after she came into contact with the path of immortal chefs, her teacher even prepared a chef heart for her.","For Chu Chu, her current life was basically what she dreamt of when she was a child.","Song Shuhang smiled and said, “I cannot provide you with much guidance on immortal cooking. I’ll contact Immortal Fairy Bie Xue to see if she is willing to teach you.”","In his Inner World, he had bred a lot of spirit beasts, as well as magical beasts from the Black Dragon World. Those magical beasts progressed according to a system that was different from that of the main world. For Immortal Fairy Bie Xue, they would definitely be very appealing.","Moreover, the recipes of the ?Heavenly Tribulation Grand Banquet? would hold an even more fatal temptation to her.","In addition, Chu Chu had the chef heart of Demon Emperor Hezhi.","With these three things, it would definitely not be a problem to get Immortal Fairy Bie Xue to guide her.","While he was thinking this, his phone suddenly rang.","Song Shuhang opened it and saw that it was a call from Immortal Fairy Bie Xue.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue called him immediately after her memory of Song Shuhang was restored.","“Speak of the devil...” Song Shuhang used the charging technique on his phone, and then answered the call.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue asked, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, are you in the Jiangnan area?”","Song Shuhang asked, “No, I’m currently on Heavenly Field Island. However, I’m going back to the Jiangnan area soon. Immortal Fairy, do you need anything from me?”","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue asked in a hushed voice, “Fellow Daoist White... Is he with you?”","Song Shuhang said, “No, Senior White has something to do and is not currently with me.”","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue replied, “Oh, goodbye then.”","“Wait a minute, Fairy Bie Xue!” Song Shuhang shouted. “I’ve got some business with you.”","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue asked happily, “Business? Information about Fellow Daoist White?”","Song Shuhang asked, “No... I’m talking about normal business. I have some special ingredients in my hand. Are you interested in them?”","“I’ll wait for you in the Jiangnan area. We can continue talking after I see the goods.” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue seemed to have lost all interest."]},{"number":2264,"title":"Chapter 2264 I Have Touched It Myself!","paragraphs":["2264 I Have Touched It Myself!","After ending the call with Immortal Fairy Biexue, Song Shuhang fell into deep thought.","Song Shuhang rubbed his chin and said, “I’m questioning Immortal Fairy Biexue’s values.","Perhaps I can trade some information about Senior White with Immortal Fairy Biexue in exchange for her guidance on immortal cooking for you, Chu Chu. My gut tells me that if I do this, both Immortal Fairy Biexue and I will be pleased.”","Song Shuhang nodded and said, “That’s a win-win!”","Chu Chu looked utterly perplexed.","—","Song Shuhang took Chu Chu and Vice-Island Master Tian Tianwei to Island Master Tian Tiankong’s immortal cave.","“Senior Tian Tiankong, could you please open the door?” Song Shuhang shouted.","Just as he finished speaking, Vice-Island Master Tian Tianwei raised her leg and kicked the immortal cave door open.","It was rough and straightforward.","“By the way, Teacher, I forgot to mention that Island Master Tian Tiankong went out to buy medicinal materials this morning,” Chu Chu suddenly remembered and said, “Senior Tian Tiankong has been gathering soul-nourishing medicinal materials lately to help Senior Tian Tianwei recover sooner.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He had originally intended to meet Island Master Tian Tiankong, bid him farewell, and take Chu Chu with him. Unexpectedly, Island Master Tian Tiankong had gone out.","After some thought, Song Shuhang took out his phone and called Island Master Tian Tiankong.","The call connected quickly.","Island Master Tian Tiankong asked, “Fellow Daoist Shuhang, is there something you need from me?”","Song Shuhang said, “Senior Tian Tiankong, I’ve just arrived at Heavenly Field Island. I planned to take Chu Chu with me and say goodbye to you. However, Chu Chu mentioned that you left early this morning, so I decided to call you instead.”","Island Master Tian Tiankong smiled and said, “How about you both stay on the island for one night? I’ll be back on the island by tomorrow.”","“We can meet up another time, Senior. It seems you’re quite busy right now,” Song Shuhang replied with a smile. Even over the phone, he could hear the fatigue in Island Master Tian Tiankong’s voice. It seemed Island Master Tian Tiankong was going to great lengths to help Vice-Island Master Tian Tianwei recover quickly.","Song Shuhang then continued, “By the way, are Island Master Tian Tiankong and Vice-Island Master Tian Tianwei siblings?”","After ending the call with Senior Tian Tiankong, Song Shuhang retrieved a branch from his cosmos magical treasure. It was a branch from his wooden body.","Chu Chu and Fairy Tian Tianwei watched with curiosity.","“This should be the right size.” Song Shuhang held up the wooden saber and summoned the virtuous fat whale.","He then employed the Divine Weapon Appraisal technique. The virtuous fat whale left a mark of Divine Weapon Appraisal on the wooden saber.","To cast Divine Weapon Appraisal, the caster needed to possess spatial abilities or be in the Tribulation Transcender Realm. Song Shuhang’s cultivation realm wasn’t sufficient to cast the technique independently, so he relied on the power of the virtuous lamia.","“It’s done.” Song Shuhang raised the short saber.","Leaving a mark of Divine Weapon Appraisal on it would make this short saber a coordinate, allowing him to use the Inner World for spatial jumps.","Chu Chu asked, “Teacher, have you learned Sage Monarch White’s disposable flying swords?”","“This isn’t a disposable flying sword; it’s a substitute for the Broken Tyrant,” Song Shuhang explained. “However, it would be better if it could be strengthened.”","Unfortunately, Song Shuhang had never learned the art of refining artifacts. Therefore, he could only summon his four Sage Seals and imprint them on the wooden saber one by one.","They were Tyrannical Song, Tyrannical Scholar, Tyrannical Dragon, Tyrannical Demon.","The four Sage Seals left imprints on the wooden saber, significantly enhancing its strength.","“Although I don’t know how to refine artifacts, I do have plenty of Sage Seals,” Song Shuhang remarked. He then handed the wooden saber to Fairy Tian Tianwei.","Fairy Tian Tianwei asked, “Are you giving this to me to play with?”","“Yes, I’m giving it to you,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Thank you.” Fairy Tian Tianwei was very polite and planned to conceal this gift—perhaps bury it deep in Heavenly Field Island’s canyon, where she kept her other treasures.","“Now that I think about it, there are many places I should visit, such as Wenzhou, the Jiangnan Area, Senior Yellow Mountain’s immortal cave, and various other important places. I should leave a wooden saber in each of them,” Song Shuhang pondered.","In the past, he couldn’t find suitable items to bear the mark of Divine Weapon Appraisal. Ordinary items couldn’t endure the mark’s power, and using magical treasures as coordinates was too wasteful.","However, the appearance of branches from his wooden body perfectly solved this problem.","By burying a few more wooden sabers in hidden locations across the universe, he could save a lot on travel expenses.","—","After bidding farewell to Fairy Tian Tianwei, Song Shuhang retrieved Fairy Jade Rabbit’s cloak from the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure and carried Chu Chu back to the Jiangnan Area.","Flying with the cloak felt like riding on a magic carpet. It was quite thrilling!","The best thing about the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure was that it allowed the user to switch between its different component magical treasures at will.","There was a cool and stylish Divine Lobster Chariot, a safe and reliable Four Kings’ Wall, and even a pillar-shaped magical treasure.","There were thirty-three different flavors to choose from: flying shield, flying ring, flying helmet, flying whisk, and even a flying piano.","If the thirty-three flavors weren’t enough, the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure could be combined into endless variations.","For instance, Song Shuhang, now a Seventh Stage Venerable, was flying at astonishingly high speeds with the cloak. It wouldn’t take long to return to the Jiangnan Area from Heavenly Field Island.","—","The next day, it was December 4th, a Wednesday.","Early in the morning, at the Jiangnan Area, in the sky, a figure controlled a sword light with two people on it. They were concealed by an invisibility formation as they traversed the air.","Their destination was Jiangnan University City.","“Tyrannical Song is incredible! Last time, when I secretly went to see Sixteen, I met him. He was flying on a door panel... and that door panel was actually an Eighth-Stage magical treasure! I even touched it with my own hands. Let me tell you this, the feeling was indescribable,” one of the figures, a young man on a flying sword, said enthusiastically.","His two companions behind him wore expressions of astonishment and envy.","The two companions, a boy and a girl, were both teenagers.","The boy on the flying sword continued, “Not only that, there was a talking magical treasure with Tyrannical Song. It was an Immortal’s divine weapon, and I almost touched it!”","“An Immortal’s divine weapon that could talk? That means it has a weapon spirit, right?” the young fairy behind him asked in amazement.","“Yes, exactly! It’s a divine weapon with a weapon spirit... And now that I think about it, I vaguely remember touching something Immortal-level that could speak. But my memory’s a bit fuzzy.” The boy on the flying sword scratched his head. “Anyway, it was an incredible experience.”"]},{"number":2265,"title":"Chapter 2265 Service Concluded. If You Found This Service Satisfactory, Kindly Consider Giving Us a Five-star Rating","paragraphs":["2265 Service Concluded. If You Found This Service Satisfactory, Kindly Consider Giving Us a Five-star Rating","After hearing that the boy on a flying sword had touched so many treasures, the two companions behind him felt a mix of envy and admiration.","At that moment, he had been just inches away from laying his hand on the legendary Sage Monarch White. Sadly, it had been a near miss.","The little fairy behind him couldn’t help but ask, “Senior Brother Kongyun, can we meet Sage Monarch White this time?”","“I’m not sure about that. Whether or not we can see Sage Monarch White depends on our luck,” replied Su Kongyun with a slight smile.","The boy on the flying sword was none other than Su Kongyun, the cousin of Su Clan’s Sixteen... He had brought his junior brother and sister to Jiangnan University Town this time to look for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and deliver an invitation.","Since successfully ascending to the Third Stage, Su Kongyun’s status within the clan had improved significantly. Along with the task of delivering the invitation to Tyrannical Song, he had received a custom-made flying magical treasure.","It was a chargeable, door-sized flying sword.","It had a similar design to Song Shuhang’s sentient Flood Dragon Puppet. However, it was just a flying sword. It required spirit stones for activation, had an average speed, and no other functions aside from flying. However, it allowed cultivators below the Fourth Stage to experience the joy of flying with a sword.","The young cultivator following him said hopefully, “It would be great if we could see Sage Monarch White this time.”","The little fairy suddenly asked in a hushed voice, “Senior Brother Kongyun... Have you ever met Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?”","Su Kongyun answered proudly, “Certainly, I was with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song at that time. How could I miss the opportunity? I shook hands with him, and it was an incredible experience.”","The little fairy and the young cultivator couldn’t help but look at Su Kongyun with admiration. Frankly, hearing that Su Kongyun had touched Tyrannical Song’s hand left a more lasting impression on them than hearing about touching an Immortal’s divine weapon!","The little fairy inquired timidly, “Did you get pregnant?”","“What?” Su Kongyun was taken aback and then chuckled, “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song isn’t as fearsome as the rumors suggest. You won’t get pregnant just from shaking his hand. There is no need to worry.”","The little fairy felt slightly relieved upon hearing this.","Su Kongyun continued, “Moreover, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is exceptionally powerful. Are you familiar with heavenly tribulations? During my Third Stage heavenly tribulation, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song boldly approached and even touched the heavenly tribulation with his hands. All the heavenly tribulation could do was make crackling sounds. It was the most pitiful heavenly tribulation I’ve ever witnessed. It was devoid of any dignity.”","Furthermore, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song could transform heavenly tribulation into sustenance, devouring it—an especially terrifying feat.","To be honest, Su Kongyun considered himself fortunate to have encountered Profound Sage Tyrannical Song while searching for Su Clan’s Sixteen. The time he spent with Tyrannical Song was brief, yet the experience was enough for him to boast about it for years.","“Truth be told, I even suspect that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song might be the reincarnation of the god of lightning. He fears neither thunder nor lightning,” Su Kongyun added, “Even if thunder accompanies Profound Sage Tyrannical Song wherever he goes, it wouldn’t surprise me.”","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was a man beloved by thunder and lightning.","“Is someone undergoing a tribulation? No, that’s not a tribulation cloud,” Su Kongyun remarked, forming a hand seal to stabilize the flying sword beneath his feet.","The three of them concentrated their gaze on the location beneath the ominous cloud.","“Eh?” Su Kongyun was taken aback.","He spotted a magic carpet flying beneath the ominous clouds.","Seated on the magic carpet were three figures.","One was a tall, beautiful fairy in a black skirt and black stockings. Her only flaw seemed to be a slight lack of curvature in her chest.","The other fairy’s appearance was more startling—an enchanting figure in a green dress, but she had no head.","The remaining person, who controlled the flying magic carpet, was a young man.","In terms of demeanor, he appeared to be in his 40s, with an air of worldly experience. However, upon closer inspection, he seemed to be in his early 20s.","“The Tyrannical Song!” the little fairy exclaimed as the effect of [Nobody under the heavens doesn’t know of me] kicked in.","“Tyr... Tyrannical Dragon,” the other young cultivator chimed in.","Su Kongyun gulped. It was indeed Senior Tyrannical Song.","He looked up at the clouds once more.","“Rumble~”","The deafening rumble of thunder echoed throughout the area.","Then, a flurry of lightning bolts descended directly toward Profound Sage Tyrannical Song!","These bolts of lightning were exceedingly menacing.","Their power exceeded that of the Third Stage heavenly tribulation he had faced in the past.","Each bolt of lightning possessed the capability to slay Third Stage, or even Fourth Stage, cultivators.","However, for Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, this level of lightning was merely child’s play.","He didn’t even bother to erect any defenses against the lightning.","Instead, to protect the two fairies, he leaped into action, serving as a lightning rod and drawing the bolts toward himself.","A relentless barrage of lightning struck him, but it failed to inflict even the slightest harm.","At this moment, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song appeared as if he were bathing in lightning. A deity of lightning had descended upon the mortal realm.","Upon his arrival in the Jiangnan Area, an unexpected voice echoed in his ears.","[DiDi Lightning, at your service. Esteemed Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, your pre-booked “Lightning Package” is now in effect. It consists of Fifth Stage power with a total of 20 divine lightning bolts covering the Jiangnan Area. Justice is served as lightning descends from the heavens. We wish you a joyful life.]","In the next moment, he felt himself being locked in place.","Then, a deluge of lightning descended from the sky.","“Is this an ambush? No, what company would forewarn you of an ambush? Moreover, for it to specify the power and scope of the lightning in advance?” Numerous thoughts raced through Song Shuhang’s mind in an instant.","Furthermore, the recent notification indicated that this “Lightning Package” was a pre-arranged service.","Song Shuhang was certain he hadn’t booked such a service.","He wasn’t out of his mind, so why would he order lightning to strike himself? Would he do it out of boredom? That simply made no sense.","Moreover, he was broke; such a service would undoubtedly cost money.","Since he had no money, how could he have possibly booked DiDi Lightning’s services?","“Could someone have intentionally ordered lightning to strike me? But who?” Song Shuhang furrowed his brow.","“Rumble, rumble~”","The lightning continued its descent.","Soon, the 20 bolts of divine lightning vanished as swiftly as they had appeared.","Song Shuhang remained entirely unscathed, thanks to the saber intent armor that had shielded him perfectly.","Apart from bewilderment, this episode of DiDi Lightning had yielded no other outcomes.","Song Shuhang scratched his head, stored the saber intent armor, and descended to the ground using his black lotus platform.","[Service concluded. If you found this service satisfactory, kindly consider giving us a five-star rating.]","Another message chimed in his ears.","Song Shuhang swiftly extended his divine sense to scan his surroundings.","However, even after enveloping the vicinity with his divine sense, he couldn’t spot anything suspicious.","Instead, the only things he detected were three small figures.","“Oh, it’s that youngster.” Song Shuhang immediately recognized the boy who couldn’t resist touching everything."]},{"number":2266,"title":"Chapter 2266 The Generous And Extravagant Senior Song","paragraphs":["2266 The Generous And Extravagant Senior Song","Although they hadn’t known each other for long, this cousin of Su Clan’s Sixteen, who had a penchant for touching everything, had made quite an impression on Song Shuhang.","“Wait, didn’t Su Kongyun return to Spirit River Su Clan? Why is he here in the Jiangnan Area? Could he have run away from home again?” Song Shuhang pondered.","While lost in thought, Su Kongyun made a hand seal and guided the door-sized flying sword closer to Song Shuhang’s position.","When Su Kongyun spotted the magical carpet beneath Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, his eyes lit up. “Could it be another Eighth Stage magical treasure? I really want to touch it. Its soft texture must feel much better than the rigid door panel from before.”","Moreover, the legends were true! Sage Monarchs and Tribulation Transcenders could sense mentions of their names. Just as he suspected! When he was talking with his two companions about ‘Profound Sage Tyrannical Song,’ the Sage must have sensed it and decided to appear before them! He even manifested as Su Kongyun had described—bathed in lightning with an air of dominance. This only elevated Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s image in Su Kongyun’s mind.","As the door-sized flying sword arrived in front of Song Shuhang, Su Kongyun and his two companions greeted him simultaneously, “We greet Sage Monarch Tyrannical Song.”","This time, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song appeared less youthful and exuded a greater air of dignity—perhaps due to the absence of Su Clan’s Sixteen, but Su Kongyun felt the pressure coming from Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was several times stronger than before.","“Kongyun, did you sneak out of Spirit River Su Clan again?” Song Shuhang sat in the middle of the magic carpet—his left was Chu Chu, and his right was Lady Onion.","Chu Chu and Lady Onion acted like protective barriers, giving Song Shuhang a sense of security.","Su Kongyun hastily waved his hands and explained, “No, no. This time, I left through the main entrance of Spirit River Su Clan on an official mission. I was tasked with delivering an invitation to Senior Song.”","He then retrieved a small bottle, took out an invitation card from it, and sent it to Song Shuhang through the air.","The little cultivator and little fairy behind him eyed the small bottle with envy. The magical treasure Su Kongyun had just taken out resembled a size-reducing pouch and was a gift from Senior Tyrannical Song.","Song Shuhang extended his hand and used invisible psychic energy to accept the invitation.","“So, it’s an invitation to the Spirit River Su Clan’s Annual Meeting,” Song Shuhang said with a smile. He had guessed as much when Su Kongyun mentioned he was delivering an invitation.","Song Shuhang stored the invitation in his magical bracelet and nodded, asking, “Do you have any other tasks?”","Su Kongyun nodded and replied, “I have another invitation for Immortal Fairy Biexue. However, I haven’t been able to contact her recently, and her whereabouts are unknown.”","He had planned to give the invitation to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song and then call Su Clan’s Seven to inquire about Immortal Fairy Biexue’s current location.","“What a coincidence,” Song Shuhang said with an effort to maintain a gentle smile. He sensed that the little cultivator and little fairy behind Su Kongyun were like timid sparrows encountering an old eagle. To avoid frightening the children, Song Shuhang tried to appear as approachable and kind as possible.","Song Shuhang suggested, “I’m about to meet Immortal Fairy Biexue. How about you join us?”","“Really? Thank you, Senior Tyrannical Song!” Su Kongyun couldn’t hide his excitement. His flying magical treasure would undoubtedly lag behind if they joined Senior Tyrannical Song, right?","Song Shuhang raised an eyebrow. “You’re interested in that?”","It was the most eye-catching treasure among the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasures. The golden dragon beast pulling the chariot, the opulent chariot itself, and the aura of an Eighth Stage magical treasure all combined to make it remarkable.","Su Kongyun, along with the two companions, hopped onto the chariot without delay.","Once the trio was settled, Song Shuhang inquired, “Are these two young fellow cultivators also members of the Spirit River Su Clan?”","Su Xiaoxiao promptly stood up. “Junior Su Xiaoxiao greets Senior Tyrannical Song.” They had neglected introductions earlier due to Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s imposing presence.","“Junior Su Ni greets Senior Tyrannical Song,” the little cultivator followed through.","Song Shuhang nodded in acknowledgment.","He then extended his hand and, with a gesture, two saber lights appeared at his fingertips, landing in the hands of Su Xiaoxiao and Su Ni.","These short sabers looked like wood but weren’t, and they appeared golden but weren’t. They were crafted from a formidable material and appeared to be unrefined. Nevertheless, they were already superior to the magical swords and sabers they possessed.","However, the real treasure lay not in the short sabers themselves but in the Sage Seal imprint and the powerful strand of saber intent contained within.","Song Shuhang explained with a smile, “As we’re meeting for the first time, I’d like to gift these two wooden sabers to you to ensure your safety. They contain a strand of my saber intent and can protect you in times of danger.”","These were precisely the Sage Seal wooden sabers he had recently made, albeit with only one of his Sage Seals imprinted on each. Additionally, he’d sealed a strand of saber intent into each saber.","Song Shuhang continued, “They’re yours now.”","The two young fellow cultivators expressed their gratitude, saying, “Thank you, Senior Tyrannical Song!”","They found Profound Sage Tyrannical Song to be as generous as Senior Brother Su Kongyun had described. He was a rare wealthy senior among the Profound Sages.","Su Kongyun looked expectantly at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang chuckled and produced two more identical treasured sabers before tossing them to Su Kongyun. “One for you, and one to give to Sixteen when the time comes during the Spirit River Su Clan Annual Meeting.” This way, he could lock onto the coordinates and traverse space directly."]},{"number":2267,"title":"Chapter 2267 With the Heavens in Chaos, Evil Delusions Emerge","paragraphs":["2267 With the Heavens in Chaos, Evil Delusions Emerge","Su Kongyun accepted the two Sage Seal Wooden Swords, placed them into small containers, and reassured Profound Sage Tyrannical Song by saying, “I’ll absolutely get this mission done, Senior Tyrannical Song. You can trust me completely!”","“Take a seat; let’s get going,” Song Shuhang flashed a friendly smile. With a thought, the Fairy Jade Rabbit’s Cloak and the Divine Lobster’s Chariot streaked across the sky.","While the cloak and chariot flew at an astonishing speed, they remained remarkably stable.","This was Song Shuhang’s unique flying style that struck a balance between speed and stability.","Profound Food Pavilion was an immortal cave newly established by Immortal Fairy Biexue in Jiangnan. She primarily chose this location because after Sage Monarch White emerged from seclusion this time, he had established his base near Jiangnan University Town and had been staying with Song Shuhang.","As a result, Immortal Fairy Biexue quietly opened an immortal cave restaurant in Jiangnan. Since it was so close, it was only natural that Sage Monarch White would think of her restaurant first when craving delicious food.","Profound Food Pavilion had been in operation for just half a month, and all kinds of immortal culinary equipment had recently been set up.","At that moment, Immortal Fairy Biexue sat by the window on the second floor. A gauze veil covered her face as she rested her cheek on her hand and stared vacantly out the window.","Immortal Fairy Biexue couldn’t muster any excitement today.","“Judging by the time, Tyrannical Song should be arriving soon,” she mumbled.","However, it was unfortunate that Sage Monarch White hadn’t come along with Tyrannical Song.","Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, as the most renowned figure in the cultivation world today, deserved some respect.","The reason she couldn’t get excited was twofold.","The main reason was that Fellow Daoist White didn’t come.","The other reason was the presence of a cluster of malevolent delusions surrounding the Profound Food Pavilion.","A gray mist enveloped the protective formation of the Profound Food Pavilion. Inside this mist, faint black flames attacked the barrier.","These were malevolent delusions.","Malevolent delusions came in various forms and were all-encompassing in their effects.","The malevolent delusions enveloping Immortal Fairy Biexue’s Shiyuan Pavilion were akin to inner demons. Although they couldn’t breach the protective formation, they could still influence the cultivators within.","That’s why Immortal Fairy Biexue was feeling down.","The malevolent delusions were still in their infancy, so even if left unchecked for a decade, they wouldn’t be able to pierce Immortal Fairy Biexue’s barrier.","Furthermore, Immortal Fairy Biexue hadn’t made any move to dispel them. When malevolent delusions were nascent and weak, they could be employed to temper one’s Dao heart.","Immortal Fairy Biexue wouldn’t miss such an opportunity.","This type of malevolent delusion, similar to inner demons, could fetch a hefty price in the cultivation world.","Cultivators had various, often peculiar, methods of honing their Dao hearts. There was no fixed regimen for something like Dao heart cultivation. Different people had unique ways of refining their Dao hearts.","There were even cultivators who paid a high price to invite members of the Demon Sect to perform secret dances in the belief it would aid in honing their Dao hearts.","“Swoosh~”","At this moment, two gleams of treasure light streaked across the sky.","A cloak and a chariot appeared in Immortal Fairy Biexue’s line of sight.","This elegant chariot was the one Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had used to transport her to the Immortal Banquet earlier.","“He’s finally here,” Immortal Fairy Biexue murmured.","While extending her hand, she created an opening at the top of the protective formation for Song Shuhang to pass through.","After a brief while, the magic carpet was the first to touch down.","“Huh?” As Song Shuhang alighted, he noticed the malevolent delusions encircling the Profound Food Pavilion.","The gray mist and black flames gave Song Shuhang a sense of déjà vu.","“Inner demons?” Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s eyes sparkled.","The malevolent delusions encircling the Profound Food Pavilion suddenly hesitated.","In the next instant, they began to retreat underground and vanished into the depths.","“I won’t let you escape so easily!” Song Shuhang chuckled.","Although inner demons couldn’t compare to Inner Demon Tribulations, and Inner Demon Sashimi Slices couldn’t rival Inner Demon Tribulation Sashimi Slices, Senior Ruler of Shadows seemed to enjoy consuming them nonetheless.","This might somewhat help offset his debt... probably.","From inside the pavilion, Immortal Fairy Biexue lazily remarked, “Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, please don’t cause trouble. Those aren’t inner demons; they’re malevolent delusions.”","Simultaneously, Immortal Fairy Biexue felt quite puzzled. Why did these malevolent delusions flee as soon as Song Shuhang arrived? It was as though they’d encountered their arch-nemesis.","[Right, I almost forgot about the tremendous power of virtue within Song Shuhang.]","The light of virtue was the bane of all malevolent entities, and malevolent delusions were no exception. They were exceptionally vulnerable to the light of virtue.","Song Shuhang heard this and lifted his head to glance at Immortal Fairy Biexue.","Even with a veil separating them, Song Shuhang could still perceive the deep-seated laziness emanating from her.","It was an aura of decadence that was utterly lethargic to the core.","It resembled Pavilion Master Chu from the original Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion.","Behind him, the Divine Lobster’s chariot descended slowly.","Song Shuhang stowed away the two life-bound magical treasures and guided the trio of Chu Chu, Lady Onion, and Su Kongyun to the second floor of the Profound Food Pavilion.","“Feel free to sit wherever you like. I had initially planned to serve you tea, but today, I just can’t summon the energy. Please prepare your own tea,” Immortal Fairy Biexue said. Her hands remained folded as she rested her chin.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","He could only silently retrieve spirit green tea from his Inner World and boil some water to make tea.","“Fairy Biexue, what exactly are malevolent delusions?” Song Shuhang asked while holding a teacup.","Meanwhile, Chu Chu, standing nearby, began pouring tea for everyone.","Immortal Fairy Biexue replied lazily, “As chaos reigns in the heavens, malevolent delusions arise. Anyway, they’re strange and negative entities. Their appearance signifies trouble. My Profound Food Pavilion was just established, and I moved a small spiritual vein from the moon here. As a result, these malevolent delusions appeared.”","Song Shuhang furrowed his brows.","He immediately understood that this matter was related to the diminishing authority of the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will and the collapse of the universe.","The universe had begun to collapse from unknown corners.","In the regions undergoing collapse, remnants of the Wielders of the Heaven’s Will were emerging.","Simultaneously, other parts of the universe were affected.","These malevolent delusions were likely to appear all over the world before the formal replacement of the Wielder of the Heaven’s Will.","During this period of transition, turmoil would likely engulf the entire universe.","Even ordinary people might become embroiled and profoundly affected by this period of transformation.","It brought to mind Senior White’s reminder. Senior White had urged him to allocate some time for worldly affairs. There seemed to be a shared concern.","Immortal Fairy Biexue interjected, “Judging by your expression, it seems you know something.”","“Mm-hm.” Song Shuhang nodded. “I fear this wave of turmoil will be quite substantial. I...”","But Immortal Fairy Biexue suddenly interrupted, “Hold off on that. I can’t be bothered to listen today. We’ll talk about it another time.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Song Shuhang thought. ‘I was about to wrap it up with just a few more words!’","Immortal Fairy Biexue then inquired, “By the way, why do I sense a chef’s heart emanating from you?”","“Haha, Fairy Biexue, you finally noticed? Yes, that’s the power of a chef’s heart. It’s not limited to me; take a look at my disciple.” Song Shuhang pointed at Chu Chu. “Actually, my main purpose in coming here this time is to request your guidance to Chu Chu.”"]},{"number":2268,"title":"Chapter 2268 Nurturing Technique","paragraphs":["2268 Nurturing Technique","Immortal Fairy Biexue turned her gaze toward Chu Chu. In the face of the current top chef in the world of cultivation, Chu Chu felt a bit reserved. After all, she didn’t possess her teacher’s easygoing nature and big heart.","However, she understood that Immortal Fairy Biexue was evaluating her. So, she did her best to school her expression.","“Has your disciple already touched upon the threshold of a ‘chef’s heart?” Immortal Fairy Biexue seemed somewhat surprised. She could tell that Chu Chu was quite young. Achieving the threshold of a chef’s heart at such a tender age indicated remarkable talent in the path of immortal cooking.","Unfortunately, she had already taken Profound Sage Tyrannical Song as her master. Song Shuhang seemed entirely clueless about immortal cooking. Immortal Fairy Biexue couldn’t fathom how he came to possess a chef’s heart. However, she couldn’t muster the motivation to ponder this further; it was giving her a headache.","“Indeed, she’s touched the threshold of a chef’s heart,” Song Shuhang affirmed. “And with further progress, she’ll develop her own chef’s heart. I even have a chef’s heart prepared for her.”","At these words, Immortal Fairy Biexue felt her temples throb. Song Shuhang’s words hinted at an unconventional path. A chef’s heart was akin to sword or saber intent, a conceptual force, and it was certainly not something that could be casually extracted or transplanted.","She contemplated voicing her concerns but found herself lacking the energy even to do that at the moment.","“If someone could read my thoughts through my expressions right now, that would be perfect,” she mused while wishing she could convey her thoughts through facial expressions alone.","“Regardless, I believe that Chu Chu’s talents in immortal cooking should not go to waste. So, I’ve come to request your guidance in the art of immortal cooking for her,” Song Shuhang said earnestly. “I have a collection of ingredients from various magical beasts across the universe, as well as some from a secret realm. If you’re interested, I’d like to offer them in exchange for Chu Chu’s lessons.”","In addition to the ingredients, Song Shuhang possessed the trump card of heavenly tribulation recipes, leaving him certain that he would not be refused.","Immortal Fairy Biexue softly proposed, “How about another day?”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“No?” Immortal Fairy Biexue buried her face in her arms.","Song Shuhang inquired, “Immortal fairy, are you unwell?”","From the moment he had seen her today, Immortal Fairy Biexue had appeared as though she were possessed. She almost resembled Soft Feather’s Senior Brother Liu Jianyi. She seemed entirely devoid of energy.","Her condition seemed even worse than the once-lazy Pavilion Master Chu.","‘I’m not ill; it’s just the influence of the malevolent delusions outside. Oddly enough, I find it quite pleasant.’ Immortal Fairy Biexue thought inwardly.","While these were her thoughts, when she spoke aloud, she could only utter two words, “Malevolent delusions.”","“Have you been possessed by malevolent delusions? I can banish them for you, Immortal Fairy!” Song Shuhang swiftly rose from his seat.","“No, I’m just influenced,” Immortal Fairy Biexue said with a wave.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“I’m feeling rather good right now. Let me stay like this a little longer,” Immortal Fairy Biexue strained to articulate.","“Immortal fairy, it appears you’ve already been affected by malevolent delusions,” Song Shuhang remarked gravely. He reached out and grasped Immortal Fairy Biexue’s petite hand. “I have a technique to address symptoms like lethargy and lack of motivation. I’ll use it on you, Immortal Fairy!”","Despite her resistance, Immortal Fairy Biexue couldn’t match Song Shuhang’s speed in her current state.","He held her hand, circulated his true qi, and radiated the light of virtue from his body.","In an instant, Immortal Fairy Biexue felt her acupoints opening. A wave of comfort coursed through her body. She felt invigorated and brimming with vitality. An urge to rush to the kitchen and whip up an exquisite meal surged within her.","“What kind of technique is this? It’s incredibly potent.” Immortal Fairy Biexue straightened up and withdrew her hand.","“Uh... the ‘Nurturing Technique’!” Song Shuhang responded. The light of virtue intesified and almost obscured his face.","“You possess quite a collection of mystical techniques,” Immortal Fairy Biexue remarked. “Let’s get back to our discussion. I can offer some guidance to this young lady, Chu Chu, as long as your trade items are acceptable.”","“Alright, let me show you the items.” Song Shuhang extended his hand, and something materialized within it. However, it was not the magical beast he intended to present, but the puppet maiden.","“Fairy, why are you here?” Song Shuhang was perplexed. He had requested his Inner World Assistant to retrieve a magical beast.","The puppet maiden responded haltingly, “I fused... with the core, and I can now move within a limited area, so... I came out.”","With a graceful leap, she alighted from Song Shuhang’s palm.","Song Shuhang had won not only two chef hearts but also a core.","It seemed that the puppet maiden was nearly accustomed to her new core.","After landing, the puppet maiden extended her hand, and a small, sheep-like magical beast from the Black Dragon World was raised from her palm. This sheep-like creature had lost its wool.","The puppet maiden placed it on the ground.","The sheep-like magical beast expanded in size and returned to its normal dimensions.","“Buddhist Palm Realm?” Song Shuhang asked in surprise. This was a spatial technique usually wielded by Ninth Stage powerhouses, right?","The puppet maiden clarified, “No, it’s not the Buddhist Palm Realm. It’s a shrinking technique.”","At the same time, she glanced at Chu Chu.","Hmm... as expected, Chu Chu’s condition had matured considerably.","On the side, Immortal Fairy Biexue reached out and touched the sheep-like magical beast while carefully examining it. She inquired, “Where is its wool?”","Song Shuhang lamented, “A few days ago, during a confrontation with a big shot, I used it as a sacrifice.”","Immortal Fairy Biexue was speechless.","Forgive her for her lack of imagination; she couldn’t quite connect the dots between confronting a ‘big shot’ and sacrificing wool.","Immortal Fairy Biexue then asked, “How many similar magical beasts do you have?”","Song Shuhang responded, “There are numerous varieties, but at the moment, many of them are reserved for breeding.”","Immortal Fairy Biexue was speechless.","“In addition, these magical beasts are actually just part of the deal,” Song Shuhang said while clearing his throat. “I have a menu in my possession, and I’m certain that you will find it intriguing.”","Immortal Fairy Biexue gave him a confused look.","“It’s called the ‘Heavenly Tribulation Grand Banquet,’ and it’s a list of recipes for transforming heavenly tribulations into dishes,” Song Shuhang declared solemnly.","Upon hearing this, Su Xiaoxiao and Su Ni, who were standing by, stared in disbelief as they struggled to keep up with the conversation. Their minds seemed unable to process the information."]},{"number":2269,"title":"Chapter 2269 This Soil Might Be Rotten and Unpleasant","paragraphs":["2269 This Soil Might Be Rotten and Unpleasant","“Have you lost your mind?” asked Immortal Fairy Bie Xue as she regarded Song Shuhang with pity.","“Yes, that’s more like it!” Song Shuhang replied with a smile.","Upon first hearing about the ‘Heavenly Tribulation Menu,’ he too had been filled with excitement, and he enjoyed sharing that enthusiasm with others.","Meanwhile, the Puppet Fairy took hold of the sheep-like demonic beast, shrunk it once more, and playfully engaged a young cultivator with it.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue continued to stare at Song Shuhang while wondering if his brain had finally turned into liquid.","“Though it may sound absurd, the ‘Heavenly Tribulation Set Meal’ is incredibly delicious. The flavor of the braised lightning tribulation is so enticing that it makes my mouth water even when I reminisce about it,” Song Shuhang remarked. To lend more credibility to his statement, he added, “Senior White also happens to be quite fond of it.”","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue remained speechless.","Who would have thought this guy with such bushy eyebrows and large eyes would be taking over her job?","“Since you claim to have a menu, let me take a look at it,” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue said while raising her veil. “As long as the menu is theoretically sound, I will do my best to instruct your disciple.”","Immortal Fairy had lowered her requirements as much as possible and was no longer seeking practical outcomes. She merely demanded a theoretically flawless menu.","“No problem,” Song Shuhang replied calmly. “Add me as a friend, and I’ll send you a copy of the ‘Red Braised Tribulation Lightning’ recipe.”","Behind them, the young disciples of the Su Clan felt that the conversation between Senior Tyrant Song and Immortal Fairy Bie Xue had the air of two bigwigs conversing.","The exchange between the two seniors was casual yet seemed to contain a hint of Zen.","“Didn’t I already add you? I’m sure I did,” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue said in confusion as she pulled out her phone and opened the chat app.","“I’m not referring to that,” Song Shuhang said with a faint smile. He extended his right thumb and index finger to reveal a shimmering QR code between them.","Ever since he had reached the rank of Seventh Stage Venerable, he could now effortlessly adjust the size of the QR code as he pleased.","Seventh Stage indeed came with its conveniences.","“What’s this?” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue subconsciously scanned the QR code projection with her spiritual sense.","[Ding! You have added Venerable Tyrant Song as a friend. Nickname: ‘Very Delicious.’]","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was confused.","“With that nickname, do you believe I’ll poison the immortal dishes you order next time?”","As she contemplated this, Song Shuhang had already initiated a private chat with her.","At the same time, he conveyed a detailed description of the ‘Red Braised Tribulation Lightning’ recipe and the process of preparing it to Immortal Fairy Bie Xue through text.","The recipe was quite extensive and contained a substantial amount of content in the latter part of the description. Immortal Fairy Bie Xue silently perused it.","In the eyes of the Su Clan’s young cultivators, Venerable Tyrant Song had extended his hand and seemed to perform a spell.","Then, both he and Immortal Fairy Bie Xue had lapsed into a protracted silence.","Vaguely, they could sense that Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and Venerable Tyrant Song were engaged in communication.","Was this how great seniors communicated?","After a while, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue furrowed her brows. “In essence, this employs the technique of Immortal Chefs from the Demon Path?”","“Yes, because the creator of the ‘Heavenly Tribulation Menu’ was a peerless expert of the Demon Path, they naturally favored the techniques of Demon Path Immortal Chefs.” Song Shuhang nodded.","When he crafted the ‘Red Braised Tribulation Lightning,’ he had required the cooperation of the ‘Demon Path Culinary Heart’ of the Demon Emperor.","“In theory, there are no issues, and its feasibility is exceedingly high. I’ll require some time to experiment with it,” Immortal Fairy Bie Xue stated.","At this point, she resembled a swordsman who had just obtained an unparalleled sword technique and was eager to put it to the test.","However, the raw materials for the ‘Red Braised Tribulation Lightning’ were not easily obtainable.","First, she needed to locate a Second Stage Third Level cultivator and find a way to seal their Heavenly Tribulation. Importantly, during the sealing process, she mustn’t interfere with the cultivator’s tribulation lest they get drawn into it and intensify its power.","“I possess a complete set of recipes similar to the ‘Red Braised Tribulation Lightning,'” Song Shuhang added slowly.","This was the temptation laid bare.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was speechless.","“In addition, Immortal Fairy, should you wish to immediately experiment with the ‘Red Braised Tribulation Lightning,’ I can provide you with some raw materials,” Song Shuhang continued.","He reached out and retrieved the sealed Tribulation Lightning from his ‘Inner World.’","“Those are my Third Stage Tribulation Lightning!” Su Kongyun couldn’t help but exclaim.","“No, they’re not your Tribulation Lightning. You already consumed your Third Stage Tribulation Lightning back on Tiandao Island. These are the Tribulation Lightning I ‘obtained’ from a young friend named Ding Gan later on,” Song Shuhang replied while turning his head.","Ding Gan was highly productive. He had contributed not only a batch of Third Stage Tribulation Lightning but also an intact Heart Demon Tribulation.","Su Kongyun was speechless.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue gazed at the sealed Tribulation Lightning in Song Shuhang’s hand and asked in puzzlement, “Why is it cylindrical?”","Song Shuhang explained, “For the sake of convenience, Senior White and I rolled it into a cylindrical shape before sealing it. The recipe also indicates that cylindrical Tribulation Lightning is better for flavor absorption.”","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue exhaled slowly and made up her mind. “In that case, I’ll accept the recipe and the cylindrical Tribulation Lightning. I’ll do my utmost to instruct your disciple, Chu Chu, in her cultivation.”","“Pleasure doing business with you.” Song Shuhang extended his hand and shook Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s hand lightly.","Then he turned around and handed a wooden sword to Chu Chu. “Chu Chu, for the time being, stay here with Immortal Fairy Bie Xue and focus on your cultivation. If anything arises, contact me.”","Chu Chu was on the brink of a breakthrough; she merely needed to form a contract and could advance at any moment. Thus, Song Shuhang wanted her to be prepared.","“What about you, Master?” Chu Chu inquired.","“Me? I plan to make a brief visit to my school. It’s been a while since I last went.” Song Shuhang looked in the direction of Jiangnan University City.","Ever since he formally entered the world of cultivation, he had slowly distanced himself from his life as a regular student.","Presently, he could no longer be the ordinary student Song Shuhang.","This was his own choice, and he had no regrets.","However, occasionally returning to visit and stay for a day or two to unwind could also be beneficial for his state of mind.","The Puppet Fairy raised her head and said, “I’ll stay here with Chu Chu.”","Chu Chu could face her tribulation at any moment, and her presence would serve as a form of protection.","“All right, this location is quite close to Jiangnan University City, after all,” Song Shuhang said as he stood up and stretched. “Kong Yun, I’ve finished my discussion with Immortal Fairy. You can now hand over your invitations to her.”","Only then did Su Kongyun recall that he had the task of delivering the invitations.","At Jiangnan University, the willow tree spirit Qing Wu carefully removed some roots from the ‘forest.’","“The soil doesn’t smell right recently. Could it have gone bad?” Qing Wu murmured.","She had a suspicion that the underground of the school’s forest was filled with a strange odor that ruined her appetite.","It seemed she would need to switch to a new type of fertilizer.","Meanwhile, Young Master Phoenix Slayer curled up into a ball.","“Oh, right, I almost forgot about this.” Young Master Phoenix Slayer took out his phone and typed Song Shuhang’s name. Suddenly, he remembered that he wanted to purchase some beast fur from Song Shuhang to tend to his business."]},{"number":2270,"title":"Chapter 2270 Long Braids","paragraphs":["2270 Long Braids","After leaving Chu Chu and the Puppet Fairy at Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s ‘Abyss Consumer,’ Song Shuhang got up and headed to Jiangnan University Town.","It was still early.","Song Shuhang didn’t use any flying tools. After applying a simple illusion technique to conceal his presence, he slowly advanced through the sky and stepped on the clouds using his own realm’s strength.","With each step he took, a black lotus flower would appear in advance and marked where he was about to step.","The headless Lady Onion transformed into her onion form and sat on his shoulder while gently swinging her legs.","“I finally made it out of the Devouring Abyss Pavilion alive,” Lady Onion said softly.","In the Devouring Abyss Pavilion, facing Immortal Fairy Bie Xue felt like confronting her arch-nemesis. Lady Onion had not dared utter a single sound. Throughout the entire ordeal, she had been suppressing her own presence. She feared that if she spoke a bit louder, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue would grab her and slice her into pieces.","Song Shuhang gave a faint smile.","In the short term, Immortal Fairy Bie Xue shouldn’t have any intentions regarding Lady Onion. After all, she had previously bought a batch of green onion strips from Song Shuhang, which should suffice for some time.","“Have you overcome your fear of heights?” Lady Onion suddenly inquired.","Song Shuhang sighed. “Don’t spoil the mood.”","He had leisurely walked through the clouds and exuded a powerful aura that was immediately disrupted by Lady Onion.","“Well, if I don’t go too fast, I’ll be fine,” Song Shuhang slowly explained.","With his current abilities, he didn’t have to worry about looking down from the clouds. After all, with his Seventh Stage Venerable Realm and the protection of three body-tempering divine techniques, the only one who would be injured if he fell would be Mother Earth, not him.","***","The distance between the Food Abyss Pavilion and Jiangnan University Town wasn’t far.","This distance was meticulously calculated by Immortal Fairy Bie Xue—it wasn’t too close, yet not too far either. Even without using a magical tool, Song Shuhang quickly arrived in the sky above Jiangnan University Town.","It was the time when young students were hurrying to their morning classes.","The entrances to the university town were bustling with people.","As Song Shuhang looked at the scene below, he felt a familiar yet strangely distant sensation.","Experience changes people.","Whether through growth or sideways progression, experiences invariably bring change.","“It hasn’t been too long, but I already feel out of place in school.” Song Shuhang sighed.","Lady Onion hit the nail on the head. “Because your mental age is that of an old man.”","To be honest, from the moment she occupied Song Shuhang’s consciousness, Lady Onion had absorbed knowledge of his experiences.","If someone else had undergone what Song Shuhang had, their minds would have shattered long ago.","Not many people could maintain the same liveliness as Song Shuhang after repeatedly facing death, enduring torture, and experiencing the world’s most excruciating pain time and time again.","Partially due to this stimulation, Lady Onion had been diligently cultivating and seeking knowledge.","“Nonsense, my mental age is at most 40 years old,” Song Shuhang retorted.","He scanned the small forest not far from the male dormitory with his consciousness and locked onto Qing Wu’s position.","Just as he was preparing to land, his phone rang.","Song Shuhang took out his phone.","“Be careful, don’t drop it from such a high altitude. At this height, if the phone falls and hits someone, it could be fatal,” Lady Onion reminded.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Generally speaking, there shouldn’t be such a careless person among cultivators, right?","Senior Phoenix Slayer was calling.","“Senior Phoenix Slayer, why did you call me so early?” Song Shuhang answered the call.","“Hello, Shuhang. Are you on Earth?” Young Master Phoenix Slayer’s voice sounded.","“I’m here,” Song Shuhang said with a smile. “I just returned to the Jiangnan area. Senior, is there something you need?”","“I don’t know why, but when you call me senior now, I suddenly feel like hitting you,” Young Master Phoenix Slayer replied.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","‘Senior Phoenix Slayer, let’s have a proper conversation.","How am I supposed to respond like this?’","“I heard that you’ve raised a batch of spirit beasts and magic beasts, so I was thinking of buying something from you to earn some pocket money,” Young Master Phoenix Slayer continued.","“Senior Phoenix Slayer, you know I sacrificed spirit stone slags?” Song Shuhang was touched. Young Master Phoenix Slayer was like a mind reader.","Young Master Phoenix Slayer was confused.","Even the spirit stone slags had been sacrificed?","“Senior, what do you want to buy?” Song Shuhang said with a smile.","“I want fur. All kinds of spirit beast fur, magic beast fur, as long as it’s soft, I want it,” Young Master Phoenix Slayer said.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“Why is there no sound? Is the signal bad?” Young Master Phoenix Slayer asked in puzzlement.","Song Shuhang let out a faint sigh. “Senior Phoenix Slayer, how about you give me some time?”","In a few months, new fur would grow.","If that didn’t work... Song Shuhang wanted to see if he could improve the Hair Growth Spell and adapt it to work on spirit beasts.","“How long?” Young Master Phoenix Slayer asked.","“Two or three months?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“Goodbye.” Young Master Phoenix Slayer hung up the phone without hesitation.","Song Shuhang held his phone and looked up at the sky.","Then, he reached up and scratched his short hair. He wondered if Senior Phoenix Slayer would accept Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s long hair.","In terms of softness, it was definitely not inferior to spirit beast fur.","At the same time, he opened the notepad on his phone and recorded the [Enhanced Hair Growth Technique].","Even if it couldn’t be used on spirit beasts... if it could be modified, it might become an unexpected surprise when used against enemies.","With the Mutated Hair Growth Technique, the hair on the other party’s body would grow wildly and instantly transform them into a furball.","It felt quite amusing.","In the small forest, the monster willow Qing Wu sensed the aura of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s mental energy.","Qing Wu had been about to get up and buy breakfast for her roommates. She stopped and waited for Tyrannical Song.","Song Shuhang landed beside her and asked, “Qing Wu, has anything significant happened at school recently?”","Qing Wu’s tree branches swayed slightly. She then briefly recounted her recent experiences while pretending to be Song Shuhang.","“Thank you for your efforts.” Song Shuhang took out a portion of ‘living spring’ and handed it to the monster willow.","He didn’t have much to offer, so he could only share some Inner World specialties.","“In addition, Sage Monarch Tyrannical Song, it seems that there has been a change in the soil at school,” Qing Wu brought up the matter again after receiving the spring water.","“Mutation? In this area?” Song Shuhang furrowed his brow. He immediately thought of those evil spirits outside the Abyss Consumer Pavilion.","“Yes, it smells like it’s gone bad.” Qing Wu lightly tapped her tree branch.","Song Shuhang stretched out his hand and pressed it on the ground.","His divine sense penetrated the earth and extended downward.","Sure enough, deep within the ground, there was an aura similar to the ones left by the evil spirits outside the Abyss Consumer Pavilion.","However, Xie Wang had likely sensed the presence of the monster willow Qing Wu and had already disappeared."]},{"number":2271,"title":"Chapter 2271 We Can Deal With The Fatty Ball Boss In Such A Manner","paragraphs":["2271 We Can Deal With The Fatty Ball Boss In Such A Manner","The speed at which ‘evil’ spread was faster than he had imagined.","He hadn’t expected the world to give him no buffer time.","Of course, it was also possible that the buffer period had already passed.","“Sage Monarch Tyrannical Song, is the land contaminated?” Qing Wu asked.","Song Shuhang replied, “For now, this piece of land seems fine. It’s just that Evil Wang was here and left his aura behind. However, I don’t know much about Evil Wang... I’ll need to find someone to gather more information.”","Moreover, since Evil Wang had appeared in the Jiangnan area, Song Shuhang wondered about Wenzhou City.","Song Shuhang took out his mobile phone and dialed his disciple, the monster bird Little Cai.","“Master, Master, what’s going on?” Little Cai’s voice was full of energy. While she answered the phone, it sounded like she was practicing her saber skills. The sound of her saber’s force could be heard continuously.","“What’s the situation like in Wenzhou City?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“I’m doing well, Master. Is there a problem on your end?” Little Cai replied.","“Yes, there’s a situation here. Evil Wang is lurking around, and I need you to be cautious while you’re in Wenzhou City. If you notice anything unusual, report it to me immediately,” Song Shuhang instructed.","“Evil Wang? Why has that guy appeared? I understand, Master. I’ll immediately contact the nearby scholarly disciples,” Little Cai replied.","In Song Shuhang’s hometown, there was a recently established faction of scholarly cultivators.","Initially, only Third Stage scholarly disciples were guarding this place. However, as news spread within the scholarly faction that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was the reincarnation of the Scholarly Sage, a Fifth Stage scholarly expert had been stationed there.","Occasionally, various True Monarchs from different sects would pass by, wanting to visit the place where Scholarly Sage Song Shuhang had reincarnated—the birthplace of the Sage.","Little Cai seemed to have encountered Evil Wang before. When she heard about Evil Wang, she immediately thought of contacting the scholarly disciples.","With how reliable Little Cai had become, Song Shuhang felt reassured. “Alright... I’ll be returning to Wenzhou City in a day or two. When I’m back, I’ll create a life-bound magical treasure for you.”","It wasn’t just Little Cai. Now that Chu Chu had reached the Third Stage, she could also start preparing materials for her life-bound magic item.","After ending the call with the monster bird Little Cai, Song Shuhang quickly called out to Senior White Two in his mind.","“Senior White, are you there?”","Therefore, he quickly added:","2. “Is there any way to mitigate the effects of ‘Everyone in the World Knows You’ a bit?”","3. “Senior White, do you still have any Eighth Stage Holy Ape Tail Hair?”","After sending the messages, Song Shuhang nodded in satisfaction.","This felt like making wishes to a deity. He was reporting wishes one, two, and three. However, in a sense, Senior White Two was no different from a deity. He ruled over the Netherworld, the other side of the Heavenly Dao.","“Do you have some misunderstanding about the phrase ‘ruler of the Netherworld’?” Senior White Two’s voice sounded in Song Shuhang’s mind. Did he really think he was a magic lamp for making wishes?","Seeing Senior White Two taking the bait—no, after he replied, he immediately delivered the script he had prepared beforehand.","“Senior White, actually, after my ‘cultivation’ function was recently upgraded, I gained many interesting abilities. One of them is the ‘multi-group chat’ function.”","“And?” Senior White Two said calmly while showing no particular interest in this function.","“After the upgrade, as the ‘server,’ I have considerable authority. When my realm increases a bit more, we can try having the fat ball scan my QR code and see if it can add me to its friend list. Then, I can create a group with just us and the fat ball boss. After that, I’ll mute the fat ball... We can use the group to scold it. What do you think?” Song Shuhang suggested.","Of course, adding the fat ball boss to his friend list was just a plan for now. Currently, Song Shuhang’s realm wasn’t high enough, and he was concerned that after adding the fat ball, it would be like dealing with the shrewd Fairy Cheng Lin.","Therefore, he planned to wait until his realm increased a bit more and the ‘cultivation’ chat system was perfected before adding the fat ball to his friend list. This way, he could secretly track the fat ball through the ‘cultivation’ chat functions, achieving the wonderful effect of ‘know yourself and know your enemy.’","“Interesting. This is quite interesting.” As expected, Senior White Two had endless energy and interest when it came to arguing with the fat ball.","“I’ll think of a way to perfect this plan for you.”","Now that he thought about how the fat ball had been involuntarily pulled into the group and couldn’t leave or even speak, it could only be scolded by him and Song Shuhang—Senior White Two was overjoyed.","“I’ll return to Wenzhou City tomorrow or the day after. During this time, I’ll study with Immortal Fairy Bie Xue to make the inner demon tribulation set meal even more delicious,” Song Shuhang replied.","Whether at home with his parents or outside with his seniors, he had been truly blessed to get to know so many seniors from the Nine Provinces Number One Group, as well as Senior White Two, Fairy Cheng Lin, the Almighty Merchant, Senior Three-Eyed, and a series of other influential figures.","“Sage Monarch Tyrannical Song, have you found an efficient way to deal with Evil Wang?” the monster willow Qing Wu asked after seeing Song Shuhang standing under the tree in thought.","“Here’s the solution!” Song Shuhang smiled faintly.","He opened his Inner World.","The demonic hamster leaped out.","Today, it looked as handsome as ever and wore an even more elegant swordsman’s robe and a red cloak.","“Daoist Ran Zhen, you have become even more handsome after reaching the Fifth Stage,” Song Shuhang complimented him.","“Of course.” The demonic hamster elegantly raised its cloak. “Come on, Supreme Song, give me your hand, and I’ll give it to you.”","The demonic hamster was rendered speechless.","“Get lost!”"]},{"number":2272,"title":"Chapter 2272 Flowing Water Master Song","paragraphs":["2272 Flowing Water Master Song","After the demonic hamster handed over the ring capable of temporarily suppressing the effect of ‘Everyone in the World Knows You,’ as well as a thick book, to Song Shuhang, it rolled up its red cloak and entered stealth mode. Next, it needed to watch and assist from the side—yes, it intended to help Song Shuhang deal with Wang Xie by observing from the sidelines.","If there were more intriguing Evil Wangs, it would naturally emerge and seal them back to its master. If there was nothing noteworthy to collect, it would simply observe from the side and assist Tyrannical Song in tormenting Evil and Extravagance.","The demonic hamster’s cloak was indeed a treasure. Once it entered stealth mode, not even Song Shuhang could detect its presence.","“Shuhang, do you see Fellow Daoist Ran Zhen’s cloak? The red one?” the headless Lady Onion asked.","Song Shuhang was confused.","‘I’m not blind; of course, I see it.’","“Other people’s bosses provide such potent equipment, so don’t show any weakness. Therefore, Shuhang, since you have equipment of this caliber on you, remember to equip me as well. Otherwise, I might embarrass you if I go out. I’m Tyrannical Song’s number one employee,” Headless Lady Onion patted Song Shuhang’s neck and remarked.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","I’m so envious of this level of equipment that I’m drooling. Where can I find a complete set for you?","Furthermore...","“Lady Onion, you’re already an official employee, not a monster pet,” Song Shuhang gently patted Lady Onion. This time, he controlled his strength and didn’t squish her.","What he meant was that employees and pets were treated differently.","Lady Onion was speechless.","She felt that something was amiss. Ever since she regained her freedom and became an employee, why did it seem like her treatment was becoming worse and worse?","For a moment, she hesitated and contemplated whether she should relinquish the hard-won freedom and sell herself as a demon pet once more.","Fortunately, at the crucial moment, her newfound freedom stopped her from making the wrong choice.","Song Shuhang faintly smiled, then opened the thick book.","This book detailed information about ‘evil’ in great detail. It documented the characteristics, weaknesses, methods of restraint, and capture techniques for hundreds of evil illusions. It could be said that this book covered nearly all types of evil commonly encountered.","Moreover, Senior White Two had thoughtfully translated the text into Chinese.","After flipping through a few pages, Song Shuhang couldn’t help but rub his temples.","It wasn’t that he disliked reading. On the contrary, he found every book fascinating and could read with great interest. This book had the potential to make his morning quite enjoyable.","However, according to the book’s records, each evil illusion was unique, and the methods to sense and capture different evil illusions varied.","If he encountered an unfamiliar evil, it would be impractical to use every ‘Evil Illusion Sensing Technique’ from the book simultaneously, right?","Simply standing there and casting thousands of variations of the ‘Evil Illusion Sensing Technique’ would take half a day.","“So, is experience still needed?” Song Shuhang mumbled.","An experienced old hunter and a novice hunter armed only with theory were worlds apart.","However, turning knowledge into experience was a time-consuming process.","“This is troublesome. Is there no way to sense and track all forms of evil?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“Yes, as long as you become strong enough, you can scan with your divine sense, and no evil will be able to hide. In this world, those who are powerful enough enjoy special privileges,” the demonic hamster’s voice echoed. “If you’re not strong enough, think of a way to become as cute as me. Then, you can apply for a special detection magical treasure to lock onto Xie Wang.”","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","I’ve already outgrown the age of ‘cute.’","Regarding the ‘detection magical treasure,’ Song Shuhang thought of something. He touched the Scholarly Sage’s eye in his left eye, wondering if the pendant with the Sage’s eyeball would be useful in the future.","Additionally, knowledge was power.","“Try to commit all the knowledge in this book to memory by morning,” Song Shuhang softly patted the book.","Now, he went to purchase breakfast and wake up his roommates. Qingwu brought them breakfast every day. If she suddenly didn’t bring it today, his roommates would surely be puzzled.","He also wanted to observe how much weight Gao Moumou, Yangde, and Tubo had gained over the past few months.","...","In a residential area near Jiangnan College Town, Ji Shuangxue rubbed her eyes and emerged from her room while appearing somewhat disoriented.","A simple breakfast had already been set on the table.","“Where’s Dad?” Ji Shuangxue inquired while tying her golden hair.","“He’s training outside,” her mother replied. She was playing with their pet cat while casting an amused glance toward the courtyard.","Over there, a middle-aged man with golden hair was vigorously swinging a heavy greatsword. He was engaged in some form of sword technique.","Ji Shuangxue covered her forehead and couldn’t help but shake her head.","Whenever she saw her father immersed in practicing swordsmanship, she would secretly grumble about that ‘Master Song.’","In the past, it was acceptable when her father practiced ‘The Times are Calling.’ After all, it was radio gymnastics that promoted physical and mental well-being.","However, at some point, her father had learned another set of sword techniques from ‘Master Song.’ Upon returning, he started wielding the sword every day and performed sword dances to the crowing of the rooster.","Wasn’t it more enjoyable to practice ‘The Times are Calling’? If that wasn’t suitable, he could even evolve it into ‘Dancing Youth’ or ‘Flying Idea.’","“Mom, why don’t you talk to him?” Ji Shuangxue whispered.","“Why should I ruin his fun?” her mother responded with a smile.","Joseph was from a generation deeply fascinated by Chinese Kungfu culture.","Moreover, practicing swordsmanship wasn’t bad either. At least over the past few months, her husband appeared much more robust.","“You spoil Dad too much,” Ji Shuangxue playfully chided her. “I’ve finished eating; I’m off to school,” she whispered.","“Take care on your way,” Joseph replied without a pause in his sword practice.","[Holy Light, that evil seems worth challenging!] Ji Shuangxue faintly heard her father muttering.","Ji Shuangxue was left speechless.","Don’t tell me that ‘Holy Light’ is part of Chinese Kungfu?","That ‘Master Song’ was truly something else.","However, on second thought, considering how her father incessantly bothered him, causing him to teach her father ‘The Times are Calling’ and this sword technique, she couldn’t really blame him.","She sighed softly and was unable to stay irritated for long. She had inherited her mother’s temperament.","Ji Shuangxue pushed open the courtyard door and ventured outside.","“Eh? Fog?” she wondered in puzzlement.","Beyond her doorstep, thick fog obscured the surroundings. The visibility was barely three meters.","But when she turned around, there was no fog in her home’s small courtyard!"]},{"number":2273,"title":"Chapter 2273 Holy Light Evil-Slaying Sword","paragraphs":["2273 Holy Light Evil-Slaying Sword","Ji Shuangxue found herself utterly perplexed. Why the fog was so thick outside, but in their courtyard, there wasn’t a trace of it? Was her dad’s sword practice so intense it managed to disperse the fog?","A moment later, she vigorously rubbed her face. She felt like her father’s quirks were rubbing off on her. A sword wasn’t some kind of electric fan; it couldn’t generate such powerful wind.","“What’s going on?” Joseph inquired in standard Chinese when he noticed his daughter standing still at the door.","“It’s foggy outside,” Ji Shuangxue replied.","“Foggy? The weather forecast didn’t mention fog today,” Joseph said while stowing away his sword. He looked visibly confused as he walked towards the door.","As they chatted, the fog outside their house grew denser, and visibility plummeted even further. What’s more, the fog seemed to be expanding visibly. The whole situation was starting to feel rather strange, and Ji Shuangxue began to feel a creeping discomfort.","“This is odd,” Joseph said while frowning at the fog. He had experienced major storms and had even witnessed the presence of true ‘experts.’","Joseph retrieved his greatsword and swirled it around in the mist.","Suddenly, an ear-piercing, sharp cry emerged from the fog.","Ji Shuangxue instinctively took a few steps back.","Bang! Bang! Bang!","Heavy knocks came from the neighbor’s house.","A moment later, the voice of the neighbor’s uncle sounded. “Who is it?”","The old iron door of the neighbor’s uncle’s house creaked open. It always made a loud noise when opened.","Joseph wanted to stop her, but it was too late.","“Eh? It’s really foggy, huh?” The neighbor’s uncle’s voice continued.","“Be careful,” Joseph called out. “This fog seems a bit unusual.”","However, his voice seemed to be muffled and didn’t reach the neighbor’s ears.","“No one? Then who was knocking on the door just now?” the neighbor wondered.","Then, the heavy iron door began to close slowly.","Just as the iron door was about to fully close, a surprised cry came from the neighbor.","Then followed the sound of the neighbor falling.","Ji Shuangxue quickly raised her head and called out to her mother, who stood by the second-floor window. “Mom, did you see what happened next door?”","Her mother gently shook her head. The entire house was enveloped in fog, and she could only see their own small courtyard; she couldn’t even see what was happening next door.","“Is this some supernatural event?” Ji Shuangxue couldn’t help but shiver. She had watched a horror movie just yesterday. The memory was still fresh in her mind.","Joseph remained very calm. With one hand, he held his sword and carefully closed the gate with the other. Since the neighbor had screamed and fallen when he closed the door, he needed to be cautious when closing it to guard against whatever was lurking in the fog.","After shutting the courtyard gate, Joseph quickly took out his mobile phone. His master’s phone number was saved in his mobile phone.","However, there was no signal on the phone.","“What the heck?” Joseph muttered.","Now he was certain that something was amiss with the fog outside.","“Let’s go back inside the house for now.” Joseph firmly made up his mind while gesturing for his wife to close all the windows.","Just as Joseph’s wife was closing the upstairs window, there was a loud bang. It sounded like something had hit the glass.","The glass cracked.","“There’s something in the fog,” his wife said nervously.","Joseph held his sword with one hand and protected his daughter as they hurried back into the house. For any normal father, his daughter’s safety was more important than his own life. If something happened to him, that was acceptable, but his daughter must not be harmed.","Ji Shuangxue was ushered back to her room. She massaged her temples and wondered if she was still dreaming.","The sound of knocking on the upstairs window continued relentlessly.","The windows of neighboring houses were shattered. Vaguely, there were also terrified cries, but the cries seemed isolated and distant.","“Have your mother come downstairs; the glass upstairs won’t hold for long,” Joseph instructed decisively.","“Yes/” her father’s composure provided Ji Shuangxue with a sense of security. She hadn’t panicked throughout this ordeal.","Joseph gripped his greatsword tightly.","Mist began to seep into the courtyard.","This scene was like the opening of a horror movie.","“In reality, sometimes truth is stranger than fiction,” Joseph muttered. Perhaps he should consider installing bulletproof glass for their house in Jiangnan in the future.","The fog accelerated its intrusion.","In the blink of an eye, it enveloped the entire courtyard.","Joseph widened his eyes.","At a certain moment, he suddenly sensed a dark shadow in the fog leaping towards him.","“Perfect timing!” Joseph tightly gripped his sword and roared, “Holy Light, that evil seems to be worth fighting! Holy Light Evil-slaying Sword!”","This Holy Light Evil-Slaying Sword was vastly different from the sword techniques practiced by ordinary cultivators. Its technique incorporated the power of the ‘spoken word spirit.’","The stronger the power of the roar, the more the sword’s strength could be harnessed.","On the other hand, if he only recited it silently, the sword’s power would be greatly reduced.","Ji Shuangxue couldn’t help but worry. This “Sword Technique” sounded like a joke, but her father believed in it and was using it against the fog.","Anxious for her father’s safety, she quickly turned around and looked at where her father stood.","The moment she turned, she noticed something peculiar. It was almost like an illusion. She could swear she saw a faint light emanating from her father’s sword.","The greatsword slashed through the fog, radiating a brilliant light.","A wretched cry echoed from within the fog.","It was evident that the ‘thing’ in the fog had been struck hard.","The ‘thing’ in the fog was sent hurtling by the sword and crashed into the courtyard door with a loud bang.","After this powerful strike, Joseph seemed to collapse. Sweat poured from his body like a waterfall. Even the muscles he’d diligently built over the past few months had atrophied in an instant and caused him to lose a significant amount of weight!","To be honest, this method of losing weight was something all the overweight people in the world could only dream of.","In the distant Jiangnan College Town, Song Shuhang, who had just delivered breakfast to his roommates and was quietly reading a book before class, looked up in Joseph’s direction.","“There’s something strange,” Song Shuhang spoke mentally.","A small token hanging at his waist responded telepathically, “[There’s a clash between an evil force and the power of ‘Holy Light.’ However, that holy light seems rather weak.]”","This small token was a shrunken version of Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet.","“Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet, please safeguard my physical body for now,” Song Shuhang requested.","“Don’t worry, I’m here.” words began to shimmer on Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s surface.","In the next moment, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit detached from his body and sped toward the source of the disturbance with astonishing speed. After reaching the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, his primordial spirit was considerably robust and far from its weaker Fifth Stage state.","Simultaneously, he summoned the ‘Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure to accompany his primordial spirit. Lady Onion, perched on Song Shuhang’s shoulder, hesitated for a moment, then reached out to retrieve the ‘Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber,’ having it follow Song Shuhang.","In an instant, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit covered a thousand miles and arrived at the scene."]},{"number":2274,"title":"Chapter 2274 Holding the Sword with Both Hands With No Need to Retreat","paragraphs":["2274 Holding the Sword with Both Hands With No Need to Retreat","After reaching his destination, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit hovered in the air while gazing down.","In this moment, the residential area lay concealed beneath a thick layer of fog. Yet, the ordinary passersby, navigating through the residential area, paid no heed to the fog and continued on nonchalantly.","They couldn’t perceive the fog at all.","Even the sounds originating from within the residential area were trapped by the fog and couldn’t escape into the outside world.","“The world is truly on the cusp of change,” Song Shuhang mused softly.","Within just one day, numerous locations in the Jiangnan area had become infested with malevolent spirits. As per Senior Thrice Reckless’ words, this was at least a foreboding sign for the G Cup.","“I need to investigate.” the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure whirled around Song Shuhang.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber trailed from a distance and joined the ranks of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure to encircle Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit with a cheerful demeanor.","“What brings you here?” Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit gently made contact with the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber emitted a contented hum.","“Let’s venture inside and take a closer look. Otherwise, we won’t be able to discern Evil Claw’s true form,” Song Shuhang said.","The fog below was a smokescreen conjured by Evil Claw, not his actual body.","Evil Claw was rather weak.","With Song Shuhang’s Seventh Stage Venerable level and the protection of his immense power of virtue, he was inherently untroubled by this nascent evil.","Beneath the safeguard of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber and the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure, Song Shuhang plunged into the fog and pinpointed the spot where the feeble holy light had emanated.","At the same time, Song Shuhang briskly recollected the contents of the book bestowed upon him by Senior White Two. He contrasted the knowledge regarding the ‘Evil Evil’ below with the book’s contents and hoped to uncover the true nature of the Evil source.","After his Essence Soul penetrated the array, he swiftly soared toward the coordinates where the faint holy light had manifested.","In the following instant, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit underwent a slight jolt.","Down below, a familiar middle-aged man with golden hair wielded a greatsword with both hands while panting heavily.","It was his chief disciple, Joseph Guy Mobsang.","“Did that holy light just now originate from Joseph?” Song Shuhang regarded Joseph with astonishment.","He had indeed taught Joseph a technique from the ? Holy Light Sword Technique ?—the Holy Light Evil-Slaying Sword.","However, Joseph was already well advanced in years and far past the age for cultivation. With the Holy Light Evil-Slaying Sword in hand, he could manage, at best, a single stance. Logically speaking, he couldn’t cultivate any energy.","Be it the Holy Light or the blood essence of a Foundation Establishment Cultivator, Joseph, in his forties, had no capability to cultivate them.","Yet, Joseph had managed to release Holy Light.","“Reality often eludes theories,’” Song Shuhang remarked with a smile.","Joseph had expended a substantial amount of energy executing the Holy Light Evil-Slaying Sword. Clearly, the blood essence power stored within him had been instantly depleted, even overdrawn.","If his Vitality wasn’t replenished, Joseph would undoubtedly fall gravely ill.","Before Joseph, a ferocious black shadow that resembled a curled-up furball but adorned with massive claws, eyed him warily while remaining by the courtyard door.","This black shadow bore a scar with a trace of Holy Light lingering within it.","Evil Claw roamed the courtyard like a ravenous wolf eyeing its prey.","The dense fog veiled its form and masked its position from Joseph.","Yet, such elementary camouflage couldn’t hope to deceive Song Shuhang.","Evil Claw emitted a shrill cry and lunged at Joseph. However, midway through the attack, it shifted noiselessly to circle around Joseph’s side.","Joseph, in his weakened state, was indeed entranced by the squeak. His attention remained riveted where Evil Claw had been. He was oblivious to the fact that Evil Claw was closing in from the side.","Its sharp, malevolent claws reached out for Joseph’s waist.","“This is outrageous!” Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit’s expression stiffened.","He didn’t hit people in the face, and he didn’t go for kidney shots.","If he couldn’t maintain these standards, how could he be considered truly evil?","Hence, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit’s left eye gleamed as a beam of light swiftly traversed toward Evil Claw.","Although he didn’t possess the Scholarly Sage’s eye, he was already a Seventh Stage Venerable. With his ‘Expert Appraisal Technique,’ even entities below the Seventh Stage Realm would experience a surge of motherly affection.","For this fledgling Evil Claw, its individual quality rated no more than Rank-2. At most, it was a Rank-3.","After the ‘Expert Appraisal Technique’ landed on Evil Claw, it tumbled to the ground with a thud.","Its spherical form swelled and rolled across the ground in agony.","Joseph, on the other hand, keenly detected Evil Claw landing on the ground. He swung his greatsword with all his might toward the source of the impact.","The sword cleaved directly into Evil Claw’s expanding body, a seamless execution. Truly befitting of the legacy of Song Shuhang’s faction.","“Squeak squeak~” Evil Claw wailed repeatedly as it scuttled away frantically.","It cast its gaze upward.","But with its cultivation level, it was entirely incapable of sensing Song Shuhang’s Seventh Stage primordial spirit.","After scrutinizing its surroundings and finding nothing amiss, it lowered its head in puzzlement. The newborn Evil Wang was hardly possessed of profound intelligence.","“Squeak squeak~” At this moment, a series of sounds reverberated from the surroundings.","From the neighboring residence, over ten evil claws soared over and infiltrated Joseph’s courtyard.","These razor-sharp claws formed a collective formation.","Within the small courtyard, the dense fog lifted—a result of Song Shuhang’s ‘Expert Appraisal Technique.’","The skill’s influence was truly pervasive. Not only did it subject Evil Claw to the pangs of affection, but it also directly dispelled the fog concealing an area with a five-meter radius.","As the fog dissipated, Joseph’s countenance stiffened. “D*mn it, I’m a goner now.”","He beheld eleven monstrosities converging on him.","He had exerted himself with every swing, but he hadn’t managed to eliminate a single monster. Now, there were ten more monsters of equivalent strength.","How was he supposed to face this?","Joseph gazed back behind him with a rueful expression.","His family, his wife, his daughter—everything precious to him lay there.","There was no retreat.","He couldn’t retreat.","Even if it meant death, he couldn’t retreat.","Joseph clutched his greatsword with tenacity, but the sensation of feebleness surged within him. The once-mighty greatsword he usually brandished fiercely had transformed into an unbearable weight.","Even his eyelids grew heavy.","“It’s a shame... If only I could learn another technique from Master... If only I could attain the same prowess as Master...” Joseph muttered.","Before him, eleven claws sensed Joseph’s vulnerability.","In an instant, they launched a coordinated assault. Eleven sets of lethal claws aimed to rend Joseph apart.","“Aaah!” Joseph bellowed and mustered all his strength to hoist his greatsword.","[Hold fast, grip your sword tenaciously.] Perhaps it was because he stood on the brink of demise that he experienced a hallucination. Joseph actually heard his master’s voice resounding in his ears.","A droplet of ‘water’ trickled from his parched lips, down his throat, and into his body.","It was as though a new force surged from within him.","His master’s voice echoed once more.","Simultaneously, an invisible force guided his body and compelled him to assume a brand-new ‘sword-wielding’ stance.","Joseph seized the moment and struck out with his sword.","A radiant Holy Light erupted from his blade.","This Holy Light coalesced into a colossal cross, enveloping the eleven demonic claws before him.","It was the second posture of the ? Holy Light Sword Technique ?—the Holy Light Cross Blade.","[Sword Technique: Fight for Glory!]"]},{"number":2275,"title":"Chapter 2275 Fate is More Important Than Anything","paragraphs":["2275 Fate is More Important Than Anything","The holy light gleaming on the greatsword resembled sacred fire in the dark night.","Joseph swung his sword while bathed in the holy light. He was akin to a legendary holy knight.","With the water he had consumed earlier, his depleted energy was swiftly replenished. His body became invigorated. Even the wrinkles at the corners of his eyes faded significantly.","“For glory!” Joseph exclaimed the sword technique.","A massive, dazzling cross-shaped Holy Light Sword Qi enveloped the eleven Evil Claws.","The eleven Evil Claws felt a chill in their hearts. With their current intelligence, they couldn’t comprehend what was happening. Clearly, the guy before them was so weak that he couldn’t even stand. How could he suddenly unleash such a terrifying attack?","They wanted to dodge, but when the ‘Cross-shaped Holy Light’ descended, they were locked in.","Immediately afterward, the cross-shaped Holy Light Sword Qi slashed fiercely onto their bodies, cutting the evil claws into pieces. This time, the eleven Evil Claws didn’t even have time to scream.","Their shredded bodies fell to the ground and crashed into the soil in the courtyard while leaving black marks on the stone floor.","The greatsword in Joseph’s hand hung weakly.","This time, he was completely drained.","The sword Qi dissipated.","However, the holy light didn’t extinguish. It transformed into flames and attached itself to the broken bodies of the Evil Claws and burned them completely, along with their chance to start over.","“How?” Joseph looked ahead wearily.","He silently watched the demon’s corpses as they were burned by the holy light.","Everything that had just happened felt like a dream.","Smack! Joseph didn’t hesitate to give himself a slap.","It hurt... His teeth ached from the slap.","His face was probably swollen.","But it wasn’t a dream; he had really survived!","Being alive was great.","Behind him, Ji Shuangxue and her mother, who had come downstairs, were utterly astonished.","They couldn’t have imagined that Joseph’s daily practice of ‘swordsmanship’ would be so powerful.","The cross-shaped Holy Light Slash was etched into their eyes and couldn’t be erased.","At that moment, as a father and husband, Joseph was like the protagonist in a movie.","“It’s Master! It must be Master,” Joseph declared while holding his greatsword.","Just now, on the brink of death, he had heard his master’s voice.","Even his body had been guided by a mysterious force into a stance where he was about to draw his sword. Moreover, the second move, the Holy Light Cross Blade, was just a “launcher” and hadn’t been executed by him.","This had to be the Chinese martial arts technique of transmitting power through the air. His master had transmitted his strength to him and allowed him to unleash the sword just now!","Joseph looked around, but as he hadn’t even completed the ‘Foundation Establishment’ stage, he couldn’t see Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit.","Was his master was transmitting strength to him from a thousand miles away?","Joseph fell into deep thought.","After the eleven Evil Claws were cut down, the ‘deceptive mist’ that had enveloped the district began to gradually disperse.","Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit calmly watched Joseph.","Joseph was a bit of a miracle.","At over 40 years of age, without reaching the Foundation Establishment stage and relying solely on the first form of the ‘Holy Light Sword Technique,’ the Holy Light Evil-Slaying Sword Technique, he had actually come into contact with the power of Holy Light.","Perhaps it was talent, or maybe a special constitution?","If that was the case... Joseph might be a hidden ‘Holy Light cultivation genius.’","[Come find me.] Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit moved toward the house.","Although he had already missed the age for cultivation, if Joseph truly had the heart to seek the Dao, there was no harm in taking him as a disciple. Perhaps his future achievements wouldn’t be too high, or maybe he would only reach the First or Second Stage Realm in his lifetime.","But it didn’t matter. Fate was more important than anything else.","It would only consume a bit of Body Tempering Liquid and Vitality Pills. Moreover, he knew how to make Body Tempering Liquid himself.","Song Shuhang arrived in front of Ji Shuangxue and her mother, extending his hand to touch their foreheads.","The runes of the Memory Erasing Technique, which he had learned from Senior White, lit up.","“Do you want to erase it?” Song Shuhang’s fingers paused slightly.","Under normal circumstances, to prevent ordinary people from getting involved in the chaos of the Cultivation world, most cultivators would choose to erase their memories in such situations.","It wasn’t necessarily good or bad to do so. Generally, it was the wisdom of countless senior cultivators.","“It doesn’t matter whether it’s erased or not,” the demonic hamster’s voice suddenly sounded in Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit’s ears.","“Can you remind me before you suddenly speak?” Song Shuhang forced a smile.","The demonic hamster’s red cloak was on par with the Almighty Merchant’s original bedsheet. Even in the primordial spirit state, Song Shuhang couldn’t sense the other party.","“I can’t,” the demonic hamster said cheerfully. “After ordinary people are affected by the Evil Mist, they will fall unconscious for a while.”","As soon as it finished speaking, Ji Shuangxue and her mother covered their heads and furrowed their brows.","Then, the two of them fell to the ground unconscious.","“When they wake up, their memories will become blurry under the influence of evil. If one’s constitution is weak, they might even fall seriously ill. If they’re lucky and have a strong physique, they might be able to retain some memory fragments,” the demonic hamster added.","“That works.” Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit nodded slightly.","It would be best if they could remember Joseph’s desperate struggle against the Evil.","Joseph, who stood by the door, heard the noise behind him. He turned around and saw his wife and daughter unconscious on the ground. Panic washed over him.","He dragged his greatsword into the house and locked the door. Despite his panic, he hadn’t lost his senses; he still knew to guard against the possibility of the Evil Claws appearing again.","Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit stepped out of the house. He extended his hand and retrieved a ‘Sage Sealed Wooden Saber’ from his Inner World and buried it under Joseph’s courtyard.","He had originally intended to leave a few coordinates in the Jiangnan area, so leaving one here first seemed like a good idea.","Then, he got up and walked to the neighboring houses.","After being attacked by the clawed demon, the residents of the neighboring houses had fallen into a coma and were weak.","“Fortunately, you arrived a step earlier... If you had come later, all the residents might have been taken away by Xie Wang and vanished from this world,” the demonic hamster said.","As a purebred demon from the Netherworld Realm, the hamster’s Justice Points were in a neutral state. This was a rare find in the Netherworld Realm.","“What kind of claws are these?” Song Shuhang asked.","He had already memorized the contents of the book, but he couldn’t find any information about the Evil Claw.","After all, he had only read less than a tenth of that thick grimoire.","“They’re low-level malevolent spirits. Scientifically, they’re called ‘Evil Claws.’ As you’ve seen, they’re vulnerable to attributes like Morality and Holy Light. These entities lack a fixed habitat, wandering like a herd of beasts,” the demonic hamster explained.","“Have you cleaned them up?” Song Shuhang asked.","The demonic hamster replied, “As soon as the fog dissipates, they’ll be completely cleaned up. That mist is where they hide.”","With matters seemingly under control, Song Shuhang felt at ease."]},{"number":2276,"title":"Chapter 2276 Don’t Mention That Name","paragraphs":["2276 Don’t Mention That Name","“However, normally, these claws appear in groups of hundreds. Was this just a trickle?” The demonic hamster added.","“Hundreds?” Song Shuhang felt uneasy. He extended his divine sense to cover the entire neighborhood. It even penetrated deep into the ground.","Within the range of his divine sense, he couldn’t detect any traces of the Evil Claws.","“Perhaps they were newborns,” he mused.","As they spoke, a flash of saber light entered through the window.","It was the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber. It joyfully spun around Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was puzzled. When had the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber left his side? Wasn’t it always orbiting him alongside the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure’?","“Did you just?” Song Shuhang reached out and patted the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","Buzz ~ The Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber emitted a cheerful saber hum.","It seemed that this saber was indeed responsible for completely driving away the Evil Claws from the neighborhood.","A Dao Artifact was truly remarkable.","Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit extended his right hand. The “Saber Nurturing Technique” landed on the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber.","The sound of the Nine Virtues Phoenix Saber grew even louder.","“Dark path,” the demonic hamster muttered softly.","“This is the Saber Path,” Song Shuhang retorted. It was the Saber Path created by Ancestor Huge Number.","With that said, he approached the unconscious residents and activated the healing spell that came with the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts ‘Combined Magical Treasure’ before applying it to each of the unconscious residents.","Healing was a beneficial skill. It could cure illnesses and neutralize the harm caused by the malevolent fog.","“By the way, Tyrant Song, isn’t it inappropriate to use the Charging Spell on ordinary people?” the demonic hamster remarked.","“Charging Spell?” Song Shuhang was taken aback. “I was using a healing spell.”","“What’s the difference? Do you even know proper healing spells?” the demonic hamster asked.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","This comment struck a nerve.","‘After I successfully cultivate the City-level Lightning Palm, I’ll make sure you witness its terrifying power. You’ll be haunted by nightmares of the City-level Lightning Palm day and night.","Previously, my Lightning Palm already had considerable power. Now, with my advancement to the Seventh Stage Venerable Realm, my Lightning Palm’s power should easily reach ‘Suppression-level Lightning Palm’.","After healing all the unconscious residents in the neighborhood, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit rose into the sky and surveyed the area.","“Aren’t you going to repair those broken windows?” the demonic hamster asked.","“I don’t have the ability to fix glass windows,” Song Shuhang replied. “Besides, I’m not Mother Yellow Mountain. Ensuring the residents’ safety is my priority; others can handle the rest.”","“Weakling. If my master were here, he could restore all the windows to their original state with a snap of his fingers,” the hamster said.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","He felt that the ‘City-level Lightning Palm’ might not be enough. He had to cultivate diligently and strive to produce the ‘Provincial Lightning Palm’ as soon as possible to make the demonic hamster understand the true terror of the lightning technique.","“Let’s go,” Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit flew up. In the blink of an eye, he returned to the dormitory.","“I just flew here with great difficulty, and now I have to fly back,” the invisible demonic hamster said with a sigh. It picked up its toothpick sword and flew back to Jiangnan University Town.","Sword Kinesis Flight was much slower than Essence Soul Fleeing.","At Jiangnan University dormitory, Song Shuhang’s primordial spirit returned.","He slowly opened his eyes. His three roommates were gradually waking up.","“Hey, Shuhang, you’re up early again. What’s for breakfast? It smells so good...” Gao Moumou said.","Song Shuhang closed the ‘Malevolent Knowledge Compendium’ and smiled at him. “Classes are about to start. Hurry and get ready.”","“We have plenty of time. Don’t worry,” Gao Moumou climbed down from the bed.","“Did you gain weight again? When you climbed out of bed, my bed shook,” Tubo said groggily.","Gao Moumou was left speechless.","Aren’t you the same?","Song Shuhang glanced at his three roommates and felt relieved. Just as he had expected, the Monster Willow Qing Wu had taken excellent care of her three roommates.","With Qing Wu around, the three roommates ate healthily and slept well. There was no need to worry about mosquitoes in the summer or temperature in the winter.","Even Yangde, who had rented a house off-campus, preferred to stay in the dormitory most of the time.","After graduation... if his three roommates suddenly left Qing Wu, would they be able to adapt?","“By the way, Shuhang, you seem a little different today,” Tubo suddenly said after brushing his teeth.","[After all, I’m not Qing Wu.] Song Shuhang smiled faintly. “I was reading a book today, so maybe I’ve been influenced by its contents.”","“No, I mean when I saw you today, I kept wanting to call you Tyrant Demon,” Tubo said.","“Me too, but I kept wanting to call you Tyrant Scholar,” Gao Moumou added.","Yangde was speechless.","“Yangde, what about you? Do you feel the same way?” Tubo asked.","An awkward smile appeared on Yangde’s face. “Like you, Tubo, I’ve been wanting to call him Tyrant Demon.”","Forget Tyrant Demon and Tyrant Scholar, why did they keep wanting to call him ‘Tyrant’?","Song Shuhang’s heart twitched as he looked at the ring on his little finger.","The ring’s effect was still active, so the ‘There’s no one in the world who doesn’t know you’ effect should have been suppressed.","[The battery is running low. When I gave you the ring, it already had low battery], the demonic hamster’s voice rang out again, and one could faintly hear that it was panting.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","So, should I recharge it?","“Let’s go, let’s go. It’s time for class,” Yangde said loudly. He didn’t want to bring up the topic of ‘Tyrannical Song’ again, so he forced himself to steer the conversation.","Song Shuhang laughed and followed Yangde’s lead.","At the same time, he rubbed his right hand on the ring and used the Charging Spell to recharge it.","...","...","The first class of the morning began.","Song Shuhang and his three roommates took their usual seats.","Afterward, Song Shuhang cast a simple illusion on the book and made it appear as a textbook. During class, he diligently memorized the contents.","Simultaneously, he made his treasured saber, Broken Tyrant, invisible and flew on it to patrol the university town in search for any lurking Evils.","Broken Tyrant conducted its patrols.","He did not find any, but Song Shuhang did spot a few interesting figures.","Three individuals with runes hanging from their shoulders stealthily infiltrated Jiangnan College Town using invisibility spells.","“Is it alright for us to sneak in like this? They say this is that person’s dojo, where he trained in the mortal world,” whispered a thin youth.","“We’re just here to look for Evils. Sage Tyrannical Song shouldn’t mind, right?”","“Don’t mention that person’s name. You’ll get pregnant! Moreover, this is that person’s dojo. If you mention his holy name, he will definitely sense it.”","In the air, the treasured saber, Tyrannical Song, trembled slightly.","Should I grant the wishes of these three fellow cultivators? Song Shuhang wondered to himself."]},{"number":2277,"title":"Chapter 2277 Song Shuhang, The Expert In The Theory Of Evil And Fantasy","paragraphs":["2277 Song Shuhang, The Expert In The Theory Of Evil And Fantasy","“Brothers, you’ve already mentioned that person’s name,” complained the slender and small monster hunter, Zhang Xiaofan.","“Can’t you be more careful? Haven’t the monster hunters suffered enough songs?”","Upon hearing this, the two older monster hunters stiffened up.","“Lu Feng, you idiot. I’ve already reminded you repeatedly before we left that you must never mention that person’s Sage Name. Why did you mention it again?” The monster hunter who said ‘mentioning names will make you pregnant’ whispered in a low voice.","“But I didn’t mention pregnancy; you were the one who mentioned the keyword,” Lu Feng retorted.","“Why don’t we retreat today? I feel like there are already eyes watching us,” Zhang Xiaofan suggested softly.","They might have already been targeted by Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","Furthermore, the two brothers beside him were the type who cultivated behind closed doors. Other than capturing demons, they did not know anything else and were very stubborn.","If this continued, they might be taught a lesson by Senior Tyrannical Song before they even saw any evil, let alone get rid of it.","The monster hunter who mentioned ‘pregnancy’ pondered for a moment before saying in a deep voice, “Why don’t we go directly to Senior Tyrannical Song?”","The monster hunter named Lu Feng shook his head and said, “If you want to go, go. Even if I jump down from the building, I won’t be caught dead with a so-...”","He almost called out that person’s holy name again.","The slender monster hunter, Zhang Xiaofan, sighed. “I have a suggestion. Let’s not sneak in like this. Since that person is training in the mortal world, then we will enter with proper identities. This way, as long as we don’t cross the line, there won’t be any problems.”","“Official identity? Transfer student?” Monster Hunter Lu Feng pinched his chin.","Zhang Xiaofan looked at Lu Feng, who had a big beard, and said after a while, “You could play around with a few identities. You can be an audit student, an exchange student, or something similar. You can even be a cleaner or a nurse. I’ll go and handle it.”","The three invisible monster hunters temporarily retreated.","Song Shuhang sighed speechlessly.","Just now, he really considered becoming a ‘wishing lamp god,’ but he thought better of it and decided to give up for now.","The target of these three monster hunters was hiding in Jiangnan College Town.","Perhaps they could be of help.","However, he still had to remind them not to go overboard, especially when the monster willow Qing Wu was still rooted in the forest.","Therefore, Song Shuhang reached out and gently touched the space between his eyebrows.","The divine third eye was activated.","His thoughts were transmitted directly into the minds of the three monster hunters through his divine third eye, allowing for remote data transmission.","The three monster hunters, who had quietly retreated and were preparing to enter the school with proper identities, suddenly froze.","The moment they stepped out of the school gate, an extremely majestic and terrifying thought appeared in their minds.","That intent was boundless and boundless, like the universe.","In the face of that will, they were like inconspicuous dust in the infinite universe.","The three monster hunters almost couldn’t handle it.","Fortunately, this terrifying thought did not have any malicious intent. It was simply transmitting a few messages to them.","[In the forest behind the male dormitory, there is a monster willow tree. That is Sage Monarch White’s pet. Don’t disturb her. Occasionally, there will be a little onion monster wandering around the school. That’s my employee, so don’t have any ideas about her. If you see a hamster riding a flying sword, don’t have any bold thoughts. Otherwise, no one can save you.]","When monster hunters faced ‘demons’, they would have a boiling impulse. However, as time passed, the monster hunters of the current era were different from the monster hunters of ancient times. This kind of impulse could already be suppressed.","After the message was transmitted, the majestic will was withdrawn and dissipated.","The three invisible monster hunters were relieved of a heavy burden. They panted heavily, and sweat poured down like rain.","Zhang Xiaofan, who had the weakest cultivation, had to lean against the wall to barely stand firm.","[Willow Tree Monster, Onion Monster, Hamster Monster.]","“Was that thought just now Profound Sage Tyrannical Song?”","“It’s too terrifying. It was like staring into a bottomless ocean.”","“Looks like the rumors are true...Profound Sage Tyrannical Song isn’t an ordinary Profound Sage. He is a peak Tribulation Transcender who is currently practicing his own ‘Dao,’ and he could step out of his own Dao at any time and become an Immortal.”","The three monster hunters looked at each other and nodded lightly.","“However, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song didn’t stop us from entering Jiangnan University Town. The message just now was equivalent to allowing us to enter,” Zhang Xiaofan said.","That’s why he warned them not to touch the three pets living in Jiangnan University.","“Go back first and prepare your identity before coming in. But when the time comes, don’t go overboard,” Zhang Xiaofan added.","After resting for a while, the three monster hunters recovered a little and quietly retreated.","The morning classes ended. Song Shuhang closed the book in his hand. After one morning, he finally memorized all the contents.","He even went through all the methods to expel and seal the evil in his mind.","Now, he was more or less an expert in theory.","Next, it would depend on the practical effect.","“Shuhang, what are you thinking about? Time to eat.” Tubo shouted.","Song Shuhang smiled and waved his hand. “Shall we order takeout this afternoon?”","Gao Moumou was puzzled.","Song Shuhang, who had been saying ‘pay attention to the nutrition of food intake’ recently, actually chose to order takeout?","“Recently, I have a... My good friend has opened a restaurant nearby. I’ll see if I can order takeout.” Song Shuhang said.","Chu Chu was cultivating at Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s place, so it was a good opportunity for her to practice.","Song Shuhang took out his phone and opened the chat software.","Then, he habitually opened the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","The group chat was just as lively today.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator: [No, it won’t work. My disciples can only fly when they go out now.]","Fairy Susu was the one who came out of seclusion with Celestial Guest in the Cloud. She was the vice sect leader of the common people path.","What were the seniors talking about?","Song Shuhang’s finger quickly swiped across the chat log, and he quickly browsed through it.","[More evil spirits again?]","There were even evil spirits appearing near some cultivator sects.","Some of these evil illusions were easily dealt with by cultivators, but some unpopular ones could not be solved in a short time.","On the common people’s path, a strange river appeared.","This ‘Great River Evil Wang’ had suddenly appeared and started circling around the protective formation of a common people’s path sect.","Sealing spells were ineffective against this Great River Evil Wang.","What’s more, it possessed a remarkable ability to recover swiftly after suffering spell attacks, and it even developed resistance to similar spells over time.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin while quickly comparing the information he had with the description of the Great River Evil Wang."]},{"number":2278,"title":"Chapter 2278 Shuhang, Is Your Account Hacked?","paragraphs":["2278 Shuhang, Is Your Account Hacked?","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, there was ongoing chatter.","“Have you found any information about the previous appearance of the Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue’s Cup?” Medicine Master asked.","Medicine Master had recently switched to voice input. He felt that his Mandarin was quite standard, but he often made mistakes when converting it into text. It would be better to let Riverly Purple Mist call for him while he enjoyed some leisure time.","“I haven’t found any records of such an entity among the evil apparitions that have appeared in the last few hundred years. I’m still looking into it. Give me some time. I think I might have a lead,” replied Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue.","Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue was the most knowledgeable member of the Nine Provinces Number One Group. When the members faced challenging problems, they often turned to him.","“I’m so exhausted; I want to retire,” Huang Shan said. “I did find a record of something similar to Evil Wang, but it only briefly mentioned it. It didn’t describe how Evil Wang was dealt with. About seven hundred years ago, a similar evil entity appeared along the Mediterranean coast. Even a Fifth Stage Spiritual Emperor-level spell attack proved ineffective against it. Senior Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue. Could you look for any relevant records from 700 years ago?”","“I’ll go search for information from that time period,” replied Sage Monarch Seventh Cultivator of True Virtue. “By the way, have any of you tried to contact Fellow Daoist White?”","“Senior White still hasn’t replied,” Fairy Dongfang Six replied.","“Speaking of which, could it be that this Evil Wang is very peculiar, and Senior White’s talent for avoiding disasters and seeking fortune has activated?” Young Master Phoenix Slayer suggested.","Susu, concerned for the common people, responded, “Young Master, don’t scare me... So far, this River Evil Wang hasn’t done anything else. It’s just circling around the sect’s protective array and preventing people from crossing the river. Our common people’s path is just an ordinary sect and can’t handle it.”","“Fairy Susu, could you take a picture of this thing and send it over?” Song Shuhang typed in the group chat. As he followed Gao Moumou and the others back to the dormitory, he rapidly typed on his phone. A cultivator’s heightened senses ensured he wouldn’t meet with accidents while using his phone.","While Song Shuhang had browsed the chat logs earlier, he couldn’t find a photo of it.","“I have several pictures here; I’ll send them to you now,” Fairy Susu replied.","“No, Senior White is in the Beast Cultivation World. Therefore, she might not be reachable on her phone... You guys can go to the Nine Provinces Number Two Group that I created and try contacting Senior White through it,” Song Shuhang suggested.","Upon hearing Song Shuhang’s reply, True Monarch White Crane was in high spirits.","Huang Shan was feeling exhausted. He quipped, “If Song Shuhang hadn’t brought this up, I wouldn’t have remembered that I’m the leader of the Nine Provinces Number Two Group due to the Wielder’s Small Black Room. I’ve intentionally avoided thinking about the Nine Provinces Number Two Group.”","Now that Song Shuhang had mentioned it, Venerable Yellow Mountain’s heart began to ache.","Northern River’s Loose Cultivator spoke up. “I tried, but the second group is still in the process of upgrading. There are three days left until the upgrade is completed.”","“Eh? Why is it upgrading again?” Song Shuhang entered the ‘cultivation’ chat feature.","[Added ‘Virus Alert’ function module. Estimated upgrade time: three days.]","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Right, he had asked Lady Long Luo to add the virus warning function at the last minute to prevent the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball from launching a long-range attack on him.","At this point, Fairy Susu had already sent the photo to the group and also sent a private message to Song Shuhang. She included additional characteristics of Big River Evil Wang.","This river exhibited ghostly characteristics. Upon entering, no matter how deep one went, they would return to their original position after turning around. However, as long as they flew past it, they would remain unaffected.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin and contemplated these photos and clues.","A moment later, with detailed information and photos in hand, he swiftly matched the data he had in mind with that of Big River Evil Wang.","“It should be the one. The Broken Dragon Evil Wang, formed by the severed dragon vein, has the same shape and characteristics. Now, how do I deal with it...” Song Shuhang retrieved the information from his mind.","At the same time, he sent a voice transmission to the hamster. [Senior White Two gave me the ‘Evil Science Tome.’ Can I share it with others?]","[You can do whatever you want. To us, fighting that nuisance is just a relatively fun thing to do in the main world. We just need to bring back a few interesting cases to the Netherworld Realm for experiments,] replied the demonic hamster.","[That’s great.] Song Shuhang nodded.","He knew this would be the response, but it was courteous to inquire cautiously. After all, the ‘Evil Science Tome’ contained knowledge about Evil, along with many sealing techniques. It could be considered a ‘cultivation technique.’","Venerable Song responded, “[Susu Cares for Common People], Fairy Susu, if I’m not mistaken, this river should be the Broken Dragon Evil. It formed over a long period after someone severed the dragon vein representing providence. Because it embodies ‘providence’ in itself, dealing with it can be a bit tricky. Ordinary spells aren’t very effective.”","“So, how do we handle it?” Fairy Susu quickly inquired.","“The simplest method is to use a force that exceeds its limit and destroy it in one fell swoop. Alternatively, you can find a fellow cultivator with extraordinary luck and have them stand within the ‘Broken Dragon Evil Illusion,’” replied Song Shuhang.","“Throw Senior White in?” Immortal Master Copper Trigram quipped.","“Would it be effective to toss in a picture of Senior White?” True Monarch White Crane suggested.","Fairy Susu was worried for the common people. She added, “But, Song Shuhang, what if Senior White gets in contact?”","“Don’t worry, Fairy Susu. The Broken Dragon Evil Wang originally formed from the dragon vein. You can use the Golden Needle Dragon Sealing Array, which seals the dragon vein, to initially restrict it. This way, it won’t grow rapidly, and it will also pin Xie Wang down without replenishing its strength, weakening it further,” Song Shuhang explained.","The Golden Needle Dragon Sealing Array was a fifth-grade sealing formation typically used to restrict dragon veins or spirit veins. Many cultivators were familiar with it.","“I know the [Golden Needle Dragon Sealing Formation]. I’ll try it immediately. Thanks, Venerable Song!” Fairy Susu replied, then logged off to make the attempt.","Song Shuhang smiled faintly.","Ah, this felt good!","This was the feeling!","The sensation of being a dependable senior was incredibly satisfying!","Once Fairy Susu successfully halted the river, he could send a green onion shoot to her flying sword to see if it could break the river.","Lady Onion was someone confirmed by Senior Three-Eyed to possess the ‘potential of a Heavenly Will Wielder.’ Daoist Priest Scarlet Heaven had also nurtured Lady Onion as the future Wielder of the Will.","This green onion shoot carried the fate of the Heavenly Dao and should be able to suppress the river.","“By the way, Shuhang, did your account get hacked?” Cave Lord Snow Wolf suddenly inquired.","Song Shuhang was confused."]},{"number":2279,"title":"Chapter 2279 Nothing Else Matters, I Just Want to Know If It’s Edible","paragraphs":["2279 Nothing Else Matters, I Just Want to Know If It’s Edible","Senior Snow Wolf’s words felt like they’d taken a big bite out of Song Shuhang’s heart. He couldn’t help but think that if he ever faced a heart demon in the future, it would probably be related to his desire to become a great senior. It would most likely have a slightly bitter yet memorable taste.","As he pondered this, Song Shuhang suddenly found himself feeling a sense of anticipation.","The inner demon tribulation was a formidable obstacle that very few cultivators could avoid in their cultivation journey. No matter how unwavering one’s Dao heart was, there was always the possibility of mental demons interfering. He was unlikely to be an exception.","**********","Their lunch break passed quickly while eating and chatting. Lunch consisted of practice dishes prepared by Chu Chu. These dishes were obtained through Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s ‘Abyss Eater’ using the coordinates stored in the ‘Sage-Sealed Wooden Saber.’ These practice dishes primarily used ingredients with very little spiritual energy and were not perfect as Chu Chu was still honing his culinary skills. They were not meant for sale to outsiders and were exclusively reserved for Song Shuhang.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue didn’t charge any fees for these practice dishes. In return, Song Shuhang had left some portions of the ‘Red-Braised Heavenly Tribulation’ and the ‘Sealed Third Stage Heavenly Tribulation’ as offerings, which effectively opened up a new avenue for Immortal Fairy Bie Xue’s culinary exploration.","At the moment, she was deeply engrossed in studying the ‘Braised Heavenly Tribulation’ recipe. The more she delved into it, the more she appreciated the bold creativity of the senior who had created this recipe. Only a true Immortal Chef could grasp the profound insights behind this recipe and appreciate the genius of its creator.","Song Shuhang, not being a culinary expert, couldn’t fully comprehend this sentiment.","Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was now considering the complete ‘Heavenly Tribulation’ recipe in Song Shuhang’s possession. For an Immortal Chef, it was second nature to examine the full picture while enjoying a single dish.","This was why Immortal Fairy Bie Xue was eager to fulfill Song Shuhang’s minor requests.","...","...","The afternoon classes soon began. On his way to the classroom, Song Shuhang’s divine sense detected a familiar face—Zhang Xiaofan, the skinny monster hunter. This time, he had followed proper procedures and enrolled as an auditing student at Jiangnan University Town. As an audit student, he could attend classes of his choosing without actually participating in them, making it convenient for him to investigate any traces of Xie Wang.","However, Song Shuhang hadn’t expected Zhang Xiaofan to randomly pick the same classroom where Profound Sage Tyrannical Song attended his afternoon classes.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but smile. It seemed like fate was at play.","He discreetly activated the ring given to him by Senior White Two to suppress the ‘Everyone in the World Knows You’ effect.","Upon spotting Zhang Xiaofan, Song Shuhang made an effort to avoid drawing his attention and entered the classroom quietly through the back door with his roommates, trying to keep things low-key.","Gao Moumou asked, “Do you have any plans for tonight, Shuhang?”","Just then, Yangde interjected, “It might be best for you to stay in the dorm and avoid going out. I just received news that a mysterious incident occurred in a neighborhood near Jiangnan University Town. Many residents’ windows and doors were smashed, and they all fell unconscious. The crime scene is quite close to the university town, and it might be related to some criminal gang. Stay cautious.”","Song Shuhang paused momentarily. It sounded like it was near Joseph’s neighborhood.","Today, Joseph would have settled his wife and daughter, so he would probably try to look for Song Shuhang tomorrow or the day after, right?","‘Oh, speaking of Xie Wang, how was Fairy Susu’s ‘Broken Dragon Xie Wang’ progressing?’","Song Shuhang took out his phone and checked his messages.","Around 1 p.m., Fairy Susu had messaged him. She had followed Song Shuhang’s method and used the ‘Golden Needle Dragon Sealing Array’ to handle the Evil Illusory Dragon Breaker. As expected, the Evil Illusory Dragon Breaker, which had been slowly growing, froze in place. It was no longer expanding or moving.","In fact, the frozen Broken Dragon Evil Wang had already begun to weaken slowly. The process, however, was gradual. Without intervention, it would likely take eight to ten years for this Broken Dragon Evil Wang to dissipate completely.","Fairy Susu was currently contemplating ways to contact Senior White and see if she could invite him as a guest to their common people sect.","At the same time, she had asked Song Shuhang for his address. She intended to send him a thank-you gift.","“Thanks, the more ordinary, the better,” Song Shuhang thought.","The compensation he had planned to offer to the Shadow Lord had already been spent. Now, he needed to find a way to make some money and settle his debts.","After some contemplation, Song Shuhang messaged Fairy Susu, “Fairy, is it convenient for you to receive a flying dagger message?”","“Daoist Shuhang, are you finally online? I can receive flying sword messages at any time. By the way, can you also provide me with your address?” Fairy Susu responded promptly.","“I just finished class and didn’t check my phone during class,” Song Shuhang explained with a smile.","Fairy Susu seemed puzzled. “???”","“I’ll send you a flying sword message with a treasure of great fortune to see if there’s a way to break that Broken Dragon Evil Illusion. I’m afraid that the treasure will wither and lose its effect if I’m too late,” Song Shuhang replied. At the same time, he sent the address of Medicine Master’s house.","Lady Onion’s green onion sprout had been accidentally cut off by him not long ago, so it was still fresh. This was the perfect time to send Fairy Susu a flying dagger message.","After agreeing on the coordinates, Song Shuhang shot the treasured saber Broken Tyrant toward Fairy Susu’s common people path.","Broken Tyrant had the imprint of Divine Weapon Mirror on it.","After the treasured saber Broken Tyrant arrived at its destination, Song Shuhang could use spatial teleportation to directly jump to the location of the common people path.","When the time came, he would bring the hamster along and see if the Broken Dragon Evil Illusion was delicious... No, it was to see if it was qualified to be chosen by Senior White Two."]},{"number":2280,"title":"Chapter 2280 Head Pats","paragraphs":["2280 Head Pats","In fact, it was the same for Immortal Fairy Bie Xue.","Ever since Song Shuhang had come into contact with the “Heavenly Tribulation Recipe,” his outlook on life had opened a new door.","Now, whenever he encountered something strange, he couldn’t help but lean towards the topic of ‘is it delicious?’ If even heavenly tribulations could be eaten, why couldn’t other things be?","After bidding farewell to the Treasured Saber Broken Tyrant, Song Shuhang quietly returned to the dormitory from the balcony and comfortably lay on the bed to rest for a while.","“Hey!” At this moment, the headless Lady Onion suddenly leaped up from the bed and kicked Song Shuhang’s face with her slender feet.","Song Shuhang glanced at her from the corner of his eye but remained indifferent.","Sometimes, indifference could be the most hurtful.","Lady Onion kicked Song Shuhang’s face with all her might, and then... She squatted down in pain and let out a soft cry of pain.","Both physically and psychologically, Lady Onion was hurting.","Song Shuhang asked via telepathy, “What got into you?”","“Where did you send my green onion sprouts?” Lady Onion waved her small fists and said.","“Eh? Did you notice?” Song Shuhang was slightly stunned. He had avoided Lady Onion.","“The hamster told me.” Lady Onion couldn’t take it anymore, so she fiercely and gently kicked Song Shuhang’s face. She didn’t dare to use too much force, as she would be the one getting injured if she did.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","One day, he would skewer that hamster through its heart.","Due to the incident near Jiangnan University, his three friends stayed in the dormitory tonight, playing games and chatting.","He hadn’t experienced such simple happiness in a long time, allowed Song Shuhang to relax both physically and mentally.","At 10 PM, Qing Wu turned invisible and appeared on the balcony while waving at Song Shuhang.","After Song Shuhang sensed her presence, he excused himself to get up and go to the balcony to open the window.","“Did something happen? Did Evil Wang appear?” Song Shuhang asked softly.","“No, Evil Wang have not appeared,” Qing Wu shook her branch. “But it’s already 10 o’clock, and it’s time for Gao Moumou and the others to sleep.”","Song Shuhang was confused","He looked at the time.","It was 10 o’clock sharp.","That’s right, it was 10 o’clock. It was the time when he and his roommates were most awake and lively.","How strict was this schedule?","“Going to bed early and getting up early is good for your health,” Qing Wu reminded him. Besides, this was also the time when she needed to absorb the moonlight essence.","Therefore, every 10 o’clock, she would release a special fragrance to encourage her three roommates to sleep early.","Song Shuhang turned around and looked at his three roommates speechlessly.","Sleeping early and waking up early is good for your health.","“Go ahead.” Song Shuhang nodded.","Hence, Qing Wu quietly entered the room and began to release her fragrance.","“Eh? Is it that time again?” Gao Moumou scratched his head, feeling sleepy.","Over the past two months, the three of them had developed a good habit—they would involuntarily feel sleepy every 10 o’clock. They slept like logs through the night.","Not long after, the three friends finished their activities.","They yawned, washed up, and went to bed.","The monster willow Qing Wu waved her branch at Song Shuhang with satisfaction and quietly left.","Song Shuhang returned to the dormitory and looked at his bed. The headless Lady Onion was also asleep.","The dormitory fell silent.","Song Shuhang felt a little uncomfortable.","A moment later, he stood up and walked to Gao Moumou’s bed and stretched his hand out to gently touch Gao Moumou’s head.","He didn’t have a habit of patting people’s heads.","The reason for doing this was because there was an important thing he needed to verify.","It went on for a while.","“Goodness, this won’t do. I have no idea how to test it at all,” Seventh Stage Venerable Song sighed.","As a Seventh Stage Venerable, he didn’t even know about such a small matter. He felt guilty.","“I have no choice but to try something else,” Song Shuhang’s right glove opened and revealed his fingertips.","The secret appraisal technique was activated.","The cost was paid.","The cost of appraising Gao Moumou was really insignificant. A small scratch appeared on Song Shuhang’s finger. It was the kind that didn’t even break the skin.","This meant that Gao Moumou was only worth this much.","At the same time, the appraisal results were sent back to his mind.","“Gao Moumou, male, Jiangnan University student. [Cultivation aptitude: Weak] [Remark 1: He has completely missed the golden age for cultivation. His vital yang has been drained, and his cultivation aptitude is weak.] [Remark 2: Unless he defies the heavens and changes his fate, it will be difficult for him to break through to the First Stage Realm in his lifetime.]”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","In other words, even if Gao Moumou was given a top-notch cultivation technique and resources, he would at most reach the First Stage Realm. The path of cultivation was merciless in this regard.","As for defying the heavens and changing fate, not even Immortals could do it. Unless... Heavenly Dao intervened! It was just like how Senior White Two had used the power of Heavenly Dao to draw a Golden Core dragon pattern for him.","However, the current Heavenly Axiom would be lucky if it didn’t crush this little squirrel to death. How could it change the fate of his friend?","Song Shuhang withdrew his hand and went to Tubo and Li Yangde’s sides while using the secret appraisal technique to check their aptitudes.","“Lin Tubo, male, Jiangnan University student, not a virgin. [Cultivation Aptitude: Poor.] Note: Same as above.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Tubo was actually in a worse state than Gao Moumou. His cultivation aptitude was ‘poor.’","“Li Yangde, male, Jiangnan University student, not a virgin. [Cultivation Aptitude: Medium to Weak] Note: Same as above.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","The three roommates in the dormitory were all in the categories of ‘poor,’ ‘weak,’ and ‘medium to weak’ aptitude.","If there was another category like ‘strong and weak,’ would it just take up all the ‘weak cultivation talent’?","Weak, weak, weak.","After thinking about this word repeatedly, Song Shuhang suddenly realized that he couldn’t recognize the word ‘weak’ anymore.","“What are you doing?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet asked.","“I’m testing the cultivation aptitude of my roommates. Although they missed the golden age of cultivation, I still hope that they have some cultivation talent. Then, I can help them. After all, I’m more or less a Venerable now,” Song Shuhang sighed.","Unless he had the authority of Heavenly Dao and could help them... Even his own parents and the people he valued had changed their fates.","At this stage, he was powerless.","“They missed the golden age of cultivation, so there’s no possibility of them cultivating. From ancient times until now, I have seen so many cultivators. Those who truly became great started cultivating from a young age. If they only started cultivating after becoming adults, they would be dreaming if they wanted to achieve anything,” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet said.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“Stone Stele, No. Tyrannical Song only started cultivating this year,” the demonic hamster’s voice rang out wearily. It wasn’t the body that was exhausted, but the soul.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","“Senior White reminded me earlier that I should make some arrangements for the main world when I have time. I thought it would be easy...” After saying this much, Song Shuhang opened the Nine Provinces Number One Group and contacted Senior Yellow Mountain.","“Shuhang, is there something you need?” Senior Yellow Mountain replied.","“Senior Yellow Mountain,” Song Shuhang said, “I would like to borrow a batch of ‘smurfs’ from you. I only need to borrow about 30 of them.”","He planned to use these 30 accounts to create three groups.","Then, he added the three roommates into the group.","As for the outcome, it would depend on his roommates’ luck."]},{"number":2281,"title":"Chapter 2281 Meticulous Senior Yellow Mountain","paragraphs":["2281 Meticulous Senior Yellow Mountain","“What are you up to?” Venerable Yellow Mountain asked.","Why would Senior Yellow Mountain be suspicious of me?","It must be a misunderstanding.","After all, just a few months ago, Senior Yellow Mountain had given him a generous red envelope as a token of appreciation for his reliability.","“Here’s the deal, Senior Yellow Mountain. I plan to use these thirty accounts to create three separate groups,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Do you think I’ll block you?” Venerable Yellow Mountain retorted almost immediately.","Song Shuhang was left dumbfounded.","“Senior Yellow Mountain, you’ve got it all wrong. I’m creating these three groups for a legitimate purpose. I’m thinking that since I’ve already reached the Seventh Stage Realm, I want to handle some important matters involving people I care about in the mortal world. Apart from my parents and relatives, there are friends who matter to me. For instance, my three dormitory mates have rather poor cultivation aptitude... So, I want to create a group and bring them in and find a way to subtly introduce them to the world of cultivation,” Song Shuhang quickly explained. He intended to use his own experiences as a guide and provide his three roommates with an opportunity to connect with the world of cultivation. In the future, he could offer them a larger stage for growth. Of course, it all depended on his roommates’ efforts and dedication.","Venerable Yellow Mountain heaved a sigh of relief. “Alright... You’re still the same. You truly embody ‘loyalty and affection.’”","At least he wasn’t entirely hopeless. Venerable Yellow Mountain continued, “Furthermore, after you create these groups with your secondary accounts, what’s your plan? You can’t rely on controlling all these accounts and having conversations with yourself indefinitely, can you?”","“I’m thinking of getting a batch of substitute puppets to populate the groups. I also have a few helpers in my Inner World, such as the adorable lamia, Fairy Creation, and the lively Soft Feather with her ebony skin. My ghost spirit can pitch in as well,” Song Shuhang replied. He had many pendants that could lend a hand. Together, they could simulate a group chat with around thirty members. He’d also think of a way to attract more puppet accounts to increase the group’s activity.","Venerable Yellow Mountain said, “By the way, do you need water puppet substitutes for the group? I happen to have a batch here, and I can lend them to you temporarily. You just need to leave a trace of your consciousness in these water puppets, and they’ll act based on your thoughts. These substitute puppets were created by me when I was learning the craft. While they can’t be used in combat, they can handle some simple tasks.”","Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude. “Thank you, Senior!”","Senior Yellow Mountain had always been a reliable senior in his heart. The Nine Provinces Number One Group couldn’t afford to lose Senior Yellow Mountain as he was the backbone of the group and one of the few sane voices.","Senior Yellow Mountain added, “However, I’m not lending you these ‘puppets’ for free.”","In the Nine Provinces Number One Group, the principle was that if you wanted to gain something, you needed to provide something in return.","“Senior, I’m currently short on funds... Could you extend me credit for now?” Song Shuhang chuckled and guiltily patted his empty pockets. The ‘One Charge Gold Strike’ and Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet’s ‘God-Subduing White Day’ had left him penniless. He had an opportunity to acquire some spirit stones from Young Master Phoenix Slayer, but he had exhausted his funds on the Gold Digging Strike and missed out on the spirit stones.","Senior Yellow Mountain replied, “Didn’t Fellow Daoist Eternal Fire give you a considerable number of spirit stones some time ago? That should be sufficient, right?”","Song Shuhang sent a ‘wry smile’ emoji and explained, “I’ve spent all my funds. Did everyone forget that I was sealed in the Wielder of the Will’s small black room a few days ago and battled waves of formidable foes? I burned through all my spirit stones.”","Senior Yellow Mountain was speechless.","“Don’t worry, I don’t need your money,” Senior Yellow Mountain reassured him. “Next month, in the middle of January next year, I plan to form a team and venture into the depths of the universe to challenge a ‘spirit transformation relic.’ Currently, I lack a strong defensive member, so I thought of you.”","He had great confidence in the defense capabilities of his Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ Combined Magical Treasure, the Impregnable Holy City.","“Furthermore, your life-bound magical treasure is a combination of the Thirty-Three Divine Beasts’ ‘Equipment.’ It’s extremely rare to get them all to birth artifact spirits. When the opportunity arises during our exploration, make sure to capitalize on it,” Senior Yellow Mountain advised.","Though he mentioned some compensation, Senior Yellow Mountain was essentially offering him a great fortuitous encounter.","Song Shuhang responded seriously, “I’ll make all the necessary preparations, Senior Yellow Mountain.”","“That’s good; you understand what I mean.” Senior Yellow Mountain concluded, “Give me your address, and I’ll have someone deliver them to you.”","Song Shuhang supplied his address, indicating, “I’m currently in Jiangnan University Town.”","“Why did you return to school? Well, you don’t have much time left here, considering your current cultivation level,” Senior Yellow Mountain pondered. “Indeed, you should cherish this time. One last reminder: When activating the puppet, it requires spirit stones. You can’t expect the puppet to operate on thin air, right?”","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but sigh.","He vowed that when he became powerful enough, he would research puppets that could function without requiring spirit stones and make them accessible to impoverished cultivators.","Senior Yellow Mountain added, “I’ve also sent you a document containing the chat account usernames and passwords.”","After a short while, Senior Yellow Mountain forwarded a document to Song Shuhang.","It contained nearly three hundred account credentials.","Among these three hundred accounts lay Daoist Priest Cloudy Mist’s tears."]},{"number":2282,"title":"Chapter 2282 I’m Feeling Lucky","paragraphs":["2282 I’m Feeling Lucky","Song Shuhang randomly chose three accounts from these 300 accounts.","[True Monarch Red Plum]","[Eastern Moonlit Night]","Among the 300 accounts, there were all sorts of names, genders, and ages.","“These names will do,” Song Shuhang said softly.","He wanted to use these three accounts to create three different chat groups and make them the group leaders.","Among the three accounts, the daoist name ‘Swordsman White Pill’ sounded particularly interesting. Song Shuhang was prepared to memorize these three daoist names so that he could use them if he needed to ‘change his identity’ in certain scenarios.","The gentle moonlight shone through the window.","Song Shuhang turned on his computer and logged into the account of the White Blade Swordsman.","For some reason, he felt a little nervous logging into this account. It was a heavy name.","After logging in, Song Shuhang first created a group name with a random number before adding 93 accounts to the group in one go. He was going to divide these accounts into three groups.","Moreover, the 300 accounts had already added each other as friends, so most of the heavy lifting was already done.","“What should we call the group?” Song Shuhang looked at Gao Moumou.","When Gao so-and-so was in the game, he definitely could not use this group name made up of random numbers...He had to change his name.","Song Shuhang’s fingers swiped on the keyboard.””Why don’t we... Nine Provinces Number Three Group?”","No, no, no. The Nine Provinces (Number) Group should be organized into a series, and the group owner must be Senior Yellow Mountain.","In the future, there might be Nine Provinces Number Three Group, Number Four Group, and Number Five Group, but they shouldn’t be used here.","In that case, he would create a group name that suited Gao Moumou’s personality.","“Cultivation writer exchange group? Immortal script group? A group of martial artists and movie actors?” Song Shuhang pondered over Gao Moumou’s style and tried his best to come up with an idea.","In the end, he tapped his fingers on the keyboard and typed in a group name that suited Gao Moumou’s style the most, [Poets...].","He had thought it through. He would use the outer layer of ‘Wuxia’ to package the inner core of ‘Cultivation’, so that he could get in touch with his three roommates. After all, compared to the legend of riding the wind and riding the sword, things like martial arts were more acceptable.","With Gao Moumou’s personality, he would definitely be able to accept a group name such as this.","Next, he had to use the White Blade Swordsman account to add Gao Moumou as a friend. After that, he added him to the group of ‘Pugilistic World Paintings.’","Song Shuhang opened the friend search function and entered Gao Moumou’s chat account.","After finding Gao Moumou’s account, Song Shuhang pressed ‘Enter’ and sent a friend request. With a light tap, Gao Moumou would embark on the extraordinary path of cultivation.","It was just like how Venerable Yellow Mountain had added Soft Feather as a friend when he had entered the wrong account number.","The moment he tapped his finger lightly, it would be the turning point of Gao Moumou’s life!","Just as he was thinking about this, the page changed.","A [Friend Verification] window popped up.","If he wanted to add Gao Moumou as a friend, he needed to verify three questions.","Question 1: Hello everyone, thank you for adding me as a friend.","Question 2: But I’m really sorry.","Question 3: My friend list is full. There isn’t any room left. Please forgive me.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","His fingers froze.","He had not thought of this possibility.","These three friend verification questions clearly showed that Gao Moumou didn’t want to add him as a friend anymore.","Song Shuhang raised his head and looked at the sky.","‘I’m such an idiot.’ he thought.","The series of ‘plans’ in his mind had died in the womb before he took the first step.","The script seemed like it had potential, but the actors were not following the script at all.","“Should I be glad that I didn’t do this ‘friend verification’ back then?” Song Shuhang thought to himself.","If he had done the same thing as Gao Moumou back then and created three ‘friend verification’ functions or activated the ‘reject friend’ function, things would have been different now.","The moment Senior Yellow Mountain was stopped by the questions and realized that he had added the wrong person, Song Shuhang would no longer be able to join the Nine Provinces Number One Group.","Song Shuhang shuddered at the thought.","The thought of not getting to know Soft Feather, Su Clan’s Sixteen, Senior Medicine Master, and Senior White in that particular order as well as the seniors of the Nine Provinces Number One Group was terrifying. He felt as if his heart was being twisted into knots by two invisible hands.","Was he going to have a heart demon?","That’s just great.","“I can’t be wrong. This is definitely the starting point for the birth of my ‘inner demon’!’ If I didn’t join the Nine Provinces Number One Group, if things continued to develop normally, there was an 80% chance that it would become my inner demon.” Song Shuhang turned on his phone and recorded this information.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was speechless.","This guy takes overthinking way too far.","“But... It’s great that I can join the Nine Provinces Number One Group,” Song Shuhang said gently.","My account number was only one digit away from Soft Feather’s. That was great.","It was great that Senior Yellow Mountain didn’t kick me out of the group.","Encountering Su Clan’s Sixteen’s Heavenly Lightning Tribulation of the Fourth Stage was truly wonderful.","It was great to be able to see the pill formula that Senior Medicine Master had sent out.","It was great that the seniors had arranged for him to pick up Senior White.","He had died over and over again and endured the extreme pain of the world. It was extremely bitter, and it was fortunate that he could survive every day.","Did he regret it? No.","From the time he typed on the keyboard and spoke for the first time in the Nine Provinces Number One Group until now, Song Shuhang had never regretted his choice.","“Senior Yellow Mountain, it’s great that I can join the Nine Provinces Number One Group. Thank you for not kicking me out of the group back then.” Song Shuhang took out his phone and sent a message to Senior Yellow Mountain.","Venerable Yellow Mountain was dumbfounded and sent a string of questions.","‘Did he overdose on something?’ he thought.","“Speaking of which, Senior Yellow Mountain, what kind of divination did you perform? What made you decide to keep me here?” Song Shuhang asked curiously.","He had always been curious about this matter, but he had never had the chance to ask.","There was no better time to ask it then now.","What kind of divination was it that made Senior Yellow Mountain decide to leave him, an ordinary person, in the Nine Provinces Number One Group and grant him great fortune?"]},{"number":2283,"title":"Chapter 2283 In Fact, I Calculated Three Hexagrams","paragraphs":["2283 In Fact, I Calculated Three Hexagrams","Song Shuhang was very curious to know what exactly Senior Yellow Mountain saw.","He had been online just a moment ago, and his messages were usually instant.","“Hmm? What’s going on?” Song Shuhang wondered.","Senior Yellow Mountain had been silent for quite some time, so it was unlikely that he had lost connection. Song Shuhang began to speculate about Senior Yellow Mountain’s thoughts. Was it a sensitive question?","But then, what could be the reason that Senior Yellow Mountain wouldn’t want to reveal the results of the hexagram? Was there some hidden secret within it?","On the other side of things, inside his immortal cave, Venerable Yellow Mountain had a serious expression on his face. His finger was sliding through his friend list. He tapped on Song Shuhang’s profile picture, pulling out the ‘delete friend’ option. At this moment, it seemed like he was struggling and making a decision in his heart.","He was genuinely considering it.","At the same time, Doudou stealthily entered Venerable Yellow Mountain’s room in search of something to eat. As soon as it entered the room, its sharp eyes saw Venerable Yellow Mountain pointing at Song Shuhang’s profile picture and clicking on the ‘delete friend’ option.","Doudou was shocked.","Stupid Yellow Mountain was actually on the verge of deleting him as a friend!","Had the sky fallen?","Had Song Shuhang met an unprecedented end?","Doudou quickly left Venerable Yellow Mountain’s room and sent an urgent message to Song Shuhang. “Shuhang, what did you do to push Yellow Mountain to this point? This is the first time I’ve seen him in such a state.”","Song Shuhang was dumbfounded. “I didn’t do anything. I haven’t even been active in the group today. In fact, during the day, I helped Fairy Susu resolve a crisis involving the ‘Broken Dragon Evil Fantasy.’ I was full of positive energy.”","Wait a minute... Could it be because I asked about the hexagram just now?","After replying to Doudou, Song Shuhang had a thought.","“How could that be possible? If you didn’t do anything, why would Huang Shan open your profile picture and even open the ‘delete friend’ option? He had a solemn expression on his face as he seemed to be seriously considering this matter,” Doudou quickly typed.","“What?” Song Shuhang’s heart was in turmoil.","What was hidden in that hexagram? It actually made Senior Yellow Mountain contemplate deleting him as a friend.","Could it be that the hexagram was related to some dark history that Senior Yellow Mountain didn’t want to reveal. Was it similar to Senior White’s ‘long hair’ issue?","If he didn’t save himself soon, Senior Yellow Mountain might really delete him as a friend or even block him.","“Senior Yellow Mountain, I suddenly value the power of mystery.”","Venerable Yellow Mountain was stunned.","“The more mysterious it is, the more intriguing it feels. I asked for the truth earlier, but I was not thinking clearly. I don’t want to know what the divination was about. It’s because I’m already a part of the Nine Provinces Number One Group. Thanks to the seniors, I’ve gained the great fortune I have today. I have no regrets in my heart.” Song Shuhang’s fingers moved rapidly and left afterimages.","“Well, you have a point,” Senior Yellow Mountain replied.","Song Shuhang finally heaved a sigh of relief. It seemed like he had temporarily passed this test.","This way, he could still quietly stay in Senior Yellow Mountain’s friend list and be a junior cultivator.","Just as he was deep in thought, Senior Yellow Mountain suddenly replied, “I didn’t respond to your message for quite some time. You should have guessed something, right? After all, you are quite meticulous, and your deductive abilities are quite good.”","When Song Shuhang saw these words, he was actually quite touched. He didn’t expect Senior Yellow Mountain to have such a high opinion of him.","“Senior Yellow Mountain, what are you talking about?” However, he still replied quickly.","“It’s alright. There’s nothing to hide now,” Venerable Yellow Mountain said slowly.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Why did it feel like Senior Yellow Mountain was about to spill some secrets?","“Back then, when I was deciding whether to keep you in the Nine Provinces Number One Group, I performed three hexagram divinations in a row,” Venerable Yellow Mountain continued.","Song Shuhang was slightly stunned.","Three hexagrams?","Senior Yellow Mountain had been so cautious when deciding whether to allow him, a mere university student, to stay in the Nine Provinces Number One Group?","“The first hexagram was related to divine birds and trees,” Venerable Yellow Mountain continued.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin and pondered for a moment. Divine bird + tree... It clicked!","“Phoenix and parasol tree?” he quickly replied.","“Yes, so the first hexagram represented that you were reborn from the ashes. Your subsequent experiences matched the first hexagram. You were the most diligent fellow cultivator I’ve ever seen. Moreover, after you joined the Nine Provinces Number One Group, you indeed went through a rebirth. This hexagram means that you have a fateful connection with the group,” Venerable Yellow Mountain replied.","Song Shuhang was at a loss for words.","“The second hexagram is related to time and symbolizes day and night,” Venerable Yellow Mountain continued.","Song Shuhang furrowed his brow and pondered. It had something to do with time.","White and black.","“Could it be Senior White?” Song Shuhang suddenly had a flash of inspiration and asked.","“Yes... That was exactly the case. At that time, I thought that this divination was related to Fellow Daoist White. So, when I read your fortune, I decided to keep you here. I even assigned you the task of bringing Fellow Daoist White out of seclusion,” Venerable Yellow Mountain revealed.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","“What about the third hexagram?” Song Shuhang asked curiously.","“The third hexagram is related to turning around, lights, and people. In fact, I still haven’t fully understood the third hexagram. I don’t comprehend its meaning. That’s also the reason why I hesitated about how to explain it to you,” Venerable Yellow Mountain said in a deep voice.","Song Shuhang fell into deep thought again.","Turning around, lights, people?","This divination was indeed difficult to explain.","“However, even though I didn’t manage to decipher the third hexagram, the first two hexagrams were enough for me to keep you here,” Venerable Yellow Mountain said with a faint smile. He raised his teacup and took a sip of immortal tea.","“I see... Thank you, Senior Yellow Mountain, for clearing my doubts.","By the way, Senior Yellow Mountain, I want to add my roommate using my alternate account, but he recently set up a friend verification. Do you have any suggestions on how to add him naturally?” Song Shuhang asked.","“If you can’t solve the problem through conventional means, you can use some minor mystical techniques. Be flexible in using your identity as a cultivator,” Venerable Yellow Mountain advised.","“Understood. Thank you for your guidance, Senior,” Song Shuhang said.","“You’re welcome,” Venerable Yellow Mountain replied.","The interaction between the senior and junior went smoothly.","After ending the conversation with Senior Yellow Mountain, Song Shuhang took out a piece of white paper and wrote down the insights.","Divine Bird + Tree.","Day + Night.","Turning Around + Lights + People.","These three hexagrams were definitely not as simple as Senior Yellow Mountain had described. If the answers were as straightforward as he had mentioned, Senior Yellow Mountain wouldn’t have contemplated deleting him as a friend."]},{"number":2284,"title":"Chapter 2284 A Godly Green Onion Shoot","paragraphs":["2284 A Godly Green Onion Shoot","People are naturally curious creatures. They were always driven by a desire for knowledge. When the answer they seek is just a page away, their eagerness to uncover it only intensifies. This insatiable curiosity has been a driving force behind human development.","“Halfway through, I almost started believing it myself,” he mused silently.","He cast a glance behind him. If things went as expected, Doudou should have secretly contacted his friend Song Shuhang by now. Venerable Yellow Mountain had raised Doudou from the beginning and could predict the kind of trouble the canine was about to cause. He knew that Doudou’s intelligence would lead it to discreetly reach out to Song Shuhang.","Because he was aware that Doudou would definitely contact Song Shuhang, Venerable Yellow Mountain had gone along with the flow and described the three hexagrams to Song Shuhang. If everything unfolded as planned, these three divinations would undoubtedly baffle Song Shuhang for some time.","“Well, clever little creatures like him won’t easily buy into the answers I provided.” Venerable Yellow Mountain thought.","The young man’s surplus of energy and thirst for knowledge would surely drive him to seek deeper truths.","“It’s good to be young,” Venerable Yellow Mountain said softly.","Moreover, regardless of what truths Song Shuhang might uncover, he would never have the opportunity to personally verify them. Without verification, it was impossible to confirm whether something was truly the ‘truth.’ It was a rather disconcerting thought.","In Jiangnan College Town, Song Shuhang gazed out of the window while lost in thought. It was already the early morning of December 5th.","“It’s arrived!” he suddenly exclaimed.","“What’s up?” came the drowsy voice of the hamster. It seemed to have been awakened from its slumber by Song Shuhang’s abrupt declaration.","Song Shuhang gave a faint smile and said, “The flying dagger I sent to Fairy Susu yesterday has reached its destination.”","“The term ‘flying dagger messenger’ almost makes it sound like you’re planning to stab Fairy Susu. ‘Flying sword messenger’ definitely has a better ring to it,” the hamster quipped while still half-asleep.","Song Shuhang was speechless. “Is it really necessary to interpret my words like that?”","Just then, his phone screen lit up with a message from Fairy Susu. “Fellow Daoist Song, I’ve received your ‘flying dagger,’ but it seems to be empty.”","Song Shuhang clarified, “No, there’s something there. Oh, I forgot to mention, Fairy, take a closer look. There should be a green onion sprout attached to the treasured saber. It’s an incredibly auspicious treasure.”","Fairy Susu was bewildered. If it weren’t for Song Shuhang’s insistence that she use the Golden Needle Dragon Sealing Formation to freeze the ‘Evil Broken Dragon,’ she might have assumed he was playing a prank.","“Fairy, try using this ‘green onion shoot’ inside the ‘Broken Dragon Evil Wang’ to see the effect. It’s an extraordinary green onion, so it should be potent,” Song Shuhang advised her.","Upon hearing this, Fairy Susu nodded and chose to trust him. “I’ll give it a try now.”","In a distant Common People’s Path, Fairy Susu stowed away the treasured saber Broken Tyrant and secured it at her waist. Then, she clutched the green onion shoot between her fingers and made her way toward the location of the Broken Dragon Evil Wang.","“I have a plan that I’m going to test. This Broken Dragon Evil Wang is quite peculiar, and I’m not entirely confident. I’ll need to try various methods,” Fairy Susu explained calmly. By stating this, her credibility would remain intact regardless of whether she succeeded or failed.","Fairy Susu extended her delicate hand, directing it toward Broken Dragon Evil Wang. Rather than simply tossing the ‘green onion shoot’ into the void, she decided to use a spell that wrapped the core of the spell around the green onion shoot.","“What kind of spell is this?” the common people path disciples guarding the formation wondered aloud.","“Could it be a new spell developed by the Deputy Sect Master?” one disciple speculated.","“Go!” Fairy Susu commanded.","A brilliant beam of light surged from her hand and carried the green onion shoot with it. It plunged into the river of Broken Dragon Evil Wang.","Boom!","The seemingly formidable light beam disappeared like a clay ox in the sea as soon as it struck Broken Dragon Evil Wang. Within a few breaths, the pillar of light vanished entirely.","However, Broken Dragon Evil Wang remained unaffected.","“Did it fail?” Fairy Susu pondered.","“Even though it’s been frozen, this Big River Evil Wang remains incredibly formidable,” the common people path disciples lamented.","Just as they discussed this, a green light suddenly appeared at the center of the Broken Dragon Evil Wang.","With the green light as the epicenter, Broken Dragon Evil Wang was forcibly pushed back.","Fairy Susu’s eyes sparkled with delight.","The green onion shoot had not disappointed her!","The sound of rushing water seemed like a tidal wave as the river parted.","It was as if someone had sliced through it!","The waters surged to the left and right and parted to reveal the dry land beneath.","The Common People’s Path, previously sealed off by water, was now an open passage to the outside world.","“It worked, it worked!” cheered the common people path disciples.","Fairy Susu beamed.","After contemplating for a moment, she ventured into the path where the river had been ‘split.’","There, an inconspicuous green onion shoot emitted a faint green glow.","“I owe you another favor,” Fairy Susu murmured softly. Then, she produced a magical seal and gently placed it next to the green onion shoot and used it to safeguard the precious plant.","As long as the green onion shoot remained intact, the waters would stay separated.","“No one is to touch the magical seal or the stone pillars,” Fairy Susu ordered as she turned slightly.","The common people path disciples behind her nodded in agreement.","They understood that the green light was what separated the waters. Unless they were foolish, they would never touch or harm the green light.","With a slight nod, Fairy Susu turned and swiftly returned to her immortal cave to report the matter to Fellow Daoist Song Shuhang.","This green onion shoot was truly miraculous!","Upon receiving Fairy Susu’s feedback, Song Shuhang nodded in approval.","Indeed, Lady Onion possessed an extraordinary fortune!","Next, he would need to rigorously train Lady Onion and prepare her for a future among the top contenders for the Heavenly Dao.","He also decided to contact Senior White Two.","“Senior White, are you interested in the Broken Dragon Evil Wang?” Song Shuhang inquired through their mental connection.","“I’m more interested in the head,” Senior White Two replied cryptically.","Song Shuhang was perplexed.","Then, he suddenly had a flash of inspiration and looked down at the paper.","The third hexagram was: Turn your head + lights + people.","Could it be that the answer to the third hexagram was Senior White Two?"]},{"number":2285,"title":"Chapter 2285 The Calamity of the Remaining Forces of the Heavenly Court","paragraphs":["2285 The Calamity of the Remaining Forces of the Heavenly Court","If the ‘head’ represented Senior White Two, then ‘person’ must symbolize him. After all, he was currently the only human Senior White Two has encountered. Not every human had nerves as robust as his when facing the ruler of the Netherworld. So, what does ‘light’ stand for?","“Are you ready?” Senior White Two asked.","Song Shuhang was pondering the puzzle when Senior White Two’s question caught him off guard. He responded instinctively, “Ready? Oh, the lights!”","Senior White Two was left momentarily speechless.","A few moments later, Senior White Two replied, “I will fulfill your request.”","Suddenly, several colorful lights bathed Song Shuhang’s body.","Song Shuhang blinked in confusion. “What’s happening?”","The hamster emerged from its invisible state. It puffed up its cheeks and frantically rubbed its paws. Seven-colored light radiated from its claws and enveloped Song Shuhang.","As a demon of the Netherworld, the hamster cultivated the pure evil energy of that realm. It had exerted all its strength to convert this pitch-black evil energy into seven colors.","“Would this be the ‘light’?” Song Shuhang muttered.","Then, an unusual force wrapped around his neck—it was the power of a curse.","It crossed through space and constricted around his neck, twisting it slightly.","Song Shuhang’s neck emitted a crisp sound as it rotated 180 degrees like an owl’s.","“Ah! It’s broken, it’s broken! It’s about to snap!” Song Shuhang whispered frantically. He was careful not to wake his three sleeping roommates with his screams. His capacity to vocalize his distress was severely restricted.","Up to this point, Song Shuhang still had no idea why Senior White Two had suddenly twisted his neck. What had happened?","“When did you become so skilled at this? How many times has your neck been twisted?” Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet couldn’t help but inquire.","“This is only the second time. The first time was when Miss Turtle’s father tried to cast a spell but failed,” Song Shuhang replied as he gingerly touched his neck. “It’s mainly because not too long ago, I lost my chastity under the ‘heavenly punishment.’ It left me only my head. At that time, I accumulated quite a bit of experience. A Heavenly Punishment is really terrifying. Besides death, there’s no way to escape it.”","He wished he could figure out how to deal with the heavenly punishment in the future. That way, he could make it a topic of discussion among cultivators. If coming into contact with it too often resulted in misfortune, did that mean eating it every day would lead to chronic indigestion?","“Don’t think about devouring everything. I don’t want to see you die one day because you ingested something you shouldn’t have during your resurrection,” Senior White Two cautioned.","“Don’t worry, Senior White. Regardless of what I eat, I’ll always be cautious,” Song Shuhang replied confidently. His desire to stay alive was still going strong in this regard.","“Take care of yourself... Lately, the fat ball has been in a somewhat complicated state. It’s likely related to the changes in the current Heavenly Dao. Be cautious,” Senior White Two reminded him.","Song Shuhang inquired further, “Senior White, do you have any ideas about how to break that seal of yours?”","Senior White Two responded, “The seal is still the same... and rather comfortable, I might add. If I wanted to break it, it would require effort. In short, be more cautious with your actions for now.”","With this, Senior White Two withdrew his presence.","Song Shuhang looked at his hands.","Last time, when he was frantically trying to apply the Saber Nurturing Technique to Senior White Two’s seal, it seemed to have some effect. However, the moment he stopped practicing the Saber Nurturing Technique, the seal immediately became hostile.","Was there a way to enhance the effects of the Saber Nurturing Technique apart from the ‘hair palm’ technique and potentially free Senior White sooner?","“What’s on your mind?” The demonic hamster reappeared. It perched on Song Shuhang’s table and spat out a fruit from its cheek. It started nibbling away.","Song Shuhang observed its cheeks which were bulging with food. He hadn’t expected the demonic hamster to store food in its cheeks like a regular hamster.","“What are you up to? Don’t even think about my cheek-stored snacks,” the demonic hamster warned him.","Song Shuhang playfully poked the hamster’s head with his finger and said, “I’d never take food from your cheeks no matter how desperate I am. I was just wondering if there’s any way to enhance the effects of the Saber Nurturing Technique aside from the ‘hair palm’ technique to speed up Senior White’s release from the seal.”","“It’s rare for you to think about my master. How about I reward you with a fruit?” the hamster proposed.","“Thank you, but that won’t be necessary,” Song Shuhang declined.","He then took a moment to recollect Senior White Two’s warning. The fat ball boss had been in a strange state lately. It was likely connected to the changes in the current Heavenly Dao.","“Eh? Didn’t Senior White Two mention that I’d be resurrected at his place if I eat something bad?” Song Shuhang suddenly looked at the hamster.","Was there a resurrection array for me in the Netherworld Realm? Did Senior White Two secretly prepare a backup resurrection plan?","“Yes... If you don’t resurrect yourself, you might become a demon of the Netherworld Realm after death,” the hamster replied while rolling its eyes.","Song Shuhang scratched his head.","Resurrected as a demon of the Netherworld?","Maybe it was best not to go down that path for now.","*Ding.* Hint: A friend list member from the Ancient Heavenly City, Dragon Fist Jialan, has met their demise."]},{"number":2286,"title":"Chapter 2286 Becoming a God","paragraphs":["2286 Becoming a God","[Ding~ Notification: Member ‘Jinhudao Ren’ of the ‘Ancient Heavenly Court’ in your friend list has died.]","[Ding~ Notification: Member ‘Cai Wu Wang’ of the ‘Ancient Heavenly Court’ in your friend list has died.]","[Ding~ Notification: Member ‘Tianwai Han Xing’ of the ‘Ancient Heavenly Court’ in your friend list has died.]","It was as if his notifications had gone on a spree. Four death notices rang in Song Shuhang’s mind in rapid succession.","These friends in his list were the high-profile remnants of the Ancient Heavenly Court. These were heavyweights who had targeted him back when he was in the world of beast cultivators. They were, at the very least, Profound Sages armed with Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender magical treasures, and some of them were even Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders themselves.","Back then, he had added them to his ‘friend list.’ Using his divine third eye, he had forcefully injected a wave of ‘junk information’ into their brains and formed a ‘fate’ bond with them.","Once Song Shuhang had emerged from the ‘Wielder’s Small Black Room,’ they had silently remained in his friend list.","Now, four members of the Ancient Heavenly Court, each possessing the power of a ‘Tribulation Transcender,’ had met their end in quick succession. This had occurred despite the protection of Zither Master Fengyi, who possessed Immortal-level power!","What had happened to the remnants of the Heavenly Court’s ‘Guangting Faction’?","Could it be Senior White’s doing?","No, given Senior White’s style, it felt more like he would suggest sending the members of the Heavenly Court to the ‘Wielder’s Small Black Room’ for safety.","Or perhaps the old subordinates of the ‘Venerable Sovereign’ had launched another attack on the remaining members of the Heavenly Court? Or could it be that the ‘Venerable Sovereign’ had truly been resurrected?","Song Shuhang furrowed his brow.","In any case, the first order of business was to find a way to contact Senior White.","“Madam Long Luo, has the ‘cultivation’ upgrade been completed?” he inquired mentally.","“It will take another day and a half for the upgrade to be completed. If Administrator Tyrant Song needs to contact someone, you can directly use the ‘Strengthening Message’ function,” Madam Long Luo reminded him.","“Thank you for the reminder,” Song Shuhang said as he retrieved Senior White from his list and inserted a drop of energy.","“Senior White, are you still in the beast cultivator world? Has something happened in the world of beast cultivators?”","After a brief pause, Senior White replied, “Recently, I’ve been gathering the evil energy of the Netherworld in the world of beast cultivators, preparing to locate that black stone tablet... Afterward, I got absorbed in researching something significant, so I didn’t pay much attention to what was happening in the world of beast cultivators.”","Song Shuhang was momentarily speechless.","‘Senior White, what are you researching?’","Senior White was engrossed in something important. Meanwhile, four Profound Sages and Tribulation Transcenders from the Ancient Heavenly Court had just died in quick succession.","If one were to link these two seemingly unrelated events together, it might spell trouble. Could Senior White have accidentally triggered some catastrophic event while conducting his research in the world of beast cultivators?","“I feel like you’re worried about something strange, but don’t fret. What I’m researching isn’t anything perilous,” Senior White reassured.","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but recall how Senior White would comfort him similarly every time he tinkered with household appliances. It was always the same reassurance, and Senior White would use it again after successfully fixing the appliances.","Senior White was truly a master of consistency.","“I’m studying how to become a ‘God,’” Senior White disclosed.","This time, it was Song Shuhang’s turn to be flabbergasted.","Become a god? For ordinary folks, beings capable of soaring through the skies and wreaking havoc with a mere gesture were already considered gods. In the realm of cultivators, only the ‘Heavenly Dao’ was comparable to the concept of a ‘god.’","“Senior White, are you planning to contend with the heavens?” Song Shuhang asked.","“Shuhang, it seems you’ve been a bit too audacious lately. No matter what you think, you always attribute things to the ‘Wielder of the Will.’ The ‘god’ I’m researching and aiming to become is more akin to the Shadow Overlord. I’ve recently stumbled upon some clues and am in the process of deducing and constructing theoretical formulas. I believe the feasibility is extremely high,” Senior White clarified.","“I’m not being audacious, Senior. It’s just that you mentioned wanting to become a ‘god,’ so I naturally applied the ‘Wielder of the Will’ template to the concept of a ‘god,’” Song Shuhang explained.","However, the fact that Senior White was investigating the Shadow Overlord and even referred to it as a ‘god’ was somewhat unexpected.","“I still need some time to delve deeper into my research. Did something happen in the world of beast cultivators?” Senior White inquired once more.","“To be precise, something unexpected occurred among the remnants of the Ancient Heavenly Court. Four Profound Sages or Tribulation Transcenders died suddenly,” Song Shuhang replied.","He wondered if these Profound Sages and Tribulation Transcenders had any means of resurrection.","“Did you do it?” Senior White swiftly asked.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","‘Senior White, do you think I’m capable of that?","You know me better than that.’ he thought.","“Then, while I’m collecting the Netherworld’s evil energy and conducting experiments, I’ll keep an eye on it for you. I’m still in the world of beast cultivators anyway,” Senior White responded.","Song Shuhang replied, “No need, no need, it’s primarily a matter concerning the remaining members of the Heavenly Court, and it doesn’t have much to do with us. You don’t have to expend your energy on it. Nonetheless, something about this situation seems strange. Please take care of yourself, Senior White.”","“Alright, understood. Actually, I’ve been quite safe all along. If there’s any danger, I’ll make a swift retreat,” Senior White assured.","After concluding his conversation with Senior White, Song Shuhang extended his hand and picked up the ancient language book.","The dead of night was an excellent time for study.","Beneath the moonlight, the demonic hamster kept the young scholar company as he earnestly delved into his studies.","After flipping through a few pages of the book, Song Shuhang suddenly raised his head as a thought occurred to him. Why not inquire directly with someone involved in the Ancient Heavenly Court about the situation?","Even though he had four high-level members of the Ancient Heavenly Court on his friend list, he still had many other friends to reach out to.","Song Shuhang opened his list and found the Ivory Trigram Tooth Fairy.","“Senior Tooth Fairy, what has happened there?”","“Tyrannical Song? Cheng Lin? Don’t come over; it’s heavenly punishment... The heavens are targeting our secret realm. The moment anyone steps even half a foot outside the secret realm, they’re struck by heavenly punishment, and there’s no escape,” the tooth fairy swiftly replied.","Song Shuhang was stunned.","He was well aware of the power of heavenly punishment.","Unless the ruler of the Netherworld entered the main world, heavenly punishment rarely made an appearance.","“What did you do to incur heavenly punishment?” Song Shuhang inquired.","“We didn’t do anything, but heavenly punishment descended inexplicably. The heavenly secrets are in turmoil, and I can’t calculate anything,” the tooth fairy responded, clearly distressed.","Song Shuhang leaned back in his chair, organizing the information in his mind.","He systematically extracted each piece of information.","Members of the Heavenly Court had been inexplicably targeted by heavenly punishment.","The authority of the Heavenly Dao was waning, and malevolence was spreading throughout the world. It had caused it to crumble in some unknown corner.","The fat ball boss from the Netherworld had exhibited peculiar behavior.","The Celestial Thearch had warned him that absorbing her Dao would put him in a perilous situation.","The Dao of the Ancient Heavenly Court was a plan to allow the Heavenly Dao Ball to complete itself.","The clues were beginning to form a clearer picture.","“Could it be that the Heavenly Dao has begun to break through and is forcefully reclaiming the Dao of the Heavenly Court to repair itself?”"]},{"number":2287,"title":"Chapter 2287 Let’s All Die Happily Together","paragraphs":["2287 Let’s All Die Happily Together","“Do you guys have a resurrection array?” Song Shuhang inquired once more.","After sending her response, contact was cut off.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","This woman dragged a long trail of sins behind her.","Hold on a moment. Previously, Cheng Lin turned off her communication devices. Even private chats were rerouted to the formidable Striped Dragon. Had she already received this information and was evading the heavenly punishment?","But that didn’t make sense. Hadn’t Fairy Cheng Lin already ‘withdrawn’ from the Heavenly Court’s Dao? Why would she need to hide?","After pondering for a moment, Song Shuhang sent another message to the Tooth Fairy. “If your resurrection array is hidden in another world outside the secret realm, you might still have a way to avoid the heavenly punishment. Only the ‘deceased’ can elude it. Therefore, before you get obliterated by the heavenly punishment, find a way to ‘die.’ This is the only method I’ve personally tested to escape the heavenly punishment. Please try it!”","There was another option, which involved Senior White Two intervening and using his unique technique to completely separate the head from the body and create two distinct entities. Then, the body could bear the brunt of the heavenly punishment while the detached head sought a way to revive. However, this plan required Senior White Two’s assistance, so it had to be abandoned.","Senior White Two wouldn’t risk entering the range of the heavenly punishment for the sake of a group of Heavenly Court members.","The ruler of the Netherworld was not a savior.","After ending the conversation with the Tooth Fairy, Song Shuhang continued scrolling through his friend list.","As he scrolled, his attention landed on the name of his ‘scoundrel friend.’","After a moment’s thought, he clicked on ‘friends’ and sent a message. “The current ‘Heaven’ is forcibly reclaiming the Heavenly Court’s path. Be cautious.”","From various perspectives and standpoints, it seemed that the Heavenly Emperor hadn’t been absorbed by the ‘big shot of the Heavenly Dao Ball.’","[Ding!* Your ‘scoundrel friend’ Heavenly Emperor has transferred 1 point of energy to you.]","“Senior Song, this is today’s energy share. I’ve received the news. Even in exciting times, I’ll exercise caution. Additionally, Senior Song, you should watch out for your own safety. Your pendant, the fragments of the Heavenly City you’ve collected, and the fact that you’ve absorbed my Dao Fruit have left you marked with the scent of the ancient Heavenly City. You might end up on the heavenly punishment’s list, just like I have. So, take good care of yourself!”","Song Shuhang couldn’t help but shake his head.","Could his luck really be this bad?","But wait, he needed to avoid undue overconfidence. People often hoped they wouldn’t encounter bad luck, but reality often proved worse than expected.","Song Shuhang reminded himself not to be overly self-assured.","When people believed that they couldn’t possibly be so unlucky, the outcome often proved to be more severe than anticipated.","“Ranzhen Daoist, I’m heading to the Inner World. Look after my roommate for me,” Song Shuhang said quietly.","“Are you seriously leaving your roommate in the care of a Netherworld demon?” The hamster spat out a fruit pit into the trash can.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet chimed in, “If it weren’t for Fellow Daoist Tyrannical Song, the Netherworld’s malevolence exuding from this hamster would have already plunged your sleeping roommate into a nightmarish abyss. I’ll stay behind to look after your roommate.”","“Alright,” Song Shuhang agreed.","Subsequently, Song Shuhang took the hamster with him and entered the Inner World. He intended to find Pavilion Master Chu and Senior White Two.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet began gradually lowering his defenses to protect the dormitory.","Gao Moumou, who was sound asleep, furrowed his brow.","Under the deep slumber of Gao Moumou and the other two, an enormous pressure suddenly bore down on them. It felt as though an invisible weight was pressing down on their beds, making even breathing a challenge. Sleep became an arduous endeavor.","Fellow Daoist Stone Tablet was a magical treasure forged by Bai Chengdao, the Wielder of the Will. It fell between the ranks of a Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcender’s magical treasure and an Immortal’s divine weapon. Even when suppressing its powers, it could still exert influence on the creatures in its vicinity.","Meanwhile, on the other side, in the secret realm where the remnants of the Heavenly Court resided within the world of beast cultivators, the Tooth Fairy sought out Zither Master Feng Yi.","Zither Master Fengyi, at this moment, was silently maintaining the secret realm. She was attempting to move the entire mystic realm, but due to the interference of the heavenly punishment, the space was extremely unstable.","“Fairy Feng Yi, just now... someone sent me a message,” the Tooth Fairy began softly.","Shuhuang’s identity had been omited out of fear that it would provoke Zither Master Fengyi.","“Go on,” Zither Master Fengyi prompted.","“There’s a plausible method for evading the divine punishment,” the Tooth Fairy continued. “It involves entering a ‘dead’ state before the divine punishment arrives. As long as one is deceased, the Heavenly Law won’t pursue them. So, if we have a resurrection array and if that array isn’t within the secret realm, we can use this method to elude the heavenly punishment’s grasp.”","“How viable is this method?” Zither Master Fengyi inquired.","“It’s absolutely viable,” the Tooth Fairy assured her.","Zither Master Fengyi fell silent.","What was it about death?","She couldn’t help but recall Slow-Witted Song’s suggestion.","The prerequisite for escaping the Heavenly Court’s Dao and achieving freedom was to ‘die’ once.","In the end, was he unable to escape this fate?","Yet, Slow-Witted Song, that unreliable individual, hadn’t appeared again since vanishing the last time.","“Did someone call me?” Suddenly, a deep voice resounded.","Following the voice, a portly figure emerged from thin air.","He was so corpulent that he couldn’t see his own feet when looking down. His entire body glistened with a golden sheen.","“You’ve been here all along?” Zither Master Fengyi widened her eyes.","“No, it wasn’t easy for me to find a moment to come out, and I just happened to hear Fairy Fengyi calling me. So, what’s your answer to the previous suggestion? Honestly, I don’t have much time. There’s no telling when I’ll get another opportunity to come out,” the golden, chubby man remarked. He waved at the Tooth Fairy while saying, “Long time no see, Tooth Fairy.”","The Tooth Fairy was rendered speechless.","“I agree, and at this point, we don’t have many options. Both sides need to experience ‘death’ once... You should be able to sense the Heavenly Punishment outside,” Zither Master Fengyi stated. “However, not everyone here possesses a resurrection array...”","“In that case, strike a deal with me,” the plump man proposed, wearing a faint smile. “Trade the fragments of the ancient Heavenly City you’ve collected in exchange for a chance at resurrection. For those who can’t be resurrected, I’ll handle the resurrection array. Gather everyone together and let them face their end contentedly.”"]},{"number":2288,"title":"Chapter 2288 Are You Going To Kill Me With A Curse?","paragraphs":["2288 Are You Going To Kill Me With A Curse?","“Can I trust you?” Zither Master Fengyi gazed at Slow-Witted Song in exasperation.","She never thought she’d find herself having to depend on the most unreliable man in the celestial heavens.","“Trust is a heavy burden, so I never ask others to place it on me. It only adds to the weight and makes it hard for me to eat well and sleep well,” the plump golden man proudly declared.","Zither Master Fengyi was left speechless.","The same unpleasant feeling tugged at her heart. It was a heart-wrenching feeling. That’s precisely why this man was so hard to trust.","“But, Fairy Fengyi, you don’t have much of a choice now. You can either leave your fate in my hands or face the heavenly punishment head-on. That’s how it is,” the golden man remarked.","“Can’t you at least tell a lie at a time like this?” Zither Master Fengyi felt exasperated.","“I’ve never lied to a woman. Not in the past, not now, and not in the future,” the golden man patted his chest and stated firmly.","“I still can’t figure it out... Why would someone like you have a girlfriend? Which eye of the Golden Dragon Fairy was blind enough to fall for you?” Zither Master Fengyi sighed as she began gathering all the members.","Reality was harsh. She had no choice but to trust this unreliable man before her.","“I don’t blame you for not understanding... With my personality, even though I have a few close fairy friends, I’m still a virgin,” the golden man said while sounding somewhat sad.","Zither Master Fengyi was rendered speechless.","“Are you still a virgin?” The Tooth Fairy’s eyes lit up.","“Don’t get too excited. Even if I am, it doesn’t mean you stand a chance with Cheng Lin. Perhaps you should change your personality?” the golden man replied, his tone full of amusement.","The Tooth Fairy’s teeth ground together.","“Do you ever think about getting together with one of those other fairies?”","“Do you want to curse me to death? After I die, do you plan to inherit the spirit stones I’ve hidden?” the golden man retorted.","The Tooth Fairy was confused.","“Let’s drop this topic. I still want to live a few more years and follow the script of my life. Eventually, I’ll pass on all the troubles to someone else. Right now, my only responsibility is to have fun,” the golden man laughed.","Zither Master Fengyi closed her eyes and sighed. “I’ve gathered everyone here... So, the deal is established. All the fragments of the Heavenly Court are yours.”","She extended her wings and tossed a jade seal that landed in the golden man’s hand.","This was the central magical treasure that controlled the entire fragment of the Heavenly Court.","“It’s done then... Only now can you trust me. Let me share some good news with you. Although the four fellow cultivators, Jia Lan, Golden Lake, Cai Shaman King, and Han Xing, perished under the heavenly punishment, they haven’t truly died yet. In the future, if fate allows, they might have a chance to reunite,” the golden man suddenly spoke softly.","His gentleness at this moment was a blow to Zither Master Fengyi’s heart.","“Then, let the feast of death commence. Work with me, Fairy Fengyi,” the golden man raised his hands.","Zither Master Fengyi gently placed her wings on the palm of the golden man with chubby knees.","Her power was drawn out.","In the next moment, a ring-shaped saber light containing the laws of sharpness radiated out from Fairy Fengyi’s center.","The Heavenly Court members had absolute trust in Zither Master Fengyi.","On top of that, they’d prefer to meet their end at her hands rather than under the heavenly punishment.","Death descended upon the entire Heavenly Court fragment.","Blood flowed like a river.","The golden man nodded slightly before he reached out and touched both Zither Master Fengyi and Tooth Fairy. “Close your eyes.”","A brilliant golden light erupted.","Moments later, another small jade seal emerged from the Heavenly Court fragment’s secret realm.","The heavenly punishment’s lightning, which had been raging outside, started to gather.","With no targets left, it slowly coalesced.","Outside the Heavenly Court’s secret realm, a figure as splendid as a star appeared.","It was Senior White!","After receiving Song Shuhang’s message, he halted the collection of Netherworld’s evil energy and sped straight to the fragment of the ancient Heavenly Court. He was eager to see what had happened to the remaining Heavenly Court members.","“Such formidable Heavenly Punishment lightning,” the tanned Soft Feather quivered while concealed within Senior White’s shadow. She was reluctant to show herself.","Fairy Creation remained silent.","The virtuous lamia gazed at the secret realm of the Heavenly Court, enveloped by the ‘Heavenly Punishment,’ a glimmer of sadness in her eyes.","At this moment, a small jade seal suddenly flew out from the fragment of the Heavenly Court and flew towards Senior White.","The virtuous lamia stood guard over Senior White. She extended her hand and caught the jade seal.","Then, a clear voice echoed from the jade seal. “@#%×, this is the central control magical treasure of the fragment of the Heavenly Court.”","The virtuous lamia was at a loss for words.","“Is it for Shuhang?” Senior White asked.","The virtuous lamia nodded and handed the small jade seal to Senior White.","“All the ‘aura’ inside has dissipated. Did they commit suicide?” the Heart Demon Scarlet Heaven Sword inquired. It could sense that all the ‘aura’ within the fragment of the ancient Heavenly Court had suddenly started dissipating.","At the same time, the heavenly punishment in the sky gradually faded away.","“Let’s go inside and have a look,” Senior White suggested.","He held the small jade seal and used it to enter the fragment of the celestial heavens.","At this moment, blood flowed like a river within the Heavenly Court fragment.","Yet, there were no corpses. All the bodies had been taken away.","Senior White extended his hand and retrieved a jade bottle. Waving it over the bloodstains on the ground, he absorbed all the blood into the bottle.","This blood came from numerous Rank-7, Rank-8, and Rank-9 Heavenly Court members. Many of them possessed precious ancient bloodlines. Be it for refining weapons or blood sacrifices, it was highly valuable.","Senior White guided everyone around the secret realm fragment of the Heavenly Court.","“It’s empty... everything’s been moved. This had to be the work of an expert,” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword commented.","“The fragment of the Heavenly Court itself is already an incredible treasure. Imagine what it could do for Shuhang who possesses an Inner World. It’s beyond priceless,” Senior White remarked.","“I feel like if I exchanged it for Ninth Stage spirit stones of the same volume, Shuhang would be so thrilled that he might faint,” Scarlet Heaven Sword chuckled.","“I think Senior Song would pinch himself and wonder if he’s dreaming,” Soft Feather added candidly.","Senior White was left speechless.","Don’t underestimate Shuhang. A few months ago, he had a tremendous fortune... which I borrowed from him.","At this point, Fairy Creation chanted, “The Sage Resurrection Formation~”","“Right, let’s see if the resurrection array is still here. Then, we’ll transfer the entire secret realm to Shuhang’s Inner World,” Senior White nodded.","With the virtuous lamia’s assistance, they could figure out how to shrink the ‘secret realm’ and relocate it."]},{"number":2289,"title":"Chapter 2289 Holy Ape World Refining Spell","paragraphs":["2289 Holy Ape World Refining Spell","Senior White and the others arrived at the location of the ‘Scholarly Sage’s Resurrection Array’.","The space separating the resurrection array was still there, but it was sealed by the ancient members of the Heavenly City. Even if they used the central jade seal to open it, it would still take half an hour. This was a defensive measure.","Even if the central jade seal were stolen by the enemy, they wouldn’t be able to open the Sage’s Resurrection Space quickly.","“I could use my ‘disposable flying sword, small black room-breaking edition,’ but never mind... It doesn’t matter as long as the Sage’s resurrection array is intact,” Senior White said.","Afterward, Senior White inspected the Immortal Sealing Jail. It had been repaired since they had destroyed it, and it seemed to have been strengthened again.","Senior White nodded in satisfaction. “I’ll figure out how to shrink this fragment of the Heavenly City and place it in Song Shuhang’s Inner World.”","The World Creator had limitations on what it could shrink. Storing such a massive mystic realm directly was impossible.","“Does the fragment of the Heavenly City have a shrinking function?” Pavilion Master Chu asked in confusion.","“I examined it, but it doesn’t have that ability,” Senior White replied while shaking his head.","The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword suddenly laughed and said, “It’s simple. Just open the Inner World, put the Heavenly City fragment inside, and close it.”","As it laughed, the Heart Demon Red Cloud Sword stopped abruptly. It sighed and said, “Oh, I forgot that I’m not with Shuhang right now, so I can’t pierce his heart. I missed a chance to pierce him.”","Senior White was speechless.","Virtue, Good Fortune, and Black-skinned Soft Feather were locked in an argument of their own.","The Heart Demon Redcloud Sword specialized in piercing the heart.","Pavilion Master Chu, who knew the strangulation technique, was lost in thought.","Song Shuhang’s life remained as colorful as ever.","“Pavilion Master Chu, do you have a spell for shrinking objects?” Black-skinned Soft Feather asked.","“I do, but my technique must match the Crystal-Clear Water Pavilion’s unique cultivation method. In my current state, I can’t use such a divine art. At best, I can cast a spell of this caliber once my arms and chest grow back,” Pavilion Master Chu replied.","After all, the Heavenly City fragment was enormous.","“Should I contact Senior Almighty Merchant?” Black-skinned Soft Feather suggested while recalling that the ‘cultivation chat’ feature had Almighty Merchant’s contact information.","“Yes, I almost forgot about that handyman,” Senior White said with a bright smile.","The Almighty Merchant could get just about anything done as long as he was paid enough.","Senior White was very wealthy.","Hence, the Almighty Merchant could get anything done.","In the past, contacting the Almighty Merchant was difficult due to his elusive nature. However, with Song Shuhang’s ‘cultivation chat’ feature, it became much easier to reach him.","Senior White retrieved the ‘cultivation’ chat feature and opened the Nine Provinces Number Two Group created by Song Shuhang. He found the nickname ‘Almighty Merchant’. It glowed in colorful light effects.","“Let’s discuss this privately,” Senior White said softly.","[Ding! The Cultivation System is still undergoing upgrades. The private chat function is temporarily unavailable. [User detected as Fellow Daoist White. A special communication channel has been temporarily added for Fellow Daoist White.] Wishing you a pleasant experience.]","“What a human-like feature. Shuhang’s ‘cultivation’ chat is getting more perfect,” Senior White praised.","Pavilion Master Chu was dumbfounded.","She remembered that even Song Shuhang himself didn’t have this feature, did he? Her primary consciousness was within Song Shuhang’s Inner World where she had always interacted with Song Shuhang’s main body.","“During the Cultivation System upgrade, Song Shuhang used the original method of ‘gifting energy + postscripts.’”","The special communication channel was swiftly established.","“Hello, Sage Monarch White! How may I assist you this time?” The Almighty Merchant’s gentle voice came through. Sage Monarch White was a high-tiered VIP who was on a completely different level from Song Shuhang.","“I need a method to shrink a massive Heavenly City fragment. I’m willing to buy it, whether it’s a magic tool, spell, scroll, or anything else. The price is negotiable,” Senior White said.","He was extremely wealthy.","The Almighty Merchant appreciated that aspect of Sage Monarch White the most.","What of negotiations? They were unnecessary.","“Is the Heavenly City fragment particularly large this time? Do you not possess the World Creator technique?” The Almighty Merchant inquired.","“It won’t hold. This time, the Heavenly City fragment is a mystic realm formed by hundreds of different fragments of the Heavenly City,” Senior White replied.","This mystic realm had been linked together by Zither Master Fengyi and the others. Cutting them apart again would be a waste.","“I understand. The simplest solution is for me to handle it, and the cost will be lowered. But... considering the fact that you encounter a similar situation in the future, I would like to recommend a practical spell to Fellow Daoist White, the ‘Sacred Ape World Refinement.’ This spell is incredibly potent.","In the past, a mighty Immortal used it to refine a moon-sized meteorite into a fist-sized object. Although it’s costly, I highly recommend it,” The Almighty Merchant said while patting his chest.","If this deal succeeded, it would be equivalent to two months of his salary.","“How much?” Senior White inquired.","“Three tons of Ninth-Stage spirit stones which would amount to the ballpark of 150,000. But this spell is well worth the price,” he replied. “It’s primarily due to the need for a special container to pass down this spell which makes it slightly more expensive.”","“Deal,” Senior White agreed without hesitation.","With that, Senior White reached into his treasure vault and produced a massive meteorite. He had collected it before entering seclusion.","While considering a spot for his previous seclusion, he got distracted while flying and accidentally collided with a meteorite. Inside that meteorite was a high-quality spirit stone mine with approximately three tons of Ninth-Stage spirit stones.","This meteorite served as the core of the mineral vein he left behind after stripping away the outer layers.","“Doing business with you is always a pleasure.” The Almighty Merchant chuckled.","In the next moment, he appeared in person while holding a golden formation disc that emitted spatial law fluctuations.","“This formation disc is the tool for passing down the ‘World Refining Holy Ape.’ Activate it, and you’ll gain the inheritance.”","“Additionally, Fellow Daoist White, once you’ve finished with the inheritance, you can still use the formation disc. As long as you use spatial power to refine it, you can give it to a junior with ‘spatial talent.’ As long as they come into contact with the formation disc daily, they’ll quickly familiarize themselves with ‘spatial laws,’ which will be immensely beneficial in their path to becoming a Tribulation Transcender.”"]},{"number":2290,"title":"Chapter 2290 For Some Reason, I’ve Gained More Power Again","paragraphs":["2290 For Some Reason, I’ve Gained More Power Again","“If you’re lucky, it’s even possible to awaken some talent related to space. Well, most of what I’ve seen have been low-tiered spatial techniques,” said the merchant.","“You’re welcome. In that case, we’ll meet again in the future.” The Almighty Merchant picked up the meteorite, opened a spatial gate, and prepared to leave.","Doing business with Sage Monarch White was quite an experience. It was completely different from doing business with Tyrannical Song.","The former was enjoyable, while the latter made his blood pressure rise.","Fortunately, he had already decided to minimize his contact with Profound Sage Tyrannical Song.","“Oh right, Pavilion Master Chu. After using the disk array, can you refine it again and give it to Shuhang?” Sage Monarch White’s voice came from behind.","When he heard the word ‘Shuhang,’ the Almighty Merchant’s step slipped and he fell over.","“No problem, leave it to me. Consider it my monthly rent for this month,” Pavilion Master Chu replied calmly.","“Thank you, Pavilion Master Chu,” Senior White said with a smile. If Song Shuhang could awaken some ‘space’ talent, perhaps the ‘World in the Sleeve’ that he had given him last time would come in handy.","Then, he reached out to activate the golden disk array and accepted the inheritance of the ‘Holy Ape World Refining’ spell contained in it.","The Almighty Merchant rubbed his face and jumped into the Space Gate. He vanished.","He felt that fate was playing tricks with him. For some reason, he couldn’t avoid Tyrannical Song at all.","Ten minutes later, Senior White opened his eyes. The inheritance of the ‘World Refining Holy Ape’ was complete.","“This spell is interesting. This money was well spent,” Senior White said happily.","After saying that, he stretched out his hand and began to cast a spell.","The power of space condensed according to his will and formed runes.","A moment later, six large Holy Apes appeared in the air.","Senior White led everyone out of the fragment of the Heavenly City.","The six holy ape phantoms were very muscular and formed a circle. The Holy Apes stretched out their arms and held them out toward the center.","As the six Saint Apes roared, the huge fragment of the ancient Heavenly City began to shrink. In the end, it became a three-dimensional room the size of 5 x 5 meters.","The virtuous lamia made a ‘salute’ gesture.","The core assistant inside had received the signal ahead of time.","After the fragment of the ancient Heavenly City was moved into the secret realm, it was quickly assigned to a suitable location.","After the fragment of the Heavenly City returned to its original state, it expanded Song Shuhang’s Inner World by a small margin.","At the same time, Senior White also placed the ‘central jade seal’ into his Inner World and handed it over to the core assistant.","The Inner World was strengthened once again.","“Contact initiated, contact successful...The defensive array has been activated. Connected to the Inner World’s defense system. Transferring a portion of the Heavenly City fragment. Transferring the Immortal Sealing Prison. Transferring the Phoenix Rites Palace. Transferring the Ivory Trigram Pagoda. Locked onto the Scholarly Sage’s resurrection space. Retrieved the Sage Resurrection Array. Fusion initiated.”","A series of information was broadcasted from the core assistant.","With it around, Song Shuhang’s Inner World was organized neatly. The originally messy defense system was also woven into the core dragon channel and formed a part of the huge defense system.","Some special palaces such as the residences of the Tribulation Transcenders and Immortals were all taken out and placed around the Palace of Winter that was originally the Great Northern Emperor’s.","In the next few days, the core assistant would be busy.","“I succeeded,” the black-skinned Soft Feather maintained her elegant posture and said excitedly. The more complicated and interesting Senior Song’s Inner World was, the more it would anchor her main body. At that time, her main body wouldn’t have to travel around the world. Just Senior Song’s Inner World alone would be enough for her to take risks for a long time.","Perhaps in the future, her main body could also grow into that of a true lady’s.","As the inner demon that corresponded to the main body, she would become a real, genuine inner demon!","Senior White waved his hand.","The ‘Holy Ape World Refining’ spell was more useful than he had imagined.","He could collect the treasures that were too large and difficult to collect the next time he encountered them.","“I feel that this ‘World Refining Holy Ape’ still has room for improvement,” Senior White said softly.","“Speaking of which, didn’t you feel that when the big monkey from the ‘World Refining Holy Ape’ appeared, it was somewhat similar to Song Shuhang’s monkey head that only knew how to say 666?” the Heart Demon Redcloud Sword suddenly said.","“They’re Holy Apes. Could it be a matching cultivation technique?” Black-skinned Soft Feather made a guess.","“Alright, after I improve this magical technique, I’ll have Shuhang learn it too.” Senior White clapped his hands.","“Will you continue extracting the evil energy of the Netherworld?”","“Today, I’ll experiment with the plan to become a god. I want to complete this plan when I vindicate the ninth grade,” Senior White replied.","“Alright. I’ll lend Fellow Daoist White a hand,” Daemao Chu said. Pavilion Master Chu was also very interested in Senior White’s plan to become a god.","In Senior White Two’s world of the black lotus, Song Shuhang had just completed a full-body physical examination.","Senior White Two used the high-tech magical equipment in the fat ball’s nest to check Song Shuhang’s body.","“The data shows that there’s nothing wrong with your body. You haven’t fused with the Celestial Thearch’s Dao. Because of the Inner World, the aura of the Heavenly City fragments you collected won’t affect your body,” Senior White Two replied while holding a test report in his hand.","“Phew. What a relief.” Song Shuhang heaved a long sigh of relief.","“Do you feel anything wrong with your body now?” asked the white-robed hamster.","“Are you talking about physical abnormalities? Well... When I was experiencing it just now, I realized that the energy in my body had increased by another portion. The Inner World must have changed, and the feedback is being transmitted to my body. Unknowingly, I have become stronger again. I’m trying to suppress my realm and delay my advancement.”","Song Shuhang frowned.","The hamster shrieked and pounced on Song Shuhang. It waved its sword and fiercely stabbed Song Shuhang’s face. “No one can stop me. Today, I will definitely pierce through your shameless face.”","Song Shuhang did not react and allowed the hamster to stab him.","“Senior White, I want to try again to see if I can remove the seal around you,” he said to Senior White Two with a serious expression.","“The seal is right here.” Senior White Two did not seem concerned.","Sleeping in the seal was much better than sleeping in the cocoon, and he was a little reluctant to come out. However, since Song Shuhang wanted to give it a try, he couldn’t refuse his good intentions."]},{"number":2291,"title":"Chapter 2291 We Have The Whole Night","paragraphs":["2291 We Have The Whole Night","Song Shuhang had been mulling it over for quite some time. His aim was to boost the immediate output of the “Saber Nurturing Technique” and break the seal that had imprisoned Senior White Two.","Besides deploying the ‘hair control technique’ to conjure twenty long-haired palms, his only other option was to enlist the ‘ghost spirit’s’ hands to bolster the number of instantaneous attacks in the “Blade Nurturing Technique.” There were no immediate plans for substantial improvements to the Hair Nurturing Knife.","With quality and quantity both off the table, he had to rely on ‘time.’","Now that he had ascended to the Seventh Stage Realm and mastered the Primary Instruction of the “Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique” as well as the “Scholarly Indestructible Body of the Buddha” and the “Mutated Steel Hands Technique,” his body’s strength had surged and surpassed its previous levels by at least four or five notches.","He could now endure the backlash of the sealing technique for an extended period. Even grinding through it for days and nights wouldn’t pose a problem.","“First, let’s work on the Hair Growth Technique!” Song Shuhang shook his head. His long hair grew rapidly and quickly reached knee length.","This length was just right. Song Shuhang had once thought about teaching this technique to Senior White, but he hadn’t found a suitable opportunity.","“Next, let’s move to the Control spell!” With a thought, his long hair danced in the air and formed twenty fists.","Song Shuhang felt satisfied. Besides his talent in saber techniques, he might also have a knack for hair techniques. Perhaps in the future, he could consider seeking more Dharma spells, divine abilities, and martial techniques related to ‘hair.’","Unknown to him, the ‘hair control technique’ Pavilion Master Chu had taught him was actually an adaptation of the ancient saber technique called the “Nine Slashes of Braid Saber.”","“Ghost fairy, you’re up,” Song Shuhang mentally called out.","The ghost spirit’s arms emerged from above his shoulders and produced a ‘four-armed form’ with him. It was a form Song Shuhang missed. He vaguely recalled the time he had battled alongside the ghost spirit and the virtuous lamia in a ‘three-headed and six-armed form.’","After the ghost spirit positioned its arms, it relinquished control and allowed Song Shuhang to manipulate and utilize its hands.","“Everything is set. I’m going to mount Senior White,” Song Shuhang declared and advanced to the sealing pillar set up by the Faint Ball boss.","Senior White Two floated up and down within the pillar while casually remarking, “We can start anytime.”","Song Shuhang took a deep breath and mentally braced himself for the sealing pillar’s backlash. Then, he pressed his twenty palms of hair, his own hands, and the ghost spirit’s hands onto the sealing pillar simultaneously.","Saber Nurturing Technique x24!","The entire hall bathed in blinding light.","Song Shuhang shrieked in agony. The larger the area of his body in contact with the ‘sealing pillar,’ the more intense the backlash was. The pain reached the threshold of causing Song Shuhang considerable discomfort.","The hamster lay on Song Shuhang’s face while fervently poking it. It let out a series of wails. Its excitement led it to remain on Song Shuhang’s face as Song Shuhang’s hand slipped and inadvertently pressed against the sealing pillar. Thus, it was subjected to the backlash of the cursed sealing pillar which had flowed through Song Shuhang.","In the end, the blasted sealing pillar’s backlash had unexpectedly flowed into its body via Song Shuhang. It suffered at least a tenth of Song Shuhang’s pain. It was an amount that Song Shuhang could easily tolerate, but was unbearable for the hamster.","For a time, the hamster’s misery surpassed Song Shuhang’s.","“Hamster, why haven’t you disengaged from my face yet?” Song Shuhang inquired once he grew accustomed to the pain and had enough strength to communicate with the hamster.","The hamster rolled its eyes in response.","Song Shuhang chuckled, “I didn’t quite feel it when you stabbed my face. I thought you had already rolled off.”","The hamster was too disgruntled to emit any sounds.","Song Shuhang utilized telekinesis to carefully lift the hamster and removed it from his face and placed it nearby.","Subsequently, his twenty-four palms, hands, and ghost spirit hands moved frenetically. The twenty-four points of radiance from the Blade Nurturing Technique intensified. It remained constant as long as he didn’t release them. This way, the effects on the sealing pillar would persist.","The boss of the Faint Ball gradually increased his ‘favorable impression’ of Song Shuhang by one point.","After employing the Saber Nurturing Technique more than two hundred times, Song Shuhang could sense the diminishing backlash from the seal.","After five hundred rounds of the Saber Nurturing Technique, the pain ceased altogether. Although the light of the backlash occasionally flared on his body, the pain became nothing more than an itch for Song Shuhang. Not only did he ignore it, but he even found it somewhat pleasurable.","Song Shuhang capitalized on this time and used telekinesis to retrieve a thick book and began reading it. It had been written in the Basic Ancient Language.","He wasn’t in a hurry. This time, he had the entire night to weaken the seal pillar with the Faint Ball boss. He could use his instincts to farm the Saber Nurturing Technique. It saved him from expending a considerable amount of mental energy.","In that case, he could use this time to ask Senior White Two about the pronunciation of the ‘ancient language.’","Whenever he studied on his own, due to the lack of a ‘reading method’ demonstration, Song Shuhang could understand the ancient language he had learned, but he couldn’t read it.","It was barely functional.","“Senior White, how do you pronounce this word?” Under the cover of the Saber Nurturing Technique, Song Shuhang rolled up the book and humbly asked for advice.","“Which word?” Senior White Two’s body sank inside the sealing pillar and hung upside down next to Song Shuhang.","“The paragraph on the sixth row of the left page,” Song Shuhang replied.","“Let me see.” Senior White Two glanced at it and began to use the standard pronunciation of the ancient language to guide Song Shuhang.","This included the way he rolled his tongue, the way he vocalized, and sometimes even the nasal sound.","Although there was no moonlight, there was the radiance of the Blade Nurturing Technique.","Although there wasn’t a hamster, Senior White Two was accompanying him.","The effect of learning was remarkable.","Song Shuhang’s learning efficiency was almost tenfold.","He was constantly learning new words and could barely pronounce them.","Learning made one happy, and knowledge made one forget time.","Song Shuhang was engrossed in his studies. He almost completely forgot about the concept of time other than instinctively brushing through the Saber Nurturing Technique.","The alarm on his phone rang and abruptly pulled him out of the sea of knowledge.","It was the sound of the clock striking seven in the morning.","The night had passed so quickly.","“Wow, time really flew!” Song Shuhang couldn’t help but feel a little unsatisfied.","He looked toward the sealing pillar.","After a night of effort, the sealing pillar began to emit a colorful radiance—it was like the feeling of evolving equipment into an artifact in an online game.","“It seems to be working,” Song Shuhang said.","“Yes, the night’s work wasn’t in vain,” Senior White Two gracefully moved within the sealing pillar like a fish.","“Let’s give it one more try. If it doesn’t work, we can try again next time.” Song Shuhang put away the book of ancient languages with his telekinesis.","He frantically propelled his spiritual energy.","Twenty-four hands rubbed vigorously on the sealing pillar and created sparks.","“Accept it, this is my final round of the Saber Nurturing Technique!”"]},{"number":2292,"title":"Chapter 2292 Heavens, What Have I Done?","paragraphs":["2292 Heavens, What Have I Done?","“Dark sorcery,” the hamster on the side said with a groan. It had taken him half the night to recover from the pain of the seal’s backlash.","But Tyrannical Song was like a beast; he could easily endure this level of pain. He had been only slightly affected and took most of the night to recover.","“You’re grinding that ‘Saber Nurturing Technique’ like it’s a videogame!” the gorilla general sitting nearby couldn’t help but comment. It had never seen anyone so frantically casting the same spell over and over.","The sealing pillar was already ablaze.","“Yeah, how are you going to convey your ‘love’ by grinding the Saber Nurturing Technique like this? Is your ‘love’ equivalent to 200 action beats per second?” the hamster agreed.","The hamster had a vague understanding of Song Shuhang’s Saber Nurturing Technique and knew that this technique required the user to infuse the target with ‘love.’","Song Shuhang was currently moving 24 palms at lightning speed.","“Bizarre Black!” Song Shuhang shouted.","In the next moment, his ‘hair palms’ exploded. They couldn’t withstand the high-intensity, continuous spellcasting and burst into strands of hair.","The pitch-black metal covering Song Shuhang and the ghost spirit’s hands turned red. It was as if they were burning iron.","“This is my limit.” Song Shuhang sighed and took a step back.","The sealing pillar once again emitted a defensive lightning barrier.","However, the seven-colored light on the pillar didn’t fade. It continued to flicker gently and gave Song Shuhang a sense of familiarity.","Had the material of the sealing pillar changed?","The fat ball had used a pseudo-immortality bone as a cost to create this sealing pillar. It had been specifically designed for Senior White Two.","Its source was the pseudo-immortality bone.","Now, under the influence of Song Shuhang’s Saber Nurturing Technique, the sealing pillar had evolved.","“It worked. As long as this seven-colored light doesn’t fade, we can try again tonight. After a few days, we might just crack it!” Song Shuhang put away the ghost spirit’s hands and expressed his satisfaction.","“Yes, there have indeed been changes.” Senior White Two gently tapped the sealing pillar’s surface and said, “I can clearly sense that the seal has evolved. It has become stronger and more robust. In the past, I could forcefully break the seal in five-thousand years. Now, I wouldn’t be able to do it in twice the time.”","The hamster stared at him suspiciously.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","General Gorilla was shocked. “What have you done, Tyrannical Song?!”","“Wait, something doesn’t seem right,” Song Shuhang stepped forward and tapped on the sealing pillar.","The sealing pillar gave him a sense of intimacy.","“It’s fine. I had already suspected this might happen.” Senior White yawned and said, “Your Saber Nurturing Technique has the ability to stimulate magical treasures. It allows them to evolve when stimulated. As long as the magical item has potential, it can be nurtured by your Blade Nurturing Technique. Isn’t it natural for the sealing pillar to evolve and become stronger after receiving your nurturing?”","Song Shuhang patted the sealing pillar reluctantly. “So, have I done more harm than good, inadvertently?”","“Don’t worry, all these years are the same to me. It’s all just a matter of sleeping. Plus, the evolved sealing pillar is more comfortable to sleep on. Sleepiness keeps creeping up. The comfort level is ten times that of the big cocoon and five times that of the old sealing pillar,” Senior White Two spoke. His voice gradually fell soft.","Unbeknownst to him, he had already fallen into a deep slumber.","Song Shuhang looked up at the sky.","In this case, his all-night effort seemed meaningless.","In fact, it might even prolong Senior White Two’s release.","Ten millenia meant nothing to Senior White Two, but the outside world would undoubtedly have undergone immense changes in that time.","“Since there have been changes... Why don’t you do me a favor and open a backdoor?” Song Shuhang suggested as he touched the sealing pillar. It felt oddly familiar.","“No. Tyrannical Song had finally lost his mind,” the demonic hamster muttered softly.","The gorilla general chimed in, “On this day, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song finally couldn’t endure the situation and started conversing with a ‘seal’... Heavens!”","Under everyone’s watchful eyes, the sealing pillar that had originally bound Senior White Two actually opened a small backdoor.","The fist-sized opening was situated at the lowest corner of the seal.","“It’s open, it’s really open! My Lord, wake up! The seal has opened a backdoor!” the hamster exclaimed.","However, Senior White Two was already sleeping soundly within the sealing pillar. No one could wake him.","“The size of this opening is just right for the hamster to enter,” Little Sun T233’s voice sounded at this moment and offered a reminder.","“That’s right. I’ll go in and awaken the Hegemon.” the hamster leaped up and rushed toward the fist-sized opening.","When its body made contact with the opening, an electric net enveloped it.","“Squeak, squeak, squeak ~” The hamster screamed and fell to the ground. Its once-beautiful fur was now charred black.","Song Shuhang hurriedly reached out to pick it up and moved it away from the sealing pillar.","“No, even though the sealing pillar has a backdoor, it doesn’t allow others to enter,” the gorilla general said while furrowing its brow.","Song Shuhang contemplated for a moment and said, “There’s no other choice. I’m the only one who can enter.”","He first produced a ‘Sage-Sealed Wooden Saber’ and placed it outside the sealing pillar. Then, he retrieved the ‘Disposable Flying Sword, Small Black Room-Breaking Edition’ that Senior White had left for him.","“Could Tyrannical Song actually shrink his body?” the gorilla general asked in astonishment while looking at Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","I don’t know how to shrink my body. I’ve truly let you down.","“Can’t he? Haha, that’s more like it,” the gorilla general deduced from Song Shuhang’s obvious reaction.","“I can’t shrink my body, but I do have a more practical method,” Song Shuhang said calmly.","In the next moment, his body transformed into a wisp of black smoke.","His body of smoke condensed into a fist-sized sphere and rolled toward the sealing pillar’s backdoor.","The smoke sphere entered the sealing pillar.","Sure enough, the sealing pillar, which had been resisting Song Shuhang the entire night due to the Saber Nurturing Technique, no longer resisted him.","Once Song Shuhang entered the sealing pillar, the ‘backdoor’ swiftly closed.","“Wait, don’t be in such a hurry to close it. Let me awaken Senior White first, then you can close it,” Song Shuhang called out.","However, this time, the sealing pillar’s backdoor did not reopen.","Song Shuhang had a foreboding feeling.","In the worst-case scenario, he and Senior White Two would be trapped inside the ‘sealing pillar.’","“Wake up my master first,” the gorilla general reminded him.","Song Shuhang was still in his smokey form. He nodded.","He approached Senior White Two and stretched out his hand to slap him.","Senior White Two was in a deep sleep. He casually waved his hand, and the smoke Song Shuhang had turned into was shattered.","The smoke exploded and enveloped the entire sealing pillar. It was dyed pitch-black.","The gorilla general fell speechless."]},{"number":2293,"title":"Chapter 2293 It’s not just Senior, look, this pot is big and round","paragraphs":["2293 It’s not just Senior, look, this pot is big and round","“Is this a pillar?” asked the gorilla general in a hushed tone as he eyed the now pitch-black structure.","“This is an assault from the ruler of the Netherworld. Such an attack could harm the soul while targeting the body,” the gorilla general whispered.","“If it were anyone else, they’d likely be dead.”","With these thoughts, the gorilla general turned and asked, “Hamster, quickly check if the resurrection array is responding.”","The hamster was still reeling from its encounter with the sealing pillar. It produced a thick plume of smoke as it tried to regain composure. Its muscles twitched sporadically.","It seemed the hamster wouldn’t be of any use for the time being.","“I’ll have to go check myself,” the gorilla general concluded.","“Am I still alive?” a voice suddenly emanated from the sealing pillar.","Subsequently, the black smoke clinging to the pillar slowly receded and coalesced into human form.","Tyrannical Song was reconstituting himself!","“Incredible. He survived even that,” the gorilla general applauded.","“No, I feel like my whole body’s about to fall apart,” the smoky form of Song Shuhang lay weakly on the sealing pillar.","Luckily, Senior White Two’s previous attack had been purely physical in nature. Even while in a deep slumber, Senior White Two’s subconscious regulated the strength of the attack. With the aid of the ‘pseudo-immortal state,’ Song Shuhang managed to endure it.","“At least you’re alive. It’s better than the alternative,” the gorilla general offered solace.","“But something feels off. Is my body okay? I sense something strange,” mumbled Song Shuhang.","Just as he voiced this, a notification chimed in his mind.","[Ding! Virus Alert (Incomplete) has detected a ‘remote interference’ signal.]","The virus warning function had yet to be fully integrated with the ‘cultivation’ function, which was still undergoing upgrades. However, the standalone ‘virus warning’ function was already operational and capable of detecting the long-range probing of the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","“It’s finally here! Quick, let’s connect to Senior ‘More Than the Demon Emperor’!” Song Shuhang’s befuddled mind instantly sharpened at the warning.","“Senior, do you see this opportunity? It’s a golden one!”","“Damn it,” Song Shuhang lamented.","[Detected critical situation, danger level five stars. Activate Supreme VIP special communication channel to connect to the Demon Emperor.]","Song Shuhang was taken aback. A hidden function like this existed?","Would the channel not open if the danger level wasn’t high enough?","[Ding ~ Blacklist ‘More than Demon Emperor’ has rejected the special communication channel.]","Could it be that this Supreme VIP communication channel had been forcibly activated?","[Quickly connect to the Immortal Lord!] Song Shuhang’s mind raced, and he made a snap decision.","The Demon Emperor not only had sentience but also rejected the communication channel. But the Immortal Lord lay in eternal slumber, responding solely to instinct. It had a high chance of connecting to the special communication channel and taking on this massive responsibility.","[Confirm command, connecting to Immortal Lord.]","[Ding ~ Connection successful. Blacklist Immortal Lord connection begins.]","“Haha!” Song Shuhang erupted in laughter.","Indeed, adding more powerful seniors to his list had been a wise choice. Sometimes, two seniors weren’t enough.","The gorilla general and Little Sun T233 exchanged confused glances. In their view, Tyrannical Song had suddenly started shouting, jumping, and laughing.","Had he gone mad?","“Do you have any medicine? Do you want to feed it to him?” the gorilla general inquired.","“No medicine... and even if we had any, we can’t get it in there,” Little Sun T233 calmly surmised.","“Hello, Senior Immortal Lord. I believe this is our first official interaction, right?” Song Shuhang, having successfully established a connection, decided to strike up a conversation with the Immortal Lord.","At the same time, he summoned Lady Long Luo within his mind and tasked her with monitoring the virus warning function to see if the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s long-distance lock had been lifted.","The Immortal Lord remained unresponsive. He was deep in slumber due to forcibly encountering the information of immortality. Waking him up wouldn’t be easy.","“Although this is our first conversation, I’ve been friends with you for quite some time, Senior Immortal Lord. It’s good to finally make your acquaintance,” Song Shuhang said cheerfully.","[Transfer successful.] Lady Long Luo reported.","As with previous instances, Song Shuhang had successfully directed the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s long-distance interference and lock toward the Immortal Lord.","In the next moment, a strange sound echoed within the communication channel shared by the Immortal Lord and Song Shuhang.","Soon after, the connection with Song Shuhang was severed.","This had been an invisible showdown between him and the Heavenly Dao Remnant Sphere. While it might have seemed like a casual action, Song Shuhang had narrowly escaped death three times. It had been an immensely thrilling and exhilarating experience.","“Today, Song Shuhang lives to see another day,” he chuckled.","[Congratulations, Administrator Tyrannical Song.] Lady Long Luo sent her congratulations from a distance.","[Ding ~ More than the Demon Emperor has transferred a drop of energy to you. What do you want to do with it? I’ll have you know, no matter what you try, it’s futile.]","Not only did the Demon Emperor foresee Song Shuhang’s backbiting, but it also revealed that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song had been plotting to murder him secretly!","This was quite different from merely trash-talking behind someone’s back. It was an outright assassination attempt.","Indeed, the Demon Emperor’s secretive curses against him had only been a test.","Song Shuhang smiled faintly and transferred a drop of energy back to the Demon Emperor. [I wanted to gift you something earlier. It was a high-level gift, but alas, you missed the opportunity. I’ve since given that gift to another senior.]","The Demon Emperor scoffed in utter disbelief."]},{"number":2294,"title":"Chapter 2294 I’m Stubborn and Tough As Nails","paragraphs":["2294 I’m Stubborn and Tough As Nails","“When my ‘cultivation’ chat feature is back, I’ll just slide into Senior More than One’s DMs. Let’s see how they refuse me then,” murmured Song Shuhang from within the sealing pillar.","Otherwise, that steaming hotpot a while ago wouldn’t have just belonged to Senior More than One!","He also wondered what had happened after the Immortal Lord took responsibility for the situation.","He remembered that during his last conversation with Striped Dragon Two, Striped Dragon Two had been hit by a long-range interference attack from the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball. Striped Dragon Two had elegantly reflected the attack and even played a prank on the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","How would the Immortal Lord respond to the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s long-range interference attack?","Be it the Demon Emperor or the Imperishable Lord, they were all at the pinnacle of the Immortal level and were closely approaching the level of the Scholarly Sage.","However, the Demon Emperor was severely wounded while the Immortal Lord was in a deep slumber.","“Yeah, the only thing I can be certain of is that the Imperishable Lord is definitely still alive,” Song Shuhang said. His friends list hadn’t indicated his demise.","Power was indeed a valuable asset.","Song Shuhang sighed inwardly.","If he were to forcefully resist the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball’s long-range interference attack, he’d probably have to undergo resurrection. The problem was he didn’t have any conventional means of resurrection with him at the moment. Senior White Two had prepared a resurrection method for him, but there was a risk of turning into a denizen of the Netherworld after being revived. His thoughts were interrupted by another notification.","[Ding! Virus Alert (Incomplete) has detected a ‘remote interference’ signal.]","“It’s happening again,” Madam Long Luo reminded him.","Today, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball seemed serious. It appeared to have realized that its previous round of locking on and long-range attacks had targeted the wrong individual.","Therefore, as soon as the first wave of long-range lock-on interference attacks ended, it immediately initiated the next wave in a relentless search for Song Shuhang.","“Again? It’s not good for the body if it happens too frequently.”","But he didn’t have time to think further.","He needed to make a decision immediately!","Connecting with the Demon Emperor was out of the question. If Senior More than One was on guard, they would undoubtedly ignore his call.","There weren’t many options left.","“Confirm command, reconnect to the Immortal Lord.”","“Let’s meet again, Senior Immortal Lord. Honestly, I’m touched by your tenacity today. Let’s not say much more. May both of us smoothly overcome today’s tribulations,” Song Shuhang said.","[Transfer successful once more], Madam Long Luo reminded.","A familiar strange sound came from the Immortal Lord’s communication channel.","The VIP communication channel between the Immortal Lord and Song Shuhang was abruptly cut off.","“This is it,” Song Shuhang said with a sigh.","However, he remained vigilant. His form remained tightly compressed. It did not take long.","[Ding! Virus Alert (Incomplete) has detected a ‘remote interference’ signal.]","It was the third time today!","Song Shuhang’s greatest fear was coming true. The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball currently lacked intelligence. Because of that, it single-mindedly focused on this task.","It wouldn’t give up until it found Song Shuhang.","This time, without awaiting Song Shuhang’s command, the ‘cultivation’ chat feature automatically reconnected to the ‘Immortal Lord’ in an eerily human-like manner.","[Ding! Connection with the Immortal Lord has been successful. Communication begins.]","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was relentless, but the Immortal Lord on the other side was equally unyielding.","The third round began.","The round concluded.","The fourth round began.","The round concluded.","By the eleventh round, Song Shuhang was numbed by the repetition.","He no longer had the heart to deceive Senior Immortal Lord.","He felt a psychological burden.","At this point, he almost wished that the Immortal Lord would reject his communication.","[Ding ~ Connection to the Immortal Lord has failed.]","“Huh? Oh my god, the Immortal Lord rejected it!” Song Shuhang’s entire body jerked up.","After ten rounds, the stubborn Immortal Lord finally relented.","However, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball hadn’t given up.","Who should he connect with next?","Among the entire friend list, aside from the Immortal Lord and the Demon Emperor, he was too embarrassed to scam the other members.","Originally, there was still a group of members from the Ancient Heavenly City who could be candidates.","However, in the previous incident involving the Tian Fa world, four of the Ancient Heavenly City’s dear friends had perished simultaneously. The other friends’ avatars were grayed out. It was an indication that they were undergoing resurrection.","Even if they were in a good condition, Song Shuhang couldn’t bear to prank them with the heavenly punishment.","“Should I prank the Celestial Thearch?” Song Shuhang glanced at his friends list.","Among the remaining members, the Heavenly Emperor seemed like the best candidate in terms of strength and connections.","Just as he pondered, Senior White Two suddenly opened his eyes.","“Who’s locking onto this place?” the dormant Senior White Two sensed danger and woke up.","It did not take long to explain the situation to him.","“Pathetic, a corpse-like entity dares to scheme against me?” Senior White Two remarked.","He reached out and crushed a clump of black smoke in the air.","Song Shuhang’s heart inexplicably tensed.","The black smoke resembled a part of his pseudo-immortal smoke incarnation."]},{"number":2295,"title":"Chapter 2295 My Platelets","paragraphs":["2295 My Platelets","“Senior White, what did you just pinch earlier? Can you give me a heads-up next time?” Song Shuhang asked. He refused to transform out of his smoky state.","Senior White Two looked toward Song Shuhang in a daze.","In the next moment, he suddenly snapped back to reality and asked, “Huh? Shuhang, how did you get in here?”","He was well aware of the formidable seal that the fat ball had set up. How did Song Shuhang manage to infiltrate it?","Song Shuhang sighed and replied, “I’ve been here for a while. You smacked me. My whole body got shattered.”","“What did I do to you?” Senior White asked. He was bewildered by why he would have smacked Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was confused.","Why did it seem like he had done something wrong?","“I opened a backdoor in the fat ball’s seal and came in to wake you up. And then... you smacked me into pieces with a single palm strike. My entire body is still in pain,” Song Shuhang reminded him.","“Well, in the future, don’t disturb others when they’re sleeping, understand?” Senior White Two extended his hand and gently patted the smoky Song Shuhang.","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","“By the way, I just sensed a corpse-like fellow locking onto this location from afar. If something could pass through the fat ball’s seal and target this area...could it be?” Senior White Two asked after grasping the situation.","“That’s right, that’s it. Ever since I escaped from the small black room, it has been searching for me using a secret technique. It did not seem to understand how to give up. Meeting such a persistent opponent gave me a headache.” Song Shuhang felt like he was now the pestle of the Li Bai family. If he continued to be ground like this, he would one day be ground into an embroidery needle.","“I understand,” Senior White Two said with a chuckle.","“Senior White, what did you just pinch off?” Song Shuhang asked again.","“I didn’t notice. It should be the part where the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball locked onto you. At the same time, it shook the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball off. It should be unable to track you for a short period of time,” Senior White Two said.","Song Shuhang quickly searched his smoky body from top to bottom. From the outside, there shouldn’t be any parts missing, but he wasn’t sure about his internal organs.","He hoped that after returning to his original form, he could use the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique inheritance to regenerate the part that Senior White had crushed.","“I hope nothing will happen,” Song Shuhang said.","The pseudo-immortal body dissipated, and the smoke began to condense into a physical body.","Mutated Steel Hands had turned his body into a pitch-black metallic color.","In the next moment, a Great Sage Ape and 132 Little Sage Apes appeared above Song Shuhang’s head.","However, due to the restriction of the fat ball boss’s sealing pillar, a total of 133 Holy Apes were forcefully squeezed together and stuffed into the narrow space at the top of the sealing pillar.","The 133 holy apes squeezed and overlapped each other.","If they weren’t phantoms, they would definitely be crushed to death.","“The seal of the fat ball boss is really terrifying.” Song Shuhang sighed.","“I don’t think it’s the time for you to lament about this,” Senior White Two gently reminded him.","“What’s wrong?” Song Shuhang asked.","In the next moment, he felt an itch on his back. He raised his hand to scratch his back.","When he raised his hand, Song Shuhang saw countless blood vessels, which extended from his arm and connected to the back of his body!","His back was also filled with blood vessel tissue. They spread across his body like lotus roots.","Since he often used similar lotus roots to stab people, Song Shuhang had long gotten used to this tentacle scene.","Therefore, he did not panic at all. Instead, he gently touched these blood vessels with his fingers.","It was cold, and it hurt.","The chill came from the touch of his fingers.","The pain came from these tissues that were similar to blood vessels.","“Heavens, are these really my blood vessels?” Song Shuhang said.","At the same time, he could also see blood flowing out of these blood vessels.","It was his blood capillaries, red blood cells, white blood cells, and so on. They were leaving his body through his blood vessels and beginning their long journey of eloping.","He was not only bleeding all over the ground, but he was also sending blood to the outside!","Song Shuhang turned his head 180 degrees and looked behind him. Ever since he suffered Senior White Two’s curse, his neck had awakened a new function.","In the next moment, he saw the blood vessels extending from his back, shoulders, and arms rooted in the fat ball boss’s sealing pillar. He was fusing with the sealing pillar.","The sealing pillar and him were one.","His blood was being continuously being injected into the sealing pillar.","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Why was this happening?","He had simply returned to his humanoid form. Why was it connected to the fat ball boss’s sealing pillar?","“My head hurts.” Song Shuhang turned his head around and rubbed his temples. As his arms and shoulders were attached with the blood vessels, he could not move his hands too much. If he moved too much, he would feel a slight pain when he pulled the blood vessels.","“There are a few possibilities,” Senior White Two sank down, crossed his legs, and held his chin with one hand. “This sealing pillar was originally created by the fat ball using the fake bone of eternity as the foundation. Your smoke mode just now was an undying state. It can be said that when you were in smoke mode, you and the sealing pillar came from the same origin. In that case, it’s understandable that you fused with it when you recovered from smoke mode.”","Song Shuhang was speechless.","Because they were both pseudo-undying, they were attracted to each other?","“In addition, it might also be related to the Blade Nurturing Technique that you spent the entire night grinding,” Senior White Two continued.","Apart from that, Senior White Two also sensed a kind of power coming from a strange space that he couldn’t see through, and it fell on Song Shuhang’s body.","That power was the main reason.","It wasn’t the Heavenly Dao Relic.","It was the power of the true Bone of Immortality."]},{"number":2296,"title":"Chapter 2296 Two, I Choose Two","paragraphs":["2296 Two, I Choose Two","However, even Senior White Two couldn’t fathom how the power of the Bone of Eternity projected onto Song Shuhang’s body.","Under the influence of the genuine Bone of Immortality, the seal formed by undying Song Shuhang and the undying bone merged together.","Furthermore, another force within Song Shuhang’s body was being drawn in—the ‘Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Mark’ on the forehead of his whale-shaped golden core.","This Dragon Talisman Reincarnation Mark also had intricate ties to the Bone of Immortality and could be classified as a pseudo-immortal-level entity.","“Anyway, congrats, Shuhang. You’ve successfully merged with the seal capable of imprisoning the ruler of the Netherworld. If you can activate even 10% to 20% of the power of this seal... you’ll be able to dominate the world,” Senior White Two said with glee.","Song Shuhang paused for a moment, then asked, “So, what state am I in now? Did I just seal myself? Am I in my own body? Senior White, you’re here too...”","“Hold on!” Senior White Two raised his hand and stopped Song Shuhang from completing his sentence. Though it was the truth, it was rather awkward to say.","‘He truly lives up to the title of Annoying Tyrannical Song.’ the gorilla general thought and sighed inwardly. Tyrannical Song dared to think, say, and even do just about anything. How could it not be vexing?","Song Shuhang was left speechless.","Blood continued to be drawn from his veins.","“Senior White, do you have any water on you?” Song Shuhang asked while trembling.","Due to the excessive blood loss, Song Shuhang’s mouth had gone dry. With his Seventh Stage Venerable physique, the support of the three body-tempering techniques, and Cheng Lin’s self-healing technique, his body was generating blood at a frantic pace. However, it couldn’t keep up with the speed at which the sealing pillar was drawing his blood.","At such a rate, even an authentic Eighth Stage Profound Sage would be drained dry.","Song Shuhang had originally intended to open an entrance to his Inner World nearby and access the water from the living spring.","This time, the Inner World didn’t resist. Song Shuhang and the ‘sealing pillar’ had merged into one and the sealing pillar no longer prevented the Inner World from opening.","However, the exit of the Inner World was outside the sealing pillar. It was just a layer of glass away from Song Shuhang.","“Yes,” Senior White Two replied.","Song Shuhang’s eyes lit up. “Senior White, I’ve lost so much blood. I need to drink some water to replenish it.”","“But it’s poisonous. Even Ninth Stage Tribulation Transcenders find difficult to resist,” Senior White Two cautioned him.","Song Shuhang shook his head vigorously. He wasn’t like Senior Thrice Reckless, who had a penchant for dancing on the precipice of death.","“Don’t worry. With your current Seventh Stage Venerable realm, even if your blood is completely drained, you won’t die. At most, you’ll become a dried up mummy. Given some time, you’ll recover very quickly,” Senior White Two reassured him.","At that moment, the gorilla general outside the sealing pillar chimed in. “My Lord, can you try to open another door on this sealing pillar and come out? As long as you can come out, you can have whatever you want.”","“That’s right!” Song Shuhang slapped his forehead.","Due to the blood loss, his mind was a bit foggy. He hadn’t even thought of such a simple solution.","[Open up, Sealing Pillar!] Song Shuhang mentally commanded the sealing pillar to create an exit.","In response to his will, the seven-colored sealing pillar slowly opened.","It worked! It really worked!","All his hard work grinding the Saber Nurturing Technique all night hadn’t been in vain.","Song Shuhang carefully stepped out of the sealing pillar.","Then, he turned to look at Senior White Two.","Senior White Two let out a faint sigh. What had been foreseen had finally come to pass.","At that moment, Senior White Two felt like someone in a cozy bed on a cold winter morning. He wished to become one with the bed.","“Senior White?” Song Shuhang called out.","“I’m coming, I’m coming,” Senior White Two replied.","As Senior White Two stepped out, the gorilla general issued a reminder, “My Lord, please be cautious. The sealing pillar previously opened a portal, but it closed up when the hamster tried to exit.”","Senior White Two nodded slightly and took a step forward.","As he stepped out, a transparent barrier seemed to block his path. However, it posed minimal resistance, and Senior White Two easily broke through it.","“It worked!” Song Shuhang clenched his fist gently.","“Five thousand years... ten thousand years have passed,” Senior White Two murmured.","Both Little Sun T233 and the gorilla general congratulated him, “Congratulations, my Lord, on your successful escape.”","The hamster squeaked weakly.","Senior White Two gazed at the empty sealing pillar while deep in thought. Then, he waved his hand and summoned a non-combat research clone.","These clones were used by Senior White Two to study magical techniques and analyze the high-tech magical treasures in the fat ball’s nest.","The research clone approached the sealing pillar and jumped into it.","“Excellent. Now we don’t have to worry about alerting the fat ball,” Senior White Two said smugly.","Song Shuhang was puzzled. “Can the fat ball remotely communicate with this ‘sealing pillar’?”","“When I was first sealed, I could vaguely sense that someone was monitoring the seal. Therefore, I tampered with various interesting spells in the sealing pillar to interfere with remote surveillance,” Senior White Two explained.","Song Shuhang pinched his chin, lost in thought.","If... if the fat ball boss indeed checked on this sealing pillar from time to time, did that mean it could often ‘see’ what was happening inside the pillar?","Song Shuhang reached out and pinched.","A Golden Core QR code appeared in his hand.","He extended his hand and pressed it. He imprinted the Golden Core QR code inside the sealing pillar.","Whether it was useful or not, he wanted to leave a QR code as bait.","“Shuhang, you and I are on the same page,” Senior White Two said, pleased. This was also part of his plan to ensnare the fat ball.","“However, Senior White, the next question is... how do I separate from the Sealing Pillar?” Song Shuhang looked at the point where he was connected to the sealing pillar, feeling stifled.","Senior White Two had gained his freedom, but Song Shuhang was now trapped. He had been confined to the area surrounding the sealing pillar.","“Yes, there are several possible solutions. The first plan was to cut you into pieces and then revive you using the Resurrection Portal. That would solve the problem,” Senior White Two suggested.","Song Shuhang frantically shook his head.","Lately, his desire to live had grown stronger as he aimed to avoid having a death anniversary every day of the year.","“The second plan is to replace your body with your heart,” Senior White Two pointed at Song Shuhang’s chest.","“What does that even mean?” Song Shuhang asked calmly.","Senior White Two affirmed, “Yes.”","“I choose Plan B!” Song Shuhang said without hesitation.","Senior White Two reached out and tore open Song Shuhang’s clothes to reveal his pitch-black metallic chest.","Then, Senior White Two formed a sword with his fingers and stabbed Song Shuhang’s chest."]},{"number":2297,"title":"Chapter 2297 Good Child","paragraphs":["2297 Good Child","When Senior White Two’s finger transformed into a sword and lunged toward him, Song Shuhang was taken aback.","Surprisingly, his chest only felt the icy chill from Senior White Two’s finger.","“Wait a second, Senior White. Did you use a local anesthetic on me?” Song Shuhang asked in puzzlement.","Furthermore, there was no blood flowing from the wound on his chest. In spite of the significant blood loss to the sealing pillar, there should still be some blood around his heart, right?","Did Senior White Two use both a local anesthetic and hemostasis simultaneously?","“Please remain calm. I am in the middle of an operation and concentration is essential,” Senior White Two replied in earnest.","Song Shuhang was uncomfortable upon hearing that.","Once the operation was complete, Song Shuhang saw his glass heart exposed. The surgery had revealed the unusual nature of his heart. It had transformed due to his practice of the three body-tempering techniques, particularly the “Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique.”","The glass heart was stunningly beautiful and resembled a work of art.","When Song Shuhang heard the word ‘dismantle,’ he promptly ceased speaking and dared not utter another word. His strong will to live was evident in his silence. Even so, his exposed glass heart was pounding rapidly.","“You’re a Seventh Stage Venerable. Act more like it,” Senior White Two advised him sternly.","“Are you ready? Three, two, one!” Senior White Two acted swiftly.","Song Shuhang’s glass heart was removed.","Surprisingly, there was no pain at all. Song Shuhang a bit puzzled.","The azure glass heart refused to give in. It continued to beat fervently. It struggled as if it was on its deathbed.","The heart removal surgery had been successful!","Song Shuhang immediately retrieved a special magical treasure known as the “Throne of Patience” and sat on it.","However, due to the unbroken connection between his back and the sealing pillar, he could only sit upright and couldn’t lean against the Throne of Patience.","The gorilla general, the revived hamster, and the conscious Little Sun T233 all gasped.","The Throne of Patience was so terrifying that it sent shivers down one’s spine with just a glance.","He was ruthless!","“Phew,” Song Shuhang, seated on the Throne of Patience, took a deep breath. He activated the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique and Cheng Lin’s self-healing technique with all his might.","Above him, 133 scholarly Holy Apes emerged from the sealing pillar and assembled above his head. Each was accompanied by a dragon phantom coiled around its neck, a style they had developed after encountering Su Clan’s Sixteen’s “Big Sister White Dragon Scarf.” This new formation showcased their newfound knowledge.","Upon exiting the cramped sealing pillar, the 133 Holy Apes promptly assumed their new formation. Guided by the great Holy Apes, they formed a massive Chinese character above Song Shuhang’s head: “Heart.”","This word exuded a spiritual aura. It was a fitting representation of the current situation.","“What a unique style,” the gorilla general commented with a touch of emotion. It was still the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique, but Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was the only one who could employ it in such playful ways.","Song Shuhang raised his head to gaze at the giant “heart” character above him. There was a hint of despair in his eyes.","Within his chest, a new heart was regenerating.","A newborn heart would be younger and beat more vigorously.","Song Shuhang raised his head to look at Senior White Two.","Senior White Two was busy inscribing runes on the glass heart.","With these runes, the glass heart emitted the gleam of a divine artifact.","If this glass heart, personally endorsed by the ruler of the Netherworld Realm, were to be discovered outside the Netherworld Realm, it would surely incite demonic entities to vie for it and lead to a bloodbath in the Netherworld Realm.","“Success. My techniques remain as effective as ever,” Senior White Two declared with satisfaction.","This exquisite glass heart was too valuable to be wasted.","Next time, when Song Shuhang was asleep, Senior White Two might secretly extract another heart.","Senior White Two raised the modified heart and positioned it beside the sealing pillar.","Gentle light emanated from the glass heart and connected to the tentacles behind Song Shuhang.","The tentacles from his back were transferred and linked to the glass heart. The glass heart assumed Song Shuhang’s place and melded with the sealing pillar.","Song Shuhang felt an immediate relief. It was as if a ten-thousand-ton burden had been lifted from him. He activated the Holy Ape Dragon Power Technique and began to recover.","“I survive yet again,” Song Shuhang murmured softly.","The hamster chimed in. “A new day has just begun. What are you talking about in your sleep?”","Song Shuhang glanced up.","Above his head, the formation of Holy Apes shifted.","The word “Endure” depicted a blade piercing through a heart. It was a representation of enduring pain.","“Sooner or later, I’ll turn you naughty monkeys into physical entities and make you work for me day and night,” Song Shuhang muttered through gritted teeth.","“It’s done,” Senior White said while clapping his hands lightly.","At that moment, the glass heart had fused with the sealing pillar and floated at its apex.","Countless gentle rays of light, now replacing the function of blood vessels, flowed from the glass heart into the pillar wall of the sealing pillar. Within this light, one could discern the flow of blood—it was Song Shuhang’s blood.","The seven-colored sealing pillar appeared to have gained additional patterns, making it even more exquisite.","“This sealing pillar is now more akin to a magical instrument,” the gorilla general remarked.","Song Shuhang used his telekinetic power to lift the Throne of Patience and positioned himself before the sealing pillar.","He extended his hand and placed it on the sealing pillar.","In an instant, the sealing pillar began to radiate light.","There was a sense of ‘bloodline connection’ between them.","“Good child,” Song Shuhang said gently while extending his hand to perform the Saber Nurturing Technique.","The demonic hamster responded, “Evil path.”","Song Shuhang turned around with his hand outstretched.","In the next moment, the sealing pillar disappeared with a swoosh.","The demonic hamster had a foreboding feeling.","It raised its head and witnessed the sealing pillar leaping high into the air before descending toward it with crushing force.","“You can control this sealing pillar?” the hamster exclaimed.","The sealing pillar halted just half a meter from the hamster.","“That’s why I called it a good child,” Song Shuhang replied.","With the bloodline connection and the effects of the Saber Nurturing Technique, he could manipulate the sealing pillar.","However, each movement depleted some of the sealing pillar’s favorability and diminished the quality of its seven-colored divine light.","Therefore, he had to replenish its mana after each transfer.","Once the sealing pillar returned to its original position, Song Shuhang extended his hand and cast the Saber Nurturing Technique 22 times."]},{"number":2298,"title":"Chapter 2298 Innumerable Ties","paragraphs":["2298 Innumerable Ties","In the coming days, he needed to make a nightly visit to Senior White Two’s hideout.","Firstly, it was an opportunity to learn the proper pronunciation of the ancient language. Secondly, he had the daily task of fortifying the “Blade Nurturing Technique” on the sealing pillar.","If he could accumulate enough proficiency in the “Blade Nurturing Technique” on the sealing pillar, there might be a chance to summon it directly from the ‘Black Lotus World’ to the ‘Inner World,’ and then use the ‘Inner World’ as a platform to transport it into the real world!","Once the ‘sealing pillar’ was in the real world, he could employ various methods with it.","This was a seal capable of imprisoning the ruler of the Netherworld for 10,000 years. Senior White Two had previously required 5,000 years to break this seal.","A seal of such magnitude would spell doom for whoever it took hold of!","“Senior White, I’ll head back to the real world first. Tonight, I plan to meet with Immortal Fairy Bie Xue to discuss the creation of the ‘Inner Demon Tribulation.’ See you later tonight,” Song Shuhang remarked as he got up from the Throne of Patience and stowed it away.","“Let’s go together. My projected clone can also operate in the real world,” Senior White Two said.","Once released from the seal, Senior White Two’s projected clone could enter the real world through Song Shuhang’s ‘Inner World.’ This was the very reason why Song Shuhang had spent the entire night refining the ‘sealing pillar.’","Having a freely maneuverable Senior White Two as his life-saving senior brother was the key to ensuring his safety.","At Jiangnan College Town’s dormitory, Song Shuhang and Senior White Two returned to the real world from the ‘Inner World’. They discovered that it was already close to noon.","His roommates had already gone to their classes.","The headless Lady Onion was nowhere to be found.","“It’s pretty late,” Song Shuhang noted. He extended his ‘divine sense’ and silently enveloped the university campus.","In the classroom, the monster tree Qing Wu had already taken Song Shuhang’s seat.","Upon sensing Song Shuhang’s ‘divine sense,’ Qing Wu looked up and smiled. She then lowered her head to continue studying and taking notes.","His three roommates were in high spirits, so they weren’t feeling drowsy during their classes.","Song Shuhang chuckled and expanded his consciousness to the outdoors.","There, the headless Lady Onion was wandering about.","After a night, her green onion sprouts had made some progress.","Not too far away, a monster hunter disguised as a janitor had already noticed Lady Onion. However, he didn’t make a move. Instead, he carefully avoided Lady Onion and kept a certain distance from her.","This monster onion was an employee of Profound Sage Tyrannical Song’s household and couldn’t be touched.","Moreover, Lady Onion had a divine saber protecting her. This divine saber was incredibly formidable, and anyone who saw it from afar would be awed.","Indeed, Profound Sage Tyrannical Song, the ‘Sage of the Era,’ had assigned such a formidable divine saber to protect a small monster onion.","Lady Onion, wandering about, was oblivious to Song Shuhang’s presence.","She strolled into a convenience store, picked out her desired snacks from the shelves, and left the money on the counter.","It was common knowledge that one must pay for what they take.","Song Shuhang retracted his divine sense contentedly.","“Senior White, it’s noon... Huh?” When Song Shuhang turned around, Senior White’s projected clone had already disappeared.","“Never mind. As long as Senior White Two’s clone can roam the real world, it’s sufficient,” Song Shuhang remarked.","He sat on his bed, glanced at the computer, and began contemplating.","Next, if he wanted to incorporate Gao Moumou and the others into the group, he would have to employ some illusionary techniques.","In terms of illusions, he had only learned the basics.","However, his Seven-Colored Kidney and the Nascent Soul born from the Mirage Dragon Pearl within his body possessed the ability to manipulate illusions.","So, he would devise a scenario to introduce White Blade Swordsman, True Monarch Red Plum, and Eastern Moonlit Night into the group.","Song Shuhang reached out and picked up his notebook from the table.","On a blank page, he had recorded Senior Yellow Mountain’s three divinations.","Divine Bird + Tree.","Day + night.","Turn your head + lights + people.","On a separate white page within the notebook:","“Divine Bird + Tree: We can be lovebirds in the sky and interconnected branches on the ground.”","“Day + Night: This one has many possibilities, but ‘morning and evening’ seems the most fitting.”","“Turning Head + Lights + Person: Quite straightforward. It’s a line from Xin Qiji’s ‘Green Jade Case’: ‘When she looked back, that person was in the dim light.’”","“Like me~”","It was Gao Moumou’s handwriting.","While jotting down the answers, Gao Moumou had thoughtfully used a separate sheet of paper and left Song Shuhang’s original paper unmarked.","Song Shuhang reviewed Gao Moumou’s answers, and his expression suddenly changed.","Divine Bird + Tree... That’s right, lovebirds could indeed be considered divine birds, and branches could be seen as trees.","Day + night... Morning and evening.","As for the last line, ‘suddenly looking back’ equated to ‘turning head,’ while lights + people was synonymous with the second half of the sentence.","It made perfect sense.","Song Shuhang’s expression became even more complicated.","It was precisely because Gao Moumou’s answers were so logical that he felt a bit flustered.","Could it be that Senior Yellow Mountain’s divination back then had yielded these three answers?","‘What if we find an opportunity to secretly confirm it? For example, casually mentioning these three lines of poetry in front of Senior Yellow Mountain?’ Several thoughts crossed Song Shuhang’s mind.","“Wait, don’t rush. At that time, Senior Yellow Mountain was calculating my fate with the Nine Provinces Number One Group. If we follow this line of thinking...” Song Shuhang focused on the last sentence.","It seemed he had indeed experienced something similar.","If he followed this train of thought. Perhaps these three answers represented different experiences in his life?","Being lovebirds in heaven and interconnected branches on earth.","Could it be that his future Dao partner was within the Nine Provinces Number One Group?","Exactly!","An individual’s imagination was always powerful.","No matter the circumstance, one could envision it in a ‘positive’ or ‘beneficial’ direction.","Song Shuhang closed the notebook.","Anyway... If the opportunity arose, he would first verify it with Senior Yellow Mountain to gauge his reaction.","He would begin with ‘lovebirds.’","[But where can I find lovebirds?]","***","Meanwhile, in the crevice of the Wielder’s small black room, The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball put down the shoe it had been holding again.","This was the second time. Every time it tried to lock onto Song Shuhang, a powerful force disrupted it.","Furthermore, Song Shuhang retaliated and prevented it from tracking his position for a short period.","But... it didn’t matter.","The previous attempts had provided it with some valuable information.","For instance, within the Wielder’s small black room, there appeared to be something intricately connected to the owner of this shoe!","What it needed to do now was to enter the Wielder’s small black room and search for that ‘lifeform.’"]},{"number":2299,"title":"Chapter 2299 Door to the Main World","paragraphs":["2299 Door to the Main World","In the current moment, inside the confines of the Heavenly Dao Small Black Room, a peculiar, all-seeing claw, a muscular bald Transcendent of Tribulations, a man and a woman, two Profound Sages, and a demon shrouded in misty form, all gathered together, engaging in sporadic chitchat.","The male Profound Sage also produced some immortal tea and a teapot.","The female Profound Sages, in turn, summoned dew through spells and prepared for tea brewing.","Once the table was set, everyone took their seats, and conversations started while tea steeped and information flowed.","“That’s correct,” nodded the misty demon. “Inside this Heavenly Dao Prison, spatial tools are free to operate, but the majority of the space here within the Heavenly Dao Prison restricts spatial jumps. Even though there might be some exceptions, it’s incredibly perilous to employ spatial abilities here. Most of the ‘Heavenly Dao Prison space’ behaves like a Rubik’s Cube in constant flux. If you happen to jump while the ‘Rubik’s Cube’ is spinning, catastrophe awaits.”","“So, is there really no way out?” inquired the male Profound Sage.","The female Profound Sage said, “The Zither Master’s true self remains outside. Maybe that can offer us some assistance?”","“Unfortunately, Fairy Fengyi’s actual self might have forgotten about her claws. Creatures within the Heavenly Dao Prison are forgotten by the outside world,” said the misty demon with a sigh.","A moment of silence settled in.","In other words, receiving assistance from the outside world was improbable.","“And... something has happened to my primary form,” revealed Zither Master Fengyi’s claw. It sensed that its main body had ‘died,’ and the resurrection ritual had begun.","The lingering question was, when her main body revived, would it grow another claw?","“In the end, if we want to leave, we can only wait for the Wielder of the Will to clear this small black room or watch for another opportunity,” suggested the muscular bald Tribulation Transcendent.","“Then how did Profound Sage Tyrannical Song manage it?” the female Profound Sage asked.","“I can’t fathom it either,” the mist-like Evil Dao admitted. “Profound Sage Tyrannical Song is an enigma, and we can be sure he’s far more than just a typical Profound Sage.”","Typical Profound Sages would have been ended long ago!","“So, will Profound Sage Tyrannical Song return?” the female Profound Sage suddenly pondered.","“I doubt it... Even if he has the means to break into the Heavenly Dao Prison space, there’s more than one Heavenly Dao Prison here. His next entry might not be into this ‘Heavenly Dao Prison world,’” the misty evil spirit slowly articulated.","As they conversed, the misty evil spirit suddenly leaped from its chair.","“Friend, what’s going on?” curiously asked Zither Master Fengyi.","“Someone is homing in on my location! Unbelievable. Unless it’s the Heavenly Dao, how could they pinpoint our situation within the Heavenly Dao Prison from the outside world?” the misty demon proclaimed in a deep voice.","Since the other party could discern the interior of the Heavenly Dao Prison, they might also possess the means to infiltrate.","If the other party could enter, it could be their ticket to freedom!","“He’s here,” declared the misty Evil Dao.","As the Heavenly Dao Prison’s space fissured, an interspatial pocket materialized before everyone’s eyes.","Toxic Yellow Spring water flowed out from within.","Zither Master Fengyi felt a touch of disappointment.","It wasn’t the outside world; it was a rift within the Heavenly Dao Prison’s space.","However, the interspatial pocket was still preferable to the Heavenly Dao Prison.","Perhaps there was a chance to escape through it?","The sound of metal making contact with the ground rang out. Following that, a liquid metal sphere leaped out from the Heavenly Dao Prison’s interspatial pocket.","The misty demon was taken aback.","‘A Ruler?!’","But soon, it vehemently shook its head.","No, this wasn’t a Ruler.","Despite the resemblance, their auras and energy properties were entirely different.","So... was it the Heavenly Dao?","Implausible; the Heavenly Dao wouldn’t readily reveal itself to people.","Moreover, if this was the Wielder of the Will, it appeared somewhat feeble.","“The object in its grasp is a shoe?” remarked the female Profound Sage.","In the ‘arm’ that the liquid metal ball had morphed into, a gleaming sports shoe resided.","This sneaker appeared to have been enchanted repeatedly, exuding the radiance of a divine artifact. How bored must this high-ranking individual be to meticulously enchant an ordinary sports shoe?","“It’s Tyrannical Song’s shoes. I can detect Tyrannical Song’s scent emanating from them,” the misty demon suddenly disclosed.","Zither Master Fengyi’s claws were rendered speechless.","With claws, she shouldn’t have athlete’s foot, right?","“Could it be that Profound Sage Tyrannical Song was vanquished by it?” the bald Tribulation Transcendent queried warily.","Their intentions were malevolent.","...","...","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball formally entered the Wielder’s small black room. It ‘gazed’ at the mist demon—indeed, it possessed the same aura as the shoe’s owner.","Having locked onto its target, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball acted resolutely.","Its form transformed into a wave that descended upon the misty evil spirit. The claws of Zither Master Fengyi, the bald Tribulation Transcendent, and the male and female Tribulation Transcendents became its targets.","“Hah!” bellowed the bald Tribulation Transcendent as he delivered a powerful punch.","His fist shimmered with a golden radiance and launched tens of thousands of punches in an instant.","Tens of thousands of fist radiance clashed with the waves created by the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball.","“Be cautious; avoid direct contact with the liquid metal!” cautioned the misty demon beside him. It was certain that this entity had ties to the Wielder of the Will.","Hence, prudence was essential.","Sizzle~~","Tens of thousands of golden fist radiance tore through the waves and caused them to dissipate!","The liquid metal wave was propelled upward above everyone’s heads before descending like raindrops.","The bald Tribulation Transcendent wrinkled his brow. Too feeble!","It was so feeble that it seemed like a trap!","Zither Master Fengyi waved her claws gracefully to erect an expansive defensive barrier and shield them against the raindrop-like projectiles.","The metal raindrops plummeted and enveloped everyone swiftly.","“It’s ceased,” noted the bald Tribulation Transcendent as he eyed the liquid metal suspended in the air.","The liquid metal, which had descended like raindrops, had halted in mid-air and coalesced into a cage, ensnaring everyone.","Subsequently... everyone discovered that they couldn’t move.","It was as if the world had frozen.","Even their consciousness began to congeal.","“Temporal Freeze?”","Zither Master Fengyi, being the strongest, experienced a gradual solidification of her consciousness.","As her consciousness solidified slowly, she observed the liquid metal around her morph into an enormous hand that delved into the ‘Evil Spirit of Mist,’ extracting a black object.","Was this its objective?","Subsequently, the colossal hand clutched the black object and began to recite an incantation.","With this black object as an offering, a spatial gateway materialized.","Before Zither Master Fengyi’s consciousness fully congealed, she glimpsed the scenery beyond the Space Gate.","It was a familiar azure life-bearing planet.","It was the vista of the primary world—Earth."]},{"number":2300,"title":"Chapter 2300 Indistinguishable Reality and Fantasy","paragraphs":["2300 Indistinguishable Reality and Fantasy","The Heavenly Dao Molt Ball had spared Zither Master Fengyi and the others.","Even though Zither Master Fengyi, the bald Tribulation Transcender, and the others were stuck in a ‘Time Freeze’ state, it could easily dispose of several of them with just one flick of its finger. It didn’t care.","After the spatial gateway to the mortal world, Earth, opened, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball wasted no time and leaped into it.","In its hand, it still clutched the black substance and the sports shoe it had taken from the mist-like demon.","With a leap, the Heavenly Dao Molt Ball was gone, and the spatial gate vanished.","Zither Master Fengyi’s phoenix claw, the bald Tribulation Transcender, and the others slowly regained consciousness.","“Am I still alive?” The bald Tribulation Transcender touched his body in disbelief. Not only was he alive, but he was also completely unharmed!","How was this possible? Just a moment ago, that liquid metal sphere had used a ‘time-type’ spell to freeze them in place. In that frozen state, they were as helpless as fish on a cutting board while waiting to be slaughtered.","But the liquid metal sphere had chosen to spare them?","“A space tunnel!” Phoenix Claw stared at the spot where the liquid metal sphere had disappeared.","It was gone. The spatial passageway had vanished. She hadn’t taken the opportunity to leave.","At that moment, the fog demon finally regained consciousness.","As soon as its body recovered, it let out a miserable cry.","Its hands clutched its waist, where there was a massive, unfillable hole. Even its undying body couldn’t repair this hole. It had lost something crucial.","“Are you alright?” the bald Tribulation Transcender asked.","The only one injured was the fog demon.","“Do you need healing?” the female Profound Sage asked.","Wincing in pain, the mist demon waved away their offers. Its constitution was highly unique and made ordinary cultivator healing techniques ineffective. After losing the black substance, its body began to shrink.","“What did that sphere take from your body?” Zither Master Fengyi inquired.","The fog demon had shrunk by more than half. In pain, it explained, “That was the most crucial part of my body. It was my core. Without it, I won’t last long in the mortal world.”","“I don’t know,” the fog demon shook its head, then asked, “Where did the ball ultimately go?”","“Perhaps it intends to borrow my core to enter the mortal world,” the fog demon said while gritting its teeth.","Its core was unique and carried its memories. Moreover, the core possessed characteristics similar to a pseudo-eternity bone and allowed certain special entities to move about briefly in the mortal world.","However, using its core wasn’t that simple. Even if someone took the core, it would require some time to understand and harness its capabilities. The fog demon hoped that the Ruler could sense the core and retrieve it during this period and allow the Ruler to extract valuable information from it.","***","On the other side, at Jiangnan University.","After lunch, Qing Wu took advantage of a trip to the restroom to complete the exchange with Song Shuhang’s main body.","“You’ve been a great help, Qing Wu,” Song Shuhang expressed his gratitude.","“You’re welcome, Sage Monarch Tyrannical Song. It was my pleasure,” Qing Wu said with a smile. “But next time, when Sage Monarch Tyrannical Song is about to ‘disappear,’ please inform me in advance so I can be ready to take over.”","After the exchange, Song Shuhang and his three roommates returned to their dormitory.","The spiritual qi in the dormitory felt denser than usual. Song Shuhang had secretly activated the mirage dragon’s hallucination power.","Now, he had to await his good friend’s entry into the game.","As usual, the three roommates either switched on their computers or perused books and magazines.","Gao Moumou, upon starting his computer, logged into his chat account and opened a document to begin writing.","On the adjacent bed, Song Shuhang likewise powered up his computer and logged into his White Blade Swordsman account.","Everything was set.","Gao Moumou wrote for a while in his document before a thought struck him.","He adjusted the chat software settings while glancing at his ‘friend verification’ template. A faint voice echoed in his mind that was much like his girlfriend Mai’s voice.","Out of the blue, Gao Moumou reached out and disabled the ‘friend verification’ function.","While deactivating the verification, he continued to work on his manuscript.","Ten minutes later after finishing a section of his story, Gao Moumou was suddenly interrupted by a thought.","He accessed the chat software settings again while focusing on his ‘friend verification’ template.","A gentle voice reminiscent of Mai seemed to be urging him to act.","Gao Moumou hesitated but then decided to turn off the ‘friend verification’ function.","His memories were fragmented and vague. They consisted of only a few images.","He was seized by an enormous divine eagle and soared into the sky. Below lay an ancient city wall where Mai, amidst a group of indistinct figures, was crying.","The next image was of Song Shuhang rushing toward them from a distance with a long black saber in hand. His face bore a fierce expression, and he seemed to defy gravity as he scaled the sheer city wall. Despite its towering height, he raced up without pause.","Gao Moumou released his mouse and rubbed his temples as confusion clouded his mind.","What was happening with these memories?","To call them ‘real’ would be an exaggeration. Yet, there was an undeniable sense of presence in them.","‘Have I become so engrossed in my writing that I can’t distinguish reality from illusion?","Am I losing my mind?’","‘The Martial Arts Expert Who Shares My Room’ seemed like an intriguing premise.","Not bad at all. He’d jot down some notes for it and consider it for his next book.","With that in mind, he glanced at White Blade Swordsman’s ID and suddenly found it rather cool.","Gao Moumou changed his mind.","He maneuvered the mouse and clicked on the ‘Accept’ option.","Just as he confirmed the friend request, another system notification popped up.","[System Notification: White Blade Swordsman (******) invites you to join the group ‘Martial Arts World Chronicles.’ Do you accept?]","Gao Moumou pondered for a moment, then clicked ‘Accept.’","Since they were already friends, joining a group seemed reasonable. Plus, he could always leave the group later and delete the contact if needed."]}]);
